window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1201,"title":"Chapter 1201 - Medusa Snake Demon’s Provision","paragraphs":["When Lin Yuan used True Data, he saw that Wendy had already reached Class 4, and its originally bald head now had many snakes growing out of it.","Now, it looked scarily beautiful.","However, Wendy was still its same old adorable self.","When Rising Lizard arrived next to Lin Yuan, Wendy changed into a small snake and leaped into Lin Yuan’s arms before changing back into human form and hugging Lin Yuan affectionately.","Rising Lizard also wanted to nudge Lin Yuan lovingly with its head. However, it was still much bigger than him, and even a gentle nudge would cause Lin Yuan to fall over.","As such, Rising Lizard stopped itself.","Lin Yuan could not help marvel at Rising Lizard. Although the strength of its faith power had not increased by much as it was not easy for Apostles to gain faith power, Rising Lizard had evolved from Class 6 to Class 7 in such a short amount of time.","This rate of power growth was terrifying! How did Rising Lizard manage it? What had happened in the marsh world during his absence?","While Lin Yuan was thinking, Wendy said, “Dad, I’ve already absorbed half of the Drugged Snake Eagle’s venom. Once I’m done, I should be able to evolve to Class 5. When you left the dimensional world, the Marsh Ground Sphagna took me to the Drugged Snake Eagle nest, and I rescued 29 Medusa Snake Demon aunties. They’re now attracting the Marsh Crocodiles with Mom. I don’t plan on accepting these Medusa Snake Demons as my believers, as I think predator plants are the best choices to become my believers. Rising Lizard can have these Medusa Snake Demons. In just a few days, the Medusa Snake Demons managed to attract many Medusa Giant Lizards that were all eaten by Rising Lizard.”","Wendy blinked its large eyes and thoroughly reported on all that had taken place in the marsh world in Lin Yuan’s absence.","Lin Yuan was momentarily stunned. This had to be the reason for Rising Lizard’s rapid increase in power! The Medusa Giant Lizards that had come running toward the Medusa Snake Demon’s aura were so tragic! The Medusa Snake Demons had essentially seduced them with the sole purpose of slaughtering them.","Nonetheless, this was fine as Lin Yuan never expected to find so many Medusa Snake Demons gathered together in his territory.","It seemed that he need not worry about Rising Lizard’s power at all as it could quickly increase its power.","Moreover, there was already a deepset genetic link between Medusa Snake Demons and Medusa Giant Lizards.","Since Rising Lizard was an Apostle, it was not a bad circumstance if all of its believers were Medusa Snake Demons.","The Medusa Snake Demon had extremely high intelligence and could contribute significantly to this almost barren land.","It would be beneficial to the base if Rising Lizard could accept the Medusa Snake Demons as its believers. Hence, Lin Yuan greatly supported this idea.","At that moment, Wendy said softly, “Dad, I might not have as many believers as Rising Lizard, but I’m still ahead of it. Rising Lizard only has one Favored Believer and four believers while I already have two Favored Believers!”","Suddenly, Lin Yuan sensed that something was wrong.","How could Wendy address him as Dad? He had not thought anything odd of it, but it had also addressed Scale Concubine as Mom. This implied that he and Scale Concubine were a couple. Scale Concubine might not be agreeable to it. But even if it was fine with it, he was not agreeable to it.","In spite of this, he did not say anything to Wendy as those were just the words of an innocent child, and Wendy had only addressed him in such a way because he had formed a contract with it.","Wendy felt safe and affectionate toward him. In a child’s world, the people they felt most at ease and loving toward were their parents.","Lin Yuan caressed Wendy’s head and said, “Later, let’s go and see your new Favored Avenger together.”","Liu Tong had gathered all the Spirit Craftsmen, and they were standing before Lin Yuan.","All of the Spirit Craftsmen had worn faces, and it looked as though they had not rested properly in a long time. Their faces were also covered in dust and looked to be in a sorry state.","Constructing a building involved digging and moving dirt around. It was a job where one could not evade becoming dirty.","Lin Yuan looked at the 34 Spirit Craftsmen behind Liu Tong and said loudly, “All of you have been working hard! The construction in the marsh world won’t be completed within a short period. You have to rest when it’s necessary!”","One of the Spirit Craftsmen replied, “Young Master, is it convenient for you to bring feys to this place? I would like to form a contract with the Vitality Sloth, so I won’t have to waste my time resting and can dedicate more of my time to work!”","Many other Spirit Craftsmen soon echoed this Spirit Craftsman’s words.","Warmth flooded Lin Yuan’s heart.","All of these Spirit Craftsmen had agreed to come to this place without asking any questions, and they were all working themselves to the bone now.","All of them were part of Hu Quan’s Heavenly Craft Pavilion, and Hu Quan was a member of Sky City. Hence, they were all distantly related to Sky City.","There was no reason for him to be stingy toward these hard workers who were technically part of Sky City.","Lin Yuan cleared his throat and said seriously, “Let Liu Tong if you want a Vitality Sloth, and I’ll bring them over soon. Moreover, I heard from Hu Quan that all of you can contract new feys. A few of you have even comprehended Willpower Runes but haven’t found the right fey. So, when you inform Liu Tong of your desire to have a Vitality Sloth, you can also request another fey of any type. I’ll also bring a Bronze/Epic fey for each of you according to the type you specified.”","Lin Yuan’s voice carried hefty weight, and it rang in the ears of the Spirit Craftsmen."]},{"number":1202,"title":"Chapter 1202 - A Haven","paragraphs":["These Class 2 and 3 Spirit Craftsman had always longed for Bronze/Epic feys, but they never imagined that they would ever be able to obtain them.","It had even been difficult for Hu Quan to obtain a Bronze/Epic Wood Weaving House Centipede when he was a Class 4 Spirit Craftsman as he needed luck on top of skill.","As such, it was no wonder that Bronze/Epic feys were so precious to the Class 2 and 3 Spirit Craftsmen.","It was no lie that these Spirit Craftsmen had worked tirelessly for Lin Yuan’s sake. They did it with Lin Yuan’s promise to them in mind, but that was not the sole reason.","If they had only prioritized their profits, they would not have agreed without question to a job where they would be separated from the rest of the world.","When Lin Yuan last mentioned the Bronze/Epic feys, the Spirit Craftsmen had all been hopeful. However, none of them imagined that their hopes would be realized in a matter of days.","Moreover, Lin Yuan was not just giving them any Bronze/Epic feys, but ones that they had specified themselves.","From the way Lin Yuan spoke, it seemed that they would be able to obtain the Bronze/Epic feys after just one or two days.","Ever since these Spirit Craftsmen entered Heavenly Craft Pavilion, they had been hard at work learning from Hu Quan and had not had the time to understand the culture in Sky City.","But now that they were offered such a reward, the Spirit Craftsmen realized that Sky City was on such an unbelievable scale that Bronze Epic feys could even be nurtured in a matter of days there.","A true gentleman would die for his closest friend, but there were very few people who would give without asking anything in return. Every gift had to be repaid.","Yet, these Spirit Craftsmen were being repaid so soon after they started working. They were all touched and motivated by Lin Yuan’s actions and were ready to work harder than ever to repay him.","Liu Tong was smart.","When Lin Yuan failed to mention him in the announcement about Bronze/Epic feys, Liu Tong knew that there was a larger reward in store for him.","Just as Liu Tong had predicted, Lin Yuan turned to him and said, “Liu Tong, even with a Vitality Sloth, it must have been hard for you to tirelessly manage the work here.”","Liu Tong had gone without sleep for so long that tears started to well up in his dry eyes.","He knew that he was a nobody. Ever since he was accepted under Hu Quan’s tutelage, all he did was doggedly work to pick up the skills and do his best to leave an impression on Hu Quan.","The first time that Liu Tong had spoken to Lin Yuan was at the back of the mountain.","He would never have believed that an aristocrat like Lin Yuan would remember his name after the very first introduction. This gesture made Liu Tong feel respected as it meant that Lin Yuan regarded him as an equal.","Because of Lin Yuan, Liu Tong knew what it felt like to be willing to die for someone.","Just as Liu Tong was about to speak, Lin Yuan said, “I remember when we last spoke, you said that you’ve comprehended a Willpower Rune but haven’t found a suitable fey for it. Why don’t you request a fey for yourself too? I’ll nurture a Bronze/Legend fey according to your specifications. Work hard. I have faith in you!”","Lin Yuan’s words were a hard blow to Liu Tong, who immediately felt his legs go weak.","He was still exhausted despite having contracted a Vitality Sloth, and he suddenly wondered if he was dreaming.","Lin Yuan did not hide this conversation from the other Spirit Craftsmen. This not only made Lin Yuan appear even more outstanding but also let the other Spirit Craftsmen know that hard work would be rewarded.","After surveying the construction around the area, Lin Yuan said to the Spirit Craftsmen, “Once you’ve contracted a Vitality Sloth, you’ll only have to sleep two to three hours each night. However, you can’t spend all the remaining time working. You can mark off an area within the territory and plant some of your favorite fruits or pretty plants there. You can even dig a pond and rear fish-species feys.","“The territory is huge and more than big enough for each of you to build a house of your own. I will arrange for the breeding rooms you rushed to build to be assigned to Creation Masters as well as place a guard by the entrance. If you need anything in the future, you can let the guard know. The Creation Masters in the breeding room will be able to provide some of your needs.","“As such, you can let the guard know about any plants, tasty fruits, decorative feys, or anything else that you need. You will be here for a long time. It’ll be best if you can treat this place as your home or develop a sense of familiarity with it.”","Lin Yuan’s rewards had motivated the Spirit Craftsmen, but his words now brought light into their lives.","Spirit Craftsmen were a creative bunch, and they already had ideas for what they were going to do with their own area. After all, every person would be agreeable to living in a beautifully flourished area.","The things that Lin Yuan said were his exact plans for the marsh world that he had in mind from the beginning.","As he continued to expand into the marsh world, the base would only grow larger, and he would eventually come into contact with native factions as well as people from various federations that came through Class 6 marsh dimensional rifts to enter the marsh world.","In such an environment, only the strong would gain respect.","Thus, his territory in the marsh world would regard outsiders with increasing hostility.","However, he hoped that those who lived within the territory would be able to live harmoniously in a haven.","After exchanging a few more words with Liu Tong, Lin Yuan climbed aboard Rising Lizard with Wendy.","Rising Lizard took them to the edge of the marsh.","At the thought that the Medusa Snake Demons would likely have attracted another group of Medusa Giant Lizards, Rising Lizard excitedly raced ahead.","Previously, Lin Yuan could see the black dirt on the ground when he rode Rising Lizard.","But now that Rising Lizard was Class 7, Lin Yuan’s vision was completely blocked by Rising Lizard’s expansive back.","He estimated that Rising Lizard was around 45 meters long now."]},{"number":1203,"title":"Chapter 1203 - Come Out, You Big Lug!","paragraphs":["Rising Lizard’s bones were naturally long and strong, allowing it to carry a lot more bodyweight. As such, its flesh was also much tougher than other dimensional lifeforms of the same size.","In fact, Rising Lizard was even stronger than many abyss demons.","The horn on Rising Lizard’s head was at least three meters long, and spikes were now jutting out of each horn as well.","These spikes greatly raised Rising Lizard’s deadliness. By turning each horn into a thorn, it would rip apart its target on top of puncturing it.","Normally, large feys were all stupid lumberers. However, Rising Lizard’s sturdy bones allowed its dorsal bone to be even stronger and more agile.","Its head and long tail could each catch a flying mosquito in mid-air.","This agility, coupled with Rising Lizard’s large size, raised its battle abilities.","Soon, Rising Lizard arrived at the edge of the marsh with Lin Yuan on its back.","As Lin Yuan looked at the graceful figures with their snake tails swishing below the water, he felt as though he was looking at a gathering of promiscuous women.","The Medusa Snake Demons were crowding around Scale Concubine and singing happily together.","As the Medusa Snake Demons sang, many of the Marsh Crocodiles that were riled up by bloodlust slowly started to calm down.","Lin Yuan found it strange that the Medusa Snake Demons were currently sneering at a white figure in the middle of the marsh.","There were also three dead Medusa Giant Lizards next to the Medusa Snake Demons.","Many green beams were jutting out from the Medusa Giant Lizards’ corpses, and it was clear that they had died after a joint attack by the Medusa Snake Demons.","It was likely that the Medusa Giant Lizards had died while in a confused state. They had traveled all this way to seek someone that they could bootlick and form a contract with. They would never have expected that they were prey that had delivered themselves to the predator.","Fresh blood was still oozing from the wounds where the beams were still lodged. It was clear that they had died only recently.","As large as Rising Lizard was, it was a predatory creature that did not make much noise when it ran.","When Rising Lizard saw the three dead Medusa Giant Lizards, its seven mouths started drooling.","The saliva spurted out like seven fountains.","Given that it was a Medusa Giant Lizard, its saliva contained bacteria that could decompose its prey. Thus, its saliva had a bad stench.","Wendy could not help but pinch its nose.","When Wendy saw how Lin Yuan was carrying it with both his arms, it frowned and placed its other hand on Lin Yuan’s nose as it squeaked, “Dad, it won’t smell as bad if you breathe through your mouth like me!”","Lin Yuan felt that Wendy was a smart little child. Unfortunately, it did not use its intelligence in the right areas.","He jumped down from Rising Lizard’s back.","He realized that his feet did not sink too deep into the ground when he landed.","When he saw the large amount of Gold Drought Ground Sweet Flags, he immediately knew why his feet were not sinking.","It seemed that the Spirit Craftsmen had been busy with other tasks besides building the base.","They had improved the entire humid environment at the edge of the marsh.","The noise that came from Lin Yuan jumping off Rising Lizard’s back startled the Medusa Snake Demons.","When Scale Concubine saw Lin Yuan, it immediately looked respectful and bowed to him.","The Medusa Snake Demons had spent their lives dodging danger at every turn and were extremely wary of everything.","Hence, they instinctively maneuvered into defensive stances and started hissing at Lin Yuan.","When Rising Lizard heard the hissing, it set aside its desire to consume the Medusa Giant Lizards. It roared at the 27 Medusa Snake Demons with all seven of its heads and went into attack mode.","The four strongest Medusa Snake Demons immediately collapsed and held their heads as they howled in agony.","The four Medusa Snake Demons that were in anguish were probably the ones that had become Rising Lizard’s believers.","Lin Yuan did not mind the way that the Medusa Snake Demons had reacted. Rather, he found it normal.","He did not know what the Medusa Snake Demons had experienced under the Drugged Snake Eagle’s tyranny.","They were sure to be on guard in this unfamiliar environment after a lifetime of hardship. This was the nature of every lifeform.","Lin Yuan waved his hand and said, “This is the first time we’re all meeting. It’s unavoidable that we’re uncomfortable with each other. They won’t be so aggressive toward me the next time we meet.”","He turned and asked Wendy, “Wendy, you said you wanted to show me your second Favored Believer. Call it here so I can take a look at it.”","Rising Lizard was still glaring at the 27 Medusa Snake Demons.","It was full of gratitude toward Lin Yuan, who had transformed it into an Apostle, and it respected him from the depths of its soul.","Wendy had told Lin Yuan that Rising Lizard was going to accept all 27 Medusa Snake Demons as its believers. It had also already accepted four of them as its believers.","In the dimensional worlds, a believer’s actions reflected their Apostle’s will.","Thus, there was no way that Rising Lizard would allow his believers to be disrespectful toward Lin Yuan.","Rising Lizard had been ready to kill these four believers. If Lin Yuan had not halted it, the four Medusa Snake Demons would already be skewered on Rising Lizard’s horns.","Wendy’s snake hair also started to move when it saw the Medusa Snake Demons’ aggression toward Lin Yuan.","Every snake was poised to attack for the sake of protecting Lin Yuan.","When Wendy heard what Lin Yuan said, it softened its antagonistic gaze.","It waved its hand toward the marsh and declared, “You big lug, come out and greet Dad. Remember to be gentle! Don’t splash any of the marsh water onto Dad!”","As the last word left Wendy’s lips, the marsh near Lin Yuan started to move violently as though Wendy’s call had awakened a gargantuan creature."]},{"number":1204,"title":"Chapter 1204 - Water Demon Support Willow and Water Demon Support Willow","paragraphs":["The violently churning marsh was a sign that the creature underwater was at least as large as the Island Whale.","A newly hatched Island Whale was about 500 meters long and could grow up to 3,000 meters as its power increased.","Leaf-covered branches slowly emerged from the marsh, sending the Marsh Crocodiles into a panicked frenzy.","Scale Concubine hurriedly started to sing the Marsh Crocodile Song at an increased speed to calm down the Marsh Crocodiles.","Lin Yuan used True Data as he watched the sturdy grayish-green branches that were covered with twisted leaves.","[Alien Beast Name]: Water Demon Support Willow","[Lifeform State]: Dimensional lifeform (Favored Believer)","[Alien Beast Class]: Class 4","[Totem Faith]: Three Flower Snake-Eyes Totem","Natural Skill:","[Excessive Splitting]: If there is sufficient energy, the Water Demon Support Willow can grow branches endlessly and remove branches. The energy from the branches that grew from it splitting its body will solidify and become even harder than its original body.","Lin Yuan’s eyebrow twitched when he saw the Water Demon Support Willow’s True Data.","Although he could tell that the Water Demon Support Willow’s body was giant, he could not see most of its body which was still underwater.","Excessive Splitting’s strength depended on the Water Demon Support Willow’s size. The larger it was, the more impactful Excessive Splitting would be.","Once the Water Demon Support Willow reached a certain size, it would be able to use its branches to create a large base underwater.","This would open up new possibilities in the marsh.","But if it were small, its main branches underwater would not be strong enough, and the structure created through Excessive Splitting would not be impressive. Not only would it be worthless, but it would even become trash that took up space in the territory.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to jump into the dirty marsh to see the Water Demon Support Willow’s entire body, Scale Concubine said, “Lord, there is a special white Marsh Crocodile there that I can’t control. At first, it was attracted by all the blood we poured into the marsh. But it saw that there’s nothing to eat here and is about to leave.”","Lin Yuan looked in the direction that Scale Concubine was pointing and saw the seven-meter-long ivory Marsh Crocodile.","The Marsh Crocodile was not creamy white but a pure and sacred type of white that shone faintly. This made the white Marsh Crocodile appear much more imposing.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the white Marsh Crocodile.","[Alien Beast]: White Evil Marsh Crocodile","[Lifeform State]: Dimensional lifeform","[Alien Beast Class]: Class 2","Natural Skill:","[Crocodile Group Worship]: It will not meet with any opposition even if it publicly robbed the other Marsh Crocodiles’ food. Its aura will set other Marsh Crocodiles at ease. The more the other Marsh Crocodiles experience its aura, the better they will feel, and their positive feelings will eventually turn into worship. It can attract Marsh Crocodiles within a large radius.","Lin Yuan was astonished.","This Marsh Crocodile was called the White Evil Marsh Crocodile. Its name was evidence that it belonged to the Marsh Crocodile family.","However, there was no mention of the White Evil Marsh Crocodile in any of the information regarding the marsh world in the main world.","Lin Yuan had guessed that the White Evil Marsh Crocodile had reached Class 6.","After all, Marsh Crocodiles’ Class was directly related to their size.","However, this White Evil Marsh Crocodile was only Class 2. Yet, it was already 7 meters long.","As such, he could only imagine how large the White Evil Marsh Crocodile would grow to become.","Rising Lizard’s 14-meter-long tail was already like a moving pillar of flesh.","Once the White Evil Marsh Crocodile reached Class 7, Lin Yuan estimated that it would grow to at least 100-meters-long.","Lin Yuan also learned from True Data why the other Marsh Crocodiles were not attacking the White Evil Marsh Crocodile.","Marsh Crocodiles in their gestating phase were naturally hostile toward young Marsh Crocodiles that they were not blood-related. They would even kill the young Marsh Crocodiles so they would have more space to give birth.","Marsh Crocodiles also reproduced quickly. In a group of so many Marsh Crocodiles, it was unlikely that there was not a single gestating Marsh Crocodile.","The other Marsh Crocodiles were not attacking the White Evil Marsh Crocodile because of Crocodile Group Worship.","From the moment Lin Yuan saw Crocodile Group Worship, he became certain that the White Evil Marsh Crocodile was extraordinary.","The marsh world was full of peril, and dimensional lifeforms were all possessive over their food.","Crocodile Group Worship not only allowed the White Evil Marsh Crocodile to steal other Marsh Crocodiles’ food without facing opposition, but it also allowed the White Evil Marsh Crocodile to be worshiped by other Marsh Crocodiles.","The White Evil Marsh Crocodile could use this natural skill to gather a group of Marsh Crocodile guards.","With so many of its worshippers offering it their faith, it would naturally transform into an Apostle.","Heavenly Family Feys were heavenly lifeforms from the main world. But this White Evil Marsh Crocodile was the heavenly lifeform from the marsh world.","There was no way Lin Yuan would allow this dimensional lifeform to slip away.","He said to the waiting Scale Concubine, “Scale Concubine, continue singing the Marsh Crocodile Song.”","Lin Yuan said to the Invisible Demon in his shadow, “Shadow, after you capture the White Evil Marsh Crocodile, kill any other Marsh Crocodile that makes a wrong move.”","A shadow emerged from Lin Yuan’s shadow and kicked the White Evil Marsh Crocodile to the ground.","The White Evil Marsh Crocodile was about to start struggling, but it was quickly enveloped by the Marsh Ground Sphagna and left incapacitated.","At that moment, all of the Marsh Crocodiles in the marsh went hysterical.","Scale Concubine’s Marsh Crocodile Song no longer worked."]},{"number":1205,"title":"Chapter 1205 - Strange White Evil Marsh Crocodile","paragraphs":["The Marsh Crocodiles ignored Scale Concubine and charged forward to save the White Evil Marsh Crocodile.","The Invisible Demon’s shadow flashed across the marsh as per Lin Yuan’s instruction.","The air above the marsh turned dark, and the waters of the marsh turned red as the frenzied Marsh Crocodiles were decimated.","This sudden event astonished all the Medusa Snake Demons.","Wendy’s eyes lit up, and it waved at the marsh as it shouted, “You big thing, time to eat! Don’t waste any bit of crocodile flesh! You better eat all of it within an hour! Otherwise, they’ll decompose and be eaten by the mushrooms!”","More branches emerged from the water.","Now that there was food present, the Water Demon Support Willow stretched out more than twice the number of branches than Marsh Crocodiles.","The branches wrapped around the Marsh Crocodiles and dragged them beneath the surface, leaving behind the red-stained water.","The Marsh Crocodiles’ blood flowed in all directions and would quickly attract many more Marsh Crocodiles.","It was impossible to wipe out all the Marsh Crocodiles in the marsh world.","There were already Marsh Crocodiles swimming toward the scent of blood.","Scale Concubine led the Medusa Snake Demons in singing the Marsh Crocodile Song to control these new Marsh Crocodiles.","Although Lin Yuan wanted to dive underwater to see just how big the Water Demon Support Willow was, he could not stand the water that was contaminated with the Marsh Crocodiles’ blood and mud.","He could only wait until the decomposing bacteria digested the blood before he could head underwater.","As such, Lin Yuan focused his attention on the White Evil Marsh Crocodile.","It was completely helpless against the Class 10 Marsh Ground Sphagna.","Marsh Crocodiles were not intelligent, and this White Evil Marsh Crocodile was still a child. Hence, there was no way it was smart in any way.","Lin Yuan walked over to place his hand on the White Evil Marsh Crocodile’s scales.","He discovered that its scales were springy if touched lightly but felt as hard as porcelain when a heavier touch was applied.","Lin Yuan turned to ask Wen Yu and Rising Lizard, “Do either of you want to accept the White Evil Marsh Crocodile as your Favored Believer?”","Wendy hurriedly shook its head and replied, “Dad, I’m more suited to accepting predatory plants as my believers because of my natural skill.”","Although Wendy did not state it explicitly, it was clear from its expression that it despised the Marsh Crocodile.","Rising Lizard’s seven heads stared at the White Evil Marsh Crocodile for some time before they started to shake, and it said, “Master, you should accept it as your believer. It’ll take too much faith power for me to accept it as my Favored Believer.”","It did not want to waste its faith power on a Marsh Crocodile.","Lin Yuan lowered his head and looked deep in thought as he gazed at the thrashing White Evil Marsh Crocodile.","Not even Rising Lizard and Scale Concubine, who had lived in the marsh world for so long, had realized what the White Evil Marsh Crocodile’s natural skill was.","This was not a normal situation.","After touching the White Evil Marsh Crocodile’s skin, Lin Yuan could tell that it was not ordinary.","The White Evil Marsh Crocodile’s natural skill Crocodile Group Worship made it a king as it enabled it to order around the Marsh Crocodiles in the marsh.","Given the Marsh Crocodiles’ reactions, Lin Yuan could tell that Crocodile Group Worship was more powerful than Marsh Crocodile Song.","He had wanted Wendy or Rising Lizard to accept the White Evil Marsh Crocodile as their Favored Believer so as to strengthen Crocodile Group Worship.","But now, neither of them wanted the White Evil Marsh Crocodile.","They deeply despised Marsh Crocodiles, regardless of how unique the Marsh Crocodile was.","Lin Yuan would never have to worry about using up all the Law Source Crystalls he obtained from trading with Cage of Brahma Insects, Coiling Dragon’s Valley, and Dark Clouds Bird Shrine.","He could produce 200 units of source-type power without issue.","As such, he instructed the Sacred Source Wielding Queen to funnel source-type power into his hands.","He touched the White Evil Marsh Crocodile with his hands full of source-type power.","Soon, the dim White Evil Marsh Crocodile became more affectionate toward Lin Yuan.","Now that he had used source-type power to soothe the White Evil Marsh Crocodile, he instructed the Marsh Ground Sphagna to release the White Evil Marsh Crocodile.","Lin Yuan pointed at the marsh to tell the White Evil Marsh Crocodile that it could leave.","However, it swished its tail like a large cat and produced a gurgling noise in its throat.","This scene reminded Lin Yuan of Genius.","Nonetheless, Genius was much cuter than the razor-toothed White Evil Marsh Crocodile.","Both crocodile-species feys and dimensional lifeforms like the Marsh Crocodile gurgled and swished their tails as a sign of their affection.","Lin Yuan did not need to be as wary with the dense White Evil Marsh Crocodile as he was with the Class 4 Land Imp.","The Source-Type Cleansing was enough to incite unintelligent dimensional lifeforms to offer up their loyalty.","The accumulated 200 units of source-type power flowed out of Lin Yuan’s hands and into the White Evil Marsh Crocodile.","Not long after, the White Evil Marsh Crocodile roared fiercely.","While it was undergoing the Source-Type Cleansing, its white scales lost all signs of grayed aging.","The scales cracked, revealing an even whiter set of scales underneath.","Although the White Evil Marsh Crocodile’s class did not increase after the Source-Type Cleansing, its body size had changed significantly.","As the White Evil Marsh Crocodile’s body expanded, it now reached a length of 16 meters.","Its grade was low, and it was not strong. However, it could now use its body to kill many Class 4 dimensional lifeforms through brute force.","Suddenly, an astonishing pressure emanated from the White Evil Marsh Crocodile.","An amber-colored tooth-shaped totem appeared in the middle of its snout.","The appearance of the totem meant that the White Evil Marsh Crocodile had successfully transformed into an Apostle.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the White Evil Marsh Crocodile again."]},{"number":1206,"title":"Chapter 1206 - Lin Yuan’s Miniature Kingdom in the Marsh World","paragraphs":["[Alien Beast]: White Evil Marsh Crocodile","[Lifeform State]: Apostle","[Alien Beast Class]: Class 2","[Power of Faith]: Extremely weak","[Faith Totem]: Crocodile Pattern White-Toothed Totem","Natural Skill:","[Crocodile Group Worship]: Even if it publicly robs food from the other Marsh Crocodiles, its aura will incite positive feelings in the other Marsh Crocodiles. The more of its aura the other Marsh Crocodiles are exposed to, the more positive feelings will arise. The positive feelings will eventually turn into worship which will allow the White Evil Marsh Crocodile to attract the other Marsh Crocodiles within a large radius. The feelings of worship will coalesce into faith that the White Evil Marsh Crocodile will be able to absorb.","[Crocodile Turned Guards]: When the White Evil Marsh Crocodile injects its blood into other Marsh Crocodiles that had become its believers, the Marsh Crocodiles will change from crawlers to human-like lifeforms that can walk on two feet. Their learning ability will also be raised.","Faith Ability:","[Change the Chosen]: Inject a portion of energy from the totem into a lifeform to change it into a different form. The lifeform will change from a normal believer to a Favored Believer.","Now, Lin Yuan knew that White Evil Marsh Crocodile’s totem was the Crocodile Pattern White-Toothed totem.","Now, Crocodile Group Worship would allow the White Evil Marsh Crocodile to absorb faith from its Marsh Crocodile believers.","This increased the White Evil Marsh Crocodile’s store of faith power.","When Lin Yuan discussed faith power with the Invisible Demon, he found out that faith power was ranked into different levels, namely extremely weak, weak, higher weak, below average, average, higher average, below strong, strong, and extremely strong.","Every time an Apostle’s faith power increased by three classes, their lifeform level would transform, allowing them to gain a new faith ability.","The type of faith power received would be fixed.","When the faith power was extremely weak, weak, and higher weak, the only faith ability the Apostle had was Change the Chosen.","Once an Apostle’s faith power reached below average, it would be able to unlock its source sacred body and gain a new ability that would raise its combat power by leaps and bounds.","At first, this all seemed too foreign to Lin Yuan.","However, the White Evil Marsh Crocodile’s Crocodile Group Worship could bridge the gap and allow it to become Lin Yuan’s first Apostle to unlock its sacred source body.","Lin Yuan turned his attention to Crocodile Turned Guards.","Crocodile Changed Guards would allow the White Evil Marsh Crocodile to turn its believers into Favored Believers and give the dim Marsh Crocodiles a cloak of human skin that enabled them to walk like humans.","Moreover, it also enabled the Marsh Crocodiles to increase their learning ability.","The strength of this ability aside, Lin Yuan saw the human-form Marsh Crocodiles as laborers.","The Medusa Snake Demons needed to attract the Marsh Crocodiles while looking after the Drought Ground Sweet Flags and Barren River Orchid Bud that grew at the edge of the marsh.","These jobs were far more useful than manual labor.","Lin Yuan felt that it was too much of a waste of manpower to use lifeforms as intelligent as the Medusa Snake Demon as laborers.","Hence, he had been trying to come up with a way to solve this issue of finding laborers.","It would be too much of a hassle to bring in external manpower from the main world.","But now, the White Evil Marsh Crocodile’s natural skill provided a perfect solution.","Now that the White Evil Marsh Crocodile was an Apostle, it could use marsh language for simple communication.","Although it was not eloquent, it was understandable.","Lin Yuan asked the White Evil Marsh Crocodile, “Can the Marsh Crocodile believers that you change into a human form still fight underwater?”","The White Evil Marsh Crocodile gurgled in its throat and said, “They can. They might be in human form, but they’re still amphibious. Marsh Crocodiles are more agile underwater than they are on land.”","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up.","This meant that he gained laborers and underwater troops that could be used in the marsh.","Wendy was taking various predator plants as its believers.","Lin Yuan saw these predator plants as defense infrastructures. Their various abilities added many different facilities to his territory.","Rising Lizard decided that it was only going to accept the Medusa Snake Demons as its believers.","The Medusa Snake Demons were very smart and could manage the day-to-day activities within the territory.","Due to Crocodile Group Worship, the most suitable believers for the White Evil Marsh Crocodile were the Marsh Crocodiles.","The Marsh Crocodiles would not only strengthen the defenses at the edge of the marsh but also become a significant source of power.","Wendy, Rising Lizard, and the White Evil Marsh Crocodile’s believers would form a flawless system that continually advanced the territory’s progress.","The three groups of believers all had their own rules.","With this perfect system, it would even be possible for Lin Yuan to create his own kingdom in the marsh world.","The foundation was already laid.","Currently, all the blood in the marsh had been consumed by the decomposing bacteria, and the marsh had returned to its original state.","Many Marsh Crocodiles had swum over and fallen under the control of Scale Concubines Marsh Crocodile Song.","These Marsh Crocodiles would only serve as guards and a source of food but also catalyze the White Evil Marsh Crocodile’s growth.","Lin Yuan removed his jacket and dove into the marsh.","It was as though he had entered a whole different world.","Most of the marshes in the marsh world were extremely deep.","The marsh at the edge of the territory stretched at least 500 meters.","The wooden plants and rotten substances floated on the surface of the marsh, giving it a dirty appearance. However, only the surface was dirty.","Once he dove underwater, the turquoise water revealed a world that was abuzz with activity.","All Lin Yuan could see were thick clusters of twisted branches.","The branches tangled together and were brimming with life.","The branches were also wrapped around many bones.","According to the shape of the bones, Lin Yuan could tell that they were from the Marsh Crocodiles that the Invisible Demon had killed.","True Data revealed that the Water Demon Support Willow was only Class 4.","The Water Demon Support Willow’s body covered more than 2,000 square meters underwater.","Since the Water Demon Support Willow was an aquatic predator plant, it did not grow upward but outward."]},{"number":1207,"title":"Chapter 1207 - Sudden Appearance of Strong Apostles","paragraphs":["If the Water Demon Support Willow had enough Marsh Crocodiles to feed on, it would continue to grow and eventually be able to build a construct for the human-form Marsh Crocodiles to live in.","Wendy’s Favored Believer had opened the path to the rest of Lin Yuan’s journey in the marsh world.","Two mighty waves of energy fluctuations hit him before Lin Yuan could swim back to the surface.","The unprepared Lin Yuan choked and swallowed two mouthfuls of water.","The water did not taste strange but had the faint taste of mud and flesh-eating bacteria. It was not detrimental to humans.","Instead, it was actually rather nutritious. It was healthier to drink the marsh water than mountain spring water.","However, when Lin Yuan remembered the blood that had contaminated the water not long ago, he could not help but feel bile rise up his throat.","But before he could think any further, he sensed two waves of concentrated faith aura.","Lin Yuan inhaled sharply.","Just as Lin Yuan was climbing out of the water, another intense wave of faith power hit him. This wave was much stronger than the previous ones, and it was as though the source of the wave flower fluctuations was coming closer.","It was almost as though two Apostles were swimming toward him while fighting.","A thunderous bellow also accompanied the third wave of faith power. “White Speak! You’re the one who brought your son to my territory. Why would I lay a hand on him?”","The woman’s voice was sharp and shrill, but Lin Yuan could discern a tinge of anxiousness and fear. Clearly, the woman was no match for White Speak.","An arrogant male voice soon followed. “Scorpion Red, my son was right there. But I can’t see him anymore. Even if you didn’t send anyone to touch my son, it should be you who takes responsibility when the son of one of the lifeforms that live in your territory goes missing!”","Another powerful wave of energy crashed through the marsh.","By this time, Lin Yuan was already back on land.","The Kill Food Sky Butterfly had arrived at the edge of the marsh when it sensed the first wave of energy.","It said anxiously, “Lin Yuan, this energy fluctuation is clearly beyond Creation Breed. We can’t stay in this territory!”","The Kill Food Sky Butterfly’s expression was solemn, and it completely disregarded the fact that they were not alone.","Lin Yuan was Purple Afterglow’s contractor. If Lin Yuan died, Purple Afterglow would soon follow. Even if it cost the Kill Food Sky Butterfly its life, it would protect Lin Yuan’s life.","The energy fluctuations were much stronger than the Kill Food Sky Butterfly.","Although the Kill Food Sky Butterfly had one of the three most elite bloodlines of butterfly-species feys, it had only recently evolved to Creation Breed.","Due to its unhealed injury, it could not even reach Sovereign grade.","It knew that it was powerless against this threat.","Lin Yuan gnashed his teeth as the gears in his head started to turn.","While Lin Yuan was thinking, all the Medusa Snake Demons’ faces fell. Amongst all the Medusa Snake Demons, Scale Concubine had been with Lin Yuan for the longest.","The other Medusa Snake Demons had only been at the territory for a few days, and this was the first time they were meeting.","Their time at the territory was the happiest they had ever been while living in the dangerous marsh world. They did not have to worry about lacking food, and they could even build a beautiful structure if they wanted,","Moreover, there were two adolescent Apostles in the territory. One of the Apostles had even accepted some of them as believers and Favored Believers.","But so soon after, they felt a sense of belonging to this place. It was going to be destroyed.","The Medusa Snake Demons looked at Lin Yuan with hope and silently pleaded for him to take them with him when he escaped.","After thinking for a moment, a determined look came over Lin Yuan’s face.","He raised his hand and summoned Liu Yanshan.","The Invisible Demon also solidified its body and stood resolutely next to Lin Yuan as it looked toward the direction where the waves of faith power were coming from.","The waves of faith power shocked the Invisible Demon.","The Invisible Demon did not encourage Lin Yuan to flee. Instead, it said frankly, “Lord Dictator, the source is too far away for me to sense how strong the entity is. However, one of the Apostle’s faith power is at least below-average level.”","The Invisible Demon’s words made Lin Yuan aware that one of the approaching Apostles had unlocked its source sacred body.","Another wave of energy fluctuation more powerful than that of a Creation Breed fey was released. This indicated that the Apostle was at least Class 12.","Morbius’ grade was not high enough for Lin Yuan to use True Data to check on lifeforms above Creation Breed.","As such, Lin Yuan did not use True Data to check on the approaching Apostles.","After he tried to check on the feys that pulled the Moon Empress’ fey carriage, Lin Yuan discovered that targets beyond the grade that Morbius could check on would sense that they were being checked on if Lin Yuan persisted with using True Data.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan had no intention of running.","He had laid the foundation for his plans in the marsh world.","The collaboration of the three Apostles would be able to form a perfect system.","If he ran now, all his efforts would have been for naught, and Endless Summer’s Barren River Orchid Bud would be damaged.","Endless Summer was not in the marsh world. But even if it were, it would not be able to retract the Barren River Orchid Bud fast enough to save it.","Even if Lin Yuan wanted to flee with all the lifeforms, the Jeweled Cave Golden Toad did not have enough space to take all of them, and he would have no choice but to reveal the existence of the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","He might be able to do it if he abandoned the 35 Spirit Craftsmen.","Lin Yuan touched the Extreme Token on his chest and calmed himself.","He said to the Kill Food Sky Butterfly, “Kill Food Sky Butterfly, lead the Medusa Snake Demons, Rising Lizard, Wendy, and the White Evil Marsh Crocodile toward the inner area of the territory. I’ll stay here with the Invisible Demon.”","At that moment, he realized the White Evil Marsh Crocodile had disappeared."]},{"number":1208,"title":"Chapter 1208 - Unpanicked Marsh Ground Sphagna","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan was confused by the White Evil Marsh Crocodile’s disappearance.","However, they were in the middle of a crisis, and Lin Yuan could not afford to attend to the disappearance now.","The Kill Food Sky Butterfly was about to speak when it saw Lin Yuan’s resolute gaze. It flipped its waist-length hair and did as Lin Yuan had instructed.","Only Lin Yuan, the Invisible Demon, and Liu Yanshan were left to greet the incoming threats.","As the sounds of fighting went on, a shrill female voice shrieked. “White Speak, are you sure you want to fight to the death? We’re the only two lifeforms in East Vast Large Lake that stand a chance of beating Ghost Firefly but only by working together! The Apostle that Ghost Firefly relies on is protected by Lord Dictator—”","Before she could finish speaking, she cried out in agony again.","“White Speak, how dare you injure my tail?”","At this moment, Lin Yuan saw a giant dark purple scorpion barreling in his direction.","The giant scorpion’s body was covered in armor that resembled dark purple crystals.","However, one of its three tails had been snapped off.","Soon after, Lin Yuan was shocked by the creature that was chasing the giant purple scorpion.","A 3,000-meter-long white crocodile disturbed the fog in the distance, and a sacred yet cold aura emanated from its mouth.","Lin Yuan could not help but gulp as he noticed the resemblance between this white crocodile and the Class 2 White Evil Marsh Crocodile.","The white crocodile had said that his son was lost. Could his son be the Class 2 White Evil Marsh Crocodile?","If that was the case, Lin yuan would be delighted.","Lin Yuan could not imagine how the white crocodile would feel when it found out that its son was in Lin Yuan’s clutches and had been transformed into an Apostle.","Would it attack Lin Yuan in a fury and blame him for kidnapping its son or thank him for transforming his son into an Apostle?","Regardless, the fact that the White Evil Marsh Crocodile had been transformed into an Apostle would inevitably come into the light.","Lin Yuan did not know what the White Evil Marsh Crocodile had gone, but it would eventually turn up.","When the white crocodile saw the White Evil Marsh Crocodile, its transformation into an Apostle would be revealed.","Lin Yuan had no clue how such a powerful Apostle would react to this news. It was even possible that the white crocodile would accept him as a Dictator.","It would be great if that happened.","Lin Yuan had asked the Invisible Demon about Dictators. However, most of what the Invisible Demon knew came from rumors. As such, the information was not reliable.","But according to the Invisible Demon’s description, Lin Yuan could discern the role that Dictators played in the dimensional world.","Dimensional worlds prided in becoming the believers of Apostles, while Apostles prided in receiving the favor of their Dictators.","It was clear that Dictators were on a higher level than Apostles.","Knowing more about Dictators would enable Lin Yuan to sell his act of being one.","At that moment, the Marsh Ground Sphagna said from below his feet, “Lord, the Drugged Snake Eagle that attacked your territory was this stupid scorpion’s Favored Believer. The scorpion takes up a large portion of the north-west region of the East Vast Large Lake.”","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up. The best thing to do at such a moment was to learn more about one’s enemies.","He asked the Marsh Ground Sphagna, “Do you know what level of faith power the scorpion Apostle has?”","“Two years ago, its faith power was below average. The strength of an Apostle’s faith power enables it to rule over a territory. In order to gain the trust of the lifeforms in its territory, Apostles will often go around declaring the strength of their faith power,” replied the Marsh Ground Sphagna.","Previously, the Marsh Ground Sphagna badly wanted to become the Dark Scorpion’s believer. However, the Dark Scorpion had turned its nose up at such a common fey.","Now that the Marsh Ground Sphagna had become Wendy’s Favored Believer and had Wendy’s Three-Flower Snake Eyes Totem, it on longer desired to become the Dark Scorpion’s believer.","As such, it was no longer as intimidated by the Dark Scorpion. Rather, it felt resentment toward the Dark Scorpion.","The Marsh Ground Sphagna had covered the entire territory with its body, and it could sense everything that took place on the territory.","It had witnessed Lin Yuan turning the White Evil Marsh Crocodile into an Apostle.","The dimensional lifeform next to Lin Yuan that did not have the aura of the marsh world had also addressed him Lord Dictator.","These two instances made a deep impression on the Marsh Ground Sphagna.","The Marsh Ground Sphagna had been wondering why Wendy and Rising Lizard were so loyal to Lin Yuan, who did not even display his aura.","But now, it finally knew why. It turned out that Lin Yuan was a Dictator.","The Marsh Ground Sphagna could not help but tremble with self-pity, admiration, happiness, and adoration.","The Marsh Ground Sphagna did not dare to imagine the glory of being by the side of a Dictator. This glory was not even bestowed on most Apostles.","Any Apostle that could experience such glory was regarded as the cream of the crop amongst Apostle communities.","Ghost Firefly was not the strongest Apostle in East Vast Large Lake. However, it held significant authority because it had formed a connection with an Apostle that was favored by a Dictator.","This connection was enough for the Ghost Firefly to wield the sword of authority and do as it pleased in East Vast Large Lake.","Although a crisis was upon them, the Marsh Ground Sphagna was not panicked at all.","Dictators could use faith power to change into their dictator bodies. Dictator bodies were the best proof of one’s Dictator status.","As long as Lin Yuan used his dictator body, he would not have to do anything else, and every Apostle that did not have the favor of a Dictator would fall at his feet in the hopes that he would bestow the dictator’s prize on them."]},{"number":1209,"title":"Chapter 1209 - Totem Come to Life on the Source Sacred Body","paragraphs":["The Marsh Ground Sphagna excitedly waited for Lin Yuan to unleash his dictator body.","It had no idea that Lin Yuan was going to use the secret weapon that the Moon Empress had given him in a last-ditch attempt.","“Marsh Ground Sphagna, since you know the giant purple scorpion, do you know the giant white crocodile as well?”","Lin Yuan felt that if the Marsh Ground Sphagna knew the giant white crocodile, it would have let him know when he first caught the White Evil Marsh Crocodile.","Thus, it was very likely that the Marsh Ground Sphagna was not acquainted with the giant white crocodile.","Nonetheless, he still had to ask as any information regarding the giant white crocodile would help Lin Yuan make a more accurate decision.","The Marsh Ground Sphagna replied respectfully, “Lord, the East Vast Large Lake is gigantic, and I’m just a predator plant with limited ability to move. When I was by the Drugged Snake Eagle’s side, I occasionally had the opportunity to see other places. If I hadn’t become Lordess Wendy’s Favored Believer, I wouldn’t have been able to escape that stupid scorpion’s territory to come to your territory. As such, I’m more familiar with the scorpion’s territory.","“However, from the way the stupid scorpion seems so fearful of the giant white crocodile, it must mean that the giant white crocodile’s faith power is on a higher level than the stupid scorpion’s. I can say with enough certainty that the giant white crocodile’s faith power is around average or higher average.”","Lin Yuan’s eyes started to sparkle.","He considered the relationship between him and the giant white crocodile while wondering if releasing the moonlight domain in the Extreme Token would be enough to defeat the giant white crocodile if they ended up being unable to see eye to eye.","Even if the moonlight domain could seriously injure the giant white crocodile, it would still be stronger than the Invisible Demon and Liu Yanshan.","At that moment, the sacred aura in the giant white crocodile’s mouth shot toward the giant purple scorpion. The giant white crocodile snarled, “Don’t look at me with your native eyes. The Ghost Dragonfly isn’t fit to be mentioned in the same sentence as me. Which part of East Vast Large Lake is closed off to me? As a Marsh Crocodile Apostle, there’s no way any Dictator will spare me a second glance.","“But despite that, my faith power has reached a higher average. The East Vast Large Lake is nothing more than a small portion of the Marsh East Region. All you know is the East Vast Large Lake, and you’ll never be capable of leaving the East Vast large Lake. Why don’t you give your faith power to me instead so that I may stabilize my faith power.”","The giant white crocodile’s words exposed information about itself to Lin Yuan.","Just as the Marsh Ground Sphagna said, the giant white crocodile’s faith power had reached higher average.","While he was conversing with the Marsh Ground Sphagna, Lin Yuan found out that this place was called the East Vast Large Lake.","This was the first time that Lin Yuan was hearing of the East Vast Large Lake. He did not have time to understand this place, but he knew that it was a part of the Marsh East Region.","Lin Yuan now knew that the marsh world was separated into regions, and his territory was situated at the most remote corner of the marsh world.","He should be happy that he had gained information about the marsh world, yet his brows were currently tightly furrowed.","The giant white crocodile’s words indicated that it had garnered impressive experience.","This made Lin Yuan feel more pressured to pretend to be a Dictator. There was a chance that the giant white crocodile would see through his farce.","He thought,? Oh God! Who can tell me what I should be doing in order to seem more like a Dictator?","Due to the giant white crocodile’s sacred aura attack, the giant purple scorpion lost another one of its tails after using it as a shield.","One of its tails had already exploded apart while the other now exploded to pieces. Evidently, the giant white crocodile’s second attack had been much stronger than the first.","The giant purple scorpion’s shell had dimmed.","It had considered fleeing until it heard what the giant white crocodile said. The air around it changed, and it turned its head in mid-air and maneuvered into a fighting stance.","It said with a heavy tone, “You’re just using the disappearance of your son in my territory as an excuse to hide your true intentions of killing me! If so, you’ll continue hunting me even if I flee. If we fight head-on, you might have stronger faith power than me and a stronger source sacred body, but you’re an outsider who hasn’t seen my source sacred body. You have no clue what I can do with my source sacred body. Aren’t you afraid of the tables being turned, and we both end up seriously injured?”","The giant purple scorpion’s faith power exploded, and the amber source power gave it an ethereal sheen.","As the purple light fell away, a tall mature-looking woman dressed in armor of purple crystals appeared in the sky.","The woman had thin eyes, which made her appear exceptionally beautiful and menacing.","Her long purple hair was braided into three scorpion braids that were held aloft just like real scorpion tails. However, two of her braids were messy. The messier of the two braids looked as though it was going to come undone at any moment.","The totem that had been on the giant purple scorpion’s head was now on the back of the woman’s neck. The totem had been bright but now had turned into a black hole that continuously leaked faith power.","The woman’s aura intensified, and the aura that leaked out of the hole turned into three amethyst scorpions that stood by the woman’s side.","Before it had changed into its source sacred body, the totem on the giant scorpion’s head was the image of three scorpions with their tail raised. It was as though the totem had come to life.","As the giant white crocodile looked at Dark Scorpion’s strongest battle form, its look of derision sharpened."]},{"number":1210,"title":"Chapter 1210 - Sacred Source Lifeform’s Secret","paragraphs":["The giant white crocodile did not seem to be in a rush to display its source sacred body.","It said haughtily to the Dark Scorpion, “Woman, you sure are dumb. Since I have the courage to try and kill you, it must mean I’m confident of my success. There’s no way this will end with both of us seriously injured. Don’t think too much. Death will surely accompany your defeat. I might not know what abilities your source sacred body has, but it doesn’t mean it’ll be strong enough to wound me.”","The giant white crocodile’s arrogant tone agitated the woman’s aura even further.","Faith power spilled fervently from the hole in her neck and flowed into the three amethyst scorpions next to her.","Her three braids also lit up with a crystal-tinted purple glow.","The woman started to inject all her energy into her three braids.","The three braids and three amethyst scorpions’ aura became more concentrated.","But at the same time, the woman started to look frailer with each passing minute. She looked as though she had not slept for three nights.","The moment the woman’s body ran out of energy, she shook her three scorpion braids at the giant white crocodile.","The three scorpion braids grabbed the three amethyst scorpions next to her.","At the same moment, the three scorpion braids turned ashy white, and the three amethyst scorpions turned black.","The three scorpions fused together and formed a shadowy black scorpion that was more than three times the size that the giant purple scorpion had been.","The shadowy black scorpion seemed to be imbued with a strange power as it ferociously charged toward the giant white crocodile.","The moment that the Dark Scorpion unleashed its source sacred body, the Invisible Demon released its aura.","The Invisible Demon’s aura enveloped the surrounding marsh and Lin Yuan’s territory.","In order for the lifeforms in the territory to remain unaffected by the Dark Scorpion’s source sacred body aura, the Invisible Demon could not keep its power under wraps.","The Invisible Demon’s aura attracted the Dark Scorpion and giant white crocodile’s attention but not their focus.","Although the Invisible Demon’s aura was not that of the marsh world, and it had a strange scent of sulfur clinging to it, it was only Class 12 and undeserving of the Dark Scorpion and giant white scorpion’s attention.","Moreover, the Invisible Demon was not an Apostle or even a believer. As such, it was deemed a pathetic failure in the dimensional world.","In spite of the fact that it was facing an attack that contained all of the Dark Scorpion’s faith power, the giant white scorpion remained just as full of itself. It also seemed to have no intention of dodging the large black shadowy scorpion that was hurtling towards it.","Just as the large black shadowy scorpion was about to make contact with the giant white crocodile, the Dark Scorpion smiled sinisterly.","But before its smile could stretch to its full extent, it froze.","The 3,000-meter-long giant white crocodile lit up with sacred light, and amber faith power made it appear just as ethereal as the giant purple scorpion when it was transforming.","A white-haired and white-eyed man dressed in a long white robe appeared when the light dispersed. There were crocodile scales patterned all over his long robe.","The giant white crocodile’s totem was now above the man’s left eye.","There was also a black hole above his left eyebrow. Faith power did not spill out of this hole like it did out of the hole on the Dark Scorpion’s neck.","The man, who had a soldierly appearance, swung his hands forward, and the totem came to life behind him.","The enormous crocodile that was formed had an extremely formidable air about it. It was as though it had the power to swallow every creature on earth.","The Dark Scorpion expected its large black scorpion to reduce the white-haired man to a mangled mess quickly.","Yet, the moment the crocodile behind the man opened its mouth, the large black scorpion turned into a million strings of energy that soared into the white-haired man’s open mouth.","When the Dark Scorpion saw the attack that it had invested all of its power into becoming nothing more than the man’s meal, it exclaimed in shock, “Impossible! My source sacred body’s ability is all-powerful! There’s no way you could have dealt with it as though it was nothing!”","The white-haired man smirked arrogantly and said, “The sacred ability full of disruption energy was rather good. But are you so stupid that you didn’t even stop to consider that my sacred power might have unfathomable abilities too?”","He opened his mouth, and a ball of white energy that encapsulated the large black scorpion shot out toward the astonished Dark Scorpion.","The white sacred power blew the Dark Scorpion away and blasted the Dark Scorpion’s source sacred body’s armor.","A portion of the sacred power entered the black hole on the Dark Scorpion’s neck.","The Dark Scorpion’s means of linking itself to the world was the hole.","Now that the sacred energy had detonated within the Dark Scorpion’s body, purple blood burst out of its pores.","Almost the entire Dark Scorpion’s source sacred body had been destroyed.","Soon, a giant purple scorpion shadow wrapped around the broken Dark Scorpion.","The spent Dark Scorpion’s source sacred body started to melt like snow in the noon sun.","A moment later, all that was left was an amber Three Scorpion totem.","White Speak waved its hand at Dark Scorpion’s totem, and all of its faith power was pulled into the mouth of the giant crocodile behind White Speak.","Despite consuming the faith power of a below-average totem, White Speak’s faith power did not increase by much.","The faith power of an Apostle that another Apostle absorbed should equal to the World Grace of a Myth Breed fey being absorbed by another Myth Breed fey.","Although their power had increased, it would not be by much.","Soon, something happened that made Lin Yuan’s eyes bulge out of their sockets.","Rainbow light enveloped the drained totem.","Lin Yuan slapped his leg.","This was how an uncontracted sacred source lifeform looked."]},{"number":1211,"title":"Chapter 1211 - Lin Yuan Changed Into a Mermaid!","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan had pondered the link between source-type items and the dimensional world ever since he first found out that source-type items came from the dimensional hub.","The main world had never been able to come up with an accurate answer to this question.","Lin Yuan had even intentionally asked the Moon Empress about this when he first became her disciple. But all she did was smile and go on to explain the relationship between the dimensional hub and the dimensional world.","He did not know if the Moon Empress was unsure of the answer or if she felt that he had been so weak that there was no need for him to learn such knowledge.","This question had always troubled Lin Yuan.","At first, he had only been curious about the relationship between the dimensional world and source-type items.","But after he found out that sacred source lifeforms came from Class 5 dimensional rifts and that every sacred source lifeform possessed astonishing powers, he developed a burning desire to know everything about sacred source lifeforms and the dimensional world.","He had just witnessed White Speak kill the Dark Scorpion. The dead Dark Scorpion’s totem had lit up with rainbow light and transformed into a sacred source lifeform.","Now, Lin Yuan finally knew how sacred source lifeforms came about, as well as the relationship between sacred source lifeforms and the dimensional world.","Apparently, sacred source lifeforms came from the totems of dead Apostles.","However, Lin Yuan did not know if the strength of the Apostle’s faith power when it was still alive had anything to do with the formation of the sacred source lifeform. He would have to look into this matter more.","Another question had arisen in Lin Yuan’s mind as he watched the fight between the Dark Scorpion and White Speak.","The hole in Dark Scorpion’s neck had not released a significant amount of faith power. In fact, it had been less than 1% of the amount of faith power stored in the shrine in the depths of Lin Yuan’s soul.","Lin Yuan started to ponder this point of confusion, and he quickly came up with an extremely likely answer.","He currently had three Apostles, Rising Lizard, Wendy, and the White Evil Marsh Crocodile.","Lin Yuan knew that Apostles needed to use some of their faith power in order to use their totems to accept believers. It was only after the Apostle accepted the believer that they would be able to draw faith power from the believer.","They also needed to use the faith power in the totems to change select believers into Favored Believers.","As such, Apostles needed to carefully plan before they decided to accept any believers or change believers into Favored Believers.","Hence, although the Dark Scorpion’s faith power had reached below average and had unlocked its source sacred body, it did not have many believers and Favored Believers.","On the other hand, due to Lin Yuan’s presence on Star Web when he was in the Radiance Federation, he could easily gain the admiration and adoration of others which would all turn into faith that would be stored in the shrine in the depths of his soul.","Moreover, he had many identities. Firstly, the combat-class spirit qi professional Black. Secondly, the Moon Empress’ disciple Lin Yuan. Next, the owner of Purchase With No Loss store Deep Mountain Elder Lin. Finally, the City Lord of Sky City.","All four identities had their own fan club.","Although most of the fans in Black’s fan club were male fans who imitated female fans’ speaking style, the faith power they contributed was very pure.","All four of his identities drew a staggering amount of faith power in the extremely populated Radiance Federation.","This meant that not even 100 Dark Scorpions could match up to the power of the faith power he possessed.","Only two types of power mattered in the dimensional world, source-type power and faith power.","Lin Yuan was able to wield both of these powers.","Thus, there was no way he could not pass off as a Master.","The Dark Scorpion’s totem shot toward the sky but was caught by White Speak in midair.","White Speak flapped its sleeve and stored the sacred source lifeform inside its sleeve before turning its gaze onto the Invisible Demon.","White Speak wanted to see what ignorant creature dared to release its aura during its fight.","However, White Speak spotted the broken white scales by Lin Yuan’s feet.","White Speak’s face fell, and its fury boiled over. Self-reproach and sadness were all also present on its frowning face.","The cloud that swirled around White Speak also started to cry as rain poured down.","White Speak had not used much faith power from the hole above its left eye during its fight with the Dark Scorpion.","But now, faith power was pouring forth from the hole above its left eye.","The pressure from the faith power shattered the shield that the Invisible Demon had formed with its aura.","In order to protect the lives of the lifeforms in the territory, Lin Yuan had to hold his ground against the might of White Speak’s faith power.","Suddenly, he remembered Dark Blue, which had been in the Spirit Lock spatial zone all this time absorbing heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","By now, Dark Blue should have reached pinnacle Gold grade.","Dark Blue’s Faith Application would allow him to fuse with Dark Blue and make use of all of Dark Blue’s strength.","He would also be able to inject the faith power within the shrine into the Moving Source Water to strengthen its abilities.","Essentially, once he fused with Dark Blue, he would turn into water. He would not have to be worried about physical attacks in the liquid form.","Lin Yuan did not care that he would also change into a female mermaid once he used Faith Application.","In order to prevent White Speak from becoming aware of the truth, he did not summon Dark Blue out.","Instead, he entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone himself and used Faith Application with Dark Blue while in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan appeared next to the Invisible Demon again with Faith Application activated in less than a second.","However, no one recognized this being as Lin Yuan.","A body wrapped in tens of thousands of faith stood in Lin Yuan’s place.","This being seemed to encompass every type of faith of every creature in the world.","A slender blue fishtail gently swished the amber waters of faith power.","The flowing faith power moved upward from the fishtail and weaved itself into a faith sacred garment."]},{"number":1212,"title":"Chapter 1212 - Greetings, Lord Dictator!","paragraphs":["The mermaid draped in faith sacred garment had an exquisite countenance.","This face still belonged to Lin Yuan, but all the lines on his face had softened significantly.","Previously, Lin Yuan’s looks had been about an eight out of ten. It was his charisma that boosted him to a nine.","But now, his features were a ten out of ten, both as a male or a female.","Beauty or handsomeness were both inaccurate to describe his current countenance.","It was a description that could only be understood in terms of deep adoration and admiration.","Lin Yuan stared at White Speak, who had a look of incredulity on his face.","His long hair, which was composed of faith power, floated up, and thick faith power once again blanketed the entire territory and marsh.","The might from White Speak’s faith power was like a weak baby banging against the shield formed from the faith power in the shrine in Lin Yuan’s soul.","As White Speak took in Lin Yuan’s appearance and sensed the faith power that covered his body, White Speak murmured, “F-Faith body? Lord Dictator!”","White Speak’s aura immediately weakened.","However, its eyes still betrayed sorrow as it gazed at the scattered white scales by Lin Yuan’s feet.","But no matter how sad it felt, it dared not make any move against Lin Yuan.","Dictators were like gods to Apostles, and it was an innate absolute authority.","Although White Speak assumed that Lin Yuan had killed its son, it could not help but keep its head low.","However, this was because White Speak had never been in the presence of another Dictator.","In the dimensional world, the rulers always kept themselves hidden and rarely even crossed paths with each other.","If any Apostle that had the favor of a Dictator spotted Lin Yuan and realized that he was not actually strong, it would definitely attack him.","At that time, it would be exposed that he was just a phony Dictator.","Lin Yuan’s eyes shone as he looked at White Speak.","When he sensed the admiration coming from White Speak, he moved his hand away from the Extreme Token.","It seemed that White Speak was dumbfounded by him.","White Speak had ample experience in the dimensional world and was like an encyclopedia of marsh world knowledge.","After Lin Yuan and Dark Blue used Faith Application to fuse together, he gained superhuman sensitivity to water.","As such, he almost immediately sensed the White Evil Marsh Crocodile that was hiding amongst the branches of the Water Demon Support Willow.","The White Evil Marsh Crocodile’s head was buried underneath the mud, and it was clear that it was terrified.","Lin Yuan looked at White Speak in confusion.","The sorrow in White Speak’s eyes when he looked at the shattered white scales was not fake.","So was the White Evil Marsh Crocodile so fearful because White Speak was a strict parent?","Lin Yuan could not allow the White Evil Marsh Crocodile to keep hiding in such a situation.","Even if White Speak regarded him as a Dictator, it would be difficult to communicate with it if the White Evil Marsh Crocodile continued hiding.","Lin Yuan immediately yelled, “White Evil Marsh Crocodile, come out! I just transformed you into an Apostle! Why are you hiding?”","The Class 2 White Evil Marsh Crocodile heard Lin Yuan’s call and felt the tug of Lin Yuan’s faith power.","It set aside its fear of White Speak and poked its head out of the water next to Lin Yuan’s tail. It wagged its tail as it produced a gurgling noise in its throat as though it was waiting for Lin Yuan to pet it.","When White Speak saw its enlarged son, all sadness disappeared from its eyes and was replaced with surprise and anger.","But soon, the anger overtook the surprise.","If Lin Yuan were not present, White Speak would have started to beat the White Evil Marsh Crocodile.","White Speak had always been dissatisfied with this talented son. White Speak was hedonistic and considered handsome amongst all the Marsh Crocodiles. None of them were able to escape White Speak’s charm.","However, White Speak was only able to gain one offspring that had inherited its mutated bloodline. In fact, its son’s bloodline was even better than its own.","White Speak had initially doted on its son. But soon, it realized that something was wrong.","Its son was always restless and took every opportunity to slip out of its line of sight. There were even times when its son would use its natural skill to camouflage itself amongst a group of Marsh Crocodiles.","This was fine as it could be understood as the playfulness of a child. However, White Speak was most outraged by the fact that its son had no interest in increasing its power at all.","White Speak had put its son through strict training in the hopes that its son would have a bright future.","Yet, its problematic son had been transformed into an Apostle by a Dictator.","This was such a miraculous opportunity.","With the favor of a Dictator, its son was now in a better position than it was. White Speak’s anger turned into pride.","White Speak looked at Lin Yuan with admiration and gratitude.","When it realized that it was still in the air while the Dictator was on the ground, White Speak hurriedly flew down to kneel before Lin Yuan.","It lowered its arrogant head and said, “Greetings, Lord Dictator!”","White Speak’s current attitude made Lin Yuan marvel at the reverence that Dictators received.","White Speak was truly and completely defenseless in front of Lin Yuan.","But given that Lin Yuan was a fake Dictator, he did not know how a genuine Dictator would react in such a situation.","After Lin Yuan did not respond, White Speak broke out into a cold sweat and wondered if the Dictator was looking down on it.","White Speak was a Marsh Crocodile that had become the White Evil Marsh Crocodile after its bloodline mutated.","It acted so arrogantly that it seemed that it did not care about its background. But actually, its background had always been a sore spot for it.","White Speak had encountered some Apostles in East Vast Large Lake that had the favor of Dictators. Those Apostles all had weaker faith power than it did. Yet, all of them acted high and mighty and looked at White Speak with scorn."]},{"number":1213,"title":"Chapter 1213 - Soul-Stealing Lin Yuan","paragraphs":["A lifeform’s bloodline was decided by its parents, and it had no choice in the matter.","But if the lifeform received the favor of a Dictator, it did not matter, even if it was the Marsh Crocodile. No one would look down on a lifeform that had the favor of a Dictator.","White Speak badly hoped that this Dictator would grant it the dictator’s prize, which represented the Dictator’s favor.","However, White Speak knew that it came from a lowly background and dared not explicitly make the request for fear of offending Lin Yuan.","One of them didn’t dare to speak while the other was at a loss. As such, they were both stuck.","Although the White Evil Marsh Crocodile was afraid of White Speak, it was still White Speak’s child. The White Evil Marsh Crocodile had started asking for mercy on White Speak’s behalf.","Lin Yuan looked vexed by the White Evil Marsh Crocodile’s pleas for mercy.","At that moment, the Marsh Ground Sphagna said in its raspy voice full of respect, “Lord, this crocodile sure is greedy. How dare it kneel and ask for your dictator’s prize!”","The Marsh Ground Sphagna sneered arrogantly at White Speak, “How dare you ask for our Lord Dictator’s dictator’s prize before even dedicating your loyalty to him?”","Previously, the Marsh Ground Sphagna never even dared to breathe before White Speak. But now that it had Lin Yuan by its side, it could be as pompous as it pleased.","Predator plants were at the bottom of the food chain. Although the Marsh Ground Sphagna had mocked White Speak, its words also served as a reminder.","White Speak immediately took out two balls of rainbow light and lifted them up toward Lin Yuan as it said, “Lord, the one in my right hand is the Dark Scorpion’s source totem while the one in my left hand is a source totem I stole from another Apostle. I’m not sure exactly what totem this source totem came from. These two are my most precious possessions. Please accept them!”","Lin Yuan realized that sacred source lifeforms were known as source totems in the marsh world.","He badly wanted the two sacred source lifeforms that White Speak was offering. However, he did not immediately receive them from White Speak.","Instead, he nonchalantly said to the Marsh Ground Sphagna, “Marsh Ground Sphagna, you know quite a lot. What is a dictator’s prize?”","It seemed like Lin Yuan was praising the Marsh Ground Sphagna, and it smugly said, “When I was following that stupid scorpion, it once used me as a carpet for its cave. It was then that I happened to hear some secrets regarding the dictator’s prize. Apparently, the dictator’s prize is a prize that comes from a Dictator’s body. Every dictator’s prize has its own abilities, and it can grant Apostles great benefits, and it’s the thing that every Apostle dreams of obtaining one day.","“However, these are all just things I heard. I have no idea if what that stupid scorpion said was true. It’s not like that stupid scorpion had the right to come into contact with a dictator’s prize. Lord, exactly what is a dictator’s prize? What can it do? I’m sure you know best!”","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up.","Suppose the dictator’s prize was just something that could greatly benefit an Apostle and was completely separate from the Dictator itself. In that case, it could be said that Faith Water had very similar abilities to a dictator’s prize.","Faith Water was a warm stream of water formed from faith power and could nourish a lifeform that relied on faith power. It could also enable the lifeform to rapidly recover its faith power and slowly increase the faith power in its body.","When Faith Water was distributed out then recollected, one would also obtain the faith power that the target which had been granted the Faith Water had gained.","Lin Yuan looked up at White Speak and saw that its gaze was brimming with admiration and pure longing. It looked like an ignorant fey that was yearning for spirit qi.","The moment that White Speak and Lin Yuan’s eyes met, White Speak was lost in Lin Yuan’s azure eyes. White Speak’s face flushed, and it dipped its head.","White Speak’s faith power was higher average, and its source sacred body was flawlessly beautiful.","The source sacred body was an ability that Apostles gained when their life rank was promoted, and it refined their life as a whole.","Hence, there was no ugly source sacred bodies.","White Speak had come across many Apostles’ source sacred bodies during its travels in the East Vast Large Lake. It had even seen Brilliant Star’s source sacred body once. Brilliant Star’s source sacred body was considered the most beautiful source sacred body in the Marsh East Region.","Ever since then, White Speak had never forgotten that image of Brilliant Star that it had glimpsed from afar.","But now, Brilliant Star paled in comparison next to Lin Yuan. Its gorgeous smile and beauty that could rival the constellations in the sky was a far cry from Lin Yuan’s soul-stealing emotionless expression.","Many powerful Apostles in the Marsh East Region had given up everything they had in order to gain favor with the breathtaking Brilliant Star.","If any of those Apostles saw Lin Yuan’s faith body, they would not be as impressed by Brilliant Star’s source sacred body.","Suddenly, White Speak had the urge to ask Lin Yuan to participate in the Marsh East Region’s beauty contest.","The Marsh East Region’s beauty contest winner won the right to live in Marsh East Palace.","But given that Lin Yuan was a Dictator, White Speak pushed this notion away.","Suddenly, White Speak sensed Lin Yuan’s mysterious faith power surging. The faith power seeped out of the water and draped over Lin Yuan’s body like a gossamer vest of faith power.","The vest extended ten miles behind Lin Yuan, and the train was almost as large as Lin Yuan’s territory.","Lin Yuan was also astonished by the might of his faith power.","He had never activated his faith power in the main world. Yet, he felt that he would be able to produce an equally large impact if he activated his faith power in the main world.","The might of the faith power should be enhanced by the faith power’s close tie to the dimensional world.","Lin Yuan activated all his faith power now in order to use Dark Blue’s Faith Water.","He had been rather unsure when he used Faith Water as he did not know if White Speak would truly accept it as a dictator’s prize.","All of a sudden, Lin Yuan felt heat bloom in his chest, and a curved amber stream burst forth from his chest"]},{"number":1214,"title":"Chapter 1214 - Marsh East Circle, Palace of Everything","paragraphs":["The stream of twisting Faith Water flowed endlessly out of Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan silently tossed the Faith Water to the kneeling White Speak.","In spite of his cold expression, he was panicking internally.","White Speak received the Faith Water with delighted shock. It was as though it was gazing upon something incredible.","Lin Yuan’s panic spiked, and he thought,? Did White Speak notice something about the Faith Water? If it’s suspicious in any way, I’ll have to use the Extreme Token.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to use his spiritual power to trigger the Extreme Token, White Speak cried out, “Thank you for your dictator’s prize, Lord Dictator! I didn’t expect your dictator’s prize to have such powerful effects. I’m slightly overwhelmed. Please excuse my behavior! You must be in a cycle. Please allow me to stay by your side!”","Lin Yuan’s expression did not change, but he made a mental note of what White Speak said.","He did not understand what being in a cycle meant but could not ask White Speak about it at such a time.","Lin Yuan made a mental calculation of whether it would be worth it to keep White Speak by his side.","His conclusion was that it would not be best to keep White Speak by his side.","Although it would greatly increase Lin Yuan’s combat power to have White Speak by his side, he would not be able to take White Speak to the main world, and there was no contract between him and White Speak.","Their current relationship was based on White Speak’s assumption that he was a Dictator. If he allowed White Speak to stick close to him, it was likely that White Speak’s suspicions would eventually be raised.","Lies were best left untouched. As such, it would be best if he kept White Speak at arm’s length.","“White Speak, if you want to follow me, why don’t you take over the Dark Scorpion’s territory? Now that the Dark Scorpion is dead, its territory is left without a ruler.”","White Speak looked disappointed by Lin Yuan’s words as it meant that it would not be able to stay by Lin Yuan’s side.","White Speak carefully took stock of the situation in the Dark Scorpion’s territory and said, “Lord Dictator, the Dark Scorpion’s territory happens to be right outside your territory. Anyone who wants to enter your territory has to first pass through the Dark Scorpion’s territory. I will stay in the Dark Scorpion’s territory to act as your first line of defense.”","White Speak glanced at its son, who had been rolling affectionately around Lin Yuan to plead for mercy on its behalf.","He’s truly my son. He knows that he has to stay on my side!","As White Speak thought about its young and blessed son, it said to Lin Yuan tentatively, “Lord, I plan on expanding once I settle the Dark Scorpion’s territory. It’ll be best if I manage to take control of the entire East Vast Large Lake. While I’m expanding the territory, it won’t be convenient to keep White Pavilion with me. Why don’t...”","Lin Yuan immediately knew what White Speak was getting at.","He never had the intention of allowing White Speak to take the White Evil Marsh Crocodile away as he needed a lot of help from the White Evil Marsh Crocodile in order to expand his territory. If White Speak took the White Evil Marsh Crocodile away, where would he find the labor to replace the work he had intended for the White Evil Marsh Crocodile? How would he be able to develop his underwater combat power?","Although he had already come to a decision, he did not immediately agree to White Speak’s request.","Instead, he asked, “Do you have the means to obtain source totems?”","White Speak hurriedly handed the two sacred source lifeforms to Lin Yuan again.","This time, Lin Yuan accepted them and stored the unknown sacred source lifeform in the amber-button-shaped Diamond fey storage box, while the Dark Scorpion’s source totem was placed in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Although the Dark Scorpion’s source totem was wrapped in rainbow light now that it was a sacred source lifeform, Lin Yuan could still use the totem’s appearance and the Apostle’s sacred abilities to come up with hypotheses regarding what the sacred source lifeform would look like once it was contracted.","White Speak immediately spilled the beans on the situation, “There are two ways to obtain source totems. First, kill an Apostle that can unleash its source sacred body. Once it’s dead, it will leave behind a source totem that corresponds to its totem. The other method is to the Marsh East Circle, where only Apostles are allowed to enter and trade with the Palace of Everything. You can take anything to be appraised at the Palace of Everything, and a suitable price will be set. The Palace of Everything will then offer resources in exchange for the appraised item.”","White Speak paused. But when it saw Lin Yuan gesturing at it to continue speaking, it gingerly went on. “The Palace of Everything is not a faction that is native to the Marsh East Circle. However, the Palace of Everything is ranked even higher than the Marsh East Palace where the 10 great Apostles live. Dictator Everything built the Palace of Everything, and it can be found in every region of the marsh world. Any item in the Palace of Everything that catches Dictator Everything’s eye can be traded for a dictator’s treasure.”","From what White Speak just said, Lin Yuan learned how he could obtain sacred source lifeforms in the marsh world.","It would be much more convenient to obtain sacred source lifeforms in the marsh world than waiting for a Class 5 dimensional rift to open in the main world.","Additionally, White Speak also confirmed Lin Yuan’s hypothesis that Apostles that had below average and above faith power would be able to unlock their sacred source body and gain a sacred ability. Once they died, their totem would become a sacred source lifeform.","Lin Yuan noted down the information about Marsh East Circle, Marsh East Palace, Palace of Everything, and Dictator Everything.","He knew that he still did not have enough power to enter the Marsh East Circle.","To be on the safe side, he could not enter the Marsh East Circle as a Dictator. Otherwise, it could result in a mess that he had no means of cleaning up.","Even the branches of a Dictator’s faction could enter the Marsh East Palace in the Marsh East Circle.","As such, it was likely that there were no Dictators in the Marsh East Region."]},{"number":1215,"title":"Chapter 1215 - The Hope of Exploration and Charging Forward","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan’s experiences today made him aware that the marsh world was not a mess dominated by warring Apostles.","There was a bigger and more perfect world waiting for him. It made him want to explore and charge forward.","He also found out where source-type items came from.","There were two ways to create a sacred source lifeform. First, Apostles that had yet to unlock their sacred source bodies would turn into source-type items. Secondly, when the believers and Favored Believers of Apostles whose faith power had reached below strong and above died, they could also turn into a source-type item.","It was more likely for Favored Believers to turn into source-type items than it was for Apostles.","This type of source-type item was known as a believer byproduct and was sold in the Palace of Everything.","However, it was not difficult for Lin Yuan to obtain source-type items in the main world. Thus, he was no need to trade for source-type items in the Palace of Everything.","Unless Lin Yuan encountered something like the Fairy’s Heart, which had substantial strategic significance, it would be better for him to save those resources to go toward trading for sacred source lifeforms.","Sacred source lifeforms could not be bought with money in the main world.","Lin Yuan sent White Speak away to the Dark Scorpion’s territory and also told White Speak to return to his territory once a month.","He would use the opportunity to learn about the situation in Dark Scorpion’s territory during White Speak’s visits and give more Faith Water to White Speak that it could use to increase its power.","The sudden crisis had ended, and Lin Yuan had come away with enormous benefits. He not only obtained two uncontracted sacred source lifeforms but also information about the marsh world.","He had been in the marsh world for a few hours, at least.","It was not difficult for him to use Faith Water, and he prepared some for Wendy, Rising Lizard, and White Pavilion.","With all the Marsh Crocodiles worshiping the talented White Pavilion, Lin Yuan had a huge incoming supply of faith power.","This incident made him aware of how important the faith power that he never took seriously was in the marsh world.","Dark Blue’s power had been continuously increasing.","Given the current strength of his faith power, Dark Blue was already able to use Power Water Steal to consume strange water and change the elemental properties of the strange water into Willpower Runes.","However, it would be a long and tedious process for Dark Blue to use this method to gain Willpower Runes and evolve to Fantasy Breed.","Dark Blue was formed from the mutation of 12 balls of water.","As such, it needed to gain 12 willpowers from the 12 types of strange water to evolve into Fantasy Breed.","Lin Yuan also required an enormous amount of faith power to enable Dark Blue to comprehend willpowers from strange water.","Given the current level of Lin Yuan’s faith power, Dark Blue would be able to comprehend two willpowers at the most.","What Lin Yuan needed to do next was to try to come up with a way to increase his faith power in the main world. From now on, obtaining faith power from the main world would become a long-term goal for Lin Yuan.","After he sent the 50 Hundred Questions Beasts to a breeding room and stationed Liu Yanshan outside, he gave each of the Hundred Questions Beasts a Diamond fey storage box.","He also assigned the fat ginger to lead the Hundred Questions Beasts in Genius’ absence.","The 50 Hundred Questions Beasts would remain here to concoct various spirit fluids for Lin Yuan.","Once the Floating Island Whale took flight, he would be able to build a large resource storage on the Floating Island Whale’s back.","Lin Yuan let out Feng Shuang and Elder He from the Jeweled Cave Golden Toad.","All the other breeding rooms were incomplete except for the one that the Hundred Questions Beasts were using.","It was impossible for Feng Shuang and Elder He to use that breeding room alongside the Hundred Questions Beasts.","Lin Yuan decided to leave Elder He and Feng Shuang outside to help with the territory’s expansion and work alongside the 35 Spirit Craftsmen.","He also wanted them to assess the territory and make suggestions based on the perspectives of Creation Masters.","Given Feng Shuang and Elder He’s experiences, they instinctively guessed that this place was a marsh dimensional rift.","But after careful observation, they noticed that this place lacked the characteristic spatial fluctuations that were present in dimensional rifts.","It did not take long for them to guess that this place was the marsh world.","They were curious about how Lin Yuan had managed to enter the marsh world. Could a Class 6 marsh dimensional rift have opened in his underground palace?","Lin Yuan did not have the time to explain to Feng Shuang and Elder He how they ended up in the marsh world. After all, all they needed to do was focus on working.","If they dared to slack off, Liu Yanshan and the Kill Food Sky Butterfly would teach them a lesson they would never forget.","With Feng Shuang and Elder He walking free outside, they would be able to help the Medusa Snake Demons look after Endless Summer’s Barren River Orchid Bud by concocting spirit fluids to fertilize the soil and slowly improve the Barren River Orchid Bud’s growth. This would increase Endless Summer’s power.","When Lin Yuan did not assign Feng Shuang and Elder He any jobs, Feng Shuang flipped her hair and asked, “Lord, what should the two of us do now? Please instruct us! Elder He and I will definitely do our best to complete the jobs you give us!”","While Feng Shuang was speaking, her actions indicated her passion and determination.","She had been indignant that Lin Yuan had assigned Hu Tian as their manager.","Now that Hu Tian was back at the underground palace in the Divine Wood Federation, Feng Shuang felt that this was her chance to prove herself.","She felt that she was a more likely candidate to earn Lin Yuan’s favor than the quiet Elder He.","Lin Yuan did not tell her what she would be doing in the marsh world.","Instead, he waved over the Kill Food Sky Butterfly.","The Kill Food Sky Butterfly instantly appeared by Lin Yuan’s side.","Lin Yuan introduced the Kill Food Sky Butterfly to Feng Shuang and Elder He and said, “You just have to do whatever the Kill Food Sky Butterfly tells you to do.”"]},{"number":1216,"title":"Chapter 1216 - Connected Beast Park Issues Another Blood Pact Ultimate Fight","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan said to the Kill Food Sky Butterfly, “I assigned a thearch-class expert outside the breeding room. You can send him out to do any tasks that involve danger. I have amassed many earth-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls. They should be enough to heal you.”","He placed a wooden chest at the Kill Food Sky Butterfly’s feet.","With a wave of his hand, earth-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls filled the wooden chest almost to the brim.","Lin Yuan bent down and looked through the wooden chest. He eventually picked out the Over the Rail Coral elemental pearls.","He did not find any Heavenly Maiden Sleet elemental pearls.","Feng Shuang and Elder He were stunned when they saw the chest full of earth-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","Three questions popped into their heads.","Since when did heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls become available by the chestful? How much is that chest of earth-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls worth? How many elemental pearls does the City Lord have in his possession!?","The Kill Food Sky Butterfly was only slightly shocked when Lin Yuan produced even more heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","It looked at Liu Yanshan before saying gently, “With these elemental pearls, I’ll be able to reach Sovereign grade in less than a week. Leave everything in the marsh world to me. I’ll send Purple Afterglow to fetch you if anything crops up.”","The Kill Food Sky Butterfly was elated after Lin Yuan told it to send the thearch-class expert to do any tasks that involved danger. This meant that Lin Yuan cared about it.","Purple Afterglow regarded Lin Yuan as its father. This meant that he was the Kill Food Sky Butterfly’s father-in-law.","It felt good to be cared for by one’s father-in-law.","Lin Yuan always maintained a low profile. He only flashed his wealth for Feng Shuang and Elder He’s sake. He wanted to squash all hints of inappropriate thoughts that they could have and understand that their future would only be bright if they followed Lin Yuan.","He had slapped them but now was flexing his wealth in front of them as he needed to bait them at the right times to ensure they did honest work.","Lin Yuan gave Feng Shuang and Elder He two pots of Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","Feng Shuang and Elder He could not help but gasp. “Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls! These are Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls!”","Every top faction in the Radiance Federation was racking their brains to come up with a way to obtain Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls from the Moon Empress.","Feng Shuang and Elder He had been members of the Zheng family and had no authority to even go near something like the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearl.","However, Zheng Kaiyuan had made bold remarks which included the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls when he had been convincing his grandfather to agree to the blood pact ultimate fight with Sky City.","From then, Feng Shuang and Elder He had yearned for this incredible item that was a treasure to all Creation Masters.","In spite of their shock, they were still confused.","Don’t the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls come from the Moon Empress? Is it possible that Sky City is connected to the Moon Empress? How else are they able to get their hands on the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls?","Given that Lin Yuan had additional Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls to give to them, it indicated that he had many Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls on hand.","Lin Yuan ignored Feng Shuang and Elder He’s shocked and suspicious expressions.","There was almost no chance that they would be leaving the marsh world in the future.","Even if they did stumble onto any secret, Lin Yuan would not have to worry because there was no one in the marsh world they could tell their discovery to.","Lin Yuan had a deeper intention behind giving the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls to Feng Shuang and Elder He.","The Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls could increase the success rate and speed of concoction of their spirit fluids. This would increase Lin Yuan’s Creation Master resources as well.","Now that he was done with everything he had to do in the marsh world, Lin Yuan left the Spirit Lock spatial zone through Klein Hub.","There was a time difference between the Startling Lines Continent and Radiance Federation. The Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting was about to start soon.","After he left the tent, he asked Hu Quan if he was ready to return to the Radiance Federation.","Hu Quan said no and asked Lin Yuan to bring more Spirit Craftsmen with him on his next trip as it would take forever for only five Spirit Craftsmen to construct the underground palace.","Lin Yuan stored Liu Jie back into the Jeweled Cave Golden Toad and walked deep into the underground palace.","He used a large number of spatial crystals and returned to the Return from Faraway Mansion through the Space Tunnel.","After another long-distance trip, Lin Yuan collapsed to the ground in a dizzy state that lasted for five minutes.","Once the dizziness faded, Lin Yuan smiled wryly and climbed to his feet. He shook his head and thought,? I’ll have to endure this pain of long-distance travel very often from now on.","He let Liu Jie out of the Jeweled Cave Golden Toad, and they left the basement together.","There was a Sunlight King Lotus planted every 100 meters along the basement. As such, the basement was as bright as the daytime.","Once they left the basement, Lin Yuan realized that the sun had just started rising and darkness still dominated the sky.","Liu Jie breathed in deeply and stretched as he said, “Wen Yu, the Mother of Bloodbath, and the rest haven’t eaten my cooking in two days. I wonder if they miss it. It’s still early, so I won’t return to the mansion just yet. I’ll head to the spiritual ingredient market to buy three Gold Shallow Stream Carp so I can cook fishball noodles seasoned with white pepper. The Mother of Bloodbath likes to eat chicken wings, so I’ll buy some back and grill them. The chicken wings will be done by the time we’re done eating the fishball noodles!”","Lin Yuan felt his saliva pool in his mouth.","He gulped and replied, “Big Brother Liu, forget about the rest of them in the mansion. I’ve been with you all this time, but I haven’t been able to eat your cooking either. I miss your cooking badly!”","While Liu Jie headed to the spiritual ingredient market, Lin Yuan returned to the mansion.","When he walked in, he saw Wen Yu was sitting on the water rhinoceros leather sofa organizing a stack of documents.","Her bloodshot eyes were a clear sign that she had not slept a wink.","She lifted her head when she heard sounds coming from the entrance.","When she spotted Lin Yuan, she looked surprised yet burdened.","She hurriedly handed a pile of papers to him and said, “During your absence these two days, many things happened in the Royal Capital! Connected Beast Park has issued a blood pact ultimate fight challenge to the Sea Bliss Clan!”"]},{"number":1217,"title":"Chapter 1217 - Time to Reap the Harvest!","paragraphs":["Wen Yu yawned and rubbed her eyes. Clearly, she was exhausted after a sleepless night.","After Lin Yuan received the documents from Wen Yu, she could not help but murmur, “Since Connected Beast Park lost two veteran thearch-class experts to Sky City, the smart thing to do now is lay low and not cause any trouble. After all that has happened, all eyes are on Connected Beast Park now. They’re all waiting for Connected Beast Park to provide an explanation. Yet, they’re doing the exact opposite by being antagonizers. Are they really unaffected by the loss of two veteran thearch-class experts?”","A look of realization came over Lin Yuan.","He was definitely part of the reason the Sea Bliss Clan was in such a predicament.","He wondered if the Sea Bliss Clan was stupid. When they realized that there was a lack of Aurora pollen, they could have properly investigated the situation and found out about Sky City and Condense Fairy Orchard’s collaboration.","Yet, they immediately assumed that Connected Beast Park was to blame.","The Sea Bliss Clan had given Connected Beast Park significant grief recently.","The Sea Bliss Clan made use of Connected Beast Park’s loss of two thearch-class experts to target them.","It was humiliating for a top faction to be targeted by a veteran faction.","The last time Lin Yuan had visited Connected Beast Park, he had given them Law Crystals that would enable them to create seven new thearch-class experts.","The new thearch-class experts would definitely be able to fill the gap in power that they needed badly as well as squash negative rumors.","Thus, despite laying low being the smart thing to do, Connected Beast Park chose to attack the Sea Bliss Clan.","They aimed to use the Sea Bliss Clan to build up their might again.","Miao Zhenshan was the head of the Miao family and could not participate himself as it would cause the Miao family to appear weak.","It was the same for the female thearch-class expert that looked after the Miao family’s treasure vault.","Hence, it was likely that the Miao family would dispatch the new thearch-class experts to participate in the blood pact ultimate fight against the Sea Bliss Clan.","Lin Yuan had not informed Wen Yu about his visit to the Miao family. Thus, no matter how strategic-minded Wen Yu was, she would not be able to figure out the plan that Connected Beast Park had.","“Connected Beast Park has a reason for acting so boldly. Not long ago, they traded with me and obtained a few Law Crystals, which they used to gain seven new thearch-class experts. If they produce seven new thearch-class during a time of crisis, not only will their reputation be unaffected by the Zheng family’s blood pact ultimate fight loss, but the other top factions will also be clamoring to work with them after witnessing their power. It might seem like they’re targeting the Sea Bliss Clan, but this is actually all part of their plan.”","Wen Yu’s eyes widened.","She had been astonished when she heard that Connected Beast Park had challenged the Sea Bliss Clan to a blood pact ultimate fight.","It turned out that the mastermind was Lin Yuan.","He might not have been in the Radiance Federation, but he had still been the cause of the biggest piece of news in the Radiance Federation.","Connected Beast Park and Sky City were bitter enemies.","Wen Yu did not believe that Lin Yuan would stop at just helping the Miao family to gain seven new thearch-class experts as that would be against Lin Yuan’s personality.","Wen Yu pondered for a moment before her eyes lit up, and she asked, “Young Master, Connected Beast Park helped the Zheng family in the blood pact ultimate fight against us. Although they lost thearch-class experts, they still haven’t compensated us. Are you going to help the Sea Bliss Clan in the blood pact ultimate fight against the Miao family?”","Lin Yuan smiled.","Wen Yu and I are on the same frequency!","That exact idea popped into Lin Yuan’s head when he heard that Connected Beast Park had issued a blood pact ultimate fight challenge to the Sea Bliss Clan.","He had helped Connected Beast Park increase their number of thearch-class experts so that he would be able to obtain the World Crystals in the bodies of the thearch-class experts’ feys.","The blood pact ultimate fight the Miao family was initiating would be a good opportunity for Lin Yuan to collect those World Crystals.","Since the Miao family had helped the Zheng family, it would not cause a stir if Sky City helped the Sea Bliss Clan this time. Rather, it would allow other factions to see that Sky City was a vengeful faction.","This would also allow him to obtain more faith power for his identity as the City Lord of Sky City.","Naturally, Sky City would not ask for nothing in return.","The Sea Bliss Clan had the courage to clash with Connected Beast Park because of the lack of Aurora pollen. The deaths of many Angelfish of Bliss had aggravated the Sea Bliss Clan’s emotions.","It was clear from this how easy loss could trigger hysteria.","But now that their lives were in the hands of another, the Sea Bliss Clan was afraid of Connected Beast Park, who was much more powerful.","Currently, the Sea Bliss Clan was desperate to find a way out of this peril.","“Wen Yu, we don’t need to reach out to the Sea Bliss Clan. Connected Beast Park might have lost two veteran thearch-class experts, but they still have Miao Zhenshan. As such, they still have the highest level of combat power.","“Other factions might be able to overwhelm them in terms of money and resources, but they won’t dare to take them on in a physical confrontation. When the Sea Bliss Clan runs out of avenues to seek help, they’ll definitely come to Sky City, which is Connected Beast Park’s enemy. All we have to do is silently wait for the Sea Bliss Clan to approach us.”","“Young Master, once the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting is over, I’ll go to Sky City’s private territory to wait for the Sea Bliss Clan,” replied Wen Yu.","Lin Yuan shook his head and said, “Big Brother Liu has gone to buy fresh ingredients for fishball noodles. You didn’t sleep at all last night, so you should hit the sack once you’re done eating. We’ll begin the parliamentary meeting after you’re done resting. The Astronomical Parliamentary meeting will sap your spiritual energy and take too much toll on your body to conduct it in an exhausted state.”","Wen Yu smiled sweetly and said, “Young Master, please wake me if I’m not awake by 1:00 p.m. No one can sleep comfortably with issues weighing on their mind. We will suffer a great loss if my rest causes Su Yiren to miss the parliamentary meeting.”"]},{"number":1218,"title":"Chapter 1218 - Sun Ningxiang Asks for Help","paragraphs":["As the owner of the Astronomical Parliament, Wen Yu had also looked through Su Yiren’s memories as Lin Yuan had done.","As such, Wen Yu was very keen on Su Yiren. After all, she was a Dark Envoy that was available to be controlled amidst the Dark Federation’s crisis. This made her even more important than the Azure Envoy Yin Lin.","Yin Lin might be an Azure Envoy, but she was the fourth Azure Envoy and did not have the authority to dictate the events in the Azure Federation.","Su Yiren was one of the seven Dark Federation Dark Envoys that were chosen simultaneously in the Dark Continent.","If Su Yiren made her identity known during this crisis in the Dark Continent, she would have the right to take control of the Dark Continent.","In Wen Yu’s eyes, Su Yiren was the equivalent of the entire Dark Continent.","Wen Yu understood that this long-term strategic resource was of the utmost importance.","She was so afraid of being late that she skipped eating Liu Jie’s fishball noodles and headed straight to her room to sleep.","Once Liu Jie was done cooking, Lin Yuan, the Mother of Bloodbath, and Liu Jie were the only people at the table.","Listen and Zhou Luo were busy liaising with Zheng Kaiyan and taking over all of the Zheng family’s luxury resources. As such, they were currently on their way to Indigo Azure City.","Endless Summer had gone with them to protect them.","Duan He was training with the white-clothed followers while Hu Quan was building the underground palace in the Divine Wood Federation.","Chu Ci had gone with Cold Moon to increase her power.","Hence, it was not possible for there to be full attendance at the mansion.","After breakfast, Lin Yuan gave the Mother of Bloodbath a fey storage box that contained the ripened Blood Brew Grapes and fallen old Blood Brew Grapevine leaves.","The Mother of Bloodbath received the fey storage box.","When it saw that there were several times the number of Blood Brew Grapes in the box than usual, the Mother of Bloodbath asked, “Lin Yuan, just how many Blood Brew Grapes do you have? Your Blood Brew Grapevine is growing way too quickly!”","Lin Yuan smiled.","This was thanks to the Fantasy V Red Thorn. Now that Red Thorn’s quality had evolved, the blood energy in the Eyes of Relinquish had also been increased.","Red Thorn now had three Mouths of Relinquish, and the number of Eyes of Relinquish had also increased by three times.","Red Thorn’s consumption and digestion abilities had also been improved. This meant that it could produce Eyes of Relinquish much faster than before.","Thus, the Blood Brew Grapevine, which was receiving many more Eyes of Relinquish now, could also produce a much higher number of Blood Brew Grapes.","“Mother of Bloodbath, I will be providing you Blood Brew Grapes at an even higher rate from now on. You should be able to reach Myth III soon.”","Lin Yuan thought about the 500 Spirit-Mouthed Peonies that were growing in the Pure Land of Bliss.","He was nurturing so many Spirit-Mouthed Peonies for the Moon Empress and the Mother of Bloodbath.","Gray’s need for pure spirit qi allowed Lin Yuan to learn the lesson of being prepared in advance.","The flowers of the Spirit-Mouthed Peony that were filled with spirit qi could be stored after they were plucked.","Stocking up on such pure spirit qi that could be used at any time would ensure that he would not have to panic if he ever needed a large amount of spirit qi.","The Mother of Bloodbath stood up and said, “Lin Yuan, I know I’m too weak to perform my duty as your Path Protector properly. However, I’ve still decided to go to the Divine Wood Federation with you.”","In the Mother of Bloodbath’s life up till now, the most exciting part was the time it spent in the Return from Faraway Mansion.","Lin Yuan was the one who made the Mother of Bloodbath aware that life was not all about increasing one’s power. Emotions could play a part too.","It thought back to the young man back at Millstone Town that needed its protection. Now, he had grown so much that he no longer needed its protection.","However, it still wanted to experience the life of adventuring by Lin Yuan’s side like it did back when it was still a small spider perched on Lin Yuan’s shoulder.","Naturally, Lin Yuan would not reject the Mother of Bloodbath’s request.","Besides, he planned on taking it to the Divine Wood Federation for its World Cleansing once it reached Myth III.","He hoped that it would be able to awaken its Sky Sundial Jade Spider bloodline and transform into a Heavenly Family Fey.","Lin Yuan returned to the basement after the Mother of Bloodbath left with the Blood Brew Grapes.","The walls of the basement were covered with Floating Silver Strands, and he cut a small piece of it.","Before he left the Divine Wood Federation, he had asked Hu Quan if he still had any Floating Silver Strands.","Hu Quan had responded that all the Floating Silver Strands were buried in the basement walls, excluding those that were set aside for the fey carriage.","Lin Yuan immediately set his sights on the fey carriage.","Hu Quan had invested a lot of effort into the fey carriage. As such, Hu Quan did not want Lin Yuan to wreck the half-done fey carriage by removing some of its Floating Silver Strands.","As such, Hu Quan told Lin Yuan that he had added additional Floating Silver Strands to the basement walls to prevent the walls from collapsing when under attack.","This tiny piece of Floating Silver Strand was enough. All Lin Yuan needed was a small piece that the Vein Land Imp could use to form a contract with it.","Once he cut the Floating Silver Strands, his phone started to ring. Lin Yuan looked and saw that the call was coming from Sun Ningxiang.","He assumed that Sun Ningxiang wanted to talk about the Aurora pollen when he picked up.","Yet, Sun Ningxiang was sniffling on the other end of the call. She started to sob when he picked up.","Lin Yuan might have faced many obstacles in his life but had no clue how he should respond when a girl was crying on the other end of a call.","He suddenly remembered that she had asked for Legend Muscle Growth Camellia when they first started working together. She had said that she needed it to heal her grandmother.","Only three direct descendants of Condense Fairy Orchard were left.","Sun Ningxiang could only be crying so woefully because something had happened to one of her two remaining family members.","Lin Yuan felt that it was more likely that something had happened to Sun Ningxiang’s grandmother.","Her brother was too young to even form contracts with feys. As long as he was properly looked after, there was no way for him to encounter any danger.","As he expected, Sun Ningxiang said in an anxious and helpless wail, “Lin Yuan, can you help me contact the Moon Empress? My grandmother isn’t going to make it!”","Sun Ningxiang’s desperate voice and choked sobs made Lin Yuan’s chest tighten, so he hastily replied, “Don’t rush. Speak slowly. I need to know what exactly has happened to your grandmother.”"]},{"number":1219,"title":"Chapter 1219 - Item that Even Members of Royalty were Not Fit to Use","paragraphs":["Sun Ningxiang was momentarily at a loss for words. She was not even certain how many hidden injuries her grandmother had sustained from that incident.","When she had asked her grandmother, her grandmother declined to tell her for fear of making her worry.","Sun Ningxiang had been having a meal with her grandmother when her grandmother’s eyes suddenly clouded over, and blood spurted from her mouth before she fainted.","Sun Ningxiang flew into a panic.","She was neither a Creation Master nor a healing-type spirit qi professional. As such, she was not capable of finding out what had happened to her grandmother.","She dared not approach any of the Sun family’s Creation Masters and healing-type spirit qi professionals.","After that incident, the strongest Creation Master in the Sun family was only pinnacle Class 3. Moreover, she could not let anyone from Condesne Fairy Orchard know that her grandmother had fainted.","Although she had assumed leadership of Condense Fairy Orchard, her grandmother was the true anchor of Condense Fairy Orchard.","Connected Beast Park would have attacked the Sun family without her grandmother’s thearch-class power deferring the Miao family.","It was also possible that some unscrupulous people within Condense Fairy Orchard could start scheming.","Sun Ningxiang had once invested many resources in seeking out a Class 4 Creation Master and emperor-class healing-class spirit qi professional to check on her grandmother’s situation.","In the end, both of them had said that her grandmother’s situation had reached a point that was beyond help.","In her panicked state, Sun Ningxiang immediately thought of Lin Yuan.","Only the Moon Empress would be able to save her grandmother.","Sun Ningxiang and Lin Yuan had a personal relationship, but the way she was speaking to him was over the line and could even be considered offensive.","However, she did not have any other choice. For the sake of her grandmother and the future of Condense Fairy Orchard, she could only and had to plead for Lin Yuan’s help.","Lin Yuan’s answer would dictate the future of Condense Fairy Orchard and her grandmother.","When Lin Yuan heard Sun Ningxiang’s muddled reply, he asked, “Your grandmother must have contracted feys. Were any of her contracted feys outside when she fainted? If so, ask them. They’ll definitely know what has happened to your grandmother.”","Sun Ningxiang sobbed even louder and replied, “Grandma’s feys had all been summoned out. But when she fainted and vomited black blood, they all automatically returned to the spiritual spatial zone. Lin Yuan, what’s going on?”","Lin Yuan’s brow furrowed even deeper.","Feys did not usually automatically return to the spiritual spatial zone when their contractor fainted.","There could only be two reasons for such an occurrence.","Firstly, their contractor had recalled them to the spiritual spatial zone before they fainted.","Secondly, their contractor was on the brink of death, and the feys were forced to return to the spiritual spatial zone. This state was known as the ‘trapped state’ by Creation Masters.","If Sun Ningxiang’s grandmother were truly in a trapped state, the situation would be dire.","Spirit qi professionals could only live for six hours at the most in a trapped state.","This meant that if Lin Yuan could not fix the situation when Sun Ningxiang brought her grandmother to the Royal Capital to see him, they would not have time to take her grandmother to Leaning Moon Mountain afterward.","However, it was also not feasible for the Moon Empress to make the trip herself.","He had just called the Moon Empress, but Mystic Moon had picked up the call. He had told Lin Yuan that the Moon Empress had locked herself away to train.","Lin Yuan had originally planned to visit the Moon Empress at Radiant Moon Palace this afternoon. But now, he had no choice but to wait till she was done training and contacted him herself.","In such a crisis, he had to tell Sun Ninxiang his thoughts, no matter how difficult to swallow they were.","“Have you heard of the trapped state?”","Sun Ningxiang immediately collapsed onto the wool carpet.","Although she was not a Creation Master, she had heard of the trapped state.","She had called Lin Yuan as he was her last hope. But now, her last strand of hope shattered.","She forgot that she was still on the phone with Lin Yuan in her despair.","“Thankfully, you called me right after your grandmother fainted. My Master has locked herself away to train, but I have one Moon Dew Revival Pill. Even if your grandmother’s situation is too serious for the Moon Dew Revival Pill to cure her completely, it should be able to help her regain consciousness and give you time to bring her to the Royal Capital for treatment.”","Sun Ningxiang was immediately stunned.","The Moon Dew Revival Pill was the Moon Empress’ specialty sacred item, and Sun Ningxiang had definitely heard of it.","It was said that the Moon Dew Revival Pill could bring a person back to life so long as they had one last breath within them.","A decade ago, the Spacetime Elder had entered a near-death state after a fight with experts from the Freedom Federation.","The thearch-class healers from Ostrich Logistics had all been helpless to heal him.","Eventually, the Moon Empress gifted him a Moon Dew Revival Pill.","It was said that the Moon Dew Revival Pill was formed from the tears of the Moon Crying Sacred Beast and almost 1,000 precious spiritual ingredients. The Moon Dew Revival Pill was activated by the tree sap of the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassias.","The Moon Dew Revival Pill had saved the Spacetime Elder and prevented the Radiance Federation from losing a member of royalty.","This Moon Dew Revival Pill was the reason for Radiant Moon Palace and Ostrich Logistics’ close relationship over the last decade.","Ever since then, many top factions had been racking their brains trying to obtain a Moon Dew Revival Pill from the Moon Empress.","There were very few factions that had managed to receive a Moon Dew Revival Pill from the Moon Empress.","Even Iron Prison had been rejected and chased out of the Radiant Moon Palace when he asked for a Moon Dew Revival Pill.","Hence, the Moon Dew Revival Pill was termed as the ‘item that not even members of royalty were fit to use’.","Sun Ningxiang felt utterly empty when she heard that her grandmother was in a trapped state.","Flower City neighbored Redbud City and was very far from the Royal Capital.","Even if Lin Yuan contacted the Moon Empress on her behalf, she would not have time to take her grandmother to the Royal Capital.","However, she did not expect Lin Yuan to have a Moon Dew Revival Pill, much less he would be willing to give it up to save her grandmother"]},{"number":1220,"title":"Chapter 1220 - Lovely Young Man Lin Yuan","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan did not say anything else when he promised to give Sun Ningxiang the Moon Dew Revival Pill. This meant that Lin Yuan did not expect anything in return from Sun Ningxiang.","Given that Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’ disciple, there was nothing Sun Ningxiang had that Lin Yuan would want.","Sun Ningxiang choked up, and her eyes blurred over with tears.","As tears cascaded down her cheeks, gratitude, preciousness, delight, and vestiges of fear gripped her and prevented her from being able to utter the thanks she badly wanted to convey.","At this moment, Lin Yuan said, “I’m going to hang up now. I’ll call you again later. Although spirit qi professionals in a trapped state can last for about five to six hours, your grandmother has other hidden injuries. It’s highly unlikely that she’ll be able to last for as long as five to six hours. I will contact Ostrich Logistics now and ask to express-deliver the Moon Dew Revival Pill to you within two hours.”","The moment Lin Yuan finished speaking, he heard more noise coming from Sun Ningxiang’s end.","Lin Yuan’s anxious tone had touched Sun Ningxiang again. She was so overwhelmed with emotion that she could not help but curl her lips slightly.","After Lin Yuan hung up, he immediately contacted his dedicated courier, Ah Neng.","Once he explained the situation to her, Ah Neng guaranteed that she would reach the entrance of Lin Yuan’s mansion in less than ten minutes and deliver the package to Sun Ningxiang in Flower City within half an hour.","After he put down the phone, he hurriedly headed over to the mansion entrance.","In less than three minutes, Ah Neng rushed over.","She was wearing Ostrich Logistics’ standard uniform, and she removed her hat with a smile when she saw Lin Yuan. With her hat in her hands, she waved at him.","Her short red and purple hair shone with liveliness under the afternoon sunlight.","Although she still looked like a rookie, she never made a mistake with Lin Yuan’s deliveries other than the occasional incident of leaving the order forms with him.","Lin Yuan solemnly told her again about how urgent this package was.","Ah Neng received the package and gave him a thumbs up after glancing at the order number.","A glowing silver shell appeared in her hand.","She recited the information on the order form toward the shell, and the shell ripped a rift in the space in front of Ah Neng.","Ah Neng waved at Lin Yuan for a final time before disappearing into the rift.","Previously, she would always leave Lin Yuan’s sight before proceeding with her delivery as it was one of Ostrich Logistics’ regulations.","However, she had heard how urgent Lin Yuan made this package out to be and decided to do away with the regulations.","This was the first time that Lin Yuan witnessed Ostrich Logistics’ method of traveling between Radiance Federation within three hours.","According to the information he had received from the Moon Empress, he knew that other factions could not replicate this power of Ostrich Logistics because the Hollow Crystal Shellfishes used by the couriers came from the Spacetime Elder’s Spatial Mother Shellfish’s ability.","After he sent off the Moon Dew Revival Pill, Lin Yuan called Sun Ningxiang again and said softly, “I’ve sent out the Moon Dew Revival Pill. It should reach you in half an hour. Don’t worry.”","As Sun Ningxiang continued to choke back sobs, Lin Yuan said comfortingly, “Don’t cry. Your grandmother will be worried if she regains consciousness and sees you crying.”","Surprisingly, Sun Ningxiang started to sob even harder.","Lin Yuan was left at a loss. He scratched the back of his head and tried to come up with a way to comfort her.","Unfortunately, the only thing he could come up with was to urge her not to worry.","As the direct descendant of Condense Fairy Orchard, who had assumed leadership of the faction long ago, she knew that she could not wear her true emotions on her sleeve.","As she had been holding up Condense Fairy Orchard on her own all these years, she was stressed with even occurrences that were related to Condense Fairy Orchard.","Things had only taken a turn for the better when she met Lin Yuan on Star Web. It was also Lin Yuan who had given her the Muscle Growth Camellia that gave her hope that her grandmother could be healed.","When Sun Ningxiang had been targeted at the Guard Ye Banquet, those from the other factions all mocked her. With her jaw clenched and at a momentary loss, Lin Yuan had supported her.","Now, Lin Yuan was selflessly giving her a Moon Dew Revival Pill to save not only her grandmother’s life but also the entire Condense Fairy Orchard.","Lin Yuan allowed Sun Ningxiang to know what it felt like to have someone to rely on.","As such, it was only with Lin Yuan that she could cry and vent without restraint. At that moment, she was completely vulnerable.","She felt that saying thanks was not enough to express her gratitude for the immense help that Lin Yuan had given her.","Without Lin Yuan’s Moon Dew Revival Pill, they would be nothing but a shell of a top faction that did not have any thearch-class experts guarding them. Regardless of her relationship with Lin Yuan, the other top factions would definitely come after them.","Sun Ningxiang glanced at her unconscious grandmother and silently decided that once her grandmother awoke, she would suggest to her grandmother that they place Condense Fairy Orchard under Sky City’s wing and become a branch of Sky City.","She felt that this was the only way to repay all that Lin Yuan had done for Condense Fairy Orchard.","As she listened to Lin Yuan struggle to comfort her, a foreign familiar rose within her. It was like the romantic and dizzying blending of midsummer with the sky. It was like fireflies dancing across a crystal clear lake.","Sun Ningxiang was like a fanatic that swung a fan amidst the fireflies. The more she swung the fan, the deeper into her obsession she fell.","While Sun Ningxiang was deep in thought, Lin Yuan did not sense that anything was odd.","He regarded her as his friend, and it was only natural that he helped out his friend in her time of need.","It did not just apply to Sun Ningxiang. He would do the same for Long Tao, Li Xuan, Zong Ze, Gu Lang, and Gao Feng as well"]},{"number":1221,"title":"Chapter 1221 - Completely Different","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan could only hope that no accident took place and that Sun Ningxiang’s grandmother could immediately recover after eating the Moon Dew Revival Pill.","Sun Ningxiang’s emotions were out of control, and Lin Yuan could not just hang up on her.","As such, he decided to wait for Ah Neng to deliver the Moon Dew Revival Pill and see what happened to Sun Ningxiang’s grandmother after consuming it.","The next half an hour flew by with Lin Yuan struggling to comfort the sobbing Sun Ningxiang.","At that moment, Sun Ningxiang received Ah Neng’s delivery.","Lin Yuan said to her seriously, “When I received this Moon Dew Revival Pill, Uncle Mystic told me that it contains the tears of the Moon Crying Sacred Beast. Hence, it can’t be taken with water. Moreover, once it comes into contact with a human’s aura, the tears of the Moon Crying Sacred Beast will rapidly dissolve. You have to be careful not to touch it with your hands when you’re retrieving it from the jade bottle.”","Although Sun Ningxiang had decided to thank Lin Yuan with her actions and not speech, she still could not help but utter her thanks.","Her voice was grim and brimming with emotions.","Lin Yuan hurriedly replied, “You’re welcome. Feed the Moon Dew Revival Pill to your grandmother, and let’s see what happens.”","Sun Ningxiang did as Lin Yuan said.","While she was feeding it to her grandmother, she noticed that her grandmother’s body had gone slightly stiff, and dark red pus was oozing out of her rapidly decaying wounds.","If not for her grandmother’s weak but still existent pulse, Sun Ningxiang would have assumed that her grandmother was already dead. Her grandmother was truly on her deathbed.","If Lin Yuan had not rushed the delivery or offered to send the Moon Dew Revival Pill without hesitation, her grandmother would have been gone by the time the Moon Dew Revival Pill arrived.","Sun Ningxiang’s heart pounded anxiously as she fed her grandmother the Moon Dew Revival Pill.","Although the Moon Dew Revival Pill was a sacred medicine that came from the Moon Empress and had revival abilities, she could not be at ease when her family member’s life was at stake.","She held her breath when the Moon Dew Revival Pill dissolved and entered her grandmother’s body.","Sun Ningxiang carefully observed her grandmother.","At that moment, a warm moonbeam shone from within her grandmother’s body. The moonbeams were also laced with 1,000 faint and poignant fragrances.","Slowly, color returned to her grandmother’s pale face, and a healthy flush bloomed.","Sun Ningxiang carefully unwrapped the bandages that covered her grandmother’s wounds.","The wounds that had been decaying moments ago were already starting to improve. The decayed portions were dissolving, and new flesh had started to grow.","In less than a minute, all the wounds that she had struggled to treat for so many years were healed.","Sun Ningxiang was over the moon.","But when the moonbeams and fragrances dissipated, Sun Ningxiang tensed up again as she realized that her grandmother had yet to awake.","Lin Yuan caught her confusion and said with a smile, “Has your grandmother’s soul ever been heavily injured? From your description, it sounds like your grandmother’s wounds have all healed. The Moon Dew Revival Pill has the ability to wake the spirit. Your grandmother should be waking up soon.”","The moment the last word left Lin Yuan’s lips, Sun Ningxiang’s grandmother opened her eyes.","Sun Ningxiang had stopped crying. But when she saw that her grandmother had regained consciousness, tears started spilling from her eyes again.","This time, it was tears of joy and not sadness.","The moment Sun Ningxiang’s grandmother awoke, Lin Yuan hung up the phone and let out a small breath of relief.","Her grandmother had been pulled out of Death’s arms.","In Condense Fairy Orchard’s residence in Flower City...","Sun Ningxiang’s grandmother had awoken with a look of disbelief on her face.","As a thearch-class expert that had been living every day expecting it to be her last, Liu Yuan was well aware of her body’s condition.","From the moment she spat out the first mouthful of blood, she knew that the moment she had been dreading was finally here.","Just as she had been about to explain the situation to Sun Ningxiang, her wounded soul exploded, and she fainted before she could get a single word out.","Liu Yuan’s heart was full of worry and self-reproach right before fainting. She was afraid that Condense Fairy Orchard would fall into ruin without her, and the other top factions would bully Sun Ningxiang.","Liu Yuan regretted insisting on using the Legend Muscle Growth Camellia’s roots to attempt to clear all the poison from her body. If she had been successful, she would be able to live for much longer than a measly three to five years.","But before she could do so, the poison had reached her brain and triggered her wounded soul that she had spent a great deal of effort subduing.","If she had still attempted to clear the poison using the roots of the Muscle Growth Camellia, the poison would have caused her soul to blow apart.","As such, she had no choice but to abandon the idea and use the Muscle Growth Camellia to treat her external wounds.","The Legend Muscle Growth Camellia’s leaves were the best medicine for removing poison. However, Liu Yuan had taken a gamble by using its roots, which were several times more powerful.","Once the roots were gone, the Muscle Growth Camellia couldn’t continue living.","Liu Yuan had relied on the Muscle Growth Camellia’s leaves to suppress the poison.","But after losing the Muscle Growth Camellia, the poison returned even more fiercely than before.","It resulted in Liu Yuan vomiting blood and fainting every two days. The poison had also affected her heart and caused it to shrink.","When her heart pumped large amounts of poison into her brain, it aggravated her wounded soul.","The recently-conscious Liu Yuan touched Sun Ningxiang’s head while wiping the tears from her face.","She sensed her body’s changes in a dumbfounded state. Her body was completely different now."]},{"number":1222,"title":"Chapter 1222 - If You Like It, Work Hard!","paragraphs":["Liu Yuan noticed that not only had her wounds been healed and poison removed, but her weak roots had also been strengthened.","For an unknown reason, the remnants of impurities in her body had all been cleansed. This reminded her of the Radiant Moon Palace’s Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar.","In its prime, Condense Fairy Orchard had once been able to obtain a few drops of Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar from the Moon Empress.","The Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar had cleansed her body of all impurities but had been unable to heal her wounds.","Liu Yuan looked down to look at her granddaughter, who was wailing like a child.","Her eyes were full of love and pity. She knew full well how difficult the past few years had been for Sun Ningxiang.","Liu Yuan sighed to herself and lamented the hardship that her granddaughter had experienced.","Sun Ningxiang was carrying the heavy burden of Condense Fairy Orchard all on her own.","Now that Liu Yuan was not only healed, but her body was even stronger than before, her granddaughter finally did not have to bear that yoke on her own.","Finally, her granddaughter could live the kind of life she wanted.","Liu Yuan wanted to know how she had recovered.","When she fainted, only Sun Ningxiang had been by her side. Her recovery had to be linked to her granddaughter in some way.","“Xiangxiang, what happened after I fainted?”","Sun Ningxiang suddenly remembered that she had been on the phone with Lin Yuan. She hastily looked at her phone, only to see that he had already hung up.","She thought,? Thank God he hung up! I wouldn’t want him to hear my wailing!","She had completely forgotten that Lin Yuan had heard her cry for close to half an hour. During that time, he had tried his best to come up with a way to comfort her.","As she looked at Liu Yuan’s questioning expression, Sun Ningxiang said, “Grandma, Lin Yuan was the one who saved you. After he found out what happened, he sent a Moon Dew Revival Pill to us through Ostrich Logistics.”","Liu Yuan froze, and one thought filled her mind.","I can’t believe I consumed the Moon Dew Revival Pill! No wonder I was able to recover and feel like a completely different person.","Liu Yuan knew much more about the Moon Dew Revival Pill than Sun Ningxiang.","During Condense Fairy Orchard’s prime, Liu Yuan’s husband had offered half of all of Condense Fairy Orchard’s resources but had still been unable to obtain a single Moon Dew Revival Pill.","One Moon Dew Revival Pill was more valuable than the life of a thearch-class expert because it had similar effects as offering immortality.","Recently, Lin Yuan had lost count of the number of times she heard Sun Ningxiang mention Lin Yuan’s name.","Although her body had been so weak that she had been unable to go outside much, she still kept up with the news in the Radiance Federation and knew that Lin Yuan was the Moon Empress’ disciple.","Sun Ningxiang had not revealed that Lin Yuan and the City Lord of Sky City were the same person.","Liu Yuan was filled with intense gratitude toward the City Lord of Sky City and Lin Yuan.","Sky City’s collaboration with Condense Fairy Orchard had solved Condense Fairy Orchard’s lack of Creation Masters and strengthened their plant-type fey resources. This ensured that Condense Fairy Orchard could continue their domination of the plant-type fey market.","Lin Yuan had stood behind Sun Ningxiang at the Guard Ye Banquet and told the other factions about his relationship with her. This deterred other factions from targeting Condense Fairy Orchard after the Guard Ye Banquet.","Before the Guard Ye Banquet, Sun Ningxiang mostly talked about the City Lord of Sky City.","But after the Guard Ye Banquet, Sun Ningxiang mostly talked about Lin Yuan instead.","Although Condense Fairy Orchard and Sky City had deepened their collaboration, Sun Ningxiang still did not mention the City Lord of Sky City again.","It seemed as though all the topics that used to include the City Lord of Sky City now featured Lin Yuan instead.","Lin Yuan was also being brought up more and more.","With all her experience, Liu Yuan noticed that something was off.","Liu Yuan’s expression changed when she saw Sun Ningxiang’s gaze as she talked about Lin Yuan.","Her granddaughter was extremely impressive at expanding the faction. Otherwise, she would not have been able to sustain Condense Fairy Orchard for so long in spite of Condense Fairy Orchard’s lack of resources.","However, her granddaughter’s affinity as a combat-class spirit qi professional was rather weak.","Even when Condense Fairy Orchard had no shortage of resources, she could only reach #40 of the Radiance Hundred Sequence at best.","Meanwhile, Lin Yuan was the champion of the Martial Arts Stage.","The Arts Stage, Martial Stage, and Martial Arts Stage had taken place separately during the Guard Ye Banquet.","Although the Martial Arts Stage champion could not be crowned as the member of the younger generation with the strongest Creation Master abilities or combat power, he was still considered an outstanding Creation Master and combat-class spirit qi professional.","During the fight with Zong Ze, Lin Yuan’s combat style had been extremely special, and he had not summoned a single fey. Instead, he had revealed an exceptionally strong sacred source lifeform that could shapeshift.","Now that an Order of Radiant Light had fallen into the hands of such an outstanding individual, he would definitely become a Radiance Envoy, notwithstanding an unexpected accident.","Moreover, Lin Yuan had the support of the Radiant Moon Palace. Sun Ningxiang was a far cry by comparison.","This distance would only increase as Lin Yuan continued to grow.","“My body is fine now. I can handle Condense Fairy Orchard now. Xiangxiang, you should take part in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection this year. All of Condense Fairy Orchard’s resources will go to you now. You should take that antique jade piece that can increase the comprehension of willpowers that your grandfather left for your brother. Do your best to comprehend a second Willpower Rune as soon as possible,” said Liu Yuan.","Sun Ningxiang’s eyes widened.","Although she never mentioned it, she knew that her grandmother doted on her brother more.","The piece of antique jade her grandmother mentioned was an heirloom of Condense Fairy Orchard.","She could not believe that her grandmother would allow her to carry it around with her.","“Grandpa left that antique jade for my brother. I—”","Before Sun Ningxiang could finish speaking, Liu Yuan said gently, “If you hadn’t kept Condense Fairy Orchard afloat, your brother wouldn’t even have the chance to use this antique jade.”"]},{"number":1223,"title":"Chapter 1223 - The Greatly Limited Moon Empress","paragraphs":["“There are still two years till the next Radiance Envoy and Radiance Knight selection. Xiangxiang, if you have any hopes, you should do your best to charge toward becoming a Radiance Knight. Otherwise, the gap between you and Lin Yuan will only grow larger until finally, even looking up to him will only be nothing more than a pipe dream.”","Liu Yuan did not speak to the point for fear of discouraging her granddaughter.","As such, Sun Ningxiang did not realize the meaning behind her grandmother’s words.","She did have one dream that she hoped would come true.","However, she had a more important matter to discuss with Liu Yuan.","She looked at Sun Ningxiang seriously and said, “Grandma, I want Condense Fairy Orchard to become part of Sky City. We should become one of Sky City’s branch factions.”","Liu Yuan was momentarily stunned before she started contemplating deeply.","Suddenly, she remembered that Lin Yuan had saved her with the Moon Dew Revival Pill.","Yet, Sun Ningxiang did not propose for Condense Fairy Orchard to join Lin Yuan but to become part of Condense Fairy Orchard instead.","Previously, all the gratitude that Sun Ningxiang should be showing the City Lord of Sky City had been transferred onto Lin Yuan.","When she put two and two together, Liu Yuan’s heart skipped a beat.","Even during Condense Fairy Orchard’s most difficult times, Liu Yuan would rather go down with the sinking ship than allow Condense Fairy Orchard to become a branch or another faction.","This was why Liu Yuan had been against working with Connected Beast Park.","However, if Lin Yuan were the City Lord of Sky City, the circumstances would be different.","It was not just that Condense Fairy Orchard owed debts of gratitude to both Lin Yuan and the City Lord of Sky City. Solely based on Lin Yuan’s status and future, as well as Sky City’s Creation Master resources, Condense Fairy Orchard’s future would be secured.","Moreover, Condense Fairy Orchard would have a real chance of surpassing other top factions.","Moreover, the resolution in Sun Ningxiang’s eyes and her feelings for Lin Yuan were important factors that persuaded Liu Yuan.","Just as Liu Yuan was about to give in, she asked Sun Ningxiang, “Xiangxiang, be honest with me. Are Liu Yuan and the City Lord of Sky City the same person?”","Due to Liu Yuan’s tone of certainty, Sun Ningxiang hesitated for a moment before nodding.","Liu Yuan affectionately touched Sun Ningxiang’s hair and said, “I’m old now. All of Condense Fairy Orchard’s decisions lie in your hands. If I’m able to support you for a few more years, I’ll consider that I’ve made good use of something as precious as the Moon Dew Revival Pill.”","Liu Yuan smiled warmly at Sun Ningxiang’s surprised expression.","This smile represented a new chapter.","...","Unknowingly, spring had arrived. The spring sun was warm and blinding.","The sun was currently slowly climbing towards its apex.","Within the imperial court, an elderly man was currently seated on a seemingly normal recliner that was brimming with life force.","He stared at the sun as he was lost in his thoughts.","The blinding sunlight not only did not force the elderly man to avert his eyes, but it even highlighted the gold in his mostly-black eyes.","A smiling man walked in and said hurriedly to the elderly man, “Did you call me over in such a hurry because your old problem has relapsed?”","The elderly man turned his eyes away from the sun and said to the grinning man, “My body is still very sturdy. That problem hasn’t affected me in over five years. Cicada Song, I notice that you’ve been staying at the imperial court with your disciple of late. How does it feel to have a disciple?”","Cicada Song rubbed his temples in frustration and replied, “Gao Feng is great in every way. The only issue is that he’s set on competing in next year’s S Tournament. He can’t stop the moment he gets excited. I would rather adjust his mental state before we start increasing his power.”","The elderly man was surprised to hear what Cicada Song said.","Cicada Song was always smiling and appeared to be extremely gentle. However, he was actually exceedingly rational and composed.","The elderly man could not believe how much Cicada Song cared about his disciple.","Initially, he had been concerned that Cicada Song would not be able to take up the mantle of being a Master.","But now, it seemed that he had been worried for nothing.","Rather than Cicada Song training Gao Feng’s character, it seemed that Gao Feng was the one training Cicada Song’s character now.","The elderly man flipped his hand over and a blaze-yellow wooden box appeared in his hand.","Cicada Song hurriedly reached out his hand to receive the blaze yellow wooden box.","“There is a drop of Earth Center Fine Milk inside the box. Deliver it to the Moon Empress. It should extend her life for a year.”","A look of obvious repressed pain appeared on the elderly man’s face.","The fight from a decade ago had caused the three federations around the Radiance Federation to sink to the bottom of the sea.","During that fight, the four immortal experts from the Freedom Federation had been killed. However, the Moon Empress’ attack had resulted in her losing a large portion of her lifespan.","Given her personality, she would not lock herself away to train for more than a decade after that incident.","Ever since she accepted a disciple, she had been paving the way for him.","This indicated that her lifespan was coming to an end soon. Otherwise, the old her would never have chosen to pave the way for her disciple.","She would only be fulfilled when she saw her disciple make a name for himself.","At the Moon Empress’ level, any further breakthrough would be accompanied by huge risk and the danger of losing her life.","An expert’s lifespan was the most precious thing in the world to them. Constant training could prolong their lifespan but not extend it endlessly.","Hence, any expert of the Moon Empress’ level would first have to weigh the cost of their possible failure.","Yet, the Moon Empress had charged forward without any qualms in recent years. This was her way of putting up a last-ditch effort against her lifespan.","When the look of intense pain appeared on the elderly man’s face, Cicada Song left the imperial court with the box.","Cicada Song had also experienced the incident himself.","If two people who had experienced the incident together reflected on it at the same time, they would only increase each other’s sorrow.","As Cicada Song headed to the Radiant Moon Palace, he muttered, “My old friend put down his sword. I did everything, but he still couldn’t return. Yet, you who are as arrogant and cold as the moon still have 15 years of brilliance left to do whatever your heart desires.”","Lin Yuan, who was currently playing with the tangerine and red Lifespan Mouse, was completely oblivious to all of this."]},{"number":1224,"title":"Chapter 1224 - Su Yiren’s Gains","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan did not have any important business to attend to in the Divine Wood Federation, and the Moon Empress was still in the midst of her training.","Lin Yuan also needed to handle the blood pact ultimate fight between the Sea Bliss Clan and the Miao family.","As such, he intended to finish everything he had on hand in the Radiance Federation before returning to the Divine Wood Federation to focus on training.","As he looked at the Lifespan Mouse scamper energetically, he felt that it would definitely become fat and good friends with the Moon Empress’ white rabbit.","Naturally, this would only happen if the Lifespan Mouse knew to stay away from the rabbit’s carrots. Otherwise, the rabbit would start hiding its carrots behind its tail again.","Lin Yuan had been so busy with setting up his establishment in the Divine Wood Federation that he had not rested properly.","As the agarwood wafted into his nose, Lin Yuan felt sleep creeping up on him.","He summoned Genius out and instructed it to wake him up at 1:00 p.m. before he snuggled up on the water rhinoceros leather sofa and started napping.","While Lin Yuan was napping, four other figures from different parts of the main world with different states of mind entered dreamland together.","Bei Xu had spent a fruitful last few days and was elated.","After sweeping through the working area of a rock insect, he finally managed to obtain subordinates. With these subordinates, Bei Xu could officially start building his own faction.","It was tough for normal people to survive in the subterranean world.","Hence, Bei Xu was extremely picky with his subordinates.","There happened to be some people who had awakened a Willpower Rune, but they had no use for it in their manual labor work.","These people who had the curse of the rock insect on them dared not reveal anything special about themselves for fear that they would be treated as pariahs or threats that needed to be killed.","After Bei Xu obtained their consent, he used the Sharp Shadow Bat’s Bat’s Fangs Blood Seed to change his two subordinates into blood zombies.","Next, Bei Xu just needed to sweep through more subterranean dimensional rifts to search for suitable source-type items for his two subordinates.","This would greatly increase the overall power of Bei Xu’s faction, and he would not need to attend to every matter anymore personally.","This was a huge step up for Bei Xu’s development.","Yin Lin was currently seated on the Island Whale along with the rest of the convoy from the Azure Federation and was headed toward the Radiance Federation.","She spent her days lazily atop the Island Whale. All she did was increase her power while looking forward to the next Astronomical Parliament.","Compared to the carefree Yin Lin, Ta Lei was in the middle of the biggest change of his life.","Due to Lin Yuan, Ta Lei was no longer a young man from a small tribe but a Class 1 Creation Master recognized by the Iron Hammer imperial court.","As such, the Horseshoe Tribe had also become a Class 1 tribe.","Ta Lei had caused a significant stir in the Iron Hammer imperial court by becoming a Class 1 Creation Master at a young age.","In order to show how much they valued Ta Lei, the imperial court dispatched a powerful soldier to protect Ta Lei.","When the Cuprite Tribe found out that Ta Lei had become a Class 1 Creation Master and was being favored by the imperial court, they decided to reach out a friendly hand to them instead.","They promised the Horseshoe Tribe that they would share ownership of the high-grade energy ore and Gold Frost Silver mines in order to form an alliance with them.","These events had deeply stunned Ta Lei, and he could not help but reflect on all the benefits he had gained after the Astronomical Parliament’s parliamentary meeting.","It was because of this that Ta Lei did not lose sight of what he needed to do.","He resolutely convinced his grandparents, parents, and brother to do as Lin Yuan asked and take the Horseshoe Tribe to the boundary toward where the Divine Wood Federation was.","Ta Lei’s decision would result in the loss of the high-grade energy ore and Gold Frost Silver mines.","The Horseshoe Tribe had never known what it was like to be wealthy and refused to give up on this chance.","Eventually, Ta Lei told them about the Master that he could see once every week, which had turned him into a Class 1 Creation Master.","Hence, the Horseshoe Tribe began their day-long journey to the boundary that separated the Iron Hammer Federation from the Divine Wood Federation.","Su Yiren was currently stooped in an alley in the Divine Wood Federation. She was a drifter and considered worthless in the Divine Wood Federation. Thus, she even had to be careful with every breath she drew.","During the last Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting, Lin Yuan had healed Su Yiren’s injuries.","But now, she was covered in fresh wounds.","In order to survive, she had no choice but to set aside her pride as a Dark Envoy and rummage through trash cans for food scraps.","The struggles of her current reality made Su Yiren all the more determined to survive.","The man’s voice amongst the constellations reverberated within Su Yiren’s mind.","“As long as you’re alive, there’s always hope.”","Albeit, this hope came with the cost of losing her freedom.","However, Su Yiren did not come away with nothing after spending the last few days foraging through the trash.","She found a usable phone with a broken screen.","During the last Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting, Su Yiren remembered that the figure wrapped in countless willpowers had instructed the person next to her who only had one willpower to travel from the Iron Hammer Federation toward the Divine Wood Federation.","This meant that there was a high chance that that figure wrapped in countless willpowers was currently at the Divine Wood Federation’s boundary.","After a full month of surveillance, Su Yiren knew that Oak City, where she was in, was the city that was the closest to the Divine Wood Federation.","As such, the phone she found was vital to her.","She wanted to try to ask the figure for his number at the next Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting and contact him through this damaged phone.","She would not always be so lucky to continue living as strongly as she was doing after every beating she received. After all, her soul was injured, and her sacred source lifeform was in a near-death state.","While crouching in the alley, Su Yiren’s skinny body curled up like a feeble kitten. In such a circumstance, she could not sleep soundly.","In order to provide herself with the deepest sleep possible, she had gone hungry for two days and traded for a cup of inferior quality alcohol from a homeless man.","She never drank alcohol, so this one cup was enough to induce sleep. She even started snoring, and it was likely that she would sleep for at least half a day.","Genius used to be a housekeeping beast and was used to performing wake-up calls.","Once the clock struck 1:00 p.m., Genius used its eight long tails to tickle Lin Yuan’s neck.","Lin Yuan was very susceptible to being tickled. When Genius’ tail brushed across his neck, he immediately woke up while chortling with laughter."]},{"number":1225,"title":"Chapter 1225 - The Entire Mansion’s Good Omen","paragraphs":["After Lin Yuan woke up, he cradled Genius in his arms and stroked it until Genius melted into content purring.","Lin Yuan carried Genius over to the water rhinoceros leather sofa and asked, “Genius, are you planning or staying in the mansion, or would you rather return to the Spirit Lock spatial zone?”","Genius hurriedly replied, “Lin Yuan, before I return to the Spirit Lock spatial zone, I want to concoct a spirit fluid that will divide the Soldier Ration Radish. I’ll take the divided Soldier Ration Radishes to the marsh world and plant them there.”","Genius swayed its tails, and its eyes sparkled.","Lin Yuan was curious about Genius’ happy behavior. He touched Genius’ small head and asked, “Genius, why are you so happy?”","Genius meowed and replied, “Genius, once I divide the Soldier Ration Radishes, there will be 15 of them. The marsh world has the ideal environment for the Soldier Ration Radishes. The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope hasn’t been able to rest because of the Soldier Ration Radishes.","“Moreover, I don’t think there’s much use for the Soldier Ration Radishes’ branches. These branches can be buried in the ground of the territory in the marsh world, and all the branches will decompose into nutritious humic acid quickly by the bacteria in the ground.","“There’s a scholarly article on Star Web which describes an experiment conducted by a Class 4 Creation Master and three pinnacle Class 3 Creation Masters. They discovered that when marsh soil is present in an environment full of humic acid, there’s a high chance that the marsh soil will fuse together to form new marsh soil that contains all the benefits of its component marsh soil.","“Given the rate that the 15 Soldier Ration Radishes grow branches, I want to try and change all the marsh soil in the territory to the fused form of marsh soil.”","Lin Yuan’s eyebrow twitched.","Genius was just like a mini scientist, and its brain was full of ideas to help his territory.","Lin Yuan did not have much use for the high amount of Soldier Ration Radish branches that he kept stored away.","Although the Soldier Ration Radish’s branches were full of nutrients and a person only needed to consume one of its leaves to be full, its impressive feature was its rapid rate of growth.","When it came to nutrition, many other production-type feys produced fruits or leaves that were more nutritious than the Soldier Ration Radish. However, none of them could match the Soldier Ration Radish’s speed of growth.","Once the Soldier Ration Radish increased its grade, it would be a powerful source of food.","If this source of food was planted at the base, Lin Yuan would not have to worry about food stock at all.","If the Soldier Ration Radish’s leaves were planted in the territory in the marsh world and turned all the marsh soil into fused marsh soil, the fused marsh soil’s strength would be multiplied as time went on.","At that point, not only would Endless Summer’s Barren River Orchid Bud be able to grow quickly, but the territory would also become a paradise for plant-type feys.","At this time, someone walked into the mansion with a grin spread across his face.","This person was Ji Feng.","Before Lin Yuan could speak, Ji Feng said, “Young Master, my Prior Decree Sleeping Lotus’ exclusive skill Heaven’s Secret Promise has given me a sign.”","Lin Yuan’s interest was immediately piqued.","Lin Yuan had seen Ji Feng’s Karma Sword Lily and Prior Decree Sleeping Lotus’ wondrous abilities.","Lin Yuan was most amazed that the Prior Decree Sleeping Lotus had the ability to read the fortunes and misfortunes of the people around Ji Feng after every set interval.","Given that Ji Feng was beaming brightly, the Prior Decree Sleeping Lotus’ prediction had to be positive.","“Ji Feng, what’s the good news?”","“Young Master, this piece of good news is special because it doesn’t just affect one person. When I first arrived at the mansion, the Prior Decree Sleeping Lotus made frequent predictions. At first, it predicted fortunes for Wen Yu, then Liu Jie, followed by Listen, the Mother of Bloodbath, Endless Summer, Zhou Luo, Hu Quan, and today it was for you!","“By using Own Truth, I can be certain that all your fortunes are linked. As such, I think that these fortunes affect the entire mansion. All of us will return to the mansion to stay. It is here that we will be affected by the fortune. I used Own Truth to test this idea and did not experience fate’s recoil. This means that my idea is right! Then, I used Own Truth to test the time frame and discovered that all our fortunes will be arriving in two days’ time.”","Although Ji Feng was bringing good news, Lin Yuan’s eyebrow twitched wildly. He remembered that when he used True Data to check on the Prior Decree Sleeping Lotus, Own Self would result in the user experiencing recoil that would grievously harm their soul if their prediction failed.","Ji Feng continuously used Own Truth despite being aware of the risks.","It was said that curiosity killed the cat. Did Ji Feng identify as a cat? Ji Feng’s actions were the equivalent of grabbing a power line with his bare hands at the risk of being electrocuted.","Lin Yuan felt that he needed to advise Ji Feng for his safety’s sake.","“Ji Feng, you should use Own Truth as infrequently as possible. A soul injury is truly unbearable.”","Ji Feng beamed and replied, “Even if my prediction fails and I experience fate’s recoil, my soul won’t be seriously injured. Young Master, have you forgotten that my Prior Decree Sleeping Lotus can heal soul injuries? All I have to do is use it to heal my soul when needed.”","Ji Feng had been traumatized by his past decade of being tortured by pain in his soul and would never casually put himself in danger to confirm a pointless fortune.","Currently, Endless Summer, Listen, and Zhou Luo were traveling to Indigo Azure City to collect the Zheng family’s resources.","Ji Feng had over Endless Summer and was guarding the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","After Sky City revealed its strength, the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce had not been in any more trouble.","As such, Ji Feng was very bored at the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce of late.","But since he had chosen to be with Lin Yuan by receiving Lin Yuan’s help, he could not allow himself to do nothing.","Thus, he tried his best to find things to do, even if it meant that he ran the risk of injuring his soul."]},{"number":1226,"title":"Chapter 1226 - Lay Down the Terms","paragraphs":["This fortune had descended on Lin Yuan and the rest of the people who were part of the Return from Faraway Mansion’s family.","Ji Feng had watched his family die a decade ago and had been alone when he met Lin Yuan.","After interacting with the rest of the people from the Return from Faraway Mansion, Ji Feng naturally came to see the Return from Faraway Mansion as his home.","Lin Yuan gazed at Ji Feng silently as Ji Feng had just given him too much information at once.","Since Ji Feng was willing to ignore the risks of injuring his soul in order to express his kinship, Lin Yuan would not treat his intentions lightly.","Moreover, Ji Feng used to be the Young Leader of Whale Ocean Commerce and knew where to draw the line when he conducted himself.","Lin Yuan intended to be on full alert from now on in preparation to receive the fortune and ensure that the fortune did not slip away.","Ji Feng immediately returned to the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce after he reported his news to Lin Yuan.","As the expert that was assigned to the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, Ji Feng could not leave it unguarded for too long.","Lin Yuan returned Genius to the Spirit Lock spatial zone so it could divide the Soldier Ration Radishes. Next, he walked to the third floor and knocked on Wen Yu’s door.","Wen Yu was a light sleeper, so her eyes snapped open when Lin Yuan knocked on her door twice.","After she opened the door, Lin Yuan noticed that she was sporting an intense bedhead. However, her eyes were clear and energetic.","Wen Yu opened the door wider and said, “Young Master, come in and wait. I will start the parliamentary meeting once I wash up.”","Lin Yuan strode into Wen Yu’s room.","The Return from Faraway’s construction had been completed some time ago, and Wen Yu often sent clothes to Lin Yuan’s room as well as discussed the events of the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting there together.","However, this was the first time that Lin Yuan entered Wen Yu’s room. In fact, this was the first time he was entering the room of a girl that was not Chu Ci’s room.","He sat down on a chair, and Wen Yu entered the washroom to clean herself up.","As Lin Yuan listened to the sounds of water, he took in the interior design of Wen Yu’s room.","He noticed that her room was decorated in a style that vastly differed from her fashion designs.","The spirit qi clothes she designed were elegant, and she used the elaborate palace-style cut on all her pieces.","As such, the spirit qi clothes that Lin Yuan wore on a day-to-day basis appeared simple, but the embroidery on them carried an opulent air.","In contrast, Wen Yu’s room was minimalistic as there were no other decorations in it besides a bed, two chairs, and a large table.","Even Lin Yuan had placed some jade-textured wooden carvings that Hu Quan made in his room.","From the moment he entered the room, Lin Yuan could smell a faint sweetness. This sweetness was of different flora and fauna and had a soft freshness about it.","If Lin Yuan had not gained peak smelling abilities after all the impurities in his body were cleansed, he might have missed this almost non-existent fragrance.","Wen Yu had walked out of the washroom with her eyebrows tightly furrowed. It was clear that she had a question she was struggling with.","She took two steps forward and asked Lin Yuan seriously, “Young Master, what are your plans for recruiting Su Yiren during this parliamentary meeting?”","Lin Yuan did not find this question strange.","After the last Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting, Wen Yu had done a thorough investigation on Su Yiren and was well aware of Su Yiren’s value.","However, Lin Yuan felt that Wen Yu was being overly worried and that she was thinking about Su Yiren’s recruitment more than Lin Yuan was.","After seven days of grappling with her excruciating reality, Su Yiren should have been racking her brains to come up with a way to join the Astronomical Parliament.","A moment of silence later, Lin Yuan told Wen Yu about his plans for recruiting Su Yiren.","“We don’t need to make any preparations for Su Yiren. If she joins this Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting, we’ll need to lay down the terms with her. She’s currently in the Divine Wood Federation, and I’m bound to meet her when I’m training in the Divine Wood Federation. Once I meet with her, I’ll have to heal her soul injury and her near-dead sacred source lifeform. She’ll be of no use to us if she can’t even summon feys.","“But now, her head is filled with thoughts of revenge. We’ll need to change her mindset during this Astronomical Parliament’s parliamentary meeting. The parliamentary meeting requires both parties to be agreeable to collaborate. One side can’t be bent on revenge.”","Wen Yu immediately understood what Lin Yuan meant and what his plans were for Su Yiren.","It seemed that Lin Yuan was going to devour Su Yiren.","After listening to what Lin Yuan said, Wen Yu’s misunderstanding had been cleared.","Upon finding out that Su Yiren was a Dark Envoy, she had placed a high value on Su Yiren. But what she valued was Su Yiren’s identity and not her abilities.","Now, Wen Yu realized that Su Yiren’s abilities were far more important than her identity as a Dark Envoy.","Lin Yuan also valued Su Yiren’s abilities, which was why he wanted to lay down the terms with her.","From this, Wen Yu could tell that Lin Yuan had far more foresight than her.","Wen Yu truly enjoyed this feeling of constantly progressing that she experienced at Lin Yuan’s side.","Lin Yuan and Wen Yu entered the training room and used the ritual to activate the Astronomical Parliament.","A banquet of stars erupted once again.","When Lin Yuan and Wen Yu sat down on the Leo throne and Libra throne, he realized that four figures were already neatly seated on the north-south constellation seats.","Yin Lin was seated on the Andromeda seat, Bei Xu on the Perseus seat, Ta Lei on the Leo Minor seat, and Su Yiren on the Corona Australis seat.","Ta Lei had formed a contract with the Leo Minor seat without hesitation during the last Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting and was now an official member.","However, Su Yiren had hesitated and had doubts about the Astronomical Parliament. As such, she had not formed a contract with the Corona Australis seat.","When Su Yiren saw Lin Yuan and Wen Yu, she immediately readied herself to form a contract with the Corona Australis seat."]},{"number":1227,"title":"Chapter 1227 - Want to Join the Astronomical Parliament? Prove Your Worth First!","paragraphs":["However, the moment she reached out her hand to touch the Corona Australis seat, the woman on the Libra throne said calmly, “Wait. If you want to join the Astronomical Parliament, you have to prove your worth first.”","Wen Yu’s words stunned Su Yiren.","She did not remember Ta Lei being asked to prove his worth before he formed a contract with the Leo Minor seat.","This made Su Yiren feel as though she was receiving special treatment.","Although she was living a life worse than death in the Divine Wood Federation, she was in a dream-like meeting where her figure was formed from willpowers.","She could puff up with the pride of being a Dark Envoy here.","She would have backed out of the Astronomical Parliament without hesitation if she had received such special treatment the last time.","Ever since the last Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting ended, Lin Yuan had used Star Spirit Seat to transfer the Jasmine Lily’s vitality to Su Yiren to heal her injuries.","This had allowed Su Yiren to see how powerful the Astronomical Parliament was. She also knew that being in the Divine Wood Federation did not affect how much help she could receive from the Astronomical Parliament.","Moreover, Lin Yuan had mentioned hope that enabled Su Yiren to plan out her future path over the last week.","This was why Su Yiren could not wait to form a contract with the Corona Australis seat the moment she entered the Astronomical Parliament.","She had decided to join the Astronomical Parliament and was determined to survive—she would not abandon this chance just because she was receiving unfair treatment.","Su Yiren looked at Wen Yu and asked, “How do you want me to prove my worth?”","While Su Yiren was speaking with Wen Yu, Lin Yuan looked through Su Yiren’s memories again to see how she had spent the last seven days.","When he saw that Su Yiren wanted to form a contract with the Corona Australis seat, he was about to stop her, but Wen Yu beat him to it.","Since Wen Yu had spoken first, Lin Yuan left the rest of the interaction to her. He wanted to see how Wen Yu would act and what she said.","Wen Yu said, “Proving one’s worth does not depend on what the person has but what they can do. Can you work with the Astronomical Parliament wholeheartedly without a single thought of scheming?”","Su Yiren fell silent.","Instead of replying to Wen Yu, Su Yiren pointed at Ta Lei, Yin Lin, and Bei Xu and said, “Can they wholeheartedly work with the Astronomical Parliament without a single thought of scheming? How are others supposed to know what a person is thinking? This promise seems childish to me. If I say I’ll do it, will you believe me?”","Yin Lin cut her off and snapped, “Don’t forget how you entered the Astronomical Parliament in the first place! What did you swear before entering the Astronomical Parliament? Libra is already being kind by using the term ‘working together’. After the Astronomical Parliament fulfills your wish, you should do whatever you can to repay them.”","Bei Xu and Ta Lei frowned as well.","Su Yiren could clearly sense the other three’s distaste for her.","Yin Lin’s words were a reminder to Su Yiren. She had been so set on entering the Astronomical Parliament again because she wanted to lead a better life and fulfill her goal. It was true that she had completely forgotten how she entered the Astronomical Parliament in the first place.","At that moment, the woman on the Libra throne said calmly, “You’re currently thinking of ways to receive more benefits from the Astronomical Parliament. Once you’re able, you’ll return to the Dark Continent and use your identity as one of the seven Dark Envoys to enjoy the benefits of your status. Am I right?”","Su Yiren’s eyes widened as Wen Yu had hit the nail right on its head.","It was like Su Yiren was an open book to Wen Yu.","Last time, Su Yiren had wondered how the two people seated on the throne knew so much about her.","Something was off about this meeting. Could the woman seated on the Libra throne have the ability to read everything in another person’s mind?","While Su Yiren was thinking, Wen Yu went on to say, “I always assumed that people who have the capabilities to become a Dark Envoy are able to judge matters clearly. If you want revenge, you have to be more powerful than Seventh Page War at the very least. If you charge ahead without this power, it will only result in the deaths of those closest to you. You should know this well.","“I’m giving you a final chance. Tell me what you can do for the Astronomical Parliament. Otherwise, you can continue to live a life of struggle by drifting around the Divine Wood Federation and scrounging for food in trash cans.","“There is a Class 4 family in Oak City, some Class 3 families, and many Class 2 families. In such a huge city full of wealthy families, the death of a drifter will be less than insignificant. No one will know that the once-great Dark Envoy has died in a dirty corner of one of Oak City’s alleys.","“You know I’m not saying this to scare you, and you shouldn’t think of forming a contract with the Astronomical Parliament as a simple matter. Once you form a contract with the Astronomical Parliament, you’ll have to make good on your promises to the Astronomical Parliament. Otherwise, you’ll have a much higher price to pay.”","Everything Wen Yu said was like arrows shot directly through Su Yiren’s heart as they were all the struggles that Su Yiren was being tortured by.","Su Yiren was terrified by Wen Yu’s ability to read a person’s mind.","She gnashed her teeth and replied, “There are many things I can do. If you hand me a federation, I can guarantee that it’ll be organized and prosperous. If you want me to do anything else, you’ll have to heal my wounds first. Moreover, my sacred source lifeform is special. Its abilities are tied together with the rest of my feys. If my sacred source lifeforms doesn’t recover from its near-death state, I won’t be able to summon my feys even if my soul injury is healed.”","Although Su Yiren spoke pompously, Wen Yu knew that she was telling the truth.","There were seven federations in the Dark Continent, and one of the tests to become a Dark Envoy was to manage a federation for a year to prove that they had the ability to plan with the big picture in mind."]},{"number":1228,"title":"Chapter 1228 - All-Knowing All-Powerful and Su Yiren’s Fear","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan took over the conversation from Wen Yu. “If you choose to become a member of the Astronomical Parliament, the Astronomical Parliament will make sure your needs are met. Your soul injury can be healed very easily, so you don’t have to worry about that. Now, we should discuss ways to treat your sacred source lifeform.”","Su Yiren’s eyes lit up.","She now knew that the Astronomical Parliament had the ability to heal her soul injury and was willing to attempt to heal her near-dead sacred source lifeform.","Frankly, Su Yiren was not certain about the exact circumstance of the Absolute Love Poppy’s injury as its flowers and leaves had all been crushed by Seventh Page War.","Immediately after, the Absolute Love Poppy had fallen unconscious in the depths of Su Yiren’s soul.","If she wanted to communicate with the sacred source lifeform and check on it, she would have to use her soul power.","However, she could not do so due to her injured soul.","Nonetheless, she was certain that it was still alive.","Under normal circumstances, plants would continue to absorb nutrients to heal themselves as long as they still had their roots.","The Absolute Love Poppy was just too weak now. It dared not absorb nutrients in its near-dead state as it would start to awake from its dormant state.","Once it woke up from its dormant state, the Absolute Love Poppy’s vitality would rapidly deplete.","If it could not absorb nutrients to replenish its vitality at the same rate that its vitality depleted, the Absolute Love Poppy would truly die.","The last thing that Su Yiren wanted was for its near-dead Absolute Love Poppy to take on any risk.","As such, Su Yiren said boldly, “It’ll be very difficult to treat my Absolute Love Poppy. I have only managed to come up with two ways. Either plant my Absolute Love Poppy in the top-grade marsh soil Eternal Life Soil or use the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire to burn it. There might be other methods to heal my Absolute Love Poppy, but these two are the safest ways. If we try anything else and it fails, my Absolute Love Poppy might die. I don’t want to put it at any risk.”","Lin Yuan frowned when he heard Su Yiren mention the top-grade Eternal Life Soil.","Not many Class 5 marsh dimensional rifts had opened in the Radiance Federation, and the amount of top-grade marsh soil produced was even more limited.","The Moon Empress had told him about top-grade marsh soil before, but there was no mention of Eternal Life Soil. This meant that he would not be able to obtain Eternal Life Soil in the Radiance Federation.","Although Lin Yuan had a territory in the marsh world, and it would be easy for him to search for marsh soil, it would be like looking for a needle in a haystack to search for a specific type of marsh soil.","Moreover, there were always powerful dimensional lifeforms in the vicinity of top-grade marsh soil.","Given Lin Yuan’s current strength, he could not afford to take on those powerful dimensional lifeforms.","But, Lin Yuan’s brow relaxed when he heard Su Yiren mention the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire because he already had that within the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","The Twin Red Pagoda had been absorbing the pure spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone as well as fire-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls. Due to this, the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire had grown exponentially.","The Lifeform Sacrificial Fire had reached half maturity.","Although Endless Summer could not eat it yet, it was more than able to burn and trigger plant-type sacred source lifeforms.","Since Su Yiren only needed the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire to burn the Absolute Love Poppy and not consume any of it, Lin Yuan did not need to hold back.","After Su Yiren spoke, she immediately felt that she had misspoken.","The Seven States of Darkness had once obtained one piece of Eternal Life Soil, and it had been treated as an extremely precious treasure by the entire Seven States of Darkness.","Meanwhile, the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire was something Su Yiren had only heard of but never seen.","She felt that her requests were rather outrageous.","She was no longer in the Seven States of Darkness, and the Dark Continent had been conquered.","She could not use her experience as a Dark Envoy to communicate with others.","Yet, she did not expect the man seated on the Leo throne to reply casually, “If so, you can go ahead and form a contract with the Corona Australis seat, and I’ll heal the Absolute Love Poppy.”","Su Yiren was taken aback by this unexpected piece of good news and amazed by Lin Yuan’s resources.","She enthusiastically formed a contract with the Corona Australis seat.","She felt that the more resources Lin Yuan possessed, the more benefits she would receive in the future.","When she formed a contract with the Corona Australis seat, the Corona Australis constellation above her lit up, and she remembered the phone she had found amongst the trash.","She was about to ask Lin Yuan for his number when he announced a string of numbers.","“Call this number five days later, and it’ll tell you what to do next.”","Lin Yuan had given Su Yiren the number of one of the two phones he had taken from the five adventurers from the Withered Cliff Thief Death Corps.","The members of Withered Cliff Thief Death Corps were all small fry in the Divine Wood Federation and did not have many ties to others.","Now that the Withered Cliff Thief Death Corps had been ruined, there would be no one left to call these two phones.","Su Yiren’s question had been right on the top of her tongue when Lin Yuan made his announcement.","Her eyes widened to the size of saucers at his prophetic abilities.","As a person of considerable status, Su Yiren was well aware of how terrifying the ability to read another person was.","Lin Yuan and Wen Yu’s all-knowing and all-powerful abilities cast a deep impression on Su Yiren.","She now knew that she could never lie to Lin Yuan because it would be futile.","If Lin Yuan knew what Su Yiren was thinking, he would be patting himself on the back for giving out his phone number.","In actuality, when Su Yiren formed a contract with the Corona Australis seat, Lin Yuan and Wen Yu had lost their access to Su Yiren’s memories."]},{"number":1229,"title":"Chapter 1229 - Four Units of Top-Grade Strange Water","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan had announced his phone number because he had seen from Su Yiren’s memories that she found a phone and wanted to ask for his number.","Additionally, he had already wasted too much time on Su Yiren.","The Astronomical Parliament could only be held for a limited time, and he could not dedicate it all to Su Yiren. He had to tend to Yin Lin, Ta Lei, and Bei Xu as well.","Lin Yuan turned back to Wen Yu.","Wen Yu’s lips moved slightly when she saw Lin Yuan looking at her.","From the shape of Wen Yu’s lips, Lin Yuan knew that there were only ten minutes left to the Astronomical Parliament.","Hence, he asked Yin Lin, “Yin Lin, let me know in advance about all the types of heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls you need so that I can prepare them.”","Yin Lin was in the Azure Federation and was going to enter the business of rare coral resources. She would need a mammoth number of heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls for this endeavor.","Dark Blue and the Island Whale were still growing in the Spirit Lock spatial zone and needed to continuously consume water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","Thus, Lin Yuan needed to properly plan for Yin Lin’s needs.","It would not do for Dark Blue’s consumption of water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls to affect Lin Yuan’s trading.","When the last Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting ended, Yin Lin had calculated how many heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls she would need, and she planned on discussing it with Lin Yuan during this parliamentary meeting.","“Leo, the more water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls I have, the better. I would like to stock up on 300 elemental pearls of each of the other types.”","Lin Yuan was astonished by how many resources Yin Lin possessed.","There were four types of Elemental Shellfish. Yin Lin did not even know how much one water-type elemental pearl was worth, yet she was ready to trade for 900 elemental pearls with Lin Yuan.","In order to comprehend Willpower Runes, Dark Blue needed strange water the most.","Once Lin Yuan completed the trade with Yin Lin, he would be able to obtain a large amount of strange water that would enable Dark Blue’s power to skyrocket.","However, Lin Yuan was not satisfied with the number ‘as many as possible’.","There was still some time before Yin Lin arrived at the Radiance Federation.","If Lin Yuan stopped Dark Blue from consuming any more water-type elemental pearls, he would have more than enough time to collect 5,000 water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, given the Aquamarine Elemental Shellfish’s current rate of production.","Would Yin Lin be able to transport all 5,000 water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls?","“I have a considerable number of water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls. State a number, and I’ll set it aside for you. This way, I’ll be able to use the rest of the water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls as I need instead of leaving them all aside while waiting to trade with you.”","Yin Lin immediately understood what Lin Yuan meant.","She carefully estimated the number of resources she had brought to the Radiance Federation and replied, “Leo, I would like to trade for 2,000 water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls. I only brought four types of top-grade strange water with me on this trip, but I have a lot of high-grade and mid-grade strange water. According to my calculations and given the price at the Radiance Federation, I should be able to trade for a premium rate of an additional 12%, bringing the number to 2,900 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.”","Lin Yuan’s eyebrow twitched wildly.","The Azure Federation truly lived up to its position as one of the three great federations, and Yin Lin was truly an Azure Envoy!","The Yin family also lived up to their title as one of the 12 great Azure families. They had so many resources that they could even offer four types of top-grade strange water at once!","Even if Lin Yuan used all his means, it would be difficult for him to obtain resources such as top-grade strange water and strange flames without asking the Moon Empress for help.","Once a faction obtained resources such as strange flames, strange water, and marsh soil, they would never let it out of their hands unless it was absolutely necessary.","If Yin Lin could offer four types of top-grade strange water at once, it also proved her rank within the family.","It could also be said that this trade with Lin Yuan was exceedingly important to Yin Lin.","Although Lin Yuan was uncomfortable with trading at a premium like Yin Lin said, he was not obligated to provide the additional 12% of heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls either.","If he did so, Yin Lin would feel awkward as well.","However, Yin Lin assumed that she would be trading for regular heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls when actually, all the elemental pearls that Lin Yuan was going to give her would either be Cloud Dream Lake or Defined Life elemental pearls.","As such, their price would be far beyond the market premium rate.","The thought that in a few days, the Spirit Lock spatial zone would be filled with piles of elemental pearls made Lin Yuan feel extremely satisfied. He reveled in this feeling of owning a stock of resources.","Ta Lei and Bei Xu had no idea what the top-grade strange water and heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls were.","They were in no position, nor did they have the ability to come in contact with such resources.","However, Su Yiren was different. She was utterly dumbfounded by this trade of four sets of top-grade strange water and 2,900 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","There were very few trades of such magnitudes even amongst the seven federations of the Dark Continent.","One thought filled Su Yiren’s mind.","Where did the people in the Astronomical Parliament come from?","During her last visit, she had realized that this meeting was an effect of a sacred source lifeform’s ability.","The person who conducted the meeting had to be outstanding to own a sacred source lifeform in the first place. However, everyone who entered the Astronomical Parliament should be pathetic creatures who needed to sell themselves to the Astronomical Parliament in order to save themselves.","So how could one of these people be able to offer four sets of top-grade strange water?","Su Yiren’s heart pounded wildly.","The trade between Lin Yuan and Yin Lin allowed her to see hope for the Seven States of Darkness’ futures.","Lin Yuan turned to Ta Lei and asked, “Ta Lei, how is the situation in your tribe?”","Ta Lei hurriedly knelt and raised both hands up toward Lin Yuan and said, “Teacher, thank you for teaching me and enabling me to become a Class 1 Creation Master. Everything is fine with the Horseshoe Tribe. As per your suggestion, we’ve started traveling toward the boundary between the Iron Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation.”","A strange look came over Lin Yuan when he heard Ta Lei address him as ‘Teacher’.","It was not he who had taught Ta Lei but Genius. Thus, Genius should be the one Ta Lei should be calling Teacher"]},{"number":1230,"title":"Chapter 1230 - Plan to Request for Territory","paragraphs":["Now that they were on a clock, Lin Yuan did not correct Ta Lei. He was very happy that the Horseshoe Tribe had listened to his suggestion.","Once they arrived at the boundary between the Iron Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation, it would be much easier for him to communicate with them. After all, he had hopes of establishing himself in the Iron Hammer Federation through the Horseshoe Tribe.","Just as he was about to ask Bei Xu about how he had been of late, Ta Lei suddenly said, “Master, now that I’m a Class 1 Creation Master, I can request territory for my tribe from the imperial court. If you have any piece of land to your liking, let me know, and I will request it. The area at the boundary is considered unimportant by the royal capital. I’ll be able to request for a larger piece of land there.”","Lin Yuan immediately became excited.","He was building the underground base at the boundary between the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation. The area was remote, but it still experienced footfall.","If Ta Lei could truly obtain a territory at the boundary between the Iron Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation, the Horseshoe Tribe would become the first line of defense for his underground palace.","Lin Yuan wanted the sea of bone lotus flowers to form a restricted area that would attract adventurers from all over the Startling Lines Continent.","Once he put his plan into action, it would progress quickly due to the gathering of many adventurers.","As he continued thinking, Lin Yuan asked Ta Lei, “How likely do you think that the Horseshoe Tribe will be allowed to take over all the land at the border of the Iron Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation?”","Ta Lei’s jaw dropped in shock. Such a scenario had never crossed his mind.","The border between the Iron Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation was a huge area where there was even more than enough space to build a city.","However, this area was also extremely dangerous.","The Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation were always at odds. There were also many occurrences of deadly fights between warring merchant groups from the Great Lush Federation.","This was why no tribe from the Iron Hammer Federation had settled in that area.","Ta Lei had dauntlessly led the entire Horseshoe Tribe to the border because Lin Yuan had suggested he do so but also because he considered Lin Yuan as his teacher and trusted Lin Yuan explicitly. As long as Lin Yuan ordered him to move, Ta Lei would advance fearlessly.","As a Class 1 Creation Master, it might be possible for him to obtain a territory with a radius of 10 kilometers. But in order to request for the entire border, he would have to be a Class 4 Creation Master at the very least because every major city in the Iron Hammer Federation was built around Class 4 tribes.","In the major cities of the Iron Hammer Federation, Class 4 tribes held absolute power.","Ta Lei could not fulfill Lin Yuan’s interest. He pouted in self-disappointment.","“Teacher, if you want the entire border between the Iron Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation, you might have to wait a long time. My grandfather says that Class 4 Creation Masters are all a bunch of old men.”","Now, Lin Yuan knew the requirement for owning the entire border between the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Hammer Federation.","When Liu Jie had used the Hurricane Owlet Moths to survey the area, they flew up into the sky to get a bird’s eye view of the area. They had discovered that the Iron Hammer Federation’s area cut into the Divine Wood Federation’s area like a needle.","Lin Yuan’s underground palace was situated within the needle. Essentially, his territory was at the crux of the link between the Divine Wood Federation and Iron Wood Federation.","If this crux could be recognized by an official that it belonged to Ta Lei, Lin Yuan would definitely seize the opportunity. This would save a significant amount of trouble for Lin Yuan.","Naturally, Lin Yuan could not place his hopes on Ta Lei to become a Class 4 Creation Master.","It was not that Lin Yuan did not have the ability to turn Ta Lei into a Class 4 Creation Master but that he would not do so.","If a 9-year-old Class 4 Creation Master appeared, it would shock the entire Startling Lines Continent. It was likely that the Divine Wood Federation would send many experts to kill Ta Lei.","This would put Ta Lei in danger.","Lin Yuan’s Class 4 Creation Masters consisted of Master Hong Shen, Hu Tian, Elder He, and Feng Shuang.","Any of these Class 4 Creation Masters could contract a fey that would take on a human form and announce itself as Ta Lei’s teacher. This would be enough for the imperial court to grant the territory.","Creation Masters’ skills lay in their abilities to nurture feys, evolve fey qualities, and heal feys and wounded roots. As such, it was difficult to identify a Creation Master based on appearances.","Frankly, if Lin Yuan stepped in personally and brought Genius along with him, the imperial could would likely also believe that he was a Class 4 Creation Master.","There were many Scholars in the Great Lush Federation. Hence, there were many more Creation Masters in the Great Lush Federation than there were in the Iron Hammer Federation.","There were many high-class Creation Masters from the Great Lush Federation who traveled to the Iron Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation to expand their influence.","Although the Divine Wood Federation and Great Lush Federation often attacked and stole from the merchants from the Great Lush Federation, they always welcomed the Creation Masters with open arms.","Due to the lack of Creation Masters in the Divine Wood Federation and Great Lush Federation, the value of Creation Masters was a widely-accepted fact.","A high-class Creation Master’s family or tribe would be able to take on the expansion of their family and lead in increasing their powers.","A plan took shape in Lin Yuan’s mind. However, he felt no need to tell Ta Lei of his plan yet.","“Ta Lei, let’s discuss the territory again once you reach the boundary between the Iron Hammer Federation and Divine Wood Federation.”","Wen Yu motioned to Lin Yuan that there were only two minutes left till the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting ended.","Lin Yuan hurriedly turned to Bei Xu.","Bei Xu had just started putting his plan into action in the subterranean world and had many things to tell Lin Yuan.","Yet, now was the only chance he had to speak with Lin Yuan.","Unfortunately, Lin Yuan denied Bei Xu that chance and used the remaining two minutes to use Star Spirit Seat to transfer a resource that he felt Bei Xu would need in the subterranean world.","This resource was the Sunlight King Lotus.","Bei Xu’s spirit qi professional rank was stuck at its current level, and Lin Yuan could not transfer any more spirit fluid to him to increase his fey’s power."]},{"number":1231,"title":"Chapter 1231 - Mystic Moon, Cicada Song, Moon Empress","paragraphs":["After giving Bei Xu the Sharp Shadow Bat, Lin Yuan had also given him the Life Knot Rock Crystal.","Lin Yuan could not give Bei Xu any more feys until he comprehended more Willpower Runes.","Although sunlight did not reach the subterranean world, enough light trickled down between the rocks to sustain the Sunlight King Lotus.","It could release the light it absorbed during the day at night to light up a space.","Bei Xu would be able to construct a place to stay with the Sunlight King Lotus.","Moreover, the Sunlight King Lotus was mobile, so Bei Xu would not be restricted to one location. This gave Bei Xu much more objective mobility to decide where he wanted to construct his home.","When he saw more cold sweat breaking out on Wen Yu’s forehead, Lin Yuan hastily said to Bei Xu, “You’ll probably like this little gift.”","Once the words left his lips, the constellations dispersed, and the dreamers awoke.","Wen Yu had not rested for long, and she had used up all her spiritual energy sustaining the Astronomical Parliament.","She teetered unsteadily before collapsing.","Lin Yuan anxiously rushed over to catch her and gave her some roasted Angelfish of Bliss fish coats.","After taking a small bite, Wen Yu’s dizziness slowly disappeared.","Lin Yuan made sure she was fine before saying in one of his rarely heard stern voices, “I will go to the territory on Star Web to wait for the people from the Sea Bliss Clan while you go take a good rest. You must rest properly before the next Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting. Otherwise, the frequent complete drains of spiritual energy will take its toll on you and affect the rate at which your spiritual energy grows.”","Wen Yu had never seen such an insistent Lin Yuan.","She stuck out her tongue slightly. Somehow, Lin Yuan’s domineering manner made her heart skip a beat.","“Young Master, I will immediately head to my room to rest after eating these fish coats. I won’t wake till tomorrow morning. My spiritual energy will be completely replenished by tomorrow,” replied Wen Yu obediently.","Lin Yuan’s tone softened as he said, “The Mother of Bloodbath specially set aside several grilled chicken wings for you. Big Brother Liu also left some fishballs. I’ll go and make you a bowl of fishball noodles. You should eat before you sleep. How can you let yourself go hungry for an entire day?”","Lin Yuan rose and walked out of the training room toward the kitchen.","During New Year’s, Lin Yuan had learned how to cook from Liu Jie in order to cook for the Moon Empress.","Moreover, Lin Yuan had cooked for Chu Ci and himself when it had just been the two of them.","As such, cooking noodles was like child’s play to him.","He used the soup and fishballs made by Liu Jie and made a dish that could not be too far of a cry from Liu Jie’s own cooking.","Additionally, Lin Yuan would eat noodles for almost every meal back in the Xia Region in order to save money. Hence, he might even be more experienced than Liu Jie when it came to cooking noodles.","When Wen Yu finished eating the fish coats and came downstairs, she saw Lin Yuan walking out of the kitchen carrying a bowl of fish coats and a plate of chicken wings.","She hurriedly walked over to take the meal over from him.","Wen Yu had chosen to remain by Lin Yuan’s side to help him.","Yet, her Creation Master skills had always been insufficient to be of any help to him.","Liu Jie took care of feeding everyone in the mansion, so Wen Yu was only left with the responsibility of dressing everyone.","Now, her Young Master had personally cooked a bowl of noodles for her. Tears welled up in her eyes.","Lin Yuan was confused when he saw Wen Yu lowering her head as she ate and wondered when she started eating with her head dipped so low that she resembled an ostrich. Her face almost made contact with the bowl.","Lin Yuan sat on the water rhinoceros leather sofa and used his Star Web Card to enter Star Web.","As the City Lord of Sky City, he could not remember the last time he had entered Sky City’s private territory.","He had taken his hands completely off and left everything about the territory to Wen Yu after he finished setting it up.","The territory had clearly been well-managed by Wen Yu, and everything outside of the territory still maintained the original style. There were no decorations anywhere.","Currently, the territory was still as crowded as it had been when it was first opened.","These people were not here to contend for Fate Letters as that event ended in the early afternoon.","They had all come to admire the decorations in the interior of Sky City’s private faction territory.","Lin Yuan could not help but scratch his head as he thought,? Sky City’s private faction territory is about to become the number one attraction on Star Web!","He opened Star Web’s private territory rankings and saw that Sky City was seated at number seven on the Visitor’s Ranking.","Sky City only gave out 100 Fate Letters per day, and other territories that had merchant roles saw hundreds of thousands of clients every day.","Evidently, the crowd that visited Sky City’s private territory on a daily basis was massive.","When Lin Yuan arrived inside the private territory, many people recognized him from his mask.","Lin Yuan had come to the private faction territory to wait for the inevitable arrival of people from the Sea Bliss Clan.","Thus, as much as he did not want to change how popular Sky City’s private territory was, he had to set up a lock.","However, he did not brutally kick out those in the territory as the Sea Bliss Clan had done. Instead, he quietly waited for all of them to leave and walked over to give reminders to those who still lingered.","Half an hour later, the interior of Sky City’s private faction territory was empty.","Lin Yuan sat down on the chair and played with the Oath Lily of the Valley as he waited for Qi Wangyang and Qi Haitao to arrive.","...","A faint frigid light appeared in the afternoon sky.","A round moon slowly emerged amidst the light.","However, noon had just passed, and the sunlight was blinding. Hence, ordinary people did not notice the changes that had taken place in the sky.","The round moon’s shape changed continuously as it lit up the sky.","Mystic Moon was currently in the inner palace of the Radiant Moon Palace, staring speechlessly at Cicada Song.","Apparently, Cicada Song had something so urgent to say to the Moon Empress that not even Mystic Moon was allowed to pass on the message.","Mystic Moon would have chased him out long ago if this was anyone else.","Alas, Cicada Song was a member of royalty like the Moon Empress. Mystic Moon had no right to chase Cicada Song away given their similar statuses and close relationship.","However, the Moon Empress had locked herself away to train.","Mystic Moon was uncomfortable with the fact that Cicada Song was currently in the inner palace of the Moon Empress, which was only separated from the Moon Empress’ bedroom by the Moon Shadow Walkway.","Suddenly, Cicada Song’s eyes sharpened, and his gaze locked in the direction of the Moon Empress’ bedroom.","At the same moment, the lotus flowers in the pool closed, and their stems sagged."]},{"number":1232,"title":"Chapter 1232 - The Beautiful are Sharing their Pain","paragraphs":["It was not just the Radiant Moon Palace. All the fresh flowers on Leaning Moon Mountain that had ever been in contact with the Moon Empress’ aura closed up and sagged.","It looked as though they were all crying.","Mystic Moon noticed this and immediately looked worried.","Cicada Song said grimly, “The beautiful are sharing their pain. The Moon Empress is too impatient! It’s not that easy to take that last step! Your lifespan decreases by five years each time you attempt it. I might be able to try it many more times, but you can’t try it a single time more.”","Initially, Mystic Moon did not think much of Cicada Song’s words. But when he heard the latter part of what Cicada Song said, his heart skipped a beat.","What did Cicada Song mean? What did he mean by the Moon Empress could not try it?","Just as Mystic Moon was about to disregard his station and ask Cicada Song what he meant, he suddenly remembered all the changes that had happened to the Moon Empress over the last decade.","These changes had left Mystic Moon shellshocked.","He had been with the Moon Empress for half a century. By now, he understood the Moon Empress even better than he understood himself.","Images from the past decade flashed through Mystic Moon’s mind, and he realized that the Moon Empress had turned into a completely different person after that incident.","Previously, she had been so unbelievably haughty, confident, and iron-willed that it almost hurt to look at her.","If you ever saw yourself as a genius, you would quickly wither in despair once you met her.","Yet, she had not done anything of note in the past decade besides accepting a disciple. Her sole focus had been increasing her power.","Mystic Moon did not think that the Moon Empress’ astounding power came from her hard work but from her incredible talent.","Her talent had enabled her to become the strongest expert in the world easily.","Additionally, she had been focused on paving the way for Lin Yuan ever since she accepted him as her disciple.","This did not fit with the person she had been ten years ago at all.","If the Moon Empress had accepted Lin Yuan as her disciple ten years ago, she would have allowed him to make his way on his own and only stepped in to clean up his messes, just like Chef Supreme did with Zong Ze.","In the past, she would only have started paving the way for him after he gained an understanding of the world.","She would never have planned out every step of the way for Lin Yuan when he was only 18 years old.","Lin Yuan had once been in danger in the water world dimensional rift outside Indigo Azure City.","Given the Moon Empress’ temper, she should have definitely stepped in to take on Tower Canon even if she did not care for Lin Yuan.","Moreover, he was the apple of her eye.","Before that incident ten years ago, before Seventh Page War had even started causing trouble, it had arrived in the Radiance Federation for the first time 15 years ago and had been riding on the Radiance War Chariot when aura had stained the plants on Leaning Moon Mountain.","At that moment, a brilliant moon had swallowed up the noon sun, and waterfalls of moonbeams had crashed down on Seventh Page War.","As a result, even the Radiance War Chariot had cracked.","If Second Page Revival, who had been hiding in the shadows, had not stepped in to help Seventh Page War flee, the Moon Empress would have continued to unleash her wrath on Seventh Page War.","Yet, 15 years later, the Moon Empress had chosen to control her temper after learning of the circumstances.","All these changes poked and prodded at Mystic Moon relentlessly, and only one possibility arose in his head.","Could something have happened during the incident ten years ago that he did not know about?","Inside the Moon Empress’ bedroom...","She had collapsed from her original upright seated position as moonbeams leaked from the moon imprint on the center of her forehead.","Her long hair and eyebrows had all turned as white as the moon.","In between breaths, she spat out moonlight. All in all, she did not look human at all.","At this moment, her tightly shut eyes flew open.","A look of wild indignance dominated her gaze. But slowly, her gaze shifted.","The small rabbit lying on her knee hurriedly handed its carrot over as an offering to the Moon Empress.","The Moon Empress smiled ruefully and gently pushed the carrot back as she said, “Zixi, it’s no use. My soul power is completely depleted. In this state, there’s no way I can continue to put my life on the line while trying to carve out a path to that heavenly road.”","The moon imprint on the Moon Empress’ forehead gradually darkened.","She paused for a moment before adding, “My birth horoscope is set. I am fated to draw my last breath within the next five years. Zixi, this is my destiny.”","The Moon Empress stopped speaking and looked down at her slender ivory hands.","Her life thus far had been a series of breakthroughs, and she had never known the taste of failure until now.","Unfortunately, this failure would bring about the ultimate end.","At that moment, the humming of what seemed to be numerous cicadas accompanied by a gentle breeze reached the Moon Empress’ bedroom.","Each cicada seemed to be using its music to weave a world that was brimming with soul power.","As the cicadas weaved their worlds and their songs amplified their efforts, thousands of rays of light appeared beside the Moon Empress.","The bodhis started from sprouts and grew into huge trees that soon produced adlays that fell onto the Moon Empress.","Every adlay replenished the Moon Empress’ diminished soul power.","The breeze danced around the bodhi trees and soothed the Moon Empress’ riled-up spirit.","Soon, the Moon Empress’ soul power had recovered.","She closed her eyes and made a final charge toward the heavenly road in the interval before her birth horoscope was truly set in stone.","Cicada Song was currently suspended in the air as winds circled him.","A cicada that was fervently rubbing its wings together sat on his palm.","Dragon horns had grown from the top of Mystic Moon’s head, and silver patterns covered his body.","But just as he entered his battle mode, Mystic Moon was promptly wrapped up in and trapped by a torrent of wind.","Cicada Song lowered his head and said, “32 lotus heads and 23 years of cicadas. In order to help the Moon Empress, I used the Cicada’s Merciful Guidance to give 23 years of Merciful Cicada Songs to the Moon Empress. I’m sure you know of the abilities of my Cicada’s Merciful Guidance.”"]},{"number":1233,"title":"Chapter 1233 - Lifespan is Set!","paragraphs":["“I am helping the Moon Empress, so retract your aura. If it explodes, it might distract the Moon Empress.”","At first, Mystic Moon’s eyes flashed, and it seemed that he was not going to back down.","But when he heard the latter part of Cicada Song’s statement, he struggled for a moment before decisively restraining his aura.","Mystic Moon knew a fair amount about Cicada Song’s signature fey, the Cicada’s Merciful Guidance.","Amongst all the 13 members of royalty, Cicada Song was the only one that was purely a support-type spirit qi professional.","Every one year of Merciful Cicada Songs would enable the target to replenish its soul power rapidly.","If Cicada Song was willing to give 23 years of Merciful Cicada Songs to the Moon Empress, it meant that he did not have any ill will.","Moreover, Cicada Song had also used the Alleviating Wind, which would reduce its user’s lifespan by a year each time it was used.","Now that Mystic Moon was calm, he could tell how much Cicada Song had sacrificed. If he was even willing to give up his own lifespan, there was no way he intended any harm to the Moon Empress.","But at the same time, he was shocked by Cicada Song’s power.","In that split second, he had completely overwhelmed Mystic Moon.","This meant that Cicada Song had also taken that step and wielded power that was a cut above Mystic Moon’s own power.","Judging from the strength of the aura, Mystic Moon could be certain that Cicada Song was not as powerful as the Moon Empress. However, he was not far off.","Just as Mystic Moon was about to ask Cicada Song what he meant when he said that the Moon Empress no longer had any chances, the Moon Empress had traveled through the Moon Shadow Walkway to arrive at the inner palace.","She was carrying a small white rabbit and looked exactly the same as how she did on any other day.","When she saw Cicada Song suspended in the air, she said, “The errant gust of wind alleviated me. Cicada Song, you have improved significantly in the past few years.”","Cicada Song raised his hand, and a blaze-yellow wooden box appeared in his hand.","A strange look appeared in the Moon Empress’ eyes.","Cicada Song handed the blaze-yellow wooden box to the Moon Empress and said, “This is Earth Center Fine Milk from that old man. Once you drink it, it’ll increase your lifespan by a year. I’ll take my leave now. Take care of yourself.”","Since the Moon Empress left so quickly, it meant that she had failed.","Those who seemed unfeeling were often the most sensitive.","Cicada Song knew that the Moon Empress did not have much longer to live and did not want to linger in the Radiant Moon Palace where his old friend, who was about to be gone, was.","The always-calm Cicada Song felt an uncontrollable urge to rush to the Freedom Federation and unleash his murderous wrath.","The Moon Empress looked at the wooden box in her hands and said, “Thank you for this. I owe you one. I’ll definitely return the favor in the future. Also, please thank that old man on my behalf.”","After Cicada Song left, the anxious Mystic Moon could no longer hold himself back and burst out, “Moon Empress, your body—”","The Moon Empress gave the wooden box to Mystic Moon and said, “I failed to reach that stage this time. My birth horoscope has been limited to five years. Now that my lifespan is shortened, I only have three years left. Give this drop of Earth Center Fine Milk to Little Yuan when he returns from the Divine Wood Federation.”","Mystic Moon was immediately overwhelmed.","He had never heard the Moon Empress say such things in the past.","However, this was clearly not the time to struggle over this issue.","The Moon Empress’ lifespan was already short, to begin with.","If she used the drop of Earth Center Fine Milk, she would immediately gain another year. In such a circumstance, why was she not using it for herself but choosing to give it to Lin Yuan instead?","Could it be because the drop of Earth Center Fine Milk would completely transform a body that had been cleansed of all impurities?","Mystic Moon was always subservient to the Moon Empress, but he could not help but suggest, “Moon Empress, I think you should use this Earth Center Fine Milk on yourself. The Young Lord is still young. Given his talent, he’ll have the opportunity to transform himself in the future even without the Earth Center Fine Milk.”","The Moon Empress looked up at the sky.","Thanks to Cicada Song’s Cicada’s Merciful Guidance and Alleviating Wind, she was able to use her life to make another attempt to carve a way into the heavenly path.","She had managed to make headway during the final strike and felt that she would be able to break through during her next attempt.","However, she also knew that her lifespan could not handle it.","Even if she used the Earth Center Fine Milk, she would not even have five years left.","The Earth Center Fine Milk could not be consumed carelessly. After one consumed a resource that could increase one’s lifespan, they would need time to digest it and allow it to take effect.","In fact, the person would need about three to four years to digest it, only to add one year to their lifespan.","Precious items like the Earth Center Fine Milk that could increase one’s lifespan were rare. But even if they were common, the Moon Empress would not be able to consume anything else to increase her lifespan in the three to four years after she used the Earth Center Fine Milk.","Her lifespan was set!","No matter how proud the Moon Empress was, she had no choice but to accept her fate. Hence, she felt that it would be best to leave the Earth Center Fine Milk for Lin Yuan.","During the tail end of the Moon Empress’ life, her only hope was to watch Lin Yuan grow slowly, become a Radiance Envoy, and achieve happiness.","If she could nurture Lin Yuan into a Radiance Envoy, it would be the most meaningful thing to contribute to the Radiance Federation at the end of her life as a member of royalty.","When she saw how worried Mystic Moon was, she explained softly, “Only Cicada Song and that old man know about my body’s condition. I can’t help that you found out from Cicada Song, but don’t tell Little Yuan and Cold Moon about this. I’m sure you can imagine how serious the impact will be if this piece of news gets out.”","The Moon Empress’ resolute tone made Mystic Moon swallow the words that had already formed in his throat.","He looked at the wooden box in his hands and said, “Moon Empress, Young Lord called you this afternoon. He has returned from the Divine Wood Federation. Why don’t I contact him now? I told him that I would inform him at once when you’re available.”","Mystic Moon felt that Lin Yuan was the only person on earth who would be able to talk sense into the Moon Empress.","Yet, the Moon Empress had forbidden him from telling Lin Yuan about this.","Usually, Mystic Moon would definitely have listened to the Moon Empress.","However, he would do anything if it meant that the Moon Empress would be able to live for another year.","Mystic Moon decided to tell Lin Yuan about this even if it meant that he would be reprimanded by the Moon Empress when she found out."]},{"number":1234,"title":"Chapter 1234 - The Moon Empress’ Plan for Lin Yuan","paragraphs":["The Moon Empress’ expression softened for a moment, and she said, “If so, you don’t have to rush. There are still a few hours to go before dinnertime. I haven’t had dinner in the Radiant Moon Palace with Little Yuan in some time. Ask him to come over to have dinner with me tonight.”","Before her lifespan was set, she rarely asked Lin Yuan to come to the Radiant Moon Palace to have dinner.","She liked to have him by her side, but she also hoped he would be able to create a bright and far-reaching future for himself.","But now that her lifespan was set, she did not have time to wait.","As an expert that had made her name with power, she understood that one was helpless against death and that death would bring about the end of everything. There was no afterlife.","In her remaining three years, she hoped that Lin Yuan would visit the Radiant Moon Palace as much as it did not infringe on his life.","As her disciple, he was the closest person to her.","Mystic Moon felt tears welling up as he felt the Moon Empress describe herself as though she was an ailing hero that could no longer live up to her past self.","At her level, she should still be in her prime now.","Yet, she was reduced to making do with another measly three years.","Mystic Moon could not do anything about any of this. If it was possible, he was willing to exchange his lifespan with the Moon Empress and die in three years instead.","The more he looked at the Moon Empress’ resigned expression, the more his heart ached. He could not bear to look at her, so he turned his head away and said softly, “Moon Empress, I’ll go and ask for dinner to be prepared now that Young Lord is coming.”","The Moon Empress placed the listless Zixi on the jade table and said, “I think Little Yuan should consume the Earth Center Fine Milk today. Once he does, he should be able to contract Golden Wings. In order to ensure that he’s able to absorb the Earth Center Fine Milk perfectly, we need to include more soul-protecting spiritual ingredients in tonight’s dinner. Since I have nothing on my plate, I will prepare the dinner myself. Mystic Moon, help me with the preparation.”","Mystic Moon had no choice but to go and inform Lin Yuan now.","As the Moon Empress continued to take her usual confident and dignified strides, Mystic Moon said tensely, “Moon Empress, I’ll go with you when the time comes three years later.”","The Moon Empress immediately rebuked him, “Mystic Moon, what nonsense are you spouting? Even when I’m gone, you still have your own life to lead. I won’t force you to do anything once I’m gone, but I hope you’ll be able to keep helping Little Yuan.”","She could not help but think about Lin Yuan’s performance during Sky City’s blood pact ultimate fight against the Zheng family.","In the short span of a few months, Lin Yuan had grown Sky City into an enormous beast. This filled the Moon Empress with happiness and pride.","Mystic Moon’s handsome face scrunched up in distress as he said, “Moon Empress, you forbade me from telling Lin Yuan and Cold Moon, but you know Cold Moon’s temper best. She’ll definitely make the same decision as me when she finds out. On the other hand, Lin Yuan is your disciple. If he encounters some danger and his lifespan is shortened to another three years as well, but he chooses not to tell you, will you be able to accept it?”","The Moon Empress stared deeply into Mystic Moon’s eyes without saying another word.","Both Mystic Moon and Cold Moon had accepted disciples as well.","Over the next three years, the Masters and disciples would only become closer. When the time came, Mystic Moon and Cold Moon were bound to make the right decision.","As for Lin Yuan, the Moon Empress had decided not to tell him after contemplating the matter thoroughly.","If she told Lin Yuan about her condition, there was no way he would accept the Earth Center Fine Milk without any reservations.","If she told him after he consumed the Earth Center Fine Milk, he would be tortured by the knowledge.","Lin Yuan had just turned 18 this year, and the next three years would be a period of exponential growth for him.","Since she was able to safeguard him for the next three years, she did not want Lin Yuan’s growth to be sidelined because of her.","The Moon Empress prepared a feast for tonight’s dinner.","After the Jade-Eating Blood Swallow evolved to Suzerain, its nest would also become jade. When its nest was cooked, it would be able to replenish a person’s energy to the maximum extent.","Amongst the blood-energy spiritual ingredients, the Jade-Eating Blood Swallow’s nest was even higher ranked than the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire was amongst fire-type spiritual ingredients. There were only about 16 comparable ingredients to the Jade-Eating Blood Swallow’s nest, among which were the Island Whale’s brain oil and Spirit Marrow Gold Ginseng.","Whenever one of these ingredients surfaced, they would incite a mad competition amongst the factions.","In the main world, federations that had good relationships often gifted treasures to each other.","Any of these ingredients could be given as a treasure.","From the way the Moon Empress did not hesitate to use such ingredients, Mystic Moon could tell how important Lin Yuan was to her.","On any other day, the Moon Empress would not even be able to bear using so many of these ingredients on herself.","But when it came to Lin Yuan, she did not care about how precious these ingredients were at all.","Nonetheless, these ingredients were all necessary in order for Lin Yuan to perfectly digest the Earth Center Fine Milk and use its energy to transform himself.","Since the Moon Empress was set on Lin Yuan consuming the Earth Center Fine Milk tonight, Mystic Milk felt that he needed to visit the Return From Faraway Mansion now to tell Lin Yuan about the Moon Empress’ condition.","While these thoughts were running through Mystic Moon’s mind, he was completely oblivious to the fact that the Moon Empress had already completely seen through him.","Mystic Moon checked the time and said, “Moon Empress, it’s getting late. I’ll go and invite the Young Lord now.”","The Moon Empress said knowingly, “Mystic Moon, you stay here and continue prepping the ingredients. I’ll call Little Yuan myself. I’ve already made up my mind. Don’t disappoint me tonight.”","She turned and left the kitchen.","Mystic Moon watched the Moon Empress leave with great sorrow in his eyes.","Meanwhile...","Qi Wangyang and Qi Haitao had arrived at Sky City’s private faction territory, where Lin Yuan was already waiting for them.","They gingerly stood before Lin Yuan with their heads lowered and sour expressions.","Small beads of sweat were rolling down Qi Wangyang’s forehead.","Lin Yuan looked at them the same way he would look at morons and said, “Exciting! It’s so exciting! The Sea Bliss Clan sure has planned this out so well. Do you take Sky City for a bunch of idiots!?”"]},{"number":1235,"title":"Chapter 1235 - What to Do Now?","paragraphs":["Qi Wangyang and Qi Haitao jumped and jerked their heads up to explain themselves.","However, Lin Yuan beat them to the chase and said, “I don’t know what’s going through your minds. You’re on the brink of doom, yet you’re still trying to do business with Sky City. You currently have no right to talk business with Sky City.","“The Sea Bliss Clan is now on Connected Beast Park’s chopping board, and they’ve already made a request to the Spirit Guards to issue a blood pact ultimate fight with you. As long as they are persistent, the Spirit Guards will force you to agree.","“It will be impossible for you to win over Connected Beast Park. According to the rules of the blood pact ultimate fight, Connected Beast Park will be able to decide your fate and gain control over all your businesses. Do you think they will allow the both of you to keep your lives?”","Lin Yuan’s words were like knives that stabbed Qi Wangyang and Qi Haitao’s hearts.","They were well aware of this, and it was the reason they felt utterly cornered and had no choice but to force themselves to seek out Sky City.","They had also come with the goal of adding fuel to the flames of Sky City’s animosity with Connected Beast Park in order to gain Sky City’s help in exchange for offering them benefits.","But from the way Lin Yuan reacted, Qi Wangyang and Qi Haitao knew that they had to scrap this plan.","Lin Yuan frowned as Qi Wangyang and Qi Haitao’s silence dragged on.","Apparently, they still did not completely understand the situation and what they needed to do.","It had not been long since Connected Beast Park initiated the blood pact ultimate fight. As such, Qi Wangyang and Qi Haitao had not begun feeling the desperation of impending death yet.","There was no point for Lin Yuan to continue talking to these two men in such a circumstance.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to put an end to their discussion, Qi Wangyang raised his head and smiled pleasingly as he asked gingerly, “I lost my head for a moment and crossed the line. If you are able to help the Sea Bliss Clan overcome this trial, we’ll give you 50% ownership of the Sea Bliss Clan. Sky City will be entitled to half of everything that the Sea Bliss Clan obtains. We will take care of managing ourselves, so you won’t have to do anything at all. Sky City will also be entitled to trading for a suitable amount of top-grade Angelfish of Bliss resources.”","Qi Wangyang anxiously watched Lin Yuan’s gaze.","When Lin Yuan did not nod after three seconds passed, Qi Wangyang added, “According to the rules of the blood pact ultimate fights, the Sea Bliss Clan can hand over all of Connected Beast Park’s resources and members’ fates to Sky City after Sky City aids the Sea Bliss Clan during the blood pact ultimate fight.”","Lin Yuan immediately started to guffaw.","It seemed that Qi Wangyang was already expecting to take over all of Connected Beast Park’s resources even before he successfully convinced Sky City to help.","Lin Yuan felt that this was a stupidly ludicrous way of thinking.","Currently, Lin Yuan did not intend to wipe out Connected Beast Park. If he did, he would have issued a blood pact ultimate fight challenge to them on the basis that they had lent their experts to the Zheng family during Sky City’s blood pact ultimate fight with the Zheng family.","Firstly, the Creation Master resources that Connected Beast Park possessed were not of much use to Lin Yuan. Secondly, Connected Beast Park was now linked to Whale Ocean Commerce.","Lin Yuan wanted to use the relationship between Connected Beast Park and Whale Ocean Commerce to obtain another strange seed that would enable Red Thorn to evolve even further.","Hence, even if he defeated Connected Beast Park in a blood pact ultimate fight, he would only take over their resources so as to maintain the fear that Whale Ocean Commerce felt toward Connected Beast Park.","If Connected Beast Park approached him after losing three thearch-class experts, he might have to produce more thearch-class experts for them.","He did not want to unleash deadly wrath on Connected Beast Park before he obtained the strange seed.","Thanks to the mask, the true meaning behind his smile could not be discerned.","When Lin Yuan smiled, Qi Wangyang instinctively assumed that his words had taken effect on Lin Yuan, so he hastily made use of the opportunity to say, “City Lord, it’s clear that Connected Beast Park lent two thearch-class experts to the Zheng family with the aim of destroying Sky City. It’s the right time for you to act now as well as cement the impression of Sky City’s power and strike fear into the hearts of the other factions. If you defeat Connected Beast Park during the blood pact ultimate fight, your rank will definitely climb to the top 15 during next year’s ranking.”","Lin Yuan could not despise Qi Wangyang more at that moment.","He could handle dealing with stupid people, but he could not accept doing business with stupid and ignorant people.","The Star Web Card could be linked to the phone, and spirit qi professionals received notifications when someone called them while they were in Star Web.","When Lin Yuan saw that the call was coming from the Moon Empress, he immediately left Sky City’s private territory on Star Web. Qi Wangyang and Qi Haitao were left staring at each other in an empty room.","The confident Qi Wangyang’s face turned grim as large beads of sweat rolled down his head.","The Sea Bliss Clan and Sky City’s previous collaboration had been rocky.","Qi Wangyang and Qi Haitao knew that they had taken advantage of Sky City by giving them Angelfish of Bliss that could not reproduce.","Thus, Qi Wangyang did not immediately think of Sky City when they were sourcing for help.","Yet, after swallowing his pride and visiting numerous top factions only to be rejected, he finally thought of Sky City.","But now, it seemed that he had angered Sky City’s City Lord.","What to do now?","Lin Yuan picked up the Moon Empress’ call, and she told him that she was done training and wanted him to go over for dinner that night.","He smiled and replied, “Master, I haven’t even had time to take a shower since I returned from the Divine Wood Federation. I’ll head to the Radiant Moon Palace right after a shower.”","Lin Yuan hung up and picked up the Lifespan Mouse like a tuft of orange fur and said to it, “Little one, you’re about to meet your true master soon.”"]},{"number":1236,"title":"Chapter 1236 - You’re the Carefree One!","paragraphs":["Even before the Lifespan Mouse had been transformed into a fey by the pure spirit qi, it already possessed impressive intelligence.","Although it was not as smart as housekeeping beasts like Genius, it was as smart as Chimey before it transformed into a fey.","The Lifespan Mouse still could not speak but could easily understand Lin Yuan’s intentions.","For example, when Lin Yuan fed the Soldier Ration Radish to the Lifespan Mouse, he noticed it liked to eat the stem. However, the most nutritious part of the Soldier Ration Radish was its leaves.","Hence, Lifespan Mouse instructed the Lifespan Mouse to eat the leaves instead.","As much as the Lifespan Mouse preferred to eat the stem, it started to eat the leaves as per Lin Yuan’s instructions.","It only furtively nibbled the stems when it noticed Lin Yuan busily attending to other matters. It seemed scared of Lin Yuan finding out that it was secretly the stem.","This was about the intelligence level of a six-year-old child.","When the Lifespan Mouse heard Lin Yuan say that he was going to give it to someone else, the Lifespan Mouse started to scamper in circles in Lin Yuan’s palm anxiously.","It looked at Lin Yuan with sad eyes, questioning how Lin Yuan could bear to give such an adorable creature like itself away.","Lin Yuan hurriedly circulated his spiritual power and released it to soothe the Lifespan Mouse through his palm.","Yet, the Lifespan Mouse looked even sadder. Tears welled up in its eyes and wet the orange fur around its eyes.","Lin Yuan realized that the Lifespan Mouse was concerned that leaving him meant that it would not be able to feel such pure spirit qi anymore. This explained why the Lifespan Mouse looked even more hurt after it felt the pure spirit qi that Lin Yuan released.","Lin Yuan caressed the Lifespan Mouse’s soft yet firm fur and said, “Little one, you will still be able to receive abundant pure spirit qi when you’re by your new master’s side. You only have a year’s worth of lifespan. If you don’t quickly form a contract with a person and absorb spiritual ingredients that contain vitality, you still won’t be able to receive any more spirit qi once the year is up. You’ll be able to eat as many vitality-increasing spiritual ingredients as you want and continue living with your new master. You’ll also be able to receive pure spirit qi whenever you want. Do you still remember the other feys chasing you in the forest? Once you form a contract with the new master, she will protect you. You will never have to spend another day running for your life.”","The Lifespan Mouse slowly calmed down and gripped Lin Yuan’s finger with its two small paws.","It gently tugged at his finger. It was obviously still reluctant to leave Lin Yuan.","He smiled warmly and said, “Your new master is my Master. I will be spending a lot of time with her, so we’ll have plenty of opportunities to see each other. Once you’re there, you’ll also be able to become friends with a stingy carrot-loving rabbit. That rabbit is just as carefree as you are. The two of you should be able to get along happily.”","While Lin Yuan was speaking, Zixi was lazily spread out on a table. It had placed its carrot in the jade basin next to it.","Zixi’s eyes trembled as large tears spilled from its eyes. However, Zixi seemed to be afraid of people spotting its tears as it hastily wiped its face clean with its white paws.","The carrot in the basin no longer interested Zixi.","If Zixi knew that Lin Yuan was currently speaking to the Lifespan Mouse, it would have waved its carrot angrily at him despite his position as the Moon Empress’ disciple.","You’re the carefree one! I eat carrots to train myself. You still haven’t witnessed how powerful I am! I’m not stingy at all. Countless experts in this world are dying to get a whiff of my carrot, but they can only dream of doing so. Yet, you not only got to taste the carrot skin but even got to eat half of the carrot. My carrot still hasn’t fully recovered! Hmph! I’m angry!","After Lin Yuan comforted the Lifespan Mouse, he went back to his room to shower.","He had limited resources in the Divine Wood Federation and had not had the chance to shower at all.","Lin Yuan’s genes had been refined, and his skin had gained resistance to dust.","However, he had a habit of showering daily, and missing just a day was enough to make his skin crawl.","As he listened to the sounds of rushing water in the shower, he could calmly assess his recent experiences.","During this trip to the Divine Wood Federation, he had smoothly established himself in the Startling Lines Continent.","He was now the honorary Captain of the Sincere Merchant Group and had gained a medium through which he could trade in the Startling Lines Continent. This also meant that he had his own native faction in the Great Lush Federation.","Ta Lei’s Horseshoe Tribe allowed Lin Yuan to gain an official channel through which he could expand himself into the Iron Hammer Federation.","Luo Ya, who came from a Class 2 family, was considered a member of the elite in the Divine Wood Federation. This would enable Lin Yuan to develop himself rapidly in the Divine Wood Federation.","The progress in the Startling Lines Continent was going smoothly.","Once Su Yiren arrived by his side, her status as a Dark Envoy would be able to aid in Lin Yuan’s development greatly.","As for the marsh world, Lin Yuan never imagined that he would be able to subjugate an expert like White Speak.","White Speak had taken over Dark Scorpion’s territory, which was right in front of Lin Yuan’s own territory. This essentially formed a barrier that separated Lin Yuan’s territory from potential dangers.","Rising Lizard, Wendy, and White Pavilion would be able to quickly increase their power and gain faith power through the neverending stream of Marsh Crocodiles.","Everything was thriving.","This thought made Lin Yuan smile.","It seemed that he needed to start something when he returned to the Divine Wood Federation.","After showering, he put on light green and lunar yellow spirit qi clothes that Wen Yu had only designed recently.","Most of Lin Yuan’s spirit qi clothes were black, white, and blue. He almost never wore light green and lunar yellow spirit qi clothes like the ones he had just put on.","The patterns on the light green and lunar yellow spirit qi clothes incorporated the dotting with kingfishers technique. Diamond Bright Light Oriole’s tail feathers were stuck to the front of the spirit qi clothes that included metal as its base.","Ice Silkworm Threads wove golden embroidery patterns of a cloud-covered sunset.","The golden threads obscured the beauty of the Bright Light Oriole’s tail feathers and made the entire spirit qi clothes appear exceptionally soft."]},{"number":1237,"title":"Chapter 1237 - Master, Can You Contract This Fey?","paragraphs":["The light blue sky that contrasted with the lunar yellow spirit qi clothes added a bright tinge to the spirit qi clothes. When it was paired with Lin Yuan’s natural charisma, his already exceptional features were elevated even further.","Lin Yuan looked at himself in the mirror but did not see anything different about himself.","When he stepped out of his room, he ran into Liu Jie, who had just returned from the Spirit Guards’ land.","Liu Jie’s eyes lit up, and he could not help but gasp to himself.","There’s no doubt about it. Lin Yuan is much more suited to wearing light-colored clothes like this over dark colors like black and navy.?","People who did not have good looks would only appear uglier when they wore light-colored clothes. In comparison, people who did not have the right charisma would appear bland when they wore light-colored clothes.","Only people like Lin Yuan, who had both the looks and the charisma, would be able to carry off light-colored spirit qi clothes perfectly. Besides his charisma, he also had an air of freshness about him.","Lin Yuan hurriedly said to Liu Jie, who was about to start preparing dinner, “Big Brother Liu, I was just going to call you. I’m going to have dinner with Master tonight, so you don’t have to prepare my share. Wen Yu just ate some of the fishball noodles and grilled chicken wings you made this morning. She will probably sleep till tomorrow morning.”","Liu Jie nodded and replied, “The Mother of Bloodbath didn’t eat its fill after saving some of the chicken wings for Wen Yu. If only the Mother of Bloodbath and I will be having dinner in the mansion tonight, I’ll just make more chicken wings and other bird-type feys to stuff the Mother of Bloodbath.”","Lin Yuan immediately used the Ethereal Jellyfish’s Node Teleportation and traveled to the entrance of the Radiant Moon Palace.","But from the moment he arrived, he sensed that something was wrong.","Normally, the two Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassias flourished and bloomed. In the evenings, the silver glow of the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassias even blanketed the afterglow of sunset.","Yet now, all the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia’s flowers had closed up, and their branches were sagging feebly.","From Lin Yuan’s knowledge, he concluded that the plant-type feys were grieving.","But why were they so sorrowful? Could something have happened at the Radiant Moon Palace?","Lin Yuan anxiously entered the lobby of the Radiant Moon Palace and saw that the four tea attendants were standing in the lobby as usual.","It did not appear as though anything had happened.","When the four tea attendants saw Lin Yuan, they hurriedly went up to greet him. They bowed and said, “Young Lord, the Moon Empress prepared the ingredients and cooked tonight’s dinner herself. Mystic Moon should be tending to the fire now. The Moon Empress should be waiting for you in the inner palace.”","Lin Yuan greeted the four tea attendants before walking toward the inner palace.","Their behavior put him at ease. Apparently, he had been worried for nothing. It must be that something was wrong with the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassias.","Lin Yuan felt that he needed to mention the problem with the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassias to the Moon Empress.","Before he entered the inner palace, he saw Mystic Moon with a troubled expression.","Lin Yuan asked him curiously, “Mystic Moon, Cai Cha told me that you’re in the kitchen. Are you waiting for me?”","Mystic Moon took a step forward and said, “Young Lord, that drop of Earth Center Fine Milk—”","Before Mystic Moon could finish speaking, the Moon Empress’ voice traveled in from the inner palace.","“Little Yuan, come into the inner palace and see the Spirit-Siphon Goldfish I nurtured.”","The Moon Empress amplified her voice using spirit qi so even people far away could hear her clearly.","Only S-rank experts and above had this exclusive ability.","Lin Yuan was only a C-rank spirit qi professional and did not have this ability. Thus, he could not reply to the Moon Empress using the same method.","The Moon Empress’ voice cut Mystic Moon off mid-sentence, so all Lin Yuan heard was the part about the Earth Center Fine Milk.","Lin Yuan had heard of the Earth Center Fine Milk.","The Moon Empress had paid special attention to talking about the Earth Center Fine Milk when she explained precious spiritual ingredients to him.","The 100 most precious treasures were listed down in a record.","The Earth Center Fine Milk was number 17 on that record.","Every precious treasure that made it onto the list had special abilities that the other treasures could not replicate.","Hence, the rankings did not quantify the treasure’s worth.","Lin Yuan’s Lifeform Sacrificial Fire did not make it onto the list.","But what did the Earth Center Fine Milk have to do with Lin Yuan?","Lin Yuan frowned at Mystic Moon’s perturbed expression and said, “Uncle Mystic, something seems to be bothering you. Do you need me to do something?”","Mystic Moon knew that the Moon Empress’ interruption was a warning to him.","After all, there was nothing truly interesting about the Spirit-Siphon Goldfish.","The Butterfly Telescope had evolved to Suzerain grade and awakened their hidden bloodline, which allowed them to glide through the water as though they were fluttering butterflies. They were not important enough for the Moon Empress to call Lin Yuan over just to admire them.","Mystic Moon’s brow was still deeply furrowed as he smiled ruefully and shook his head.","“Young Lord, the Moon Empress is waiting to admire the fish together with you. Don’t keep her waiting.”","When Lin Yuan and Mystic Moon arrived at the inner palace together, Lin Yuan saw the Moon Empress seated at a table. She smiled at him just as warmly as she usually did.","Just when Lin Yuan was about to sit down next to her, he saw the stingy carrot-loving rabbit’s listless manner and immediately thought of the Lifespan Mouse.","He had planned on giving the Lifespan Mouse to the Moon Empress when he was about to leave.","But now that he noticed how lethargic the rabbit seemed, he decided to give the Lifespan Mouse to the Moon Empress now so that it could start spending time with the rabbit.","Lin Yuan took out the Bronze fey storage box that contained the Lifespan Mouse and said, “Master, can you contract this fey? I think it suits you well!”","The Moon Empress was taken aback.","She had prepared feys for Lin Yuan numerous times and even had to come up with all sorts of reasons to convince him to accept them.","Yet today, he was the one giving her a fey instead."]},{"number":1238,"title":"Chapter 1238 - Align Karma","paragraphs":["The Moon Empress was at a momentary loss as she knew how little time she had left.","As one of the strongest experts in the world, she had gathered and nurtured all her feys herself except her first fey. which that old man had given to her.","She could not remember another time when someone had given her a fey to contract.","Back then, that old man had given her a Bronze fey storage box just like Lin Yuan was doing now.","At that time, she had just become a spirit qi professional and was interested and curious in any type of fey.","But now that she only had three years left to live, it would be cruel to contract another fey knowing that it would have to end its life three years later alongside her.","As troubled as Mystic Moon was, he was still stunned by what Lin Yuan said.","Besides Lin Yuan, there was no one else on earth who dared to say such a disrespectful thing to the Moon Empress. Even the other members of royalty would be deemed as insulting her if they recommended a fey to her.","But since it came from Lin Yuan, it was an act of filial piety rather than an insult.","Mystic Moon recovered when he saw the Moon Empress smiling back at Lin Yuan.","After spending over 50 years by the Moon Empress’ side as a Moon Envoy, Mystic Moon was well aware of how powerful her spiritual energy was.","Although she had already contracted many feys, she still had more than enough spiritual energy left to contract another fey.","As he thought about the Moon Empress’ arsenal of feys, Mystic Moon could not think of any fey that she needed.","Lin Yuan had said that the fey in the fey storage box was suitable for the Moon Empress.","If the Moon Empress had more than three years left to live, she would have immediately contracted the fey and started nurturing it out of her love for him.","But now, she only had three years left to live and was already struggling to handle the feys she already had.","Hence, there was no way she would form a contract with this fey that Lin Yuan was giving her.","Lin Yuan still did not know that she only had three years left.","But what would happen once three years passed?","As he looked at the Moon Empress and Lin Yuan, tears welled up in his eyes for the first time in his life.","The Moon Empress was about to reject Lin Yuan. However, when she saw his hopeful expression, the words died on the tip of her tongue.","When she received the Bronze fey storage box from Lin Yuan, a surge of warmth that she only experienced after accepting Lin Yuan as her disciple washed over her.","She was about to keep the Bronze fey storage box away when Lin Yuan said, “Master, Zixi looks a little lifeless. The little creature in the Bronze fey storage box is about the same size as Zixi, and they should be able to play together.”","Lin Yuan reached over to pat Zixi.","He would often pat Zixi secretly when he was at the Radiant Moon Palace.","When Zixi was in a good mood, Zixi did not show an adverse reaction to him because he was the Moon Empress’ disciple. It would just close its eyes and let it pass.","But ever since Lin Yuan ate half of Zixi’s carrot, Zixi would hop far away whenever he tried to pat it. Occasionally, it would even bat away Lin Yuan’s hand.","Lin Yuan could not figure out what had happened to this stingy rabbit to make it act so coldly toward him all of a sudden.","Given Zixi’s listlessness, Lin Yuan felt that it would not be opposed to him petting it.","When he reached out his hand, however, Zixi immediately leaped over to the Moon Empress and glared at him out of the corner of its eye.","It seemed to be saying that it did not need any play buddy.","I’m having a difficult time because Xiyue only has three more years left to live. Who cares about a play buddy? Even if you spit out the carrot you ate now, I’ll still be as sad as I am now!","The Moon Empress did not look inside the Bronze fey storage box. Instead, she circulated her spiritual energy and summoned the Lifespan Mouse.","The moment that she summoned it, she, Mystic Moon, and Zixi were dumbfounded.","The Lifespan Mouse had spent all of its life in the Divine Wood Federation and was afraid of new people.","Now that it was suddenly in a strange place, all its hair stood on end.","Its eyes lit up upon spotting Lin Yuan, and it ran up his body to hide in the crook of his neck.","Lin Yuan did not attend to the shivering Lifespan Mouse. He could not shake the feeling that something was off.","If the issue was only with the two Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassias, Lin Yuan would not dwell too much on it.","However, Mystic Moon’s troubled demeanor and Zixi’s lifelessness were evidence of something serious.","Moreover, at the center of their strange behavior was the same person, the Moon Empress.","Could something have happened to his Master?","The Moon Empress recovered from her daze while Lin Yuan was deep in thought. She could not remember how long it had been since she was last dazed like this.","As a Class 5 Creation Master, she immediately discovered the Lifespan Mouse’s Knotted Lifespan ability.","This moment automatically carved itself into the Moon Empress’ mind.","The Moon Empress had been in a resigned state of mind. But now, a spark erupted into a raging flame within her.","She finally did not have to live like a person about to expire.","At that moment, she seemed to return to the person she was ten years ago.","Excitement, joy, and marvel bubbled up within her. They took control of her and caused her to start trembling slightly.","Her feelings swirled within her in a tangled mess.","Eventually, she pushed all of them down and smiled a small yet warm smile at him.","She was just as quiet as when she had first found out that her life was coming to an end.","Ever since the Moon Empress accepted Lin Yuan as her disciple, she regarded him as her crowning glory. There was nothing more important to her.","Although she did not talk about her limited lifespan, she was extremely indignant about it.","She was most upset that she would not be able to see the bright future that Lin Yuan would make for himself.","But today, her indignance morphed into hope.","Thanks to Lin Yuan, her lifespan was going to change.","Somehow, in this strange reality, fate would align everything on its own."]},{"number":1239,"title":"Chapter 1239 - Mystic Moon’s Tears and Essence Blood","paragraphs":["If someone had told the Moon Empress ten years ago that her disciple would change her lifespan, she would teach them a lesson they would never forget for bringing up something so ludicrous.","The Moon Empress of a decade ago could never imagine that she would accept a disciple one day. She had only decided to do so last year.","But the moment she came up with the necessary criteria, Ling Xiao immediately found the right candidate.","Up to the moment Lin Yuan appeared, the Moon Empress would never have believed that her disciple would one day change her lifespan.","Lin Yuan constantly shocked her with things like the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls and pure spirit qi, which were difficult for even a Class 5 Creation Master to produce.","When she had first obtained the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, she determined that they were the same species as the Flower Brocade Pearls.","After gaining the pure spirit qi from Lin Yuan, she tried using it to activate the Flower Brocade Pearls. Alas, the reaction was lackluster, and they did not evolve into the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls.","It was then she realized that the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls were not related to the pure spirit qi. It was more likely that they had been mutated through a special process.","The pure spirit qi and Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls were evidence that Lin Yuan had silently surpassed her in the field of Creation Master skills.","The Moon Empress did not probe Lin Yuan about how he did it. She was just filled with pride and joy for him.","But regardless of the fact that Lin Yuan had surpassed her in terms of Creation Master skills, the Moon Empress never expected him to be able to alter her lifespan.","Yet, he was now presenting her with the Lifespan Mouse.","The level of astonishment that the Moon Empress was feeling was different from when she received the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls and pure spirit qi.","There were many ways to evolve and mutate lifeforms. There were even several Class 4 Creation Masters who had mutated extremely valuable feys.","If the Moon Empress’ Creation Master level were raised, the spirit qi she produced would also become purer.","The Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls and pure spirit qi could produce feasible effects. However, the Lifespan Mouse could alter life itself.","As far as the Moon Empress’ knowledge went, such feys that could increase a person’s lifespan should not exist in this world.","Once she formed a contract with the Lifespan Mouse, she would have fulfilled the dream of countless experts.","Extended life!","With Cicada Song’s help, the Moon Empress had unlocked many secrets to unlock the heavenly road.","Once her birth horoscope awakened five years later, she would have another chance to charge toward the heavenly path.","After contracting the Lifespan Mouse, her lifespan would not be restricted to another three years.","As the Lifespan Mouse continued to consume spiritual ingredients that contained vitality, the Moon Empress’ life would be further extended. As such, she would no longer have to be terrified about putting her lifespan at risk when she tried to break through again in the future.","The Moon Empress glanced at the Lifespan Mouse before turning her gaze onto Lin Yuan. All her messy emotions dissipated when she saw his smile.","At that moment, all she felt was happiness.","The Lifespan Mouse would allow her to protect Lin Yuan forever and continue to ensure that his path was smooth.","The second person to recover from their dazed state was Mystic Moon. The corners of his lips twitched, and he babbled to the Moon Empress and Lin Yuan, “Moon Empress, Young Lord, I better go and check on the situation in the kitchen.”","Before the Moon Empress nodded, he turned and rushed off to the kitchen.","Lin Yuan had been deep in thought but was interrupted by Mystic Moon’s voice.","Lin Yuan managed to catch the tremor in Mystic Moon’s voice. A few of the words even sounded choked.","Was Mystic Moon crying?","Lin Yuan immediately shook his head. He had no clue that the moment Mystic Moon stepped out of the inner palace tears started to well up in his eyes.","Mystic Moon did not blink, and the tears did not spill out from his eyes as he instantly evaporated them using his spiritual power.","When he had heard about the Moon Empress’ condition from Cicada Song, he felt his world come crashing down.","In the past 50 years that they had spent together, Mystic Moon never imagined the day would come that death would separate them.","His eyes had welled up slightly when he had been in the kitchen.","When he saw the way the Moon Empress looked at Lin Yuan in the inner palace, his eyes immediately welled up again.","However, he had held them back.","But when he saw the Lifespan Mouse and realized that the Moon Empress’ tragic fate of only having three years left was resolved, the overwhelming excitement broke the dam and allowed his elation to burst through.","As his tears evaporated, Mystic Moon tried to collect himself multiple times.","The feelings of excitement made the handsome Mystic Moon’s face seem rather distended.","His mouth had split so far that the corners were almost touching his ears, revealing a mouthful of pearly teeth.","Silver patterns appeared on his teeth and seemed to be on the cusp of turning into dragon fangs.","At that moment, Mystic Moon found it difficult to control his emotions.","This expression of tears of joy made the exceptionally attractive Mystic Moon appear slightly ugly.","Yet, the sorrow of knowing that the Moon Empress’ lifespan had been reduced to another three years could not vanish in an instant.","Hence, Mystic Moon’s uncharacteristic expression lasted till he arrived in the kitchen.","Now that he had fully recovered, he could properly control his delight.","He went back to carefully cooking the Jade-Eating Blood Swallow’s bird nest and Island Whale’s brain oil.","Previously, he had cooked with a heavy heart and did it extremely unhappily as he knew that they were meant to aid in Lin Yuan’s absorption of the Earth Center Fine Milk.","But now, he was cooking with a complete change of heart that was filled with gratitude.","His body started to glow with silver light, and a blood pearl with silver and gold hues appeared in front of his chest.","Mystic Moon placed the blood pearl into the cooking Island Whale’s brain oil.","The Island Whale’s brain oil was very effective in nourishing and protecting the soul. Lin Yuan needed to consume it in order to absorb the Earth Center Fine Milk.","The Moon Empress did not like to eat fish, and there was a fishy taste to the Island Whale’s brain oil which was present in all aquatic lifeforms.","Hence, the Moon Empress did not touch the Island Whale’s brain oil when she dined.","If the Moon Empress found out that he had added essence blood from his heart into the dish, she would definitely reprimand him.","The more elite the dragon species fey’s bloodline, the more difficult it would be to extract their essence blood.","A Gold dragon-species fey could easily produce 200 to 300 drops of essence blood. However, it was difficult for a Myth Breed fey to produce more than 10 drops of essence blood.","At Mystic Moon’s level, he would only be able to produce three drops of essence blood at most."]},{"number":1240,"title":"Chapter 1240 - Most Well-Loved Fey!","paragraphs":["The loss of essence blood was extremely damaging to a dragon-species fey.","However, main dragon-species feys’ essence blood could improve the effects of spiritual ingredients to the greatest extent. As such, the Island Whale’s brain oil would be able to protect a soul much better now that a main dragon-species fey’s essence blood had been added to it.","Moreover, Mystic Moon was a double-type spiritual- and soul-type dragon-species fey, so his essence blood already had spiritual and soul protection properties.","Dragon-species feys loved their essence blood like how a mother would love her child.","This was Mystic Moon’s way of thanking Lin Yuan.","Previously, he always felt that the Radiant Moon Palace was sheltering Lin Yuan.","But now, Lin Yuan had essentially reshaped the Radiant Moon Palace.","Lin Yuan was staring dumbfoundedly at Zixi, who had just been giving him the cold shoulder. He could not figure out what was going through the stingy rabbit’s mind.","It had been so against Lin Yuan touching it, but now, it held his hand using both its ears and placed his hand on its body.","What was it trying to do? Was it inviting him to pet it?","Lin Yuan experimentally gently patted Zixi. He was afraid that Zixi had been trying to bait him and slap his hand the moment he tried to pet it.","But after he touched it, Zixi lay flat on the table and exposed its soft abdomen fur.","The Moon Empress immediately picked up Zixi.","Zixi could change into human form, but it felt more comfortable eating carrots in its animal form.","Hence, Zixi never changed into its human form outside of battle.","Nonetheless, Zixi was a female rabbit, and the Moon Empress could not stand to see it lay flat and expose itself in such a manner.","Lin Yuan had questions for the Moon Empress. But just as he was about to ask them, he noticed that the Moon Empress’ aura had changed.","Now, there was a slight wildness and a significant amount of hope in her eyes.","Lin Yuan felt that there was no longer any need for him to ask.","He picked up the Lifespan Mouse from his neck and said, “Master, this Lifespan Mouse has a small disadvantage. If you contract it, you can’t show it to anyone you don’t trust.”","The Moon Empress flipped over her hand, and a fruit that contained an overwhelming amount of vitality appeared in her palm.","Lin Yuan had only been feeding the Lifespan Mouse with the Soldier Ration Radish, which contained a significant amount of energy but a pitiful amount of vitality.","Hence, the Lifespan Mouse had not been able to gain more lifespan.","The Lifespan Mouse’s original lifespan was only a year.","In order to survive, the Lifespan Mouse madly sought out vitality-containing spiritual ingredients.","The fruit that the Moon Empress had just taken out was the largest treasure that the Lifespan Mouse had ever seen in its life.","However, it had a careful nature and did not immediately charge toward it.","It chittered on Lin Yuan’s hand and scampered about as though it was saying, “I want to eat that fruit so badly! Please take it for me!”","Lin Yuan said to the Lifespan Mouse with a smile, “Once you become Master’s fey, you’ll be able to eat such vitality-containing spiritual ingredients as often as you want.”","He patted its orange fur and encouraged it, “Go over, little one!”","The Lifespan Mouse looked deeply into this young man’s eyes who had saved it in the forest and transformed its life.","It gently raised its small paws and shook them before chittering at him.","It scampered over to the Moon Empress’ palm.","The Moon Empress circulated her spiritual energy and formed a contract with the Lifespan Mouse before giving it the fruit of the Blue Life Jade Pear that only bore fruits every three years.","The Lifespan Mouse immediately started gobbling down the Blue Life Jade Pear’s fruit.","Once it was done eating, its vitality rose, and its lifespan increased from a year to two and a half years.","This meant that the Blue Life Jade Pear’s fruit allowed it to live another 500 or more so days.","Normal factions and experts would find it a huge burden to use such resources. There were even some factions that would not be able to earn one of the Blue Life Jade Pear’s fruit after working for a year.","However, this was nothing to the Moon Empress.","The Lifespan Mouse’s increase in vitality made the Moon Empress smile even wider.","She flipped over her hand again, and a basket of Blue Life Jade Pear fruits appeared on the floor.","The Lifespan Mouse immediately wanted to dive into the basket, but the Moon Empress grabbed it and said, “Little one, you can only eat more once you’ve digested the one you’ve already eaten. Eating more will make you uncomfortably bloated.”","The Lifespan Mouse shyly nudged the Moon Empress’ palm.","After the Moon Empress formed a contract with it, it felt automatically affectionate toward her.","Lin Yuan started to chuckle when he saw the Lifespan Mouse’s bloated stomach.","The Lifespan Mouse had been extremely greedy when it ate the Soldier Ration Radish’s leaves and stem, and Lin Yuan had wondered when it would fix this bad habit.","Luckily, mouse-species feys digested quickly and could eat three to four Blue Life Jade Pear fruits without any problems.","Now that the Lifespan Mouse had eaten its fill, it looked at Zixi and leaped onto it.","Zixi would have immediately slapped it away with its ear if any other fey tried to touch it.","However, Zixi did not do so to the Lifespan Mouse. It was afraid that it would accidentally kill the Lifespan Mouse, which could only remain at Normal I/Normal forev er. It was the Moon Empress’ source of lifespan, after all.","All the worry that Zixi felt over the Moon Empress’ reduced lifespan turned into valuing the Lifespan Mouse.","Zixi allowed the Lifespan Mouse to jump around on its back and even used its ears to make sure it did not fall off.","When the Moon Empress’ other feys, such as the Calamity Sun-Swallowing Fox, were around Zixi, they dared not even make a sound.","Now, Zixi was protecting the Lifespan Mouse as though it was a baby.","Zixi was not alone. All of the Moon Empress’ other feys that had not been summoned all felt affection toward the Lifespan Mouse.","The Lifespan Mouse did not know that it was already the most well-loved fey amongst all of the Moon Empress’ feys.","It was as popular amongst the feys as Lin Yuan was in the Radiance Federation."]},{"number":1241,"title":"Chapter 1241 - Barren Bloodline","paragraphs":["The Moon Empress watched Zixi playing with the Lifespan Mouse for a second before asking Lin Yuan seriously, “Little Yuan, have you heard of the Barren bloodline which only exists in feys in the Radiance Federation?”","Lin Yuan suddenly thought about the meal he had together with Zong Ze and the rest in Zong Ze’s residence.","Zong Ze and Gu Lang had mentioned the Barren bloodline. Long Tao, Zong Ze, and Sun Ningxiang looked at Gao Feng, Liu Jie, and Lin Yuan enviously when they did so.","That was the first time that Lin Yuan had heard of the Barren bloodline.","He had learned from Zong Ze that the Fiery Sky Hou had the Barren bloodline and that it was not fully mature yet.","Lin Yuan remembered that Zong Ze had wanted to talk more about the Fiery Sky Hou. But Zong Ze had stopped after glancing at Gao Feng, Long Tao, and Sun Ningxiang.","This had made Lin Yuan realize that Zong Ze did not want to share more about the Fiery Sky Hou and the Barren bloodline with Long Tao, Gao Feng, and Sun Ningxiang.","However, he clearly saw no need to be careful with Liu Jie, Lin Yuan, and Gao Feng.","Eventually, Zong Ze did not mention the Barren bloodline again until the group dispersed.","When Zong Ze had brought up the Barren bloodline, Gu Lang said to Long Tao, “If you work hard, you’ll have the chance to gain the Barren bloodline too.”","Lin Yuan only managed to gain a partial understanding of the Barren bloodline from the information provided by Zong Ze and Gu Lang.","As such, Lin Yuan shook his head and said, “Master, I don’t know much about the Barren bloodline. All I know is that Zong Ze’s Fiery Sky Hou has it.”","“I had planned on telling you about it when you’re 20 years old and participating in the selection to become a Radiance Envoy. Today, I prepared a drop of the Earth Center Fine Milk for you. Once you consume it, you’ll be able to contract feys with the Barren bloodline,” replied the Moon Empress.","Now, Lin Yuan knew that feys with the Barren bloodline required its contractor to be of a certain age.","The Earth Center Fine Milk could refine a person’s body, soul, and spiritual energy if their body were cleansed of impurities.","This meant that spirit qi professionals needed to be outstanding bodies, spirits, and souls to contract feys with the Barren bloodline.","It was just like how people below 18 years old could not use their souls to form marrow contracts with sacred source lifeforms.","However, Lin Yuan had not managed to learn what feys with the Barren bloodlines were based on what the Moon Empress said.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan had gained a deep impression of the Fiery Sky Hou’s might during their fight.","The Life-Changing Fire Beast and Heaven Crimson Fire could produce such power because of the Fiery Sky Hou.","Without the Fiery Sky Hou’s fire-elemental energy-increasing abilities and the Dreamland of Fire, Zong Ze’s overall power would be 20% weaker than what it currently was.","Lin Yuan was also shocked that the Diamond X/Fantasy V Fiery Sky Hou had eight high-grade strange flames within it.","When combined, the eight high-grade strange flames would be as powerful as a top-grade strange flame. The top-grade strange flame was far more powerful than regular Fantasy Breed feys.","Lin Yuan had been silently stunned by the Fiery Sky Hou’s talent and bloodline.","The Fiery Sky Hou’s power and abilities definitely exceeded all of Lin Yuan’s feys.","Lin Yuan’s feys were evolved through the best methods.","Now, Lin Yuan finally understood that the root of Zong Ze’s Fiery Sky Hou’s power came from the Barren bloodline.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to ask the Moon Empress how one would go about obtaining a fey with the Barren bloodline, she said, “Little Yuan, in another month, the group from the Azure Federation will arrive at the Radiance Federation to watch the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection. There are four Azure Envoys amongst them. The fourth Azure Envoy is from the Azure Cloud Leopard family, which is one of the 12 Azure families. The Azure Cloud Leopard bloodline only exists in the Azure Federation. The equivalent to that in the Radiant Federation is the Barren bloodline.","“Zong Ze’s Fiery Sky Hou and Zixi both have the Barren bloodline. In the Radiance Federation, the older generation can only gain a fey with the Barren bloodline by becoming one of the members of royalty. It is slightly easier for the younger generation, who have three methods of doing so. Firstly, they can become a disciple of a member of royalty before they turn 30 years old. Secondly, they can become a Radiance Envoy. Lastly, they can become a Radiance Knight.”","The Moon Empress’ words rendered Lin Yuan speechless.","Previously, Lin Yuan only had a general idea of feys with the Barren bloodline. But now, he truly understood their worth.","Lin Yuan knew what the 12 Azure families signified in the Azure Federation from Yin Lin’s memories. They were completely different from the roles that top factions played in the Radiance Federation.","Not even the top three top factions, Rhine Lifeform, Whale Ocean Commerce, and Cage of Brahma Insects combined, could combine to one of the Azure families’ positions in the Azure Federation.","There were no members of royalty in the Azure Federation. The leader of each of the Azure families was equivalent to one of the members of royalty in the Radiance Federation. All of them had the authority to speak in the meetings held in the Azure Federation’s imperial court.","This was because every member of the Azure families had their Azure beast patterns and could contract feys that had the Azure bloodline.","Clearly, the feys with the Azure bloodline were extremely strong.","By the same logic, given that feys that had the Barren bloodline and Azure bloodline could be compared, feys with the Barren bloodline were just as strong when it came to combat power.","According to the conditions that the Moon Empress had said were necessary to contract a fey with the Barren bloodline, there were many more types of feys that could gain the Barren bloodline than there were feys with the Azure bloodline.","But in terms of quantity, fewer feys could gain the Barren bloodline because every spirit qi professional that was part of an Azure family and had awakened their Azure beast pattern could immediately contract a respective fey that had the Azure bloodline.","The Moon Empress seemed to insinuate that he would be able to gain a fey that had the Barren bloodline once he consumed Earth Center Fine Milk.","Lin Yuan was immediately looking forward to this. But at the same time, he worried about his spiritual energy.","Feys with the Barren bloodline were so powerful that they could not be spirit-locked by Morbius.","It would be blasphemous for him to spirit lock a fey with the Barren bloodline."]},{"number":1242,"title":"Chapter 1242 - I Did it for Young Lord’s Sake","paragraphs":["If he required a mammoth amount of spiritual energy to contract a fey with the Barren bloodline, most of his spiritual energy was being used on Morbius. He only had enough to contract one normal fey.","If the fey with the Barren bloodline needed more spiritual energy than a normal fey, he would not be able to contract it.","Hence, he asked the Moon Empress, “Master, what are the conditions to contract a fey with the Barren bloodline? I don’t have a lot of usable spiritual energy left.”","The Moon Empress knew about his alternate identity as Black, so she knew he had contracted many feys.","She was not shocked that he did not have much spiritual energy left.","Despite his young age, Lin Yuan had already contracted many feys. The Moon Empress felt that he was already far ahead of all his peers.","As she looked at his worried expression, she explained to him seriously, “One person can only contract one fey with a Barren bloodline, unlike sacred source lifeforms where a person can contract more than one as long as their soul is strong enough.","“Once you form a contract with a fey with a Barren bloodline, it will bind together with all of you. While the Barren bloodline is maturing, its contractor will be able to receive some of the bloodline power. The bloodline power will greatly strengthen the contractor’s body.","“Little Yuan, don’t worry. The fey with the Barren bloodline will only use up a small amount of your spiritual energy. The most important factors are your physique and the strength of your soul. You might be in a lot of pain during tonight’s dinner, but you have to do your best to eat as much as possible. It will help you absorb the Earth Center Fine Milk’s energy better as well as give you an easier time later.”","While the Moon Empress was talking to Lin Yuan, Mystic Moon led the spirit attendants and served the dinner dishes.","Jin Qi was holding the Jade-Eating Blood Swallow’s nest. Its fragrance wafted into Jin Qi’s nose and triggered the blood flowing within her.","If its scent was enough to have such effects, Jin Qi could not imagine what the effects would be once it was eaten.","In the past, Jin Qi had wanted to seduce Lin Yuan to raise her position in the Radiant Moon Palace. But as she gazed at the Lin Yuan standing next to the Moon Empress, she understood that her idea would only ever be realistic as a pipe dream.","Jin Qi could not help but be envious of Wen Yu. But at the same time, she felt that Wen Yu was extremely stupid!","Wen Yu spent every day by Lin Yuan’s side and had ample opportunity to reap the benefits of her position. Yet, she never grabbed her chance and made Lin Yuan hers.","If Lin Yuan had chosen Jin Qi, she might already be carrying his child and enjoying the life of being waited on hand and foot by the other spirit attendants. Naturally, this was only a fantasy she kept to herself.","If she made this fantasy of hers known, she would probably be dumped into the Sin Cleansing Pool by Mystic Moon and be forced to reflect on herself.","Lin Yuan noticed the spirit attendants serving the dishes and instinctively used True Data.","His jaw dropped. This was too ridiculous!","He had thought of himself as extremely wealthy, given that heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls were produced every minute in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","But all of his riches were only barely enough to buy one portion of Island Whale brain oil.","Suddenly, Lin Yuan felt that something was wrong. The Island Whale’s brain oil was dark gold which was not its normal color.","The Island Whale had to be at least 600 years old to be able to produce brain oil of this color.","Lin Yuan gulped.","As he looked at this obscenely expensive brain oil, he saw himself as a pauper.","Frankly, he could not use True Data to check on many of the spiritual ingredients. This meant that they all came from Immortal Breed feys.","Although he never scrimped and saved when it came to food, he could not help but continuously marvel at how opulent this meal was.","But it was only when he started eating that he realized that opulence did not equate to taste.","He had an agonizing time eating the food.","The Moon Empress spooned a bowl of Jade-Eating Blood Swallow’s nest for him. When it first touched his tongue, it was sweet and pleasant. It was as though he was kissing a pair of the softest lips.","This was the first time that Lin Yuan was experiencing such a feeling.","But once he swallowed it, the taste and texture disappeared. All Lin Yuan could feel was a raging heat that was enveloping him.","His blood surged and thrashed. Lin Yuan felt as though his blood was flowing at three times its normal speed.","At the same time, his heart started pounding like a drum, and large beads of sweat rose on his forehead.","The Moon Empress said with a pained expression, “Little Yuan, once you’re done drinking this bowl of bird’s nest, down the Island Whale’s brain oil immediately. Finally, eat as much of the rest of the other dishes as you can. The more you eat, the stronger you’ll become. You have to use up all your determination now!”","Lin Yuan took a deep breath and gulped down the Jade-Eating Blood Swallow’s nest as quickly as he could before holding up the jade bowl of Island Whale’s brain oil and pouring it down his throat.","He ate so quickly that the food could not settle in his body quickly enough to match the rate he was putting more food in.","The Jade-Eating Blood Swallow’s bird nest only started to take effect when Lin Yuan was done drinking the Island Whale’s brain oil.","His rushing blood made his blood vessels bulge out of his skin and made Lin Yuan feel a strange euphoria.","This also increased Lin Yuan’s eating speed.","When he moved on to the other dishes, he felt as though an ocean had been stuffed into his soul. He felt so bloated that all the hairs on his body stood on end.","At that moment, Lin Yuan felt that he had reached his limit.","Suddenly, he thought of Morbius’ Calm Mind.","Calm Mind’s effects were meant to be activated, but it could also be initiated.","He used Calm Mind continuously and fought against his discomfort to continue gobbling down the food.","As the Moon Empress watched Lin Yuan frantically stuff food into his body, she turned her gaze onto Mystic Moon.","Mystic Moon retracted his neck and said softly, “Moon Empress, I did it for Young Lord’s sake!”"]},{"number":1243,"title":"Chapter 1243 - Lin Yuan’s Transformation","paragraphs":["The Moon Empress sighed and said, “Once Little Yuan is done eating the Earth Center Fine Milk, I’ll ask him if he has more pure spirit qi. It must have been very uncomfortable to be bound by Cicada Song. With the pure spirit qi, your bloodline will probably improve. Once your bloodline is improved, you’ll be able to get over that rut.”","The Moon Empress noticed that Lin Yuan was only left with the last dish, and she was silently shocked by Lin Yuan’s resolve.","Once Lin Yuan cleared the last dish, she said, “Mystic Moon, now is the time. Give the Earth Center Fine Milk to Little Yuan now!”","If the Lifespan Mouse were not present, Mystic Moon would have hesitated to carry out this order.","But now, he was more than willing to allow Lin Yuan to consume the Earth Center Fine Milk.","After Lin Yuan swallowed the last mouthful, Mystic Moon’s hand shook, and a drop of white liquid flew into Lin Yuan’s mouth.","When the drop of white liquid entered his mouth, he felt all his bodily functions being suppressed.","If not for the white liquid’s stickiness preventing him from swallowing it instantly, he might have started to exclaim, “Damn! This Earth Center Fine Milk is so disgusting?”","It had a stench and was salty and bitter at the same time.","When he finally managed to swallow it and felt relief that his surging blood and bloated soul would be alleviated, he was plunged into what he could only describe as true pain.","When he had first consumed the Diamond Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar and cleansed his body of all impurities, he felt as though he was going through a slow death.","When he had consumed the Suzerain Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar, he felt as though his soul was being excruciatingly shattered.","He had thought that such physical and soul pain was the greatest extent of pain that existed.","But compared to the pain he was experiencing now, the physical and soul pain had been nothing.","He was sure that if his body were sliced open now, it would immediately explode like a balloon, and blood would spurt out like a fountain.","All of the medicinal effects of the food he had eaten rose from his surging blood and were injected into his flesh. It was so painful that Lin Yuan felt like he was becoming a large mulberry with a hatching parasite within it.","As the parasite clawed its way outward, it started to drain the mulberry.","When Lin Yuan ate the Suzerain Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar, the physical pain slowed down his soul and dulled his sense of pain.","But because of the Island Whale’s brain oil and other spiritual ingredients, his soul was being overactivated. This greatly raised Lin Yuan’s sense of pain.","The Earth Center Fine Milk did not only affect his body but also his soul.","Its medicinal effects significantly strengthened Lin Yuan’s soul.","However, the medicinal effects were too strong, and Lin Yuan’s soul almost shattered in the process of absorbing the Earth Center Fine Milk.","Moreover, both of Lin Yuan’s souls were being affected simultaneously. This resulted in him experiencing twice the amount of soul pain.","If he were only experiencing either one of the pains, it would have been too much for him. But now that both pains were mixed, they struck a strange balance between Lin Yuan’s physical and soul pain.","Lin Yuan could not faint as a form of relief even if he wanted to.","At that moment, every passing second felt a hundred times longer to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan’s activated soul enabled him to feel every single change in his body.","He tried using Calm Mind again, but the two types of pain made him unable to control his body.","Lin Yuan could only check on the condition within his body while the Moon Empress and Mystic Moon witnessed the changes to his exterior.","At that moment, Lin Yuan looked as though he was completely covered in blood.","Due to the Jade-Eating Blood Swallow’s nest, he produced an endless stream of blood that formed a thick crust that sealed Lin Yuan within.","Now, Lin Yuan looked like a cocoon.","The Moon Empress clenched her fist, and a pained expression came over her.","Mystic Moon was the same. But when he saw the Moon Empress’ expression, he hurriedly tried to comfort her and said, “Moon Empress, Young Lord will be able to ride out the effects of the Earth Center Fine Milk even if he didn’t eat all those beneficial spiritual ingredients. Now that he ate them, you don’t have to worry at all. He will be completely fine.”","The Moon Empress furrowed her brow even deeper.","She knew that the Earth Center Fine Milk would only be beneficial to Lin Yuan, but she could not help but be in pain as she watched him suffer in anguish.","Lin Yuan was currently undergoing a refinement of his genes and transforming himself.","The Moon Empress could not help him out even if she wanted to.","If she tried to alleviate his pain, it might halt his transformation. This would cause Lin Yuan to lose his opportunity.","But she thought of all the dishes that Lin Yuan had eaten, and her brow relaxed.","Given the time, the dishes should have been digested when the Earth Center Fine Milk took effect.","The double pain from his soul and body had left Lin Yuan numb.","He suddenly felt energy being released from within his stomach. Although the energy deepened Lin Yuan’s pain, every atom of energy acted like a soldier that protected his body and soul from being destroyed by the Earth Center Fine Milk. The energy also increased the rate of Lin Yuan’s absorption of the Earth Center Fine Milk.","Lin Yuan also absorbed all of this energy.","All he could do was helplessly hold on.","A few short minutes in the outside world felt like several centuries in Lin Yuan’s soul world.","During this time, Lin Yuan collapsed, was plunged into despair, and picked himself up over a thousand times.","Finally, Lin Yuan slowly acclimated himself to the soul and physical pain."]},{"number":1244,"title":"Chapter 1244 - Features, Charisma, and Nobility","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan no longer felt any despair. All he felt was happiness over his body’s transformation and hope for a better future.","As he fought against the pain, his mood lifted.","It was said that the younger generation needed to have soaring ambitions but could not help but be pulled down by loneliness.","Yet, Lin Yuan’s ambitions had reached a level so high that they could not be deterred by anything unless it was worse than the pain he was currently experiencing.","Suddenly, a burst of spirit took shape within Lin Yuan’s heart.","When he used spirit qi to strengthen Genius and the Lifespan Mouse, they continuously lost and grew new fur.","However, Lin Yuan did not lose his hair but his body’s cells. His cells died and were created in an endless loop within Lin Yuan’s body.","Lin Yuan had lost count of the number of times his body died and revived. His marrow, skeleton, blood, tendons, nerves, nails, and hair were in a constant cycle of death and regrowth.","After Lin Yuan’s body went through the final cycle, a clean air that only belonged to lifeforms burst forth from the cocoon and filled the air in the Radiant Moon Palace.","The lotus-species feys in the lotus pool swayed their petals and produced fog.","The Butterfly Telescopes spread out their wing-like fins and tail and leaped out of the water as though there was something outside of the lotus pool that was calling to them.","Inside the crust, Lin Yuan had finished his transformation.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to use his hand to break out of the crust, he noticed that his clothes had been wrecked during the transformation.","As such, he hurriedly took out a set of black spirit qi clothes and changed into them.","He checked himself again and broke out of the crust once he was sure nothing was wrong.","Mystic Moon and the Moon Empress had seen many members of nobility before.","But when they saw Lin Yuan, they could not control the astonishment that surfaced.","Lin Yuan’s appearance did not seem very different from before, but his features had become fundamentally more striking.","Previously, his features had been about 80 marks. But now, it was above 90 marks.","Once a person’s looks reached above 90 marks, he would be considered to have reached the peak of attractiveness.","If every person at the peak of attractiveness were judged against one another, the result of the judging would produce very different results. After all, beauty was in the eye of its beholder.","However, Lin Yuan’s point of appeal had always been his charisma and not his looks.","Previously, his aura had already boosted his looks from 80 marks to more than 90 marks.","But now that charisma was above 90 marks, he had an air of unexplainable nobility.","He had continuously grown and increased his power in the past eight months. His resources had also continually increased, and he even established his faction.","The culmination of these experiences, luxurious clothes, and change in status in society already gave him an aura of eliteness.","However, the air of nobility that rose from Lin Yuan now was different from his previous air of eliteness.","This charisma of nobility was not obvious, yet it could not be overlooked.","It was the same as how Apostles were on a higher lifeform level than other dimensional lifeforms.","Moreover, Lin Yuan’s figure and skeletal structure had also changed.","When Lin Yuan grew from 1.78 meters to 1.79 meters, he had hoped that he would be able to grow past 1.8 meters.","Now, his dream had finally become a reality as he stood at 1.82 meters.","He knew that he had grown taller.","The clothes that Wen Yu had designed for him perfectly matched his previous figure and measurements.","Although he had only grown by a few centimeters, the black spirit qi clothes he was wearing had obviously too tight and ill-fitting.","Moreover, a person’s bones and features changed over time due to their lifestyle and nutrition intake.","For example, if a person often sat for long periods, their spine would naturally curve. But if they often lay flat, the back of their heads would flatten. If they always chewed on hard things, their jaws would become stronger.","These changes were not obvious but could tangibly affect a person’s looks and aura.","Now that Lin Yuan’s bone structure had transformed and his genetic model was at its peak, any changes to his body due to bad habits would be automatically recovered.","Lin Yuan was about to greet the Moon Empress and Mystic Moon when his stomach started to rumble.","He instinctively held his stomach. However, his stomach stopped after making the noise once.","With his body’s innate ability, Lin Yuan sensed an intense hunger. It was as though all the cells in his body were begging him to eat something.","He hurriedly took out a Soldier Ration Radish vine and was about to eat its leaves when the Moon Empress said, “Little Yuan, don’t eat the Soldier Ration Radish now. All your cells are encouraging you to take in nutrients. This means that you didn’t consume enough nutrients from the dishes just now. You should eat some high-quality ingredients and make use of the after-effects of the Earth Center Fine Milk so that your muscles will absorb another portion of nutritious energy.”","Mystic Moon suppressed his shock and said, “I’ll go and make the preparations in the kitchen now and serve food to Young Lord within half an hour.”","He quickly marched off to the kitchen and instructed the spirit attendants to clear the empty dishes from the table.","Mystic Moon could not understand how Lin Yuan’s body managed to absorb so many nutrients and energy.","The Moon Empress had already prepared a significant amount of spiritual ingredients for the previous meal, and he had even added a drop of his own essence blood.","No matter how hard he thought about it, Mystic Moon could not come up with an answer to his conclusion.","From the changes that had just happened to Lin Yuan’s body, Mystic Moon felt that there was no more space for Lin Yuan to improve his physical self further.","It was more likely that his state of hunger came from his soul’s need for nutrients.","Hence, Mystic Moon took out another portion of the Island Whale’s brain oil and some other spiritual ingredients of the same quality as the Island Whale’s brain oil that could also nourish souls and started cooking."]},{"number":1245,"title":"Chapter 1245 - Only Consume Dragon Lungs and Drink Phoenix Blood","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan’s stomach started to grumble, and he soon became embarrassed by the constant noise.","The Moon Empress tried to find something to distract him as she knew that being in an extended state of hunger was a form of torture. It was ten times more difficult to bear than normal hunger.","She flipped her hand, and a golden egg appeared in her palm.","She asked Lin Yuan solemnly, “Little Yuan, have you finished reading the Catalog of Mountains and Seas that I gave you?”","Lin Yuan hurriedly nodded and replied, “I finished it long ago!”","He always had the habit of reading. As such, he had thoroughly read the entire book within three days.","However, he had found it rather confusing.","He did not know why the Moon Empress wanted him to read a book that was published before the Spirit Qi Awakening.","The Catalog of Mountains and Seas was similar to the Classic of Mountains and Seas that Lin Yuan had read in his previous life. However, the Catalog of Mountains and Seas was much more believable.","Nonetheless, such books of lore were still regarded as unrealistic no matter in what a believable way they were written.","Lin Yuan responded to the Moon Empress while staring at the gold egg in her hand.","There were swirling storm patterns engraved on the shell of the egg. It was as though the egg was the eye of a storm, and it looked like a concurrent mix of darkness and light.","Somehow, it was as though a ferocious beast was looking out from within the storm.","Additionally, the egg had a similar aura to Zong Ze’s Fiery Sky Hou. This meant that there had to be a fey with the Barren bloodline within the golden egg.","This was very likely the fey with a Barren bloodline that the Moon Empress had prepared for him.","The Moon Empress smiled and replied honestly, “There is a legend in the Catalog of Mountains and Seas which mentions a bird with golden wings that only eats dragon lungs and drinks phoenix blood. Do you remember this legend?”","Lin Yuan gulped and nodded before saying, “Of course, I remember it. Master, is the fey with the Barren bloodline in this egg the Golden Wings?”","When Lin Yuan had been reading the Catalog of Mountains and Seas, he soon reached the part about the Golden Wings, and it had left a deep impression on him.","He had not taken the Catalog of Mountains and Seas seriously and brushed it off as mere legends. Hence, he had not thought too seriously about its contents.","The first thought that came to Lin Yuan’s mind about the Golden Wings was that it was picky. It only ate dragon lungs and drank phoenix blood!","As long as a fey had a drop of dragon-species or phoenix-species bloodline in them, it would become much more expensive than other feys.","The feys that had awakened their dragon-species and phoenix-species bloodlines were sometimes worth more than money could buy despite not being true dragons or phoenixes.","Lin Yuan wondered if the Golden Wings’ pickiness had caused it to die of starvation.","However, the existence of the golden egg was proof that the Golden Wings was real.","It was likely that all the feys recorded in the Catalog of Mountains and Seas were feys in the Radiance Federation that had the Barren bloodline.","As such, Lin Yuan’s impression of the Golden Wings changed from picky to wonder as he imagined the power it would gain from such a diet.","The Moon Empress nodded and replied, “You’re right. The Golden Wings is in this egg. There is basic information about feys with the Barren bloodline written in Catalog of Mountains and Seas. Although you’ve consumed the Earth Center Fine Milk and both your body and soul have transformed, it will still be difficult for you to form a contract with the Golden Wings.","“I had a hard time when I contracted Zixi as well. Feys with the Barren bloodline are wild. It’s much harder to form a contract with feys with the Barren bloodline than it is to form a marrow contract with sacred source lifeforms.","“Your sacred source lifeform will be able to aid you when you’re contracting the Golden Wings. You must remember to obstinately suppress the Golden Wings’ willpower during the contraction process. Otherwise, the balance of power could be overturned.","“Once you form a contract with the fey with the Barren bloodline, it will accompany you for the rest of your life just like all your other feys.”","The Moon Empress handed the Golden Wings’ egg to Lin Yuan.","Soon, Mystic Moon led the spirit attendants and served another tableful of dishes.","After Lin Yuan started eating, he no longer felt as uncomfortable.","Soon, he realized that he no longer felt hungry once the uncontracted fey in his soul absorbed its fill of nutrients and energy.","Finally, his transformation was complete.","Given that he would need to put his willpower against the fey with the Barren bloodline during the contraction process, he could not be disturbed.","Thus, Lin Yuan went into his breeding room after the meal and shut the door.","He followed the Moon Empress’s directions and started to move his palms.","His blood and soul energy simultaneously enveloped the Golden Wings’ shell.","At the same moment that the Golden Wings’ egg absorbed Lin Yuan’s blood and soul energy, he felt himself being transported into the eye of a storm.","He could feel the fierce air currents around him and readied himself to unleash his willpower.","Suddenly, he sensed an enormous beast awakening in the wind. The beast was staring at him through the howling winds.","Lin Yuan’s expression remained steady.","He had just been in the breeding room in the Radiant Moon Palace. But he had appeared here after he used his blood and soul to engulf the egg.","It seemed that his soul had entered the golden egg, and he was currently witnessing the scene within the golden egg.","Lin Yuan remembered that the Moon Empress had said he would have to clash against the Golden Wings in a battle of willpower in order to contract it.","Since it was a battle of willpower, it did not matter who made the first move. They were bound to duke it out.","Hence, Lin Yuan just needed to steel himself.","However, his chest tightened when he remembered what the Moon Empress said about him, still having a hard time despite having consumed the Earth Center Fine Milk.","She had not given him any such warning in the past when he consumed the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar to cleanse the impurities in his body or the Earth Center Fine Milk to transform himself."]},{"number":1246,"title":"Chapter 1246 - Fundamentally Training its Wings, Body Swathed in Light and Darkness","paragraphs":["Since the Moon Empress had given him a warning, it was likely that he would be in more pain than when he consumed the Earth Center Fine Milk.","By the time the Golden Wings’ willpower arrived, Lin Yuan had already released his willpower and filled the surroundings with it.","Since Lin Yuan was within the golden egg, his body was a rendition of his soul.","As he continued to release his willpower, a silhouette appeared behind him.","This silhouette was in the image of Lin Yuan; only it was over a thousand times larger than his normal body.","Lin Yuan’s willpower was powerful to start with. But after consuming the Earth Center Fine Milk, his willpower was strengthened to its peak.","The enormous silhouette of Lin Yuan looked as though it was going to destroy the storm.","He sensed the willpower silhouette behind him. However, he did not notice that a crimson bronze bangle had appeared on the wrist of the silhouette.","A cry piercing enough to cut through metal broke through the storm at that moment.","Clouds arose within the eye of the storm.","Lin Yuan looked up and saw that an enormous bird that seemed to cover the sky was currently glaring down at him with its piercing eyes.","Its body was sturdy and elegant, and its gold feathers were covered with wild patterns. Every movement of its feathers could form a raging tornado.","The thousands of tornados weaved around the enormous bird and seemed determined to crash into everything.","The enormous bird’s dark gold eyes were piercing as it sneered contemptuously at everything.","Its long and razor-sharp claws could easily slash out a dragon’s heart.","Its sharp beak could also rip a phoenix’s neck to drink its blood.","It was such an intimidatingly handsome bird!","Lin Yuan felt that this description was not apt.","Lin Yuan’s silhouette was giant. But in the face of the enormous golden-winged bird, he was like a child standing before an adult.","This difference made Lin Yuan aware of how powerful the Golden Wings’ willpower was.","He remembered the Moon Empress saying that his sacred source lifeform could help him during the battle of wills. Hence, he called out to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","Soon after, an even larger shadow appeared behind his silhouette.","The shadow’s skirt billowed, its eyes were shut, and its arms were crossed over its chest in a defensive pose.","The Golden Wings’ willpower was provoked when it saw the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s shadow that was almost half its size.","It unleashed an even fiercer cry.","Lin Yuan could clearly sense the Golden Wings trying to use its willpower to crush him.","He had assumed that he would need to fight tooth and nail.","But at this moment, the crimson bronze bangle on the wrist of his silhouette lit up and flew off its wrist. It shot toward the Golden Wings’ prodigious figure.","It looked like a piece of dust landing on a majestic eagle.","When the unassuming crimson bronze bangle landed on Golden Wings, it started to grow larger until it fitted itself tightly around the Golden Wings’ neck.","The Golden Wings’ willpower seemed to have been trapped by the crimson bronze bangle and prevented the Golden Wings from releasing any more of its willpower.","Lin Yuan could clearly sense the Golden Wings’ fear of the crimson bronze bangle. It was as though the crimson bronze bangle was on a completely different level from the Golden Wings.","Lin Yuan had sensed this from the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen before.","As for the crimson bronze bangle around the Golden Wings’ neck, Lin Yuan could not be more familiar with it.","The crimson bronze bangle was none other than Morbius.","Lin Yuan was astonished.","As its contractor, Lin Yuan was well aware of Morbius’ condition.","Morbius was currently sleeping. Could this event be a natural reaction of Morbius’ sleeping state?","Moreover, Lin Yuan had made numerous guesses about what level of lifeform Morbius was.","Morbius had reached Silver X/Fantasy I. At its current level, it still could not see its own genus. Moreover, Morbius’ type was mystery-type.","Besides Morbius, Lin Yuan had never encountered any other mystery-type fey or source-type lifeform.","At first, he assumed that he would have to engage in an intense battle of willpower with the Golden Wings.","Yet, it seemed that the Golden Wings was completely under Morbius’ control, and any struggle on its part would be futile.","During the battle, Lin Yuan would use the opportunity to inject his willpower into the Golden Wings to suppress its willpower.","Yet, he managed to easily suppress the Golden Wings’ willpower with Morbius’ help.","After Lin Yuan suppressed the Golden Wings’ willpower, all the rampaging winds around him turned into a warm breeze.","The eye of the storm dispersed, and the time warp formed by the winds shattered.","Lin Yuan also felt a sense of weightlessness.","By the time he recovered, he found himself in the breeding room again, and the golden egg in his hand had cracked.","As he listened to the pecking noises coming from within the egg, a small beak soon popped out.","Eventually, a small golden-winged bird about the same size as Chimey pushed itself out of the egg.","Lin Yuan hurriedly took out a handkerchief and placed it over the damp bird.","The little bird could not even stand steadily, yet it had the same aura of the Barren bloodline that the Fiery Sky Hou had.","The Catalog of Mountains and Seas had other information about the Golden Wings besides its diet.","‘When the Golden Wings spreads its wings, it will cover the skies. Its claws will slice through majestic alters and cleave mountains.’","Evidently, the Golden Wings was a gargantuan fey with the Barren bloodline and mainly depended on its body to attack.","However, there was a line in the description that said, ‘Fundamentally training its wings, its body will be swathed in light and darkness’.","Lin Yuan was utterly clueless.","He understood it as the Golden Wings would be able to gain the ability to control light and darkness through various evolutions.","But what did the light and darkness abilities mean specifically? No matter how hard he thought about it, Lin Yuan still came up blank."]},{"number":1247,"title":"Chapter 1247 - What Kind of Life is This?","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan was not the type to fixate. When he could not come up with an accurate answer with the information he currently possessed, he instinctively pushed the thought out of his mind. After all, the Golden Wings would eventually provide him with an answer as he continued to nurture it.","He guessed that this small creature would soon grow exponentially on its dragon lungs and phoenix blood diet. It was likely that it would grow to the size Lin Yuan witnessed within the golden egg.","However, his head ached when he realized the number of dragon lungs and phoenix blood that he would have to procure. Where would he go to secure the large stock that he needed?","It would not be a one-time procurement as the Golden Wings would only need more as it continued to grow.","Lin Yuan had no choice but to continue to mull over this problem as he needed it in order to enable the Golden Wings to grow.","The Catalog of Mountains and Seas had also mentioned that the Golden Wings was a stickler for high-quality food.","‘The creature that consumes dragon lungs and drinks phoenix blood cannot accept any careless form of sustenance lest its feathers degrade and it loses its wind.’","This line meant that the dragon lungs and phoenix blood all had to be fresh and of a certain quality. Otherwise, its feathers would lose their luster while the storm patterns on its feathers would disappear.","It was evident that the Golden Wings was persnickety and difficult to maintain.","Since the freshness and quality of the dragon lungs and phoenix blood would have an effect on the Golden Wings’ health, Lin Yuan could only assume that the higher quality of food the Golden Wings consumed, the stronger it would grow to become.","However, Lin Yuan did not have a good hold on differentiating the quality of dragon lungs and phoenix blood.","Nonetheless, he was certain that Chimey did not meet the cut.","Firstly, the luan-species was only a subcategory of the main phoenix-species, and there was no guarantee that the Golden Wings would be able to maintain its health using impure phoenix blood.","Moreover, Chimey’s Sound Bird bloodline had devoured its Luan bloodline.","As such, the proportion of Luan bloodline in its body was pitifully little.","Although Chimey was not suitable, Blackie was a pure flood-dragon-species fey, and it would definitely be able to evolve into the main dragon-species fey.","It was likely that Blackie’s lungs were large enough to meet the Golden Wings’ needs, but Lin Yuan would not allow either Blackie or Chimey to sacrifice themselves.","After mulling over the issue for some time, Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up abruptly.","Killing phoenix-species feys was not the only way to obtain phoenix blood.","Dark Clouds Bird Shrine had many main phoenix feys.","A top faction had limited resources, and they would have to hold back in some areas in order to branch into other markets.","As elite as the main phoenix-species fey’s bloodline was, their resource needs would increase at a much steeper rate as compared to other feys.","Given that the Dark Clouds Bird Shrine was trying to branch into another market rapidly, they did not have enough resources for their faction’s main phoenix-species feys.","Lin Yuan felt that he would be able to trade with Dark Clouds Bird Shrine for main phoenix-species fey blood in exchange for resources.","Under normal circumstances, no main phoenix fey would be willing to give up its blood. But if it were offered sufficiently attractive benefits, it would be able to give up its blood as a trade.","Lin Yuan felt that it was unlikely that any problems would arise given his relationship with Li Xuan.","This method would allow Lin Yuan to affirm from the source that the phoenix blood drunk by the Golden Wings was fresh.","Alas, Lin Yuan could not find it in himself to ask Long Tao directly for the dragon lungs.","Coiling Dragon’s Valley had many dragon-species feys, and it would be easy for him to obtain dragon blood or even essence blood from Long Tao as they were reproducible.","However, the lungs were an important organ that dragon-species feys could not regrow.","Once the lungs were removed, the dragon-species fey would certainly die.","Hence, it would be much more difficult to obtain the dragon lungs than it was the phoenix blood.","Nonetheless, the most convenient method of obtaining the dragon lungs would be through Long Tao and ask if he had any ideas.","Even if Long Tao did not have any ideas, Lin Yuan could still trade for some dragon-species feys whose bloodlines could be easily evolved.","Lin Yuan’s army of Hundred Questions Beasts would only grow stronger, and he would be overflowing with Creation Master resources.","He could use his Creation Master resources to nurture high-quality dragon-species feys and extract their lungs for the Golden Wings.","As for the wind-elemental energy and spirit qi that the Golden Wings would require during its growth, Lin Yuan did not need to worry.","There was more than enough spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Although there was no such thing as strange wind in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, he had enough wind-elemental pearls for the Golden Wings.","As he looked at the Golden Wings in his hand that would eventually deplete a mountain of resources, Lin Yuan could not help but sigh to himself.","What kind of life is this? I contracted the source-type lifeform Red Thorn, which is difficult to maintain, and the Sacred Source Wielding Queen, which is challenging to upkeep. Now, the Golden Wings will be even harder to nurture. If I didn’t have the Spirit Lock spatial zone, all my feys, source-type lifeforms, and sacred source lifeforms would drain me dry.","The Golden Wings in his hand was now dry.","It pushed itself out of the handkerchief and looked at Lin Yuan warily.","Since Lin Yuan had used his soul, blood, and spiritual energy to form a contract with the Golden Wings, it could grow by learning from the information in his soul.","Just as he was about to greet the Golden Wings, it said, “Lin Yuan, give me a name! From now on, I will do my best to protect you!”","The Golden Wings flapped its wings as though it was showing off its strength.","But before it lifted itself into the air, it noticed Morbius on Lin Yuan’s wrist and immediately used its wings to cover its eyes in terror.","Lin Yuan almost burst into laughter.","The Golden Wings looked just like a small newly-hatched chick.","When it flapped its wings, it looked clumsy and unstable.","Lin Yuan forced himself to hold his laughter back for fear of hurting the Golden Wings’ pride.","He could sense the Golden Wings’ fear through his spiritual energy and hurriedly patted its soft feathers with his finger.","“Don’t be afraid. Morbius will be your friend now too,” said Lin Yuan soothingly.","As for choosing a name for it, Lin Yuan felt that this was his niche skill."]},{"number":1248,"title":"Chapter 1248 - Snapped Neck Falling Death","paragraphs":["He thought about the majestic Golden Wings that seemed to cover the sky that he had seen inside the egg and said, “From now on, your name shall be Shiny!”","He had wanted to call the Golden Wings Gold Shine, but it seemed inconvenient to say. Shiny was much easier.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen that had been scarfing World Crystals down inside Lin Yuan’s soul looked satisfied when it heard the name that Lin Yuan gave the Golden Wings.","It felt that its name Pill was better-sounding than Shiny.","Lin Yuan had named the Sea Burial Lotus Flower Silver Corona and the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls as Brocade Zither, and Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had been feeling that it was extremely unfair.","But now, everything was back to normal.","With Lin Yuan’s affectionate actions, the trembling Shiny slowly revealed its eyes.","He used True Data as he was curious to see what abilities a fey with the Barren bloodline had.","Lin Yuan wondered if this small creature that was eventually going to gobble up an enormous amount of resources would be able to make the expense worth it.","[Fey Name]: Golden Wings","[Fey Species]: Barren/Feather-Winged","[Fey Grade]: Normal (1/10)","[Fey Type]: Wind","[Fey Quality]: Normal","Abilities:","[Snapped Neck Falling Death]: When its sharp claws make contact with a target, the target’s neck will be snapped. At the same time, the Golden Wings will extract the target’s soul and absorb the soul into its feathers. The soul will imbue the storm patterns on the feathers with intelligence.","Lin Yuan immediately thought of Zong Ze’s Fiery Sky Hou.","The Fiery Sky Hou was Barren-species and Toothed-Beast species.","That was the first time that Lin Yuan had seen a Barren-species fey.","Now, he was seeing another fey with the Barren bloodline with the Barren-species.","From now on, he could use a fey’s type to determine if they had the Barren bloodline on top of identifying their aura.","Given the description of the Golden Wings in the Catalog of Mountains and Seas, Lin Yuan knew that the Golden Wings used its body as its main weapon.","Its Normal ability, Snapped Neck Falling Death, suited it very well.","Snapped Neck Falling Death could significantly increase Shiny’s damage power and give the Shiny the ability to kill its target with a single attack.","The ability absorbed the target’s soul into Shiny’s feathers and imbued the storm patterns on its feathers with intelligence. This made Lin Yuan think of the thousands of twisting tornadoes on the shell of the golden egg.","If all of the storm patterns gained intelligence, the tornados they produced would become extensions of Shiny’s body.","Snapped Neck Falling Death enabled Shiny to strengthen its elemental damage ability, which would go hand in hand with its physical damage ability.","Lin Yuan brought Shiny into the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","He realized that Genius was not in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, and he assumed that it had gone into the marsh world to plant the Soldier Ration Radishes.","Chimey was not live streaming. Instead, it was in its nest on the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree and hard at work absorbing the energy from strange flames.","When it spotted Lin Yuan, Chimey cheeped and flew over to him.","At that moment, Shiny was stunned and stared unblinkingly at Chimey like a foolish young man who had just laid his eyes on a beautiful girl.","Chimey landed on Lin Yuan’s ear and happily snuggled against him.","While Lin Yuan was talking to Chimey, he sensed Shiny’s feelings.","He did not know what he should say about Shiny’s feelings.","When Shiny first hatched, Lin Yuan noticed that it was male.","Shiny truly was special. It fell in love right after stepping into the world.","Unfortunately, falling in love early did not end well.","Lin Yuan had come into the Spirit-Mouthed Peony to grow and harvest some of the Spirit-Mouthed Peonies for the Moon Empress.","As such, he did not bother with the possibility that Shiny falling in love at first sight could end badly.","He instructed Chimey to take care of Shiny before he crushed three spirit qi crystals and fed them to the Spirit-Mouthed Peonies.","Previously, one spirit qi crystal had filled 10 Spirit-Mouthed Peonies with spirit qi.","But now, three spirit qi crystals filled 40 Spirit-Mouthed Peonies with spirit qi. However, this also had to do with the fact that they had been absorbing the pure spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan plucked the 40 Spirit-Mouthed Peonies out and placed them into a Platinum fey storage box before he left the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Once he exited his breeding room, he saw the Moon Empress and Mystic Moon waiting for him at the door.","When he saw the Moon Empress’ concerned gaze, he said with a smile, “Master, the Golden Wings is now my fey.”","The Moon Empress grinned and replied, “Little Yuan, do you know what you’re going to do about the dragon lungs and phoenix bleed that you’ll need to nurture the Golden Wings?”","Lin Yuan honestly told the Moon Empress about all his plans.","The more she listened to him, the more shocked she looked.","After he was done speaking, there was a moment of silence before pride came over her expression.","When Lin Yuan started talking about his plans to obtain the dragon lungs and phoenix blood, Mystic Moon knew that he would have no need for the dragon lungs and phoenix blood that the Moon Empress had prepared for him.","Moreover, Lin Yuan’s ability to use social connections for his own purposes allowed Mystic Moon to realize how Lin Yuan had been able to develop Sky City so rapidly without the Moon Empress’ help.","After the Moon Empress contemplated for a moment, she kept away the Diamond fey storage box she was holding.","Instead, she tossed a Gold fey storage box to Lin Yuan and said, “Little Yuan, it’s getting late. Why don’t you stay the night in the Radiant Moon Palace and return tomorrow? There are a few bottles of main phoenix-species feys’ blood inside the Gold fey storage box and the organs of one dragon-species fey that is one step away from evolving into the main dragon-species.","“These should be enough to enable the Golden Wings to evolve to Bronze grade. The Golden Wings should consume pure spirit qi and wind-elemental energy alongside the phoenix blood and dragon lungs.","“Little Yuan, I didn’t expect you to set such a high standard for the Golden Wing’s nurturing. I’m looking forward to seeing how strong the Golden Wings will grow to become.”","As Lin Yuan looked at the Gold fey storage box that the Moon Empress had given him, he decided that he would immediately return to the breeding room to evolve Shiny.","On the day that he had met Qin Lun and Qin Yu, he had comprehended a Willpower Rune formed from air currents.","This Willpower Rune was like restless winds, and it suited Shiny exceedingly well."]},{"number":1249,"title":"Chapter 1249 - Mystic Moon’s Opportunity","paragraphs":["If Lin Yuan could evolve Shiny to Legend, he would be able to evolve it to Fantasy Breed immediately.","There was no spirit qi professional in this world that did not look forward to the evolution of his feys, and Lin Yuan was no exception.","Moreover, Shiny was not an ordinary fey but a fey with the Barren bloodline.","Lin Yuan was in a rush to head to the breeding room to nurture Shiny and thrust the Platinum fey storage box that contained the 40 Spirit-Mouthed Peonies to the Moon Empress. “Master, besides the Lifespan Mouse, the feys in this fey storage box are also for you!”","The Moon Empress received the fey storage box. She had been planning on asking him if he had any more pure spirit qi.","Although she was willing to use all her precious spiritual ingredients on Lin Yuan and give him the Earth Center Fine Milk in spite of her limited lifespan, she still found it difficult to ask her disciple for things.","She wanted to ask Lin Yuan if he still had any pure spirit qi because Mystic Moon had given a drop of his essence blood to Lin Yuan.","Essence blood was the essence of a dragon-species fey’s life, and the loss of even one drop could be extremely detrimental to Mystic Moon.","The Moon Empress did not want the loss of this one drop of essence blood to affect Mystic Moon’s potential.","Moreover, by giving Lin Yuan a drop of essence blood, Mystic Moon did Lin Yuan a huge favor.","Mystic Moon was the Moon Empress’ Moon Envoy, but the Moon Empress did not see him as her servant. Rather, she respected him greatly.","The Moon Empress had to return this favor to Mystic Moon.","It was natural for her to provide for Lin Yuan because she was his Master.","However, Mystic Moon was not Lin Yuan’s Master, nor did Lin Yuan know that Mystic Moon had given him his essence blood.","As such, the Moon Empress wanted to use the pure spirit qi, which even she did not have to return the favor to Mystic Moon on Lin Yuan’s behalf.","When the Moon Empress looked through the Platinum fey storage box that Lin Yuan had given her, she realized that she did not have to ask him for Lin Yuan as he had already prepared so much for her.","At that moment, the Moon Empress felt a feeling that she had not felt in the last decade.","Ever since she became a Class 4 Creation Master, her life had been consumed by her overwhelming lead over everyone else.","Once she became a Class 5 Creation Master, countless people begged her to evolve their feys and heal their fey’s roots.","This kind of life made her accustomed to wielding all the power and using her Creation Master skill to provide for others.","When she laid her eyes on the Lifespan Mouse, she not only realized that the Lifespan Mouse would be able to change her limited lifespan but also that she was the first person on Lin Yuan’s mind as he journeyed through life despite not knowing that she only had three years left to live.","The Moon Empress felt that no smart person would give away the secret to longevity.","However, Lin Yuan gave the chance away to her.","As a Creation Master, Lin Yuan must have witnessed countless miraculous transformations of fey translations.","Hence, he knew how precious his life was.","Was Lin Yuan stupid?","The answer was definitely no. In order to attain the power he possessed at such a young age, he had to be much smarter than others.","Yet, he was willing to give away the chance at longevity to the Moon Empress.","It went without saying how much Lin Yuan cared about the Moon Empress.","The Moon Empress never needed Lin Yuan to prove anything, but the Lifespan Mouse was the best proof.","She did not know how much pure spirit qi Lin Yuan possessed, but he managed to provide her with 40 Spirit-Mouthed Peonies in the short span of a few days.","This was proof that Lin Yuan had constantly been making preparations for the Moon Empress.","The Moon Empress could not obtain the Lifespan Mouse and pure spirit qi in the Spirit-Mouthed Peonies through her own means. Thus, they were both considered gifts.","After receiving so many gifts, the Moon Empress was experiencing what it was like to depend on someone for the first time.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan’s Creation Master abilities had exceeded the Moon Empress’.","However, she knew that he was not a Class 5 Creation Master as he did not have the specialties that Class 5 Creation Masters had.","This meant that Lin Yuan was using a special method to produce the pure spirit qi.","The Moon Empress was extremely curious, but she was not going to probe.","Ever since she accepted Lin Yuan as her disciple, she instructed him to keep his secret weapons a secret.","The last time that the Moon Empress received pure spirit qi from Lin Yuan, she had wondered what would happen if someone found out about how special Lin Yuan was one day.","At that time, she had only had three years left to live and could not come up with an answer.","But now, she could.","With the Lifespan Mouse, she would not have to worry about death as a result of her lifespan coming to its end.","She could protect Lin Yuan forever.","This thought made the Moon Empress even more resolute.","She organized her thoughts and said, “Little Yuan, I’m planning on locking myself away to train until right before the selection for the Radiance Hundred Sequence begins. I will keep my phone with me. You can call me if any urgent matter crops up.”","Lin Yuan smiled and replied, “I don’t think I’ll have any urgent matters that I’ll need to bother you with. I’ll come and see you once you’re out.”","Lin Yuan sat and drank tea with the Moon Empress for half an hour before returning to the breeding room.","Mystic Moon, who was standing behind the Moon Empress, said softly, “Moon Empress, thank God for the Young Lord.”","The Moon Empress’ cold eyes turned happy once Lin Yuan returned to the breeding room. She then glared at Mystic Moon and said, “Mystic Moon, how dare you use your essence blood so flippantly?”","Mystic Moon’s jaw dropped. He did not expect the Moon Empress to chew him out after Lin Yuan left.","He racked his brain to try and come up with an answer as the Moon Empress went on to say, “Regardless, I have to thank you on Little Yuan’s behalf.”","She handed the Platinum fey storage box to Mystic Moon. “Little Yuan gave this to me, and I’ll use the pure spirit qi inside to increase the purity of your bloodline.”","Although Mystic Moon was a fey, he was also a genuine pinnacle Class 4 Creation Master who could tell how pure the spirit qi within the Spirit-Mouthed Peonies was.","Mystic Moon immediately knew that his opportunity had come with the pure spirit qi."]},{"number":1250,"title":"Chapter 1250 - Exclusive Skill that Gives the Golden Wings Boundless Possibilities!","paragraphs":["The Moon Empress stood up and said nonchalantly, “According to the Totem Moon’s investigation, the wind sands from all eight directions are congregating in the Radiance Federation.","“Mystic Moon, once news that the group from the Azure Federation is coming to the Radiance Federation to watch the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection got out, the Freedom Federation also had the idea of sending out a convoy to the Radiance Federation. They have sent a request to the Radiance imperial court.”","Mystic Moon’s expression hardened, and he asked after a moment of silence, “Moon Empress, do you need to tell the imperial court that your lifespan is no longer restricted to three years?”","The Moon Empress looked at her hands for a second before saying, “There’s no need to let the imperial court know for now. Since the sand winds from eight directions are congregating at the Radiance Federation, I shall use them to polish my crown. It’s fine if they’re coming with good intentions. But if they have a shred of ill-intent, I’ll make sure they won’t be able to leave even if they try.”","Back in the breeding room...","Lin Yuan hurriedly summoned Chimey and Shiny.","While he was drinking tea with the Moon Empress, he had received multiple complaints from Chimey.","After Lin Yuan left, Chimey returned to its nest in the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree to absorb its energy. It was working hard to change into human form so as to hold fan meetings.","Shiny was like a child that clung to Chimey and pestered Chimey to play together. When Chimey turned it down, Shiny would continue to bother Chimey.","Shiny had just hatched. Although it was learning from Lin Yuan’s soul, it had not picked up social skills.","As Shiny’s contractor, Lin Yuan pulled it aside to teach it a stern lesson about how boys should behave.","After Lin Yuan taught Shiny, it immediately rushed over to Chimey and bashfully apologized to it.","Lin Yuan had never taught Chimey such a stern lesson before. In fact, Lin Yuan rarely spoke to it in a stern tone.","Hence, Chimey assumed that its complaints led Lin Yuan to become angry at Shiny.","Chimey apologized to Shiny as well and became more friendly toward it.","This was also due to Shiny’s change, as it was difficult for rowdy children to leave a good impression on others.","Lin Yuan nodded in satisfaction when he saw the way Shiny and Chimey interacted.","After Lin Yuan sent Chimey back to the Spirit Lock spatial zone to continue increasing its power, he took out the dragon lungs and phoenix blood and placed it in front of Shiny.","Shiny’s eyes lit up, and it turned to ask, “Yuan, can I eat these? I really like them!”","Lin Yuan placed his hand on Shiny’s back and said, “Go ahead. These are all for you. Once you’ve eaten them, your power will increase!”","He tried injecting pure spirit qi into Shiny’s body and realized that it quickly dissipated.","This meant that Shiny’s body currently did not need to absorb pure spirit qi.","Meanwhile, Shiny had started feasting.","Lin Yuan realized that Shiny’s body slowly absorbed the pure spirit qi as it ate the dragon lungs and phoenix blood.","While Shiny was eating, Lin Yuan did not forget about the wind-elemental pearls.","He crushed the wind-elemental pearls and placed the powder beside the dragon lungs and phoenix blood so that Shiny could decide for itself if it wanted to eat the powder.","As Shiny continued to eat, Lin Yuan could see its feathers slowly hardening until they became sharp golden shards.","Shiny’s young eyes slowly sharpened as it gained more power.","Its body also expanded with every passing second.","Lin Yuan intentionally suppressed its grade when its grade started to rise. He only allowed it to break through to Bronze grade when it evolved to Elite/Epic.","Once Shiny reached Bronze grade, three exclusive skills appeared from which Lin Yuan could choose.","[Dragon-Phoenix Shocking Food]: While eating the dragon lungs and phoenix blood, it can swallow a large amount at once and increase its rate of digestion. It can also produce a mighty aura that is effective against dragons and phoenixes, which will increase its damage power against dragon- and phoenix-species feys.","Lin Yuan frowned slightly when he saw the first exclusive skill.","It was not that this first exclusive skill was bad as it increased Shiny’s rate of evolution and damage power when it had eaten its fill of dragon lungs and phoenix blood.","If he chose this exclusive skill, he would be able to nurture Shiny quickly.","Although phoenix-species feys were the most prevalent species of feys amongst experts, they still faced restrictions.","Lin Yuan had always been firm that he would only evolve his feys with the best methods rather than trying to nurture them in the shortest time possible.","As such, this exclusive skill did not suit Lin Yuan’s style.","Lin Yuan looked at the second exclusive skill.","[Mountain and Sea in Abdomen]: A small world will be opened in the Golden Wings’ abdomen. The small world will be able to store dead creatures and living dragon- and phoenix-species feys. As the Golden Wings’ grade increases, the size of the world will increase, and the creatures stored inside can be turned into energy that the Golden Wings will be able to utilize.","Lin Yuan did not know where to start criticizing the second exclusive skill.","Mountain and Sea in Abdomen resembled the Spirit Lock spatial zone, but it could not be compared to the Spirit Lock spatial zone in the slightest.","Lin Yuan felt that this exclusive skill was like a fey storage box combined with a dragon and phoenix fey storage area and an energy tank.","Lin Yuan had more than enough Diamond fey storage boxes and could find any breeding base to nurture dragon- and phoenix-species feys.","The only appealing part of Mountain and Seas in Abdomen was that it could serve as an energy tank.","However, there were many external ways to recover energy, and an exclusive skill was unnecessary.","Since both of the exclusive skills did not meet Lin Yuan’s fancy, he looked at the third exclusive skill.","When he saw the third exclusive skill, Lin Yuan immediately broke out into a smile.","[Unset State]: When interacting with another fey, the Golden Wings can copy the fey’s exclusive skill and triggered abilities. Unset State will then turn into the copied exclusive skill and triggered ability. The abilities can only be switched out once every lunar cycle.","Essentially, Unset State allowed Lin Yuan to envision boundless possibilities for Shiny."]},{"number":1251,"title":"Chapter 1251 - Lin Yuan’s Complete Defense System","paragraphs":["Unset State would allow Shiny to change its state to suit Lin Yuan’s fey configuration.","Lin Yuan would also never have to be envious of other fey’s exclusive skills and triggered abilities anymore.","As a Creation Master, Lin Yuan had evolved countless feys and had come across many outstanding exclusive skills and triggered abilities.","Amongst all the feys that Lin Yuan had evolved, he still felt that Chu Ci’s Obsidian Iron Wild Bull had the best exclusive skills.","Lin Yuan badly wanted the abilities Sacrifice and Annihilation Gaze. However, he wanted Sacrifice more than he did Annihilation Gaze.","Given that Shiny depended on its physique to fight, its body was made to store a sea of vitality and be extremely damage resistant.","If Unset State could be replaced with Sacrifice, Lin Yuan would be able to increase his defensive abilities and gain a powerful method of protecting his life.","Spirit qi professionals had three ways of protecting their lives.","The first method was to use an external item to defend against damage. Most defense-type spirit qi professionals who used shielding abilities applied this method.","Lin Yuan’s use of Source Sand also applied this form of defense.","Although the first method of defense was the most commonly utilized, it was the least reliable as it was unlikely to provide complete protection.","The first method of defense would fail to defend against unexpected dangers.","When Lin Yuan had been controlled within the water world dimensional rift, he had been unable to summon Source Sand quickly enough to defend himself against sudden attacks.","If Liu Jie had not been by his side, he would definitely have been seriously injured or even killed.","After Lin Yuan formed a contract with the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen and Genius gained a new ability, he gained a second form of defense.","The laws and willpowers on the Queen’s Skirt Hem gave Lin Yuan resistance to all types of damage.","Genius’ Spiritual Energy Expansion would allow Lin Yuan to deflect spiritual damage while protecting him with spiritual energy.","Both of these were considered the second form of defense, which would be able to protect the spirit qi professional in a split second.","Compared to the first form of defense, the second form was undoubtedly more effective.","However, the second form of defense also had its limitations and could not be considered a traditional life-saving method.","The Obsidian Iron Wild Bull’s Sacrifice was strong and valuable because it belonged to the third form of defense.","The third form of defense would genuinely increase the spirit qi professional’s method of saving their life.","If Lin Yuan instructed Shiny to use Unset State to copy the Obsidian Iron Wild Bull’s Sacrifice, he would be able to obtain the third method of defense. This would turn Shiny into Lin Yuan’s outstanding living shield.","Unless the opponent had an attack that could kill Shiny in an instant, Lin Yuan would be able to save his life no matter how powerful the attack was.","The Jasmine Lily’s Vitality Imprint was also notable.","It had been a long time since Lin Yuan last used the Jasmine Lily’s Vitality Imprint, and he could sense how much vitality was stored in the Vitality Imprint on his forehead.","He had not had the chance to use the Vitality Imprint during unexpected moments of danger.","With Shiny taking the damage on his behalf, Lin Yuan would now have the chance to use the Vitality Imprint to heal himself continuously.","He would also be able to use Sacrifice to transfer vitality to the injured Shiny.","Shiny’s Unset State provided Lin Yuan’s defense system with a three-pronged approach and allowed him never to have to worry about defense again in the future.","This new method of protecting himself made Lin Yuan feel much more at ease.","Moreover, Unset State could swap out the copied exclusive skill or triggered skill once every lunar cycle.","One lunar cycle was 24 hours. Within 24 hours, Lin Yuan could mold Shiny in any way he saw fit.","Lin Yuan could also swap out Sacrifice for other combat-type abilities and exclusive skills during specific circumstances.","This would enable Shiny’s combat power to become stronger in a more obvious way.","Nonetheless, he could not use Unset State to copy exclusive skills and abilities flippantly.","For example, he could copy Chimey’s Clear Sky without many qualms, but the Jasmine Lily’s Vitality Imprint, Blackie’s Spirit Qi Imprint, and Genius’ Connected Tails would not have any effects when copied.","The Jasmine Lily and Blackie’s powerful foundation came from a continuous supply of vitality and spirit qi, which Shiny did not have access to.","Even if Shiny copied Vitality Imprint and Spirit Qi Imprint, it would not be able to tap into a source of vitality and spirit qi.","As for Genius’ Connected Tails, it was based on the fact that Genius had a sea of knowledge stored in its head.","Without the immense knowledge, Connected Tails’ effects would be cut in half to only being able to offer a perfect flow of communication.","In general, Lin Yuan was pleased with Unset State.","When he first started evolving Shiny, Lin Yuan had stood next to Shiny.","But now, Lin Yuan could only stand on Shiny’s back to inject spirit qi into its body.","Shiny’s wingspan had reached 20 meters, and it was a truly giant creature.","Lin Yuan no longer saw anything cute about Shiny.","The size of Shiny’s body exceeded Lin Yuan’s expectation, and he had never encountered a fey that could grow to such a large size at only Bronze grade.","He could not imagine how shockingly large Shiny would grow to become as it continued to evolve.","Regardless, it seemed that Blackie would not be able to match up to Shiny.","As Shiny continued to eat the dragon lungs, phoenix blood, and powdered wind-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, its quality steadily raised to Epic.","Lin Yuan immediately suppressed Shiny’s grade so that it could focus on evolving its quality."]},{"number":1252,"title":"Chapter 1252 - Your Whole Family is Small!","paragraphs":["When only a small portion of dragon lungs and phoenix blood was left, Shiny’s quality finally reached Legend.","Lin Yuan said softly, “Shiny, Master said that feys with the Barren bloodlinee only start to reveal their power when they reach Fantasy Breed. Every fey with the Barren bloodline is recorded in the Catalog of Mountains and Seas and possesses some form of special ability. Shiny, I want to see how powerful you become when you reach Fantasy Breed!”","Lin Yuan summoned the Willpower Rune of wind currents that seemed to have been created for Shiny.","Shiny stopped eating when it sensed the Willpower Rune.","With all of Lin Yuan’s hopes on its shoulders, Shiny charged toward the Willpower Rune of wind currents.","When it made contact with the Willpower Rune, a gust kicked up in the breeding room.","Shiny let out a cry as it spread its wings and took to the sky, and danced in tandem with the wind currents.","At that moment, Shiny slightly resembled the version of it that Lin Yuan had seen inside the egg.","It was as though Shiny had become the heart of the winds.","As it evolved to Fantasy Breed, the golden color of Shiny’s feathers intensified while the storm patterns compressed even closer together.","The brownish-gold feathers on its neck also turned gold.","Lin Yuan’s eyebrow twitched.","Shiny’s golden feathers looked different from what Lin Yuan had seen inside the egg.","The Catalog of Mountains and Seas did not mention that Shiny’s brownish-gold feathers would turn gold.","Did this mean that the pure spirit qi strengthened Shiny’s bloodline in the process of evolving it?","When he had been drinking tea with the Moon Empress, the Moon Empress had intentionally told him that pure spirit qi would be beneficial to feys with the Barren bloodlinee.","Hence, Lin Yuan became increasingly certain that the change in the color of Shiny’s feathers was linked to the pure spirit qi.","Although Shiny’s grade did not increase when it evolved to Fantasy Breed, it did grow in size from a 20-meter wingspan to a 35-meter wingspan.","Thankfully, his breeding room was large. Otherwise, the Fantasy Breed Golden Wings would tear the breeding room apart.","Slowly, Lin Yuan noticed that Shiny’s golden wings also looked crystallized.","Its eyes also darkened, and a shining golden circle appeared around its pupils. Its dark gold pupils started to spin, and startling storms appeared within them.","As the winds around Shiny dissipated, it finally changed into a Fantasy Breed fey.","Lin Yuan immediately used True Data to check on Shiny.","[Fey Name]: Golden Wings","[Fey Species]: Barren/Feather-Winged","[Fey Grade]: Bronze (2/10)","[Fey Type]: Wind","[Fey Quality]: Fantasy I","Abilities:","[Snapped Neck Falling Death]: When its sharp claws make contact with a target, the target’s neck will be snapped. Simultaneously, the Golden Wings will extract the target’s soul and absorb the soul into its feathers. The soul will imbue the storm patterns on the feathers with intelligence.","[Flowing Wind Claws]: When the wind elements in the Golden Wings’ feathers are released into the environment, it will be able to control the surrounding winds and manipulate them to attack its opponent. The attacked target will feel like it is being slashed by claws. After attacking a target, the Golden Wings will also be able to inject wind-element into its target through explosions and cause double the amount of damage.","Exclusive Skill:","[Unset State]: When interacting with another fey, the Golden Wings can copy the fey’s exclusive skill and triggered abilities. Unset State will then turn into the copied exclusive skill and triggered ability. The abilities can only be switched out once every lunar cycle.","[Wind’s Descendant]: By placing itself as the heart of all wind elements, it will become the eye of a hurricane and control all of the surrounding wind elements. It will become the master while all other winds will become its disciple.","Lin Yuan’s eyes widened to the eyes of saucers, and he finally understood why feys with the Barren bloodline could become the Radiance Federation’s representative feys.","The feys with the Barren bloodlinee were so powerful that they were worthy of carrying the reputation of the entire Radiance Federation on their shoulders.","Wind’s Descendant cemented Shiny’s control over wind elements.","With Shiny around, any fey that depended on wind elements would be weakened.","Wind’s Descendant was a triggered ability, and it would improve as Shiny’s power rose.","Previously, Lin Yuan had been stunned by the Fiery Sky Hou’s startling ability to amplify fire-type feys.","But now, Shiny’s ability to overwhelm wind-type feys was stronger than the Fiery Sky Hou’s ability to aid fire-type feys.","Moreover, Lin Yuan did not have any pure wind-type feys.","The only fey he had that was affiliated with wind-type was when Gray absorbed windy weather and gained a wind-type ability.","Thus, Lin Yuan would not be significantly negatively affected by Shiny’s ability to suppress wind-type combat feys.","Lin Yuan felt that once Shiny evolved to Creation Breed and formed the wind world, it would become the king of winds.","As for Flowing Wind Claws, Lin Yuan found it very familiar.","After pondering over it for some time, he remembered that Long Tao’s Sea King Chalk Mosasaurus had an ability called Sea Bite which would enable the Sea King Chalk Mosasaurus to bite its target underwater by controlling the water.","This was very similar to the way in which Shiny’s Flowing Wind Claws attacked targets.","However, Flowing Wind Claws also had an additional effect that Sea Bite did not have, which was to inject wind elements into its target using explosions.","Sea Bite’s attack was like a pistol, while Flowing Wind Claw’s attack was like a shotgun.","Its true attacking power lay in this hidden ability rather than its surface ability.","Wind element was known for its sharp cutting effects, flame element was known for its burning effects,, and water element was known for its suffocating effects.","When wind was compressed into a wound and exploded, it was like placing a meat mincer into the wound that would completely destroy that area of flesh.","When high-pressure winds entered a blood vessel, it would also cause a chain effect that damaged the heart.","If the attacked fey had a weak heart, its heart would become an embolism of air and lead to a failure of circulation, resulting in death.","While Lin Yuan was observing Shiny, he noticed Shiny was about to snuggle up to him.","Lin Yuan hurriedly stopped it.","All of the feathers on Shiny’s neck shone with a metallic gleam.","If Shiny got too near, his face would be sliced to shreds.","Shiny looked at Lin Yuan sorrowfully and said, “Yuan, you’re so tiny!”","Lin Yuan massaged his forehead and thought,? You’re the tiny one! Your whole family is small!"]},{"number":1253,"title":"Chapter 1253 - How Can You Be So Shameless? Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan’s jaw dropped.","Wait! Shiny is my fey, so we’re family now. That notion makes me come across as dumb.","Lin Yuan coughed and instructed Shiny to eat the rest of the dragon lungs and phoenix blood.","When Shiny was done eating the dragon lungs and phoenix blood, Lin Yuan returned it to the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Shiny was large and could not change its form. Unless it reached Myth II and changed into human form, Lin Yuan felt that he would not be able to summon it any other time besides during battle.","When he left the breeding room and returned to his room, he took a bath and snuggled in for a good night’s sleep.","But in the deep stillness of the night, the Sea Bliss Clan was in a complete mess.","Every main member of the Sea Bliss Clan sat fearfully in the meeting room.","The Spirit Guards had sent word that the Miao family had just requested a blood pact ultimate fight with the Sea Bliss Clan for the third time.","According to the ultimate fighting ground rules, the blood pact ultimate fight would automatically go ahead after one party made three requests.","Ever since Qi Haitao and Qi Wangyang angered Lin Yuan at Sky City’s private faction territory, they had lost all hope.","They also blamed themselves for being too ignorant and greedy and not offering all of the Sea Bliss Clan’s resources in exchange for a chance at survival.","Qi Haitao and Qi Wangyang clung to a thread of hope.","They had heard that the Young Liege of Midnight Palace had been refusing to see the Miao family ever since the incident at the Guard Ye Banquet.","The Miao family had tried to gain favor with the Young Liege many times but were all shot down and chased out by the Spirit Guards before they even had a chance to meet him.","Moreover, a blood pact ultimate fight could only go through with the agreement of both the ultimate fighting ground and the Spirit Guards.","Qi Wangyang felt that given the Young Liege of the Midnight Palace’s attitude toward the Miao family, it was unlikely that the Spirit Guards would agree to let the blood pact ultimate fight go through.","But now, the Spirit Guards had already sent word. which meant that the last hope they placed in Sky City had also been dashed.","This was the first time that Qi Wangyang felt so close to death.","All the main members of the Sea Bliss Clan were silent and looking up at him with retracted necks.","Anger intermingled with despair in the pits of Qi Wangyang’s stomach.","His fear set his fury alight, and he furiously banged his hand on the table before bellowing, “Each and every one of you only want to drain money from me! You’ll come and pester me for rewards whenever you achieve something small. But now that we’re on the brink of death, why are all of you so quiet? What happened to all your bravado when you’re asking me for resources?”","Qi Wangyang was still boiling with rage when an elderly man said, “I’ve been working in the Sea Bliss Clan for about five years, but I’m just one of the pinnacle Class 3 Creation Masters you hired. From today onward, I would like to dissolve our employment relationship.”","The elderly man’s words made the words that were rising in Qi Wangyang’s throat stop short, and Qi Wangyang started to splutter violently.","He glared at the elderly man as he coughed.","If his eyes held any power, the elderly man would be dead by now.","Qi Wangyang screamed internally.","What the hell? How can you be so shameless? This old man was acting devotedly loyal to me when we were breaking into the offshore islands. He even promised to serve the Sea Bliss Clan for the rest of his life in exchange for 3% of the island’s shares.","Not only did I give him what he wanted, but he’s also taken a considerable amount of resources from the Sea Bliss Clan during his time here. I was also the one who provided the resources to evolve his fey to Myth Breed. But now, he says he’s only a Creation Master that the Sea Bliss Clan hired. Damn you. He probably used more resources than the Zheng family’s own Creation Masters!?","After his coughing fit subsided, Qi Wangyang prepared himself to give the elderly man a good scolding when the elderly man went on to say, “Leader, you can’t blame me. I have to continue living. You failed to ask Sky City for help and won’t be able to defeat Connected Beast Park during the blood pact ultimate fight. I wasn’t supportive of you targeting Connected Beast Park in the first place. Your decision ruined this family’s future!”","Many Class 1, 2, and 3 Creation Masters sounded out their assent.","Even a Class 1 Creation Master would be able to receive respect.","Thus, no Creation Master was willing to spend their entire life with a faction that they did not have any emotional ties.","Before the meeting started, many hired Creation Masters had decided they wanted to leave the Sea Bliss Clan.","However, the low-class Creation Masters were afraid that the Sea Bliss Clan would do something risky without strong group support during this desperate circumstance.","Now that an emperor-class pinnacle Class 3 Creation Master that had a Myth Breed fey had spoken, it would be a good segway to voice the other Creation Masters’ intention of leaving the Sea Bliss Clan.","If Qi Wangyang forced them to stay in the Sea Bliss Clan, the only future they had was death.","When Connected Beast Park defeated the Sea Bliss Clan in the blood pact ultimate fight and took over their resources, the Sea Bliss Clan’s Class 4 Creation Masters, who were willing to offer their loyalty, would be accepted by Connected Beast Park.","This was also a rule of the blood pact ultimate fight. Besides the faction’s high-class Creation Masters, the hired high-class Creation Masters were usually allowed to live.","However, this was not the case for Class 1 and 2 Creation Masters.","If the Sea Bliss Clan was taking on another veteran faction in the blood pact ultimate fight, the other veteran faction might be willing to accept the Class 1 and 2 Creation Masters.","However, Connected Beast Park was a top faction that specialized in Creation Master resources, and it did not make sense for them to nurture low-class Creation Masters.","Thus, the hired Class 1 and 2 Creation Masters would probably be seen as burdens and eliminated by Connected Beast Park.","With so many Creation Masters riding on the elderly man’s train, Qi Wangyang started to tremble with rage.","It was said that the sailors would abandon the ship once the captain was ruined. However, the Sea Bliss Clan had not been ruined yet, but the Creation Masters were already ready to abandon ship.","How dare they?","Qi Wangyang’s anger overtook his fear, and his gaze glinted evilly.","Qi Wangyang stopped Qi Haitao who was about to stand.","He allowed the elderly man to lead the Class 1 and 2 Creation Masters as they continued to cause a din."]},{"number":1254,"title":"Chapter 1254 - Will the Falling Wall be Pushed Down or Will it Crush Everyone?","paragraphs":["Qi Wangyang waited until no one else voiced their desire to join the elderly man’s camp before standing up and saying coldly, “All of you are pretty good at pushing down the falling wall. But don’t forget that a falling wall can also crush you to death.”","The moment Qi Wangyang spoke, the faces of the group of Creation Masters that wanted to jump ship fell.","Usually, there would be no need for the elderly man who was a pinnacle Class 3 Creation Master to cause a disturbance because he would be accepted by Connected Beast Park even if the Sea Bliss Clan lost to Connected Beast Park.","However, he had insulted Connected Beast Park significantly when he had been trying to prove his loyalty to gain Qi Wangyang’s favor.","The elderly man was afraid that Connected Beast Park would hold that against him.","Hence, he chose to fan the flames of disrest during the Sea Bliss Clan’s precarious moment between life and death.","The elderly man needed the rest of the external Class 1 and 2 Creation Masters to cause a scene just as much as they needed to follow his lead.","In order to curry favor with Qi Wangyang, the elderly man had spent a lot of time by Qi Wangyang’s side and understood Qi Wangyang well.","Qi Wangyang cared about his reputation.","He would not burn any bridges unless he were pushed to his limit.","This was why so many Class 1 and 2 Creation Masters dared to voice their desire to leave the Sea Bliss Clan during this perilous situation.","Now that Qi Wangyang was acting so mercilessly in a public setting, the elderly man felt a sense of danger creep up on him.","Qi Wangyang turned and said something to a hunched over elderly man beside him who looked extremely frail and sickly. It was as though he would collapse at any moment.","However, everyone present knew that this elderly man was not as weak as he appeared because he was the younger brother of the previous leader of the Sea Bliss Clan and the uncle of Qi Wangyang, Qi Heng.","As a Class 4 Creation Master, Qi Heng was the strongest Creation Master in the Sea Bliss Clan and the center of all their martial power.","“Uncle, please exterminate these parasites who want to betray the Sea Bliss Clan.”","The elderly man trembled as he got to his feet and sighed before asking Qi Wangyang, “Wangyang, tell me, what do you want to do with these people? If you weren’t the leader, these people would have died by my Freeze Piercing Double Carp long ago.”","A concentrated murderous aura emanated from the elderly man, and everyone present froze.","Qi Wangyang sneered. “I share the same sentiments as you. Normally, it wouldn’t matter if the hired members left. Don’t I usually give the hired Creation Masters bonuses when they leave and wish them the best of luck? But now that the Sea Bliss Clan is facing a life or death situation leaving would only be detrimental to the Sea Bliss Clan!","“All these people trying to damage the Sea Bliss Clan now are the ones that are usually clamoring to display their loyalty and acting as though their only wish is to have the blood of the Qi family flowing through their veins. All these people who managed to grow by using the Sea Bliss Clan’s resources are all in such a hurry to break ties with us now.","“How ironic. I don’t know if the Sea Bliss Clan will be able to make it out of this quagmire, but even if we don’t make it out, I will make sure that these ungrateful people bent on causing unrest will all die before I do.”","The moment that Qi Haitao finished speaking, two blue-haired lolis appeared next to Qi Heng, and the meeting room was filled with a bone-piercing chill.","An ice awl pierced through the throats of each and every person who had voiced their desire to leave the Sea Bliss Clan.","This reduced 20% of the members of the Sea Bliss Clan that were inside the meeting room.","The Creation Masters who had not been attacked stared shell-shocked at the dead pinnacle Class 3 Creation Master and Class 1 and 2 Creation Masters.","Qi Heng took note of all their gazes and postures.","Although Qi Wangyang had made a show of talking about how well he treated the members of the Sea Bliss Clan, they had been unable to obscure his murderous intent.","The members of the Sea Bliss Clan were completely divided and ready to leave.","If Qi Heng had not mentioned the Freeze Piercing Double Carp, the rest of the Class 3 and 4 Creation Masters would have asked to leave the Sea Bliss Clan as well after the meeting.","After all, being tied to a faction that was about to be ended by a blood pact ultimate fight would not be able to compare to the freedom of being able to join another faction.","Qi Heng sighed to himself.","It’s fine if none of them are loyal anymore, but their physical selves must remain with us.","According to the information that Qi Wangyang had given him prior to the meeting, the City Lord of Sky City only ripped a new one into Qi Wangyang and Qi Haitao.","However, he had not said that he would not help the Sea Bliss Clan.","It was a fact that Sky City and the Miao family were enemies.","Qi Wangyang and Qi Haitao had been taught a lesson and chased out because they had not been sincere enough.","If news that the members of the Sea Bliss Clan left got out, the Sea Bliss Clan’s value would decrease significantly in the public’s eyes.","This would cause Sky City to devalue the Sea Bliss Clan as well, and the Sea Bliss Clan would have less to leverage in exchange for Sky City’s help.","Qi Heng could not accept this.","As he looked around at the roomful of perturbed people and furious Qi Wangyang, Qi Heng rapped his cane on the ground and said, “Leader, I will go and speak to Sky City myself. What is your bottom line?”","Qi Wangyang’s face lit up with delight.","If Qi Heng had the courage to take over this issue, Qi Wangyang could relax to a certain extent.","“Uncle, I’m willing to give Sky City 80% of the Sea Bliss Clan’s shares at the most. At that point, the Sea Bliss Clan will essentially become a branch of Sky City. I hope that when you’re negotiating with them, you’ll be able to gain their promise to provide the Sea Bliss Clan with resources in exchange for 80% of our shares.”","The elderly man could not help but think of what his elder brother had said of his nephew, “Wangyang will be able to develop the Sea Bliss Clan but will be unable to save the Sea Bliss Clan from danger.”","Apparently, Qi Heng’s brother knew his son like the palm of his hand.","On the brink of life and death, he could not allow Qi Wangyang to do as he pleased any longer.","Instead of responding to what Qi Wangyang had said, he turned to ask Qi Haitao, “Haitao, what are your thoughts on this?”"]},{"number":1255,"title":"Chapter 1255 - Zong Ze’s Plea for Help","paragraphs":["Qi Haitao did not expect Qi Heng to mention him at such an event.","He glanced at his father and hesitated for a second before saying, “If Sky City can promise to protect us, the City Lord of Sky City can make any request of us. This will be able to prove our sincerity to the greatest extent.","“If we offer a promise first, they won’t be satisfied, and there’s no way they will help us overcome this trial. After all, we have no ties with them and even tried to take advantage of them during our previous trade deal.","“Additionally, we shouldn’t zero in on the enmity between Sky City and Connected Beast Park during the negotiation because it has nothing to do with us, and they don’t need to make use of this blood pact ultimate fight to attack Connected Beast Park. If Sky City truly wants to attack Connected Beast Park, they can issue a blood pact ultimate fight challenge to Connected Beast Park directly.”","When Qi Haitao finished speaking, he bowed to Qi Heng and purposely evaded Qi Wangyang’s gaze.","Qi Wangyang’s expression hardened as Qi Haitao had essentially stomped all over Qi Wangyang’s method.","Previously, he had been focused on the animosity between Sky City and Connected Beast Park and had not been willing to give up Sea Bliss Clan’s resources.","Qi Wangyang felt that Qi Haitao was basically selling the family away. If the City Lord of Sky City was allowed to make any request, there was no way he would leave room for the Sea Bliss Clan to breathe.","Unlike Qi Wangyang’s grim expression, Qi Heng smiled in relief and said, “Haitao and I shall handle this matter. Leader, Haitao has grown up. If the Sea Bliss Clan makes it out of this crisis, you should discuss more matters with him in the future. He is clear-headed. If you had discussed with him from the beginning, our Sea Bliss Clan wouldn’t have fallen this deep.”","No one dared to speak after Qi Heng, and a harsh silence fell over the room.","As silent as the room was, the people inside were all brimming with emotions that they dared not express.","The next day, Lin Yuan awoke from a deep sleep and found that he was feeling completely different than before.","When humans sleep, their bodies start to recover. Hence, they feel lazy when they have just awoken.","But now, Lin Yuan’s bodily functions had reached peak capabilities.","He was fairly certain that it was linked to his transformation after consuming the Earth Center Fine Milk.","Lin Yuan took a shower and changed into a set of spirit qi clothes.","When he looked into the mirror, he realized that he could not tear his eyes away from the image of himself.","He was not narcissistic, nor did he have any interest in men. However, the person in the mirror had undeniably breathtaking looks.","A thought flashed through his head.","Did I wake myself up with my handsomeness?","Lin Yuan hastily shook his head to shake the ludicrous thought out of his head.","Cai Cha, who was coincidentally walking by Lin Yuan’s room and glanced at him in passing, could not help but gasp.","My Young Lord is so impressive! I wonder what kind of lady is worthy of him?","Given Lin Yuan’s talent and status, finding a fitting match in the Radiance Federation would be difficult.","To Cai Cha’s knowledge, the Space Elder’s granddaughter was suitable.","However, her talent and power were far below that of Lin Yuan.","Tian Feng’s younger sister was the second Radiance Envoy and had enough talent and power. But, she was much older than Lin Yuan.","As such, it seemed that only the granddaughter of that member of royalty would be able to match up to Lin Yuan in terms of status and talent.","By now, Lin Yuan had spotted Cai Cha, and he quickly greeted her.","He had no idea what was going through her head. But if he did, he would definitely have sighed ruefully.","As someone who had crossed through space and time, he did not care for status and talent.","Lin Yuan was confused when he saw Cai Cha carrying a tray of breakfast food. Normally, he should be dining with his Master in the inner palace.","He found out from Cai Cha that the Moon Empress and Mystic Moon had locked themselves away to train since last night.","After eating breakfast, Lin Yuan did not rush to return to the mansion.","Instead, he strolled down Leaning Moon Mountain against the backdrop of the early morning sun until he arrived at the Royal Capital’s Noisy City.","Lin Yuan smiled as he looked around at the rolling mountains and rivers and sea of people around him.","There was something about the brilliance of dawn that made him want to protect its beauty.","At this moment, Lin Yuan spotted a stall selling cornmeal steamed buns nearby, and he immediately recalled the way Chu Ci would always insist on eating cornmeal steamed buns when she was young.","He walked up to the stall to buy some to reminisce about the flavor.","Lin Yuan was in such a rush that he did not notice that a group had gathered behind him and stole glances at him.","After Lin Yuan bought the cornmeal steamed buns, he placed one in his mouth. But, it was hard to swallow.","Nonetheless, he slowly chewed until he swallowed all of it because the memories stored within this experience far outweighed the taste.","Just as Lin Yuan was preparing to return to the mansion, his phone started to ring.","He saw that the call was coming from Zong Ze, so he picked it up.","Lin Yuan had asked Zong Ze for help to see if he could retrieve the Wind Crystal Precious Bottle from the Whale Ocean Commerce’s Ten Thousand Source Hall.","At that time, Zong Ze had agreed happily. But, Zong Ze had not contacted Lin Yuan since then.","Lin Yuan assumed that Zong Ze was contacting him now regarding the Wind Crystal Precious Bottle.","But when Lin Yuan picked up the call, Zong Ze said in an embarrassed tone, “Lin Yuan, do you still have any of the fire-type Heavenly Maiden Sleet pearls?”","Lin Yuan was stunned.","He did have one fire-type Heavenly Maiden Sleet pearl, but Hu Quan had used it to create the chain of pearls.","Hu Quan had unleashed his talent as a Spirit Craftsman while crafting the chain of pearls and creating a bona fide work of art.","But since Zong Ze sounded anxious, Lin Yuan spoke honestly."]},{"number":1256,"title":"Chapter 1256 - Zong Ze’s Best Friends","paragraphs":["“Big Brother Zong, I do have one fire-type Heavenly Maiden Sleet pearl.”","Zong Ze was overjoyed to hear Lin Yuan’s response and said candidly, “Lin Yuan, it’s great that you still have one! My Fiery Sky Hou needs to increase the purity of its bloodline. To do so, it needs pure fire-elemental energy as well as pure spirit qi. The pure elemental energy in the elemental pearl you gave me last time triggered the Fiery Sky Hou’s bloodline, and it has been using the fire-elemental energy to refine its bloodline.","“Although the Fiery Sky Hou doesn’t need to consume fire-type Heavenly Maiden Sleet pearls during the refinement process, it needs to experience pure fire-elemental energy while homogenizing the fire elements in its body. One fire-type Heavenly Maiden Sleet pearl contains sufficiently pure fire-elemental energy but not enough of it, making it rather difficult for the Fiery Sky Hou to homogenize the fire elements in its body.","“If you still have another fire-type Heavenly Maiden Sleet pearl, I hope that you can lend it to me.”","Lin Yuan replied without hesitation, “No problem. Are you in the Royal Capital now? I happen to have some time now. Why don’t I send it over to you now?”","A surge of warmth washed over Zong Ze.","He was well aware of how precious the fire-type Heavenly Maiden Sleet pearl was. Not even Chef Supreme was able to obtain it.","Zong Ze assumed that the Moon Empress’ Creation Master skills had elevated over the last couple of years to the point that she now surpassed Chef Supreme.","He was sure that the Moon Empress had given the two fire-type Heavenly Maiden Sleet pearls to Lin Yuan.","Zong Ze had already been more astonished when he received the fire-type Heavenly Maiden Sleet pearl from Lin Yuan when he visited Zong Ze’s residence.","Zong Ze never expected Lin Yuan to give him such a magnificent gift.","He had called Lin Yuan because he could not stand that the Fiery Sky Hou was only one step away from increasing the purity of its bloodline.","Usually, it was taboo to ask for goods of such a level, even from one’s good friends.","Unless the parties were truly best friends, they would not be willing to give up such goods.","If any friend below the level of a best friend asked for such a good, they would be rejected without hesitation even if they did possess the good.","Yet, Lin Yuan had immediately and honestly replied that he did have it and offered to send it over when he realized that Zong Ze needed it.","Such a gesture would move even the most cold-hearted person.","Moreover, Zong Ze was hoping to become true best friends with Lin Yuan.","In the past few days, when Zong Ze had been busy helping the Fiery Sky Hou increase its bloodline’s purity, Lin Yuan’s strange fragrance occupied his mind.","Due to his curse, his desire to battle had been pulsing. But once he thought of the fragrance, the burning urge would settle.","At first, the thought of Lin Yuan was connected to the strange fragrance.","But now, this matter made Zong Ze aware of Lin Yuan’s kinship toward him, and the idea of Lin Yuan in his mind was no longer linked to that soul-soothing scent.","It seemed that he had gained another true friend beside Gu Lang.","When Zong Ze did not respond after Lin Yuan offered to send over the elemental pearl, Lin Yuan assumed that it was not a convenient time for Zong Ze.","“Big Brother Zong, if this is not a good time, I can send it over through Ostrich Logistics as well. Don’t forget to sign for it yourself. This is my last fire-type Heavenly Maiden Sleet pearl.”","Zong Ze recovered from his trance and said with a smile, “Lin Yuan, I’ve never been to your place. I can come and collect it from you directly and deliver the Wind Crystal Precious Bottle to you at the same time.”","“Big Brother Zong, I’ll text you the address now. I’m returning home from Master’s place now.”","Lin Yuan hung up the call.","After sending the text, Lin Yuan no longer had any desire to continue shopping.","Zong Ze should be arriving at the mansion soon. As the mansion owner, it was only right to arrive in advance and greet Zong Ze instead of having Zong Ze wait for him.","Hence, Lin Yuan used the Ethereal Jellyfish’s Node Teleportation to flash himself to the mansion entrance.","The moment he arrived, he saw Wen Yu looking at the documents in her hand with bemusement.","Lin Yuan asked with a smile, “Was someone from the Sea Bliss Clan lying in wait for you on Star Web this morning?”","Wen Yu hurriedly stood up and handed her documents to Lin Yuan as she replied, “Young Master, Big Brother Liu has informed the Spirit Guards, and they sent a final notice to the Sea Bliss Clan to confirm the blood pact ultimate fight between the Sea Bliss Clan and Connected Beast Park. What are your plans?”","Instead of responding to her question, he asked, “What conditions did the people from the Sea Bliss Clan ask of you this morning?”","Wen Yu pointed at the information on the documents and said, “Young Master, the leader of the Sea Bliss Clan might appear to be Qi Wangyang, but there is someone higher ranked than him in the Sea Bliss Clan. This person is his uncle, Qi Heng. This time, Qi Heng and Qi Haitao came to see me. They didn’t list any conditions. All they said was that the Sea Bliss Clan will do its best to meet any request that Sky City makes.”","Lin Yuan nodded.","It seemed that the people from the Sea Bliss Clan finally understood their circumstances and knew they had to keep their tails between their legs.","However, it would not benefit Lin Yuan in any way for the City Lord of Sky City to help the Sea Bliss Clan to defeat Connected Beast Park.","Instead, it would affect his chances of using Connected Beast Park to learn more about Ten Thousand Flags Trading.","Lin Yuan also had another important goal, which was to gather faith and increase the amount of faith power in his shrine.","Thus, he had to contemplate the best way to gather the most faith power possible."]},{"number":1257,"title":"Chapter 1257 - Connected Beast Park’s Savior Lin Yuan is Here","paragraphs":["After thinking for some time, Lin Yuan could not come up with an ideal plan and decided to tell Wen Yu about the issue to see if she might have any constructive suggestions.","He had to tell Wen Yu about his goal first to ensure that her suggestions would not clash with his aim. If so, there would be no point in him asking for her opinion.","“Wen Yu, have you heard of faith power?” asked Lin Yuan.","After mulling over the question for a moment, she was certain that she had never heard of faith power and shook her head decidedly.","She was confused by Lin Yuan’s sudden question, but she knew that he had to have his reason for mentioning it.","Since Wen Yu shook her head, Lin Yuan went on to explain, “Faith power is a type of worship that one lifeform expresses toward another lifeform. The feelings of admiration will turn into faith power. One of my fey’s power is linked to the strength of the faith power I receive.”","Lin Yuan paused before continuing. “If we help the Sea Bliss Clan to win their blood pact ultimate fight, we’ll have to handle the organization or their resources. Previously, I asked you to look into Ten Thousand Flags Trading, and you discovered that they are hiding a huge problem.","“Recently, Whale Ocean Commerce has been seeking to work with Connected Beast Park. My identity as the City Lord of Sky City has a deep enmity with the Miao family, but they are dying to gain favor with my original identity. There’s an item that I want to gain from Whale Ocean Commerce by using Connected Beast Park. It will negatively affect my plan if I end Connected Beast Park now.","“Moreover, I don’t think this is the way to gain the most faith power. Many people on Star Web are speculating that Sky City will issue a blood pact ultimate fight to Connected Beast Park as revenge. Furthermore, Sky City demonstrated incredible power during the blood pact ultimate fight against the Zheng family by killing the veteran thearch-class experts Han Tianhe and Liu Yanshan in an instant. Thus, it will not be shocking if Sky City destroys Connected Beast Park.”","Now, Wen Yu understood what faith power was and understood both of Lin Yuan’s aims.","It did not take long for her to come up with an idea.","But before she brought it up, she had to confirm something with Lin Yuan.","“Young Master, you mentioned that faith power comes from the feelings of worship and admiration. Does this mean that you only need more people to notice this incident and understand more about your power without directly tying it to one of your specific identities?”","Lin Yuan’s eyebrow twitched. Somehow, that made him sound like one of the celebrities from his past that was trying to increase their popularity.","But basically, what she said was right.","“My current identities are the City Lord of Sky City, Black, the combat-class spirit qi professional, and my original identity. When Chimey caused trouble a while ago, Black received a significant amount of faith power as a result of it.”","Wen Yu’s eyes lit up, and she was assured that her idea could work.","Instead of explaining it straight, she guided Lin Yuan so that he would understand the logic behind her idea.","“Young Master, when Pinru and I were setting up Pinru’s Home, we had the idea of using popular influencers on Star Web to promote ourselves once our garments became available. This allowed Pinru and I to gain an understanding of some of the most popular personalities on Star Web. There is a group of them that aren’t outstanding but have legions of fans that will rush to protect them during any scandal that they might face loyally.”","Now, she asked him, “Young Master, have you heard of blind sheep fans? Any respect, admiration, or worship that arises as a result of an incident will only be temporary. It will fade with time and become diluted as other incidents take place. By contrast, blind sheep fans will be able to deepen these feelings.","“During my observation, I discovered that these below average yet popular Star Web influencers like to insert themselves into situations that do not concern them. They constantly place themselves in the spotlight and throw in occasional displays of weakness to attract pity. This enables their fans to link several varieties of emotional ties to them. I think that this concept can be applied to your goal of receiving as much faith power as possible.","“Firstly, I think you should set up a seemingly infallible enemy for the City Lord of Sky City. This enemy should step in to save Connected Beast Park. This way, we won’t have to worry about Connected Beast Park. You said that all your identities are able to receive faith power on your behalf. I think that all your identities can use a boost in exposure.”","If Lin Yuan still did not understand what she meant, he would be a fool.","Connected Beast Park had been eager to cling to him ever since he gave them seven Law Crystals to produce seven new thearch-class experts.","In a quest to secure power in Connected Beast Park, Miao Zhuo and Miao He pestered Lin Yuan all day.","If Sky City helped the Sea Bliss Clan to win their blood pact ultimate fight against Connected Beast Park, the latter would certainly turn to Lin Yuan as their last hope.","If he helped Connected Beast Park by saving them from Sky City’s wrath, he would become their savior.","At that time, everyone from Connected Beast Park would be clamoring to express their gratitude to him, and it would be easier than easy for him to use them to fulfill his goal.","Moreover, by using his identity as the Moon Empress’ disciple to save Connected Beast Park from Sky City, other factions and the general public would assume that the Moon Empress’ disciple was at odds with Sky City.","That was why Wen Yu explained the concept of blind sheep fans to him.","After deliberating this idea, he agreed that it was very feasible."]},{"number":1258,"title":"Chapter 1258 - Distance Between Chef Supreme and Lin Yuan","paragraphs":["By having two of his identities be the cause of the incident, Lin Yuan would be able to reap significant benefits.","Firstly, he would be able to control the event. Secondly, two of his identities would be able to have a large spotlight beating down on them.","As long as the incident persisted, two of his identities would be able to gain an enormous amount of faith power.","Wen Yu was nothing short of a top strategic genius. She was able to solve the issue that Lin Yuan had been butting heads with just a few statements.","Lin Yuan picked up the teapot on the table and brewed a pot of Three Treasures Tea. He added the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus nectar into the tea and ignited the hade-textured agarwood.","“Wen Yu, Zong Ze is coming to visit. He should be here soon. Let’s go and greet him at the entrance together,” said Lin Yuan.","Wen Yu agreed softly before the pair walked toward the mansion’s entrance together.","When Wen Yu was still a spirit attendant, she was always nervous when she had to greet important people like Zong Ze, who was Chef Supreme’s youngest disciple.","But now that she had been by Lin Yuan’s side for some time, her horizons and knowledge had increased by tenfold from a year before.","Given that she spent every day with outstanding younger generation members like Lin Yuan and Liu Jie, Zong Ze dimmed by comparison.","She suddenly remembered that Liu Jie had called this morning and said to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, Big Brother Liu said he would return from the Spirit Guards’ land this afternoon to cook for us. I will call him now to ask him to buy more ingredients.”","The moment the last word left Wen Yu’s lips, a magnetic chuckle sounded out from the space next to Lin Yuan.","“Master’s Dragon Within Pond opened recently. The crabs in the pond are at their fattest and strongest now. I brought several fresh crabs inside my Diamond fey storage box. Let me cook lunch!”","Lin Yuan thought,? Zong Ze must also have a spatial-type fey that enables him to teleport.","When Lin Yuan turned to greet Zong Ze, he immediately sensed that something was wrong.","Zong Ze’s eyes shone with a dim dark red, and there was an aura of an overwhelming desire for battle being suppressed.","Lin Yuan remembered that a curse plagued Zong Ze.","The Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen was produced in the Spirit Lock spatial zone at a quick rate, and a box was filled every two weeks.","Wang Fuxiang went through one box in about 25 days.","Hence, Lin Yuan still had more than enough Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen for Zong Ze.","However, this was not a good opportunity to give the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen to Zong Ze.","Zong Ze had just offered to cook lunch. This meant that he treated Lin Yuan as one of his friends.","Lin Yuan smiled and replied, “I’ve been missing your cooking ever since our last meal. Come in and let’s talk.”","Zong Ze spotted the almost complete Submerged Flood Dragon Lake as they walked into the mansion.","Zong Ze could not help but marvel at the beauty of the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake.","As Chef Supreme’s youngest disciple, Zong Ze had seen more than his fair share of opulent mansions and landscapes.","However, the rainbow lake, half-filled with large lotus leaves that had flower-covered pavilions built atop them, was a testament to the mansion owner’s artistic taste.","The moment Zong Ze entered the mansion, his eyes were drawn to the red sandalwood longevity fish tank.","Unlike the rest of the people who had visited the Return from Faraway Mansion, Zong Ze was not admiring its value but its design.","While Lin Yuan poured a cup of tea for Zong Ze, the latter handed two brocade boxes to Lin Yuan and said, “One of these is my gift to you as a guest. The other is the Wind Crystal Precious Bottle that you asked me to procure.”","Lin Yuan received the two brocade boxes and removed the string of pearls from around his wrist.","He gave it to Zong Ze and said, “Big Brother Zong, take this chain of pearls and use it. You can return it to me whenever you’re done.”","Zong Ze had only intended on borrowing the Heavenly Maiden Sleet pearl from Lin Yuan.","But now that Lin Yuan was handing the chain of 108 heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls to him without hesitation, Zong Ze’s heart skipped a beat.","Since Lin Yuan wore the chain around his wrist, it had to be one of his treasured items.","Zong Ze had intended on taking the fire-type Heavenly Maiden Sleet pearl back with him before using it on the Fiery Sky Hou.","However, he felt that it was inappropriate for him to take Lin Yuan’s treasured item back with him.","Zong Ze summoned the Fiery Sky Hou and said, “Luckily, my Fiery Sky Hou is only one step away from increasing the purity of its bloodline. Why don’t I instruct the Fiery Sky Hou to sense the pure fire-elemental energy inside the two elemental pearls to increase its bloodline’s purity?”","After the Fiery Sky Hou was summoned, it squeaked in greeting at Lin Yuan while perching itself on Zong Ze’s shoulder.","Zong Ze gestured for it to leap onto the table.","Shortly after, a wave of fire-elemental energy flowed out from its body and wrapped around the two Heavenly Maiden Sleet pearls in Zon Ze’s hand.","At this moment, the silhouette of the heavenly maiden inside the pearls seemed to solidify.","Lin Yuan noticed that the fire-elemental energy flowing from the Fiery Sky Hou started to change as well.","With a shake of Zong Ze’s hand, several cooked dishes appeared.","Zong Ze placed the dishes in front of the Fiery Sky Hou and instructed it to consume them to gain pure spirit qi.","These dishes had been made by the Class 5 Creation Master Chef Supreme.","The Moon Empress’ Creation Master path was defined by her concoction of scents, while Chef Supreme’s path was defined by cooking.","Lin Yuan studied the dishes curiously.","He used True Data and found out that the spirit qi within the dishes was about 57% of the concentration of the spirit qi within the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","As such, Lin Yuan discovered the difference between the pure spirit qi concocted by Chef Supreme and that of the Spirit Lock spatial zone."]},{"number":1259,"title":"Chapter 1259 - Fiery Sky Hou’s Bloodline Purified","paragraphs":["At first, Lin Yuan waited for the Fiery Sky Hou to complete the purifying of its bloodline while drinking tea.","But at that moment, something unexpected happened to the Fiery Sky Hou.","Suddenly, its flesh started to split open and raging bursts of fire-elemental energy intermingled with blood energy spilled forth from the cracks.","The fire-elemental energy that was meant to be under the Fiery Sky Hou’s control now became a weapon that was hurting it.","Zong Ze did not look panicked by this development because he knew that it would happen.","Since the dishes cooked by Chef Supreme did not contain a high enough concentration of spirit qi, they were unable to enable the Fiery Sky Hou to evolve its body at the same time as it evolved the fire-elemental energy in its body.","But since the Fiery Sky Hou was a fey with the Barren bloodline that had the ability to control fire, it would be able to endure this.","Due to the insufficient concentration of spirit qi, the Fiery Sky Hou’s bloodline could not be purified to perfection.","Nonetheless, this was a conundrum that all spirit qi professionals who possessed feys with the Barren bloodline had to face.","At that moment, Lin Yuan reached out his hand toward Zong Ze. There were two flower buds in his palm.","“Big Brother Zong, there is extremely pure spirit qi inside these two flower buds. They should be helpful to the Fiery Sky Hou.”","Zong Ze received the flower buds and studied them.","The ever-present stony expression on Zong Ze’s face melted away. Then, his eyes bulged, and he looked utterly astonished.","He raised his head and looked at Lin Yuan with a touched expression as he asked, “Lin Yuan, these flower buds—”","Before Zong Ze could finish speaking, Lin Yuan said anxiously, “Big Brother Zong, if you don’t give the spirit qi to the Fiery Sky Hou now, it will finish its evolution with the flawed spirit qi.”","Zong Ze took a deep breath and stared at Lin Yuan for a moment before throwing the two flower buds at the Fiery Sky Hou and ordering it to consume them.","The Fiery Sky Hou fought against the pain of its body splitting open and leaped over to catch the two flower buds with its mouth.","When the Fiery Sky Hou swallowed the flower buds, its torn skin sealed itself shut, and the glow of a flame ignited at the ends of its fur.","The flame started to spread and elongated the fur of the Fiery Sky Hou.","It released the howl of agony that it had been suppressing.","A red crystallized curved horn grew out of the center of the Fiery Sky Hou’s forehead.","Its exposed fangs also grew longer and were covered by a red transparent substance.","The Fiery Sky Hou’s body had been about the size of two palms. But now, it had grown to a length of one meter.","The Fiery Sky Hou’s changes made Lin Yuan think of the description he had read in the Catalog of Mountains and Seas.","‘Tail like a fan, wide mouth, posture as straight as a board, covered in red fur, long body, savage beast that spits fire.’","When he found out that the contents of the Catalog of Mountains and Seas were not mere legends but actual descriptions of feys with the Barren bloodline, he had been curious about why the Fiery Sky Hou’s description seemed different.","Apparently, it was because the Fiery Sky Hou’s bloodline had not been purified yet.","The Fiery Sky Hou’s appearance now matched the Catalog of Mountains and Seas description.","Zong Ze was over the moon about the Fiery Sky Hou’s changes.","He knew that if it had not been for Lin Yuan’s pure spirit qi, the Fiery Sky Hou’s changes were not solely due to the purification of its fire-elemental energy but also the complete transformation of its body.","Counting the time Lin Yuan had visited Zong Ze’s residence and had given him the Heavenly Maiden Sleetl pearl, Lin Yuan had now provided Zong Ze with two unexpected opportunities.","When he was young, Chef Supreme had told Zong Ze that even the people he regarded as his good friends could put an end to his opportunities and that he needed to treasure the friends that actually provided him with opportunities.","If someone gave him opportunities without asking for anything in return, he would have to marry her if she was female and ask him to be his blood brother if he was male.","Before Zong Ze could mull over Chef Supreme’s words, eight high-grade strange flames shot out from the Fiery Sky Hou’s abdomen.","The eight strange flames swirled around its body in a beautiful dance.","If the Fiery Sky Hou had not been controlling the eight strange flames and preventing them from spreading to the surroundings, all of Lin Yuan’s jade-textured furniture would be burnt to ashes.","Lin Yuan shivered when he saw the eight high-grade strange flames.","During the fight on the Martial Arts Stage, Lin Yuan had witnessed the power of the Fiery Sky Hou’s Strange Fire Eight Refinement.","When Zong Ze used the Fiery Sky Hou to attack a target, it would release the eight strange flames in its abdomen to cause layered damage to the target.","The final attack that hit the target would be the strongest strange flame.","Currently, the Fiery Sky Hou was wielding and purifying the fire-elemental energy in the eight strange flames.","When one of the strange flames was being purified, the flame would take on a crystal hue, and the other seven flames would result in faint waves of heat.","The beautiful red flame twisted the space.","From this, it was evident that the temperature of the high-grade flames had risen significantly.","At this moment, Zong Ze ordered, “Fiery Sky Hou, keep the Red Plum Falling Fire and use Tempering of Fire to temper the Red Plum Falling Fire through the other seven flames.”","The Fiery Sky Hou moved and summoned a flame that looked like a blooming red plum.","The other seven strange flames were immediately attracted to it and sailed into the red plum of a flame.","The Red Plum Falling Fire grew stronger as it consumed the purified strange flames.","After consuming five strange flames, the red plum flowers and frosted snow seemed to appear around the Red Plum Falling Fire.","Lin Yuan thought, ?It looks like Zong Ze wants to use the other seven strange flames to evolve the high-grade Red Plum Falling Fire to top-grade."]},{"number":1260,"title":"Chapter 1260 - Zong Ze’s Sudden Mania","paragraphs":["If the red plum flowers that blossomed and frosted snow that appeared were successful, the Red Plum Falling Fire would be able to turn into a true top-grade strange flame.","Only top-grade flames appeared alongside unforeseen events.","Zong Ze flipped over his hand, and a brocade pouch appeared in his hand.","He opened the brocade pouch, and Lin Yuan saw that it was filled with fire-type Defined Life pearls.","Zong Ze tossed the fire-type elemental pearl to the Fiery Sky Hou one by one so that it could use the pure fire-elemental energy within to nourish and absorb the Red Plum Falling Fire strange flame.","It was not a last-minute decision for Zong Ze to use the Red Plum Falling Fire to consume the other seven strange flames.","The Red Plum Falling Fire was the most effortless strange flame that Zong Ze had encountered.","The Red Plum Falling Fire did not start off as a high-grade strange flame but as a mid-grade strange flame that had a much higher temperature than other strange flames.","As such, Zong Ze instructed the Fiery Sky Hou to use Tempering of Fire to endlessly strengthen the Red Plum Falling Fire until it became a high-grade strange flame.","The high-grade Red Plum Falling Fire did not disappoint Zong Ze.","When the high-grade Red Plum Falling Fire released its absolute temperature, its beauty surpassed that of some top-grade strange flames.","High temperature was the most important factor that Zong Ze required from his fire elements because it would be able to increase the damage power of Heaven Crimson Fire and Life-Changing Fire Beast.","Moreover, the Red Plum Falling Fire’s highest temperature would be able to affect an entire area.","At that moment, Zong Ze’s fists were tightly clenched as he waited with bated breath for the Red Plum Falling Fire’s temperature to rise once it evolved to a top-grade strange flame.","Zong Ze had been afflicted by bad luck ever since he was young and had become accustomed to using his spirit to suppress the boiling battle urge.","Previously, Zong Ze had built a large dam within himself to keep the battle urge at bay.","However, the emotions he felt as a result of what Lin Yuan did caused the dam to tremble.","Now, the sense of hope had cracked the dam even further.","The smallest of things had the biggest of effects. Zong Ze’s battle urge seeped through the cracks and eventually eroded the dam away.","At that moment, red stained the pupils and whites of Zong Ze’s eyes.","With the remnants of his sanity, Zong Ze thought,? Oh no!","He had experienced instances when his battle urge ran rampant.","He would find a place to release his battle urge during such occurrences without holding back until he utterly tired himself out.","Every time his battle urge was loose, he would release most of it so that he would be able to keep his cool for the next two weeks.","But this was Lin Yuan’s mansion, and he would wreck Lin Yuan’s mansion if he released his hold on himself now.","However, he did not have time to continue worrying as his last thread of sanity snapped.","When his battle urge swallowed his conscious mind, Zong Ze let out a beast-like roar.","Wen Yu jumped, and the Fiery Sky Hou stopped strengthening the Red Plum Falling Fire.","Lin Yuan said to Wen Yu, “Don’t worry. I know what to do.”","He said hastily to the Fiery Sky Hou, “Fiery Sky Hou, leave this to me. Calm yourself and continue evolving the Red Plum Falling Fire. Otherwise, all of Zong Ze’s hopes will be dashed. I’m sure you don’t want Zong Ze to wake up and be disappointed that the Red Plum Falling Fire failed to evolve to top-grade.”","Lin Yuan returned to the Spirit Lock spatial zone and grabbed a handful of the mature Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen.","He left the Spirit Lock spatial zone and tossed it at the rampaging Zong Ze.","Zong Ze breathed the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen in. Although his eyes remained red, he quieted down.","Lin Yuan returned to the Spirit Lock spatial zone again and grabbed another handful of Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen.","This time, instead of tossing it at Zong Ze, he crushed and scattered it all over the jade-textured wood on the crane shadowed censer so that the scent would permeate the air.","Lin Yuan placed the crane shadowed censer next to Zong Ze so that the scent would engulf him.","After the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen started to burn, Zong Ze’s battle urge was suppressed, and he could rebuild another dam to keep the battle urge at bay.","Lin Yuan frowned when the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen started to run out.","According to the rate that Zong Ze used up the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen, Lin Yuan could tell that Zong Ze’s bad luck was much more serious than Wang Fuxiang.","Luckily, Zong Ze’s bad luck would eventually be cleared as he continued to use the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds pollen.","However, it would take at least six months and even up to a year.","After Zong Ze regained his faculties, he saw the red plum’s outreached branches changing shape.","As the plum branches continued to stretch, beautiful red plum flowers bloomed and fell in a continuous loop.","The red plum flowers wilted the moment they reached their peak of beauty.","A red flame that looked like a blooming red plum flower burned at the center of the unforeseen event.","However, instead of focusing on the top-grade Red Plum Falling Fire that he had been looking forward to or the worried Fiery Sky Hou, his eyes were fixed on Lin Yuan."]},{"number":1261,"title":"Chapter 1261 - Zong Ze’s Renewed Life","paragraphs":["Ever since he was young, Zong Ze was terrified that the battle urge caused by his bad luck would take control of his mind.","Aside from the burning sensation that came with the battle urge, he had been training to be an expert ever since he was young. As such, he hated not being in control of any situation, much less losing control of his own body.","Not even Chef Supreme knew that this curse resulted in him having nightmares.","Thus, he not only had to suffer through the curse in reality but even had to experience it again in his nightmares until he scared himself awake.","This overwhelming battle urge that took over him had always been an issue to which he could only grapple but could not find a solution.","Ever since he smelled Lin Yuan’s scent at the Guard Ye Banquet, a sweet-smelling figure that could soothe his battle urge started appearing in his nightmares.","This figure made Zong Ze dread his nightmares less.","Just now, he had smelled that fragrance when he had succumbed to the battle urge.","The scent made Zong Ze wonder if he was dreaming.","However, the fragrance was much stronger than it was in his dreams, and it enabled him to regain control over himself.","It was only when he rebuilt the dam to block the surging battle urge that he realized this was real life and not a dream.","Zong Ze did not know what that fragrance was, but he could guarantee that it did not come from Lin Yuan but from something that Lin Yuan possessed.","Zong Ze had visited the Purple Bamboo Forest with Chef Supreme a while ago and heard that the Moon Empress had brought medicine that removed Wang Fuxiang’s bad luck.","Chef Supreme had gone to beg the Moon Empress afterward but had been rejected.","Zong Ze was sure that the fragrant medicine was the same one that the Moon Empress had given Wang Fuxiang.","When Lin Yuan saw Zong Ze looking at him silently, he said, “Big Brother Zong, congratulations on your Red Plum Falling Fire evolving to a top-grade strange flame.”","A surge of warmth flooded Zong Ze’s heart.","The Fiery Sky Hou had communicated to Zong Ze through their spiritual connection about what Lin Yuan did.","Given Zong Ze’s understanding of the Fiery Sky Hou, it would have completely stopped evolving the Red Plum Falling Fire out of concern for him if Lin Yuan had not comforted it.","Lin Yuan had played an important role in the Red Plum Falling Fire evolving to a top-grade strange flame.","Zong Ze remembered Chef Supreme saying that if a man provided him with many opportunities without asking for anything in return, he should regard that person as his blood brother.","But what should he do if that person also saved him from peril?","Zong Ze carried the Fiery Sky Hou and said solemnly, “Brother, words can’t express my gratitude.”","Lin Yuan patted Zong Ze’s shoulder and said, “You already addressed me as Brother. There’s no need to stand on ceremony with me.”","Lin Yuan thought about the Possess Star Intelligent Dark Clouds’ rate of production and the current circumstance of Zong Ze’s curse.","“Big Brother Zong, can you explain your bad luck to me?” asked Lin Yuan.","Zong Ze replied without hesitation, “I was attacked when I was young and nearly died. That was when this bad luck afflicted me. Master has tried many ways to remove my bad luck but to no avail.","“In recent years, the bad luck’s impact has grown stronger. At first, I used to be able to suppress the battle urge for at least four months. But as I grew older and my spirit became stronger, I’m only able to suppress it for a month at most now. Moreover, this is only if nothing triggering takes place during the month.","“Master did a test and found that the battle urge will overcome me three times a month despite my best efforts to suppress it when there are external triggers. ”","A pained expression came over Zong Ze’s face.","This was the memory he hated dredging up the most.","If Lin Yuan had not asked him, he would never choose to reopen this scar.","When he found out that the fragrance came from a medicine that could suppress his bad luck, Zong Ze wanted to ask Lin Yuan about it. He hoped that he would be able to obtain some of the medicine from Lin Yuan since the Moon Empress had rejected Chef Supreme.","If nothing was done about his bad luck, he would be completely engulfed by the battle urge in less than three years and become a mindless battle machine.","Before Zong Ze could ask, Lin Yuan said, “Big Brother Zong, I can help you with your bad luck. However, it will require you to undergo at least half a year and at most a year of treatment.”","Zong Ze froze. He never expected Lin Yuan to offer to cure him of his bad luck.","He had told Lin Yuan that his gratitude could not be expressed through words, and now even more so because it would be an insult to Lin Yuan’s gesture.","If Lin Yuan were able to treat Zong Ze’s bad luck, even if it took decades or could not be cured completely, it would give Zong Ze a renewed life and free him from the torture.","He no longer had to suffer nightmares every night nor be afraid when he was increasing his power that he would one day fall completely prey to the battle urge.","He did not have to be afraid that his efforts to increase his power would harm the people closest to him.","“Brother, if you need me for anything in the future, I will be willing to do absolutely anything.”","Lin Yuan thought of the Spirit Settling Silver Ore vein the Vein Land Imp had discovered at the border of the Divine Wood Federation.","He had thought about recruiting people to turn the Spirit Settling Silver Ore into weapons and selling them.","Although weapons made of the Spirit Settling Silver Ore were used commonly by Creation Masters and would always be in demand, there were not enough Spirit Craftsmen from the Heavenly Craft Pavilion to perform the job."]},{"number":1262,"title":"Chapter 1262 - Lin Yuan and Zong Ze’s Business","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan did not want to create another team for the sole purpose of creating the Spirit Settling Silver Ore weapons because this would expand Sky City’s members to too large of an extent.","Besides the fact that it would require Lin Yuan to invest many resources and effort, he would be at odds with the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s role.","This was not what Lin Yuan wanted.","Moreover, the Vein Land Imp was like a walking mineral vein.","As such, it might be able to discover other mineral veins besides the Spirit Settling Silver Ore vein.","In order to match up with the speed at which the Vein Land Imp dug through the mineral veins, Lin Yuan would have to form a group with more members than a top faction, as not even a top faction would be able to harvest a mineral vein in a short span of time.","After mulling over this problem, he decided to go into the business of the mineral itself.","“Big Brother Zong, I do have something to ask of you. Have you heard of any faction that has a project that requires a large number of minerals?”","Zong Ze raised an eyebrow and thought,? Could Lin Yuan have discovered a mineral mountain? It is forbidden to harvest from mineral veins without permission in the Radiance Federation.","All the mineral veins within a 10,000-kilometer radius of each of the 32 major cities belonged to all the cities collectively, and factions were only allowed to harvest from mineral veins beyond that radius.","Top, veteran, and rising factions had already taken ownership of all the areas not under the jurisdiction of the major cities.","There was barely any cake left to go around.","As for a project that required a large number of minerals, Zong Ze knew of one.","The top faction Furnace Stone Metal had a metal spiritual ingredient role, and their supporter was Chef Supreme.","Hence, Furnace Stone Metal often gave newly discovered mineral mountains to Chef Supreme in exchange for the chance to evolve feys.","Chef Supreme had left these mineral mountains to Zong Ze.","Gu Lang was in a similar situation.","Thus, the two of them had formed a faction specifically meant to harvest minerals from mineral mountains. This faction had close to 10,000 Spirit Craftsmen as its members.","The Creation Master team that Zong Ze had formed provided a large amount of Creation Master resources to this faction annually.","If Lin Yuan had a large number of minerals that he wanted to use up, Zong Ze would be able to take them all.","Zong Ze remembered that he owned half the ownership of this faction and said, “Lin Yuan, Gu Lang and I started a faction seven or eight years ago. The faction only works for the two of us, so it doesn’t even have a name. This faction turns metal spiritual ingredients into weapons and other instruments or molds them into various-sized cubes that can be sold in the market. Why don’t I give you 25% of the ownership, and you can use this faction to handle any metal spiritual ingredient in the future?”","Wen Yu looked shocked when she heard what Zong Ze said.","No matter how busy she was, she never stopped collecting information for Sky City and knew of the faction that Zong Ze and Gu Lang owned and all the resources and finances it possessed.","Although Sky City possessed a sizable amount of resources, it was likely only worth half of what this faction owned.","After all, this faction gained its resources from natural sources.","If Zong Ze was giving Lin Yuan 25% ownership of the faction to Lin Yuan to express his gratitude, Wen Yu felt that it was too much.","No one expressed their gratitude in such a way!","Wen Yu used to be a spirit attendant, but she also could not imagine someone handing out such wealth so easily.","By giving Lin Yuan 25% ownership of the faction, Zong Ze was going the equivalent of Mystic Moon cutting open the Radiant Moon Palace’s money bag and giving it away.","Lin Yuan hastily shook his head and said, “Big Brother Zong, we might be brothers, but you can’t give me shares for nothing! But if you have a faction that can make use of a large amount of metal-type spiritual ingredients, I would like to work with you.”","When Zong Ze seemed intent on giving Lin Yuan the 25% of the shares, Lin Yuan hurriedly added, “I’m sure you won’t take advantage of me if we work together!”","As such, Zong Ze could only say vexedly, “If I work with you, I won’t let you suffer even if I have to suffer myself.”","Lin Yuan thought for a moment before saying, “Big Brother Zong, I was at another land to train. When I was at the other land and found a dimensional rift, I stumbled on a Vein Land Imp. This Vein Land Imp found a Spirit Settling Silver Ore vein. I would like to establish a deal with you based on all the Spirit Settling Silver Ore in the vein.”","Zong Ze thought,? All of these coincidences that happen to Lin Yuan seem almost uncanny!","Not only had Lin Yuan found a Spirit Settling Silver Ore vein but even a Vein Land Imp.","With the Vein Land Imp, Lin Yuan would have countless opportunities to access mineral veins in the future.","Previously, Zong Ze only wanted to help out Lin Yuan. But now, it felt more like Lin Yuan was helping him.","As the mineral veins were continuously harvested, the quantity of minerals within them would reduce.","Additionally, it was difficult to discover new mineral veins. As such, the Spirit Craftsmen in Gu Lang and Zong Ze’s faction only needed to work about six hours a day.","If Lin Yuan could supply them with many mineral veins, the Spirit Craftsmen only had to work longer to generate tremendous wealth.","“Lin Yuan, I said that I’m giving you 25% of the ownership. But after working with you, I think I should give you at least 30%! This number purely came about based on transactional value and not at any other reasons.”","Zong Ze paused for a moment before continuing. “Lin Yuan, do you want to join this faction by taking over some of the shares? If you do, I’ll contact Gu Lang so we can split the shares evenly,”","Lin Yuan found Zong Ze’s suggestion more than acceptable.","This was the most convenient option for him, and he could collect earnings in the future based on the divided shares without much worry.","Hence, he nodded and said, “Fine. Big Brother Zong. Why don’t we call Zong Ze over so we can all talk face-to-face?”","Zong Ze immediately called Gu Lang."]},{"number":1263,"title":"Chapter 1263 - Long Lamplight and An He","paragraphs":["After the call rang for a moment, Gu Lang picked up and said, “Hey, Ze. You said in your last call that you’re going to lock yourself away to train. Are you out already?”","Zong Ze looked shocked when he heard Gu Lang’s voice. It was not the words that Gu Lang said that surprised Zong Ze but the heavy weariness of Gu Lang’s voice.","Moreover, there seemed to be another person talking next to Gu Lang. But the person’s voice had been too soft for Zong Ze to make out what was said.","Before Zong Ze could reply, Gu Lang seemed to pull his phone away and snap at someone. “I’m on the phone. We’ll talk once I’m done!”","The voice silenced itself.","Gu Lang smiled apologetically and said, “Ze, I came to Cold Frost City for some business. I thought that a Class 5 marsh dimensional rift had opened in Cold Frost City, so I came to catch a few Black Marsh Fly Dragonflies. But not only did I come up empty, but I even bumped into An He.”","Zong Ze frowned.","He was calling Gu Lang to discuss the ownership of shares. As such, he had put the call on speaker, so Lin Yuan could hear Gu Lang as well.","Lin Yuan had never met An He, but he was not unfamiliar with the name.","Among the 13 members of royalty in the Radiance Federation, one managed an association that encompassed all of the lifestyle-class spirit qi professionals besides the Creation Master Association.","This member of royalty was Long Lamplight.","Long Lamplight was the most low-profile of all the 13 members of royalty. However, he could not remain completely under the radar because his first disciple was the third Radiance Envoy.","Although Long Lamplight’s first disciple did not have Creation Master talent, he was an extremely talented healing-type spirit qi professional.","An He was Long Lamplight’s youngest disciple. He had powerful healing-type spirit qi professional talent, just like his senior.","An He had also obtained an Order of Radiant Light, which gave him the right to participate in the Radiance Envoy selection two years later.","Although Lin Yuan and An He had never crossed paths, he knew Gu Lang’s temperament well.","Gu Lang was very mild-mannered and would not speak sternly unless he was on his last nerve.","Hence, there had to be a serious wedge between Gu Lang and An He.","“Lang, did you fight with An He again?”","Gu Lang replied vexedly, “We didn’t start fighting, but this meeting caused me to be unable to explore the Class 5 marsh dimensional rift freely. His men stole the sacred source lifeform. Luckily, I managed to obtain three portions of high-grade marsh soil. Otherwise, I would have made this trip for nothing.”","Zong Ze clenched his fist tightly.","Apparently, An He was not on his list of favorite people either.","Gu Lang changed the topic and said, “Ze, what’s up? If you want to vent your battle urge by fighting with me, I won’t be able to make it. I’ll need at least 10 days to reach the Royal Capital.”","Gu Lang was one year older than Zong Ze.","When Zong Ze was young, he was closed off and did not like speaking to others. But after that incident, he started speaking even less.","Hence, it was usually Gu Lang who sought out Zong Ze.","If Zong Ze took the initiative to seek out Gu Lang, nine times out of ten, it would be to ask Gu Lang to fight.","Zong Ze’s expression softened, and he said, “Lang, Ah Yuan has a way to cure my bad luck completely. I won’t ask you to fight me to suppress my battle urges anymore.”","A smile broke out on Gu Lang’s weary face.","When Gu Lang found out that the Moon Empress’ medicine could cure Wang Fuxiang’s curse, he immediately thought of Zong Ze, who was also afflicted by bad luck.","Since the medicine could remove Wang Fuxiang’s bad luck, it would definitely be able to remove Zong Ze’s bad luck as well.","Gu Lang had wanted to mention this to the Bamboo Monarch more than once, but he had not been able to bring himself to raise the topic.","After all, Wang Fuxiang’s bad luck had not been completely removed yet. It would be offensive for him to ask for the medicine.","Now that Gu Lang knew that Lin Yuan could cure Zong Ze’s bad luck, he was over the moon for Zong Ze.","As the disciple of a member of royalty, Gu Lang had been bootlicked by other factions and received special treatment ever since he was young.","It was difficult for him to make friends in such an environment.","The only friend he had made in his childhood was Zong Ze.","During the gathering, Lin Yuan had given the Golden Thearch Bamboo shoot to Gu Lang without any conditions attached, thereby opening up Gu Lang’s future as a Creation Master.","Now that Lin Yuan was going to save Zong Ze, Gu Lang was even more grateful to Lin Yuan than before.","When he heard Zong Ze address Lin Yuan as ‘Ah Yuan’, Gu Lang knew that Zong Ze now regarded Lin Yuan as a brother as well.","Just as Gu Lang was about to express his joy, Zong Ze said, “Lang, I’m at Ah Yuan’s place, and this entire call has been on speaker. I called you to discuss the ownership of shares of our faction.”","Gu Lang assumed that Zong Ze wanted to give part of his shares to Lin Yuan.","He thought about the help that Lin Yuan had given him and said, “Why don’t we each give up 25% of our shares and give them to Ah Yuan?”","Lin Yuan looked exasperated again.","Did all the disciples of bigshots like to give away shares?","Before Zong Ze could respond to Gu Lang, Lin Yuan hurriedly cut in and said, “Big Brother Gu, why do the both of you want to give me shares? Big Brother Zong called to talk about a collaboration. From what you said just now, you seem to be in need of the Black Marsh Fly Dragonflies from the marsh world. I can get a few for you.”","The Black Marsh Fly Dragonfly was a rare marsh dimensional lifeform. It was similar to the Marsh Ground Sphagna in that it could not even defeat a Normal Hundred Questions Beast when it was young.","However, its slow start also meant that it had unimaginable peak potential.","Given enough resources, it would be able to defeat its natural enemy during its adolescence.","The Black Marsh Fly Dragonfly evolved its grade much easier than other dimensional lifeforms."]},{"number":1264,"title":"Chapter 1264 - Zong Ze and Liu Jie’s Competiti on","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan remembered that Gu Lang nurtured the Snake Change Medusa.","It was likely that Gu Lang wanted the Black Marsh Fly Dragonflies because of the Snake Change Medusa’s natural skill. That was the only reason that Lin Yuan could come up with to explain why Gu Lang would want the Black Marsh Fly Dragonflies.","Lin Yuan could enter the marsh world through Klein Hub at any time.","No matter how rare the Black Marsh Fly Dragonfly was, it would be easier for Lin Yuan to search for it than it would be for Gu Lang to wait for Class 5 marsh dimensional rifts to open.","Gu Lang’s exhaustion dropped by half when he heard what Lin Yuan said.","If Lin Yuan could find the Black Marsh Fly Dragonflies, the Snake Change Medusa that Gu Lang had obtained with much difficulty would finally be usable.","Given that this was something Gu Lang truly needed, he did not hold back and said, “Lin Yuan, thank you. The Black Marsh Fly Dragonflies are of great use to me.”","Gu Lang knew that Lin Yuan would not take the shares without giving anything in return.","After all, Lin Yuan had already rejected Zong Ze.","Hence, Gu Lang did not offer to give Lin Yuan shares again. Instead, he used a proper business attitude to discuss the division of shares amongst the three of them.","Eventually, Zong Ze and Lin Yuan took 33.3% of the shares, while Gu Lang took 33.4% of the shares because he put effort into managing the faction’s operations.","When they were done discussing, Zong Ze checked the time and headed to the kitchen to fish out the crabs he had taken from the Dragon Within Pond.","Wen Yu looked at Lin Yuan with admiration.","As the faction manager, she knew how difficult it was to accumulate resources.","Yet, Lin Yuan had managed to seal such an immense deal with a few statements.","While Wen Yu’s eyes were shining, Lin Yuan said to her, “Wen Yu, the shares have been settled. You can communicate with Gu Lang directly in the future.”","Wen Yu smiled and replied, “Don’t worry, Young Master. I will pay close attention to this and make sure I do my best.”","While Wen Yu was speaking, Lin Yuan saw that Liu Jie had returned carrying numerous fresh spiritual ingredients.","But the moment Liu Jie stepped into the house, his nose picked up the aroma of crabs.","He looked at the sofa. He immediately knew that Zong Ze was here when he saw the transformed Fiery Sky Hou.","At first, Liu Jie felt an unexplained animosity toward Zong Ze. Even he had no idea where this animosity was coming from.","During the gathering, Liu Jie and Zong Ze had cooked together and had shown off their cooking skills. They had become friends ever since.","When they ate at Zong Ze’s residence, Lin Yuan had praised Zong Ze’s cooking skills more than once.","Since Zong Ze had cooked Kitchen Fragrance Palace’s secret 300 dishes, all Liu Jie could do was assist Zong Ze.","But today, Liu Jie finally had the chance to compete against Zong Ze.","Now that Zong Ze had started cooking, Liu Jie would follow suit.","This way, he would be able to serve his dish to Lin Yuan alongside Zong Ze so Lin Yuan could decide whose cooking was better.","Lin Yuan scratched his head when he saw Liu Jie make a dash for the kitchen. He could not figure out why Liu Jie was suddenly bursting with energy.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan greatly looked forward to the meal cooked by two amazing chefs.","Lin Yuan had not had one good meal during his trip to the Divine Wood Federation. The meal he had had at the Radiant Moon Palace was also traumatic.","Finally, he could fill his stomach with a delectable feast.","No matter how careful the amazing chefs were, they served up dishes quickly.","Moreover, the only people in the mansion were Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, Liu Jie, and Zong Ze. The Mother of Bloodbath, who had the largest stomach capacity, had gone out to meet its fellow glutton friends.","The Mother of Bloodbath was definitely missing out!","Lin Yuan estimated that Zong Ze and Liu Jie would walk out of the kitchen in less than 40 minutes.","He did not know what took place in the kitchen, but in a shocking result, they used almost the exact same ingredients with only slight differences in cooking methods.","Zong Ze excelled at steaming and stewing, whereas Liu Jie’s forte lay in frying and deep-frying.","Zong Ze steamed the crabs before dousing them in vinegar and cooking them over a small flame.","The crabs freshly caught from a lake in spring were filled with potent sweetness and would leave a hint of spiciness on the tongue. Adding vinegar and cooking them over a small flame would enable the vinegar to seep through the shell and penetrate the flesh while cohesively working with the taste of the flesh itself to produce an incredibly fresh taste.","Zong Ze applied the cooking principle that sourness was king.","Meanwhile, Liu Jie first removed the crab legs before digging out the roe. He used the roe as the base ingredient as he fried it together with other seasonings before adding a spicy touch to tie the ingredients together. Finally, he covered the dish with the crab legs to cook them using the heat rising from the food underneath. This would enable the crab meat to absorb and combine with the fragrance of the seasonings and roe.","Each dish was excellent in its own way, and ranking them would only be a matter of personal taste.","Those who liked lighter flavors would prefer Zong Ze’s dish, while those who liked heavier flavors would go for Liu Jie’s one.","Lin Yuan and Wen Yu were baited by the aromas and failed to notice the competitive aura between Zong Ze and Liu Jie. They also did not think to compare whose cooking skills were better.","While Lin Yuan and Wen Yu tucked in happily, Zong Ze and Liu Jie scrutinized them carefully to see which dish was being cleared quicker.","Wen Yu had a large appetite and usually put away about four bowls of food.","Lin Yuan’s appetite also expanded after he consumed the Earth Center Fine Milk, and his body transformed. His body could now digest food at a rapid rate.","Thus, Lin Yuan and Wen Yu ate almost all of the food.","As they gobbled down the food, Lin Yuan and Wen Yu were embarrassed when they noticed that Zong Ze and Liu Jie practically had not touched their chopsticks at all.","It was only when Zong Ze and Liu Jie declared that they could not eat any more that Lin Yuan and Wen Yu continued shoveling food down their throats without worry.","Zong Ze and Liu Jie could not help but exchange a glance when they saw the clean plates.","They scratched their heads simultaneously.","Now that all the food had been eaten, Zong Ze and Liu Jie’s competitive spirit dissipated as they decided to call it a tie."]},{"number":1265,"title":"Chapter 1265 - Pinnacle of Strange Flame","paragraphs":["At that moment, Lin Yuan said, “Big Brother Zong, did you notice anything different about Ten Thousand Source Hall when you went to collect the Wind Crystal Precious Bottle?”","Lin Yuan asked Zong Ze this as he wanted to know whether anything out of the ordinary was happening with Whale Ocean Commerce.","Whale Ocean Commerce had to know that Ten Thousand Flags Trading had killed Sea Sky Nurture.","It would be very strange if nothing were amiss about Ten Thousand Source Hall.","Moreover, Lin Yuan wanted to find out more about Whale Ocean Commerce.","Since they were one of the top three top factions and were supported by Chef Supreme, Zong Ze, who was one of Chef Supreme’s disciples, should know a lot about them.","Zong Ze did not rush to reply and started to think deeply.","Although he had not known Lin Yuan for long, he knew that Lin Yuan always spoke with intention. One did not need to ponder and puzzle over his true intentions.","Hence, Lin Yuan had to have his reasons for mentioning Whale Ocean Commerce.","While he was thinking, he decided to first tell Lin Yuan about the relationship between Kitchen Fragrance Palace and Whale Ocean Commerce.","“Brother, the relationship between Whale Ocean Commerce and Kitchen Fragrance Palace is very different from what it used to be. They have not come to Kitchen Fragrance Palace to ask for Creation Master resources from Master in three or four years. However, they still provide offerings so that the outside world assumes that they are still close to Kitchen Fragrance Palace.","“If I were to bring up anything special that has happened to Whale Ocean Commerce recently, it would be that Di Wancheng has gained immortal power. Whale Ocean Commerce themselves revealed this piece of news.”","Zong Ze paused for a moment before saying, “As Rhine Lifeform and Cage of Brahma Insects developed over the last few decades with the help of the Moon Empress and Bamboo Monarch’s resources, they must have gained more than one thearch-class expert with immortal power. However, Rhine Lifeform and Cage of Brahma Insects have never revealed any of them. Compared to Rhine Lifeform and Cage of Brahma Insects, Whale Ocean Commerce is exposing itself.","“At the same time, it’s understandable because Di Hao has decided to participate in this year’s Radiance Hundred Sequence selection. Di Wantian only has one son, so Di Hao has secured the title of Young Leader. Di Hao is already 25 years old this year. There can only be one reason he’s suddenly participating in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection after not participating for years. Di Wancheng wants to use the Radiance Hundred Sequence as a stepping stone to the Radiance Envoy selection two years later. This is the only reason to explain why Whale Ocean Commerce is making such a public move after keeping a low profile for so long.”","Lin Yuan immediately felt that something was wrong with Whale Ocean Commerce.","If Whale Ocean Commerce revealed their two experts with immortal power in order to brandish their power and disrupt the balance between the top three top factions, Ten Thousand Flags Trading did not need to wipe out Sea Sky Nurture, which mostly consisted of Creation Masters.","Whale Ocean Commerce’s overall Creation Master resources had been depressed by killing off Sea Sky Nurture.","This seemed the complete opposite of what Di Hao wanted.","The members of top factions usually were not assessed before they participated in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection as they had the support of an entire top faction.","However, every person would have to be thoroughly checked by the Radiance Sacred Hall before they were allowed to participate in the Radiance Envoy selection.","Lin Yuan was not certain if his identity as the City Lord of Sky City would be revealed, but he knew that his identity as Black would not be able to be kept under wraps.","The Radiance Sacred Hall would certainly discover that Ten Thousand Flags Trading had despicably killed Sea Sky Nurture.","A faction’s internal conflict that resulted in murder would have a huge negative impact on that faction if the news were released. There was no way that Di Hao would be able to become a Radiance Envoy with this hanging over him.","Whale Ocean Commerce had to be aware of this.","Hence, it was much more likely that Whale Ocean Commerce was making such big waves, and Di Hao was suddenly participating in the Radiance Hundred Sequence to draw as much attention to these two events as possible to cover up their other shady activities.","But no matter how hard they tried to hide it, Di Hao would not be able to participate in the Radiance Envoy selection two years later.","Whale Ocean Commerce’s high-profile actions had also caught the eye of the members of royalty.","It seemed that Whale Ocean Commerce was, in a roundabout way, trying to stall the two years.","However, Lin Yuan did not understand what good stalling would do. What would they be able to achieve in the next two years?","Regardless, this was only Lin Yuan’s speculation.","From what Zong Ze said, Lin Yuan was sure that Zong Ze had no clue about the specifics of what had taken place within Whale Ocean Commerce.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan had genuinely obtained information from Zong Ze about Whale Ocean Commerce that he had not known before.","In order to find out Whale Ocean Commerce’s endgame, the best option for Lin Yuan would be to understand the collaboration between Whale Ocean Commerce and Connected Beast Park.","In the upcoming blood pact ultimate fight between the Sea Bliss Clan and Connected Beast Park, the latter would fully lean on Lin Yuan’s identity as the Moon Empress’ disciple.","Once they were completely reliant on him, he would be able to use them to learn what was exactly going on with Whale Ocean Commerce.","After lunch, Zong Ze readied himself to bid goodbye to Lin Yuan.","His bad luck was now solved, and the Fiery Sky Hou’s bloodline had been purified.","Since the Fiery Sky Hou’s eight high-grade strange flames had combined into one top-grade strange flame, it could now consume another seven types of strange flames.","Given that it could wield the Red Plum Falling Fire, it was only expected that the Fiery Sky Hou would also be able to control other top-grade strange flames.","If he could gain eight top-grade strange flames, the Fiery Sky Hou’s combat power would shoot upward.","An idea popped into his head.","Since the eight high-grade strange flames had combined together to form a top-grade strange flame, it indicated that top-grade strange flame was the pinnacle of strange flames.","He wondered what would happen if he used the Fiery Sky Hou’s Tempering of Fire to temper and produce eight top-grade strange flames."]},{"number":1266,"title":"Chapter 1266 - The Fortune that Ji Feng Predicted Was Here!","paragraphs":["With this thought, Zong Ze’s motivation swelled.","But even if he was Chef Supreme’s disciple, it was not possible for him to obtain seven top-grade strange flames in a short period.","Hence, his venture into the abyssal world through the Class 6 abyss dimensional rift would be the crux to turn his dream into reality.","He was extremely confident about venturing into the abyssal world as Gao Feng, Long Tao, and Sun Ningxian had all played their roles well. Zong Ze also had no worries about Lin Yuan’s provision of Creation Master resources.","Zong Ze would definitely be able to reap the benefits of the Class 6 abyss dimensional rift.","Even if the faction formed by him, Lin Yuan, and the rest did not manage to find any top-grade strange flames but other factions did, he could approach them and offer resources in exchange for the top-grade strange flames.","The Heaven Crimson Fire and Fiery Sky Hou needed strange flames badly.","When the Class 6 abyss dimensional rift was opened to all the factions, he would be able to increase his power rapidly using the strange flames produced in the abyssal world.","Zong Ze, who had been plagued with the curse ever since he was young, finally realized that looking forward to the future was blissful.","When Zong Ze stood to leave, Lin Yuan hurriedly rose as well to send Zong Ze to the entrance of the mansion.","The moment that Lin Yuan stepped out of the mansion, he saw a yellow avian-type fey with a delicate appearance perched on the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus.","Lin Yuan could tell that it was a type of swallow from the avian-type fey’s scissor-shaped tail and nail-shaped beak.","The yellow avian-type fey looked delighted to be on the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus. Moreover, since his mansion was in the Royal Capital, rarely any wild feys visited.","Lin Yuan instinctively used True Data to check on the yellow swallow.","[Fey Name]: Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow","[Fey Species]: Feathered Swallow/ Swallow","[Fey Grade]: Silver (3/10)","[Fey Type]: Wood","[Fey Quality]: Normal","Abilities:","[Contract Fortune]: Find a plant-type fey with fortune properties and nest there. The Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow’s quality will change to match that of the plant-type fey.","[Fortune Source Drain]: Consume the leaves and flowers of the plant-type fey on which Contract Fortune was used and drain the fortune aura inside the leaves and flowers into the nest. As long as the nest is not destroyed, the fortune aura within it will become increasingly concentrated.","[Explosion of Fortune]: Once the fortune in the nest reaches a certain amount, the nest will start releasing fortune into the surroundings to increase the luck of those who have been blessed.","Exclusive Skill","[Unsullied Swallow]: Before the contract with the fortune plant type fey is removed, the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow cannot form a contract with any type of lifeform. The contracted fortune plant-type fey will be able to share in the fortune aura of the nest.","When he saw the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow’s True Data, Lin Yuan immediately realized that the fortune that Ji Feng had predicted would befall every person in the mansion was here.","This small yellow swallow seated on the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus was the fortune that would shine down on every person in the mansion.","Lin Yuan was shocked by the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow as he had never heard of it. He guessed that it came from a mutation of a certain type of fortune swallow-species fey.","He had come across various fortune feys in his day like the Mountain River Eternal Life Carp he had nurtured.","One of them would be able to protect an entire mountain, river, and all the creatures that lived within them.","But from the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow’s abilities, it was not any weaker than the Mountain River Eternal Life Carp.","In fact, to a spirit qi professional, the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow was much more useful than the Mountain River Eternal Life Carp.","After Lin Yuan witnessed Zong Ze and Wang Fuxiang’s curses, he learned that bad luck truly existed.","But since there was bad luck, there had to be good luck too.","By showering good luck on every person in the mansion, the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow was essentially draping all of them in an armor of good luck and ensuring that they would have good luck accompanying them in all their endeavors.","Lin Yuan watched as the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow started piling twigs together on the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus and thought,? Is the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow planning on creating its nest on the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus?","The Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow was so delicate that Lin Yuan would be left helpless if it did not decide to build its home in the mansion of its own accord.","Its exclusive skill Unsullied Swallow guaranteed that the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow would not be able to form contracts with any other spirit qi professional.","It was common knowledge that fortune feys were difficult to maintain, and forcing them in any way could result in their death.","Moreover, the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow needed to fill its nest with sufficient fortune aura to bless everyone in the mansion with good luck.","Even if the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow were unwilling to build its nest, eat, and stock up on fortune, it would be useless to force it.","Since the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow had reached Silver III, it had to have formed a contract with a fortune plant type fey before.","As for the reason for the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow removing the contract, it had to be that either the fortune plant type fey died or that the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow was interested in another plant type fey.","Nonetheless, the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus was the best choice for the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow as it bloomed often and flourished with thick foliage.","Since the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus was a cinnabar-species fey, it had a naturally clean aura about it.","Moreover, its calming, spirit-gathering, and evil-shielding abilities would make the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow feel comfortable. As such, there was no reason for the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow not to like the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus.","More importantly, the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus was Legend quality. This meant that when the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow used Contract Fortune to form a contract with the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus, the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow would only reach Legend quality.","The evolution of quality was appealing to any fey, and the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow was no exception.","A Creation Master needed to expend a Herculean effort into evolving a fey to Legend quality.","It would be near impossible to find a Legend fey in the wild.","Additionally, the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow did not just need any Legend fey or Legend plant-type fey but a Legend fortune plant-type fey.","The Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow must have searched for a long time before it found the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus.","Lin Yuan felt that no matter what, there was no reason for the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow to turn away the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus."]},{"number":1267,"title":"Chapter 1267 - The Legendary Osmanthus Fey","paragraphs":["The blossoming springtime was slowly turning warm, and people were starting to shed their bulky insulated clothes for thinner garments.","Today’s weather happened to be clear skies, and the puffs of clouds resembled cotton candy laying on the plate that was the sky.","As the sunlight pierced through the fluffy clouds, it did not feel scalding when it beat down on people’s skin. Rather, the warm sunlight reflected off each person and caused them to shine with transparent light.","Lin Yuan was swathed in sunlight as he observed the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow, which peered back at him curiously.","Perhaps it was due to the fact that he had consumed the Earth Center Fine Milk and transformed his body, but the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow was not afraid of him.","It flapped its wings and flew over to his shoulder.","At first, the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow looked like an unassuming yellow swallow. It was only when it spread its wings and took to the air that it was revealed that it had about four or five light superfluous yellow feathers.","One of these superfluous feathers stood out as it was at least five times longer than the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow’s body.","The light yellow superfluous feathers glinted with a crystal hue.","Lin Yuan immediately noticed a deep injury on the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow’s abdomen.","This was unsurprising as an avian-type fey with no attack skills and such an eye-catching appearance would definitely attract the attention of predators. Moreover, the lovely superfluous feathers would also slow down its flying speed.","It was likely that the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow had recently been hunted, and it had flown to the mansion to seek help and healing.","Lin Yuan did not immediately turn to the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow when it landed on his shoulder because he could sense that it had not found solid footing yet, and he could not feel its weight pressing down on his shoulder.","Search VipNovel/C0M on google","He was afraid that turning his head too quickly would scare the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow off.","Lin Yuan silently circulated the Jasmine Lily’s Heal, and vitality flowed from his shoulder to heal the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow’s injury.","After Lin Yuan made this kind gesture, the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow slowly let down its guard.","Lin Yuan finally felt the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow’s weight on his shoulder a moment later. Evidently, it had finally lowered its guard!","Although the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow did not exactly trust him, it was unlikely that it would be startled if he made small movements.","Hence, Lin Yuan slowly turned his head and noticed that the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow was looking at him with its head cocked.","Fear, curiosity, and faint gratitude could be seen in its gaze.","Read more on VjpNovel-C0M","Lin Yuan smiled brightly when he saw the adorable Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow.","A breeze blew by and messed up Lin Yuan’s hair. His hair fell over his eyes, so only his curved lips could be seen.","‘When a young man smiles, a bird of fortune will descend from the sky.’","The young man’s smile looked like a painted portrait beneath the sun.","Wen Yu, Liu Jie, and Zong Ze were unspeakably taken aback by this scene.","The three of them all felt that his features had suddenly become more exquisite.","At first, they thought that it was only their imagination. But after taking a closer look, even Wen Yu and Liu Jie, who saw Lin Yuan often, were certain that his appearance had transformed.","Please reading on VjpNovel,C0M","Both his features and bone structure had noticeably changed.","Such changes were usually due to an improvement in the genetic model. As such, it was evident that Lin Yuan’s genetic model had improved during his overnight stay at the Radiant Moon Palace.","Zong Ze, Liu Jie, and Wen Yu all felt pressure come crashing down on them","Lin Yuan suddenly recalled a legend as he looked at the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow.","If the legend was true, it was not the people at the mansion or the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow that would benefit the most but the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus.","According to legend, the number one fortune osmanthus fey was the Crimson Jade Osmanthus, which mutated from the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus.","In the past, this legend had led to crazy inflation in the price of the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus of upward of five times its original price.","But in the end, all the hopeful people who had bought the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus to evolve it into the Crimson Jade Osmanthus had ended up sorely disappointed as the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus stubbornly refused to show any signs of mutation no matter what was used to coax it.","That was until one Class 4 Creation Master discovered that the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus’ flowers would turn redder when it absorbed fortune aura, indicating that fortune aura would be able to trigger its evolution.","By that time, the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus’ value had fallen after the widespread failure of its mutation.","When the Class 4 Creation Master posted his findings in a thesis on Star Web, those who had bought the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus with the dream of nurturing it into the Crimson Jade Osmanthus started cursing profusely.","Fortune aura was fundamental to fortune feys’ evolution and one of the reasons they were so expensive.","If the fortune power within fortune feys were extracted, it would be as good as killing the fortune feys.","If those who had bought the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus had the disposable income to buy large numbers of fortune feys, they would not have to try to garner wealth through evolving the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus in the first place.","Eventually, the hype surrounding the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus cooled.","The Class 4 Creation Master who had made the discovery broke his bank to buy fortune feys to extract their fortune aura and prove his finding.","Each time the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus absorbed a certain amount of fortune aura, it would transform.","Unfortunately, even after extracting the fortune aura of over 1,000 fortune feys, the Class 4 Creation Master failed to trigger the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus’ evolution into the Crimson Jade Osmanthus.","The Class 4 Creation Master ended up chopping down the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus and posting the video of the chopping onto Star Web, turning himself into the laughingstock of the year.","At that time, Lin Yuan had not started using Star Web. However, mocking comments about the Class 4 Creation Master had been posted on forums that Lin Yuan frequented. Hence, he was aware of this incident.","Through the sea of knowledge that Genius had gained, Lin Yuan could guarantee that fortune aura would be able to incite the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus to evolve. Its appearance changes after absorbing fortune aura were proof of this.","Lin Yuan guessed that the Class 4 Creation Master had failed because he had not used enough fortune power.","Once the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow made its nest in the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus and used its ability to share fortune aura with the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus, the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus would have the opportunity to evolve eventually.","Lin Yuan would gain another mountain of wealth to mine if the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus could truly evolve into the number one of the ten fortune osmanthus feys the Crimson Jade Osmanthus."]},{"number":1268,"title":"Chapter 1268 - Fortuitous Guest is Staying","paragraphs":["The Crimson Jade Osmanthus’ flower sap could slow aging and whiten skin.","When the Crimson Jade Osmanthus’ nectar was applied to one’s face for an extended period, it could enable one to regain the appearance of a 20-year-old.","This effect was enough to drive any female spirit qi professional crazy.","However, it was still unconfirmed if the legend was true that the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus could evolve to the Crimson Jade Osmanthus.","Regardless, the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus’ evolution was a good thing.","Since Wen Yu was a Class 2 Creation Master, she could not immediately see the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow’s abilities.","On the other hand, Zong Ze was almost a Class 4 Creation Master.","The moment he realized how special the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow was, he immediately stopped Liu Jie and Wen Yu and told them to remain calm.","When he saw the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow let down its guard with Lin Yuan, Zong Ze said, “Ah Yuan, congratulations on having such a fortuitous guest visit your mansion.”","Lin Yuan replied with a smile, “I have you to thank as well. If you hadn’t decided to leave at the right time, this little fella and I wouldn’t have been able to cross paths.”","Lin Yuan was not speaking superficially but rather voicing his true thoughts.","The Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow’s abdomen was injured, but the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus’ abilities could only target the spiritual level. Hence, it would not be able to heal the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow’s physical injury.","In order to speed up the healing of the injury, it was likely that the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow would leave the mansion to find a way to heal itself.","Even if the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow imprinted on the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus and came back eventually, it was likely that the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow’s superfluous feathers would attract trouble to it.","If the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow died someplace else, all the fortune that was supposed to descend on the mansion’s people would be gone.","After sending Zong Ze off, Lin Yuan activated the Source Sand.","The Source Sand produced many black feathers that formed a pair of wings on Lin Yuan’s back.","Lin Yuan flapped the wings and carried the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow with him to the main branch of the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus.","He determined the most stable spot on the branch and tried to grab the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow from his shoulder.","But before his hand even touched the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow, it hopped onto the branch itself.","Lin Yuan realized that although the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow was no longer wary around him, he still needed to maintain a safe distance from it.","Lin Yuan did not mind this and picked some suitably-sized branches and used one of his feathers to cut the branches into seven or eight-centimeter twigs.","He used these branches to create a simple nest before returning to the ground and retracting the black feathers.","Lin Yuan knew that the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow would not live in the nest he had built. Still, he had done so as a gesture to show the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow that it could live comfortably without a worry in the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus.","He also wanted it to know that it could go to him if it had any problems.","The Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow was an exceedingly cautious avian-type fey and would not build its nest while being watched.","As such, Lin Yuan dragged Liu Jie and Wen Yu back into the mansion.","When Lin Yuan saw Liu Jie and Wen Yu’s astonished expressions, he explained the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow’s abilities to the confused pair.","Liu Jie and Wen Yu did not expect such a huge opportunity to unfold right under their noses.","If Lin Yuan had not discovered this opportunity and Zong Ze stopped them from doing anything, they might have accidentally scared it away.","Liu Jie thought,? It truly is easier for Creation Masters to seize opportunities.","Meanwhile, Wen Yu once again realized how vast the gap between her and Lin Yuan’s Creation Master levels was.","She needed to touch feys in order to sense their abilities, while Lin Yuan only needed to look at them.","After night descended, Lin Yuan walked out of the mansion with light footsteps and saw that the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow had kicked the nest he had made to the ground.","A nest made of broken branches and light yellow feathers sat where the nest he had made used to be.","Lin Yuan did not disturb the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow that was happily consuming the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus’ nectar and turned to return to the mansion to hit the sack.","The next morning after breakfast, Lin Yuan went to Star Web and saw Qi Heng and Qi Haitao, who had been waiting for a day.","He put on a resolute face and cut straight to the chase. “Yesterday, the two of you told me to make any request I want and promised to fulfill it. Does that still stand?”","Qi Heng and Qi Haitao exchanged a look, and Qi Heng took a step forward and said, “City Lord, you’re right. Please feel free to make any request you want. The Sea Bliss Clan will do our best to meet your request.”","While Qi Heng spoke, he kept a smile hanging off his face. Yet, his gaze was stony.","From the way Lin Yuan spoke, Qi Heng could tell that Lin Yuan had lost patience with the Sea Bliss Clan and was definitely not going to give the Sea Bliss Clan any room for negotiation.","He was exactly right as Lin Yuan said, “If so, give all of the Sea Bliss Clan’s properties and resources to Sky City. As the City Lord of Sky City, I promise you that I will win the blood pact ultimate fight against Connected Beast Park on your behalf, thereby allowing you to continue living. You can decide what you will do from then on yourselves. Regardless, you just have to hand over everything the Sea Bliss Clan has to me.”","Qi Heng was dumbfounded by what Lin Yuan said.","He had assumed that Lin Yuan would allow every person from the Sea Bliss Clan to remain there at least to continue managing the Sea Bliss Clan.","However, Lin Yuan had deemed every member of the Sea Bliss Clan as useless and only wanted the resources.","This meant that even if Sea Bliss Clan won the blood pact ultimate fight against Connected Beast Park, they would still be kicked to the streets.","Qi Heng anxiously said, “City Lord, why don’t you—”","But before he could finish speaking, Lin Yuan cut in and said, “The condition I stated is my final offer. If you find it unacceptable, you can face the blood pact ultimate fight against Connected Beast Park yourselves. Once your blood pact ultimate fight is over, Sky City can just issue another blood fight ultimate fight challenge to Connected Beast Park. Then, all your resources will still be mine. Meanwhile, I’m sure you’re aware of what state all of you will be in.”","Lin Yuan stood up and looked as though he was about to leave.","Qi Haitao instantly fell to his knees and spoke to Lin Yuan."]},{"number":1269,"title":"Chapter 1269 - Possibility of the Floating Island Whale’s Early Hatching","paragraphs":["“City Lord, we see your requests and will do everything as you say. However, I have a piece of news. May I trade this information with you for enough resources that will allow the Sea Bliss Clan to rebuild?”","Lin Yuan lowered his head to look at the kneeling Qi Haitao. He became interested as Qi Haitao had to have a big piece of news to muster up enough courage to propose a trade.","“If this news is valuable, I will give the Qi family 5,000,000 Radiance dollars to rebuild when you leave the Sea Bliss Clan,” said Lin Yuan nonchalantly.","Qi Haitao’s eyes flashed.","The last time he had come to Sky City’s Star Web private faction territory, he had been discussing business with the City Lord as an equal.","But now, they were desperate beggars before the City Lord.","It was not up to Qi Haitao but Qi Heng whether he would accept Lin Yuan’s offer.","As such, Qi Haitao fixed his gaze on Qi Heng.","Qi Heng nodded helplessly.","The source of information came from the few islands that the Sea Bliss Clan had bought.","Sky City would discover this secret once they took possession of the islands. If they revealed it now, they would be able to receive resources in return. Hence, this was the best option.","However, 5,000,000 Radiance dollars was too little. One Bronze/Epic fey was already worth 30,000,000 Radiance dollars.","Given that Qi Heng was a Class 4 Creation Master, he would be able to generate 5,000,000 Radiance dollars’ worth of income in one or two days.","Essentially, he could not accept Lin Yuan’s offer.","However, Qi Heng knew that the Sea Bliss Clan was in no position to negotiate with the City Lord of Sky City. If he tried to negotiate and ended up aggravating the City Lord, he might decide not to help the Sea Bliss Clan at all. The Sea Bliss Clan would be well and truly finished if that happened.","Qi Haitao said, “City Lord, a huge whale fall took place not long ago near the islands our Sea Bliss Clan bought.”","Lin Yuan’s eyes immediately widened.","Damn! What was going on? Why was he running into one opportunity after another these days?","A whale fall was a naturally-occurring source of nourishment for the ocean.","One small whale fall would be like a feast to the creatures on the seafloor, much less a large one.","When hundreds of whales died, and their carcasses were left at the bottom of the seafloor, it would result in an unimaginable amount of nourishment for the ocean. It would be enough to turn the area into a super fish farm for deep-sea fish-species feys. Any fish-species fey living in the area would grow up rapidly.","As the carcasses of the whale-species feys decomposed, the currents would propel a large amount of nourishment to the surface of the sea. This nourishment could even trigger mutations in the aquatic feys living at the surface of the sea.","However, a large whale fall was not solely beneficial for fish-species feys but could even provide a major opportunity for the Floating Island Whale in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","If Qi Haitao was speaking the truth, his Floating Island Whale could use this opportunity to use the energy from the whale fall and hatch sooner than expected.","He would also be able to obtain many unhatched Island Whales from where the whale fall was.","Lin Yuan looked at Qi Haitao solemnly and said, “If you’re telling the truth and there truly is a large whale fall near your islands, I can promise to keep the Qi family safe for three years. Three years is enough time for the Qi family to rise from the ashes and start another rising faction. At that point, your enemies will have to issue another blood pact ultimate fight challenge to you if they want to go after you. This way, you’ll have time to prepare.”","Qi Haitao and Qi Heng were utterly confused as they did not understand what Lin Yuan meant.","Once Sky City destroyed Connected Beast Park, the Qi family would still retain their combat power despite losing all their resources.","It was impossible that anyone would target them at that point.","Hence, both Qi Haitao and Qi Heng did not take Lin Yuan’s words seriously.","Nonetheless, they both looked at Lin Yuan with gratitude.","Now that the matter was settled, Qi Heng and Qi Haitao prepared themselves to leave.","But, Lin Yuan said, “Connected Beast Park has struck up a relationship with Whale Ocean Commerce, and they are currently working together. You must have heard that Whale Ocean Commerce already has two experts with immortal power.","“Don’t reveal the news that Sky City is helping the Sea Bliss Clan with the blood pact ultimate fight. It’ll be best if only the two of you know and return home acting as though Sky City rejected you. The more people are involved, the looser their lips will be. If the Sea Bliss Clan leaks the news and Connected Beast Park catches wind of it, they can go to Whale Ocean Commerce for help. If that happens, your ending can only be death even if Sky City helps you.”","Qi Haitao and Qi Heng immediately understood what Lin Yuan meant.","The Sea Bliss Clan was currently a wreck, and some might have joined the Miao family secretly.","If Connected Beast Park heard about this, the results would be disastrous.","However, Lin Yuan’s tone was too merciless! He only mentioned that the Qi family would end up dead. Wouldn’t the thearch-class experts dispatched by Sky City to help the Sea Bliss Clan be killed too? Or could it be that the City Lord did not care if his faction’s thearch-class experts lived or died? Was it because Sky City had so many thearch-class experts that it did not matter if a few died? Or was it that the City Lord was just downright evil?","The misunderstood Lin Yuan was not afraid of Connected Beast Park seeking help from Whale Ocean Commerce at all.","This was because he had received word from the Invisible Demon before he came to Star Web that it hoped to go through the Source-type Cleansing as soon as possible to evolve into a Class 12 dimensional lifeform.","There was only one day left before the blood pact ultimate fight between the Sea Bliss Clan and Connected Beast Park, which was more than enough time for the Invisible Demon to go through the Source-type Cleansing.","Thus, the Invisible Demon would have reached immortal level when it was helping the Sea Bliss Clan with their blood pact ultimate fight.","Even if the news was leaked at that time and Connected Beast Park went to borrow immortal experts from Whale Ocean Commerce, the Invisible Demon would still stand a fighting chance.","Lin Yuan would recall it back into his shadow if it really could not hold out.","Given the Invisible Demon’s hidden abilities, even experts of the same level who were skilled at investigating Immortal Breed feys would find it difficult to detect the Invisible Demon."]},{"number":1270,"title":"Chapter 1270 - The Invisible Demon is About to Transform","paragraphs":["Even if the news that Sky City was helping the Sea Bliss Clan in their blood pact ultimate fight was leaked and Connected Beast Park went to borrow experts with immortal power from Whale Ocean Commerce, Lin Yuan would not be afraid.","Qi Heng hurriedly said, “Don’t worry, City Lord. It is the Sea Bliss Clan’s greatest honor to receive your help. Naturally, we won’t cause Sky City any trouble. When we return home, I’ll say that Sky City rejected our plea for help. I’ll fill in three random names on the list of members who’ll be participating in the blood pact ultimate fight. When Lord Gu Han asks if these are the confirmed participants, I’ll swap out Haitao at the last minute with your expert. I’ll also be able to use the opportunity to see which members of the Sea Bliss Clan are loyal.”","At this point, Qi Heng no longer cared about the Sea Bliss Clan’s original honor. Instead, he was focused on coming up with a way to rebuild after the blood pact ultimate fight.","This disaster would also be the Sea Bliss Clan’s touchstone through which Qi Heng would be able to look into the hearts of all the members of the Sea Bliss Clan.","Connected Beast Park had issued the blood pact ultimate fight to the Sea Bliss Clan because Qi Wangyang was too arrogant to see the situation for what it was.","Even if Connected Beast Park lost two thearch-class experts to Sky City and received crushing public criticism from the public afterward, the Sea Bliss Clan was a mere veteran faction that should never provoke the top-faction Connected Beast Park under any circumstances.","Yet it was ironic that as the leader, Qi Wangyang did not understand that even if the elites were somehow slipping, they would still remain as his betters.","Qi Haitao’s adaptable nature made him appear more suited to be the Sea Bliss Clan’s leader in Qi Heng’s eyes.","Qi Wangyang should have taken responsibility for his mistake after that incident.","A few days after Qi Wangyang went after Connected Beast Park, Qi Heng became certain that it was not Connected Beast Park that had bought up all the Aurora pollen on the market.","Connected Beast Park was always at odds with Condense Fairy Orchard, and plant-type feys were Condense Fairy Orchard’s role.","Thus, Connected Beast Park did not have much authority in the plant-type fey market.","After some investigation, Qi Heng unearthed that Condense Fairy Orchard was the one who had been controlling the supply of spiritual ingredients like Aurora pollen and using their expansive storage to create the farce that there was still sufficient Aurora pollen in the market.","This was why the Sea Bliss Clan, who had been focused on their far-off fish farms, did not notice that something was off about the supply of Aurora pollen in the market.","Qi Heng also realized that besides Condense Fairy Orchard, the Purchase With No Loss store, which was popular on Star Web, was also involved.","This Star Web store used blind trading to secretly increase their store of Aurora pollen.","There was no point for a faction to buy so much Aurora pollen unless it bred Angelfish of Bliss. Moreover, even if they did breed Angelfish of Bliss, they would not require such a humongous amount of Aurora pollen.","Additionally, it was not easy to store Aurora pollen as it would get moldy after two years.","If a fey as delicate as the Angelfish of Bliss consumed moldy Aurora pollen, it would quickly fall sick and die.","Hence, it was all but certain that the shortage of Aurora pollen in the market was part of a scheme conducted by both the Purchase With No Loss store and Condense Fairy Orchard.","After Qi Heng found this out, he had not even had time to become enraged at Condense Fairy Orchard, and the Purchase With No Loss store before Connected Beast Park issued a blood pact ultimate fight challenge to the Sea Bliss Clan.","Now that Sky City’s City Lord promised to help the Sea Bliss Clan, the matter was all but settled.","Qi Heng thought that he would move on to hating Condense Fairy Orchard and the Purchase With No Loss store. However, he felt intense terror instead.","Despite all that had happened to Condense Fairy Orchard over the last few years, they still steadfastly held onto their status as a top faction. This meant that they had to have a thearch-class expert holding down the fort.","Moreover, the Sea Bliss Clan had personally witnessed Sun Ningxiang standing amongst the disciples of the members of royalty at the Guard Ye Banquet.","No matter how brave Qi Heng was, he would not dare to cross such a person.","Since Condense Fairy Orchard was willing to collaborate with the Purchase With No Loss store, it meant that there was an extremely important person behind the Purchase With No Loss store.","It was also no secret that Condense Fairy Orchard and Sky City were on good terms.","If Qi Heng went after Condense Fairy Orchard for revenge, Sky City might step in to end the already doomed Qi family to protect Condense Fairy Orchard.","Qi Heng only hoped that Condense Fairy Orchard and the Purchase With No Loss store would let the Sea Bliss Clan off when they tried to rebuild and stop scheming against them.","He was even willing to personally beg Condense Fairy Orchard and the Purchase With No Loss store for forgiveness if they felt that the problem lay with him.","At the brink of life and death, Qi Heng realized that even a veteran faction that he had been proud to be a part of was actually much less impressive than he had initially thought. If they crossed people they had no business crossing, they would be wiped from existence as well.","Now that Qi Heng understood what he meant, Lin Yuan gave the order to kick them out.","Lin Yuan’s focus was on the Invisible Demon’s imminent breakthrough.","If the Invisible Demon could evolve to Class 12, Lin Yuan would finally gain immortal power under his control. This would allow Lin Yuan to do whatever he wanted in the future without needing the Moon Empress’ help.","Immortal power was considered peak combat power in the Radiance Federation.","Moreover, the Invisible Demon would not just be evolving to a Class 12 dimensional lifeform. When 9,900 units of source-type power was used on the Invisible Demon during its Source-Type Cleansing, its life would reach a whole new level.","Once the Invisible Demon became an Apostle, it would gain a second natural skill, and both its power and abilities would be transformed.","When Qi Haitao and Qi Heng left Sky City’s private territory, Lin Yuan removed the access prohibitions and left Star Web.","He returned to his room and flashed himself into the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan said to the waiting Invisible Demon, “Shadow, I’ve prepared the source-type power needed for your Source-Type Cleansing. From now on, it’s all on you. Given my current power, I might not be able to help even if you run into danger during the transformation.”"]},{"number":1271,"title":"Chapter 1271 - Hardworking Army of Hundred Questions Beasts","paragraphs":["The Invisible Demon was so excited that it fell to its knees and said, “I’m privileged to receive your source-type power. I definitely won’t disappoint you and successfully evolve to Class 12.”","After all the time they had spent together, Lin Yuan knew that the Invisible Demon was very cautious and would not attempt to do anything that it did not have the confidence to achieve.","Otherwise, it would have jumped at the chance to go through the Source-Type Cleansing the last time Lin Yuan offered instead of waiting until it could evolve to Class 12 and use the Source-Type Cleansing to kill two birds with one stone.","But now that the Invisible Demon was taking the initiative to ask for the Source-Type Cleansing, it meant that it was confident it would succeed.","Lin Yuan had asked White Speak if dimensional lifeforms would encounter any risk when they evolved from Class 11 to Class 12.","White Speak had responded that there was a chance the evolution would fail. But even if it did fail, it would not result in death.","Hence, Lin Yuan had nothing to worry about now.","He took the Invisible Demon into the marsh world through Klein Hub so that it would be able to evolve its class in the marsh world.","It was not convenient to take the Invisible Demon into the abyssal world to evolve its class. But at least the marsh world was also a dimensional world, and it would still be a better choice than the main world.","When Lin Yuan entered the marsh world, he realized that only two days had passed.","In the distance, someone had already planted several fruit trees. It seemed that his words had an effect on the Spirit Craftsmen.","It just so happened that in the past two days, Lin Yuan had found the time to produce the Bronze/Epic feys requested by the Spirit Craftsmen.","It was effortless on Lin Yuan’s part to produce Bronze/Epic feys, and it did not take a long time either.","The only part which took more time was producing the Bronze/Legend fey for Liu Tong.","One of the Medusa Snake Demons was currently planting decorative plants on the Marsh Ground Sphagna not far off from Lin Yuan.","He decided to call it over and instruct it to fetch Liu Tong so that he could give all the Bronze/Epic feys to Liu Tong to hand out.","At first, he thought that the Medusa Snake Demons would be terrified of him and it would be difficult to communicate with them.","Yet, when he called out to the Medusa Snake Demon, it looked at him with admiration and respect. Lin Yuan found this slightly odd.","He had not spent any time in the marsh world connecting with the Medusa Snake Demons in just two days. So why wasn’t it afraid of him?","What had happened was that when Lin Yuan left for the Spirit Lock spatial zone the last time he was in the marsh world, news that he was a Dictator spread like a wildfire amongst the Medusa Snake Demons in the territory.","To these Medusa Snake Demons, Apostles were already magnificent in their eyes, much less the legendary Dictator.","These Medusa Snake Demons could not believe how lucky they were to be able to live in the same territory as the Dictator and be able to gaze upon the Dictator’s face so often.","After receiving Lin Yuan’s instruction, the Medusa Snake Demon acted as though it had just received an order from a god and immediately stopped what it was doing to slither away toward where the Spirit Craftsmen were working solemnly.","Lin Yuan turned and entered the breeding room where the 50 Hundred Questions Beasts were working.","The breeding room looked very bare and unimpressive. However, the space was extremely large.","One Hundred Questions Beast could take up about 100 square meters of space, and the room was also equipped with top Creation Master instruments.","When Lin Yuan checked on the Hundred Questions Beasts’ progress, he was not disappointed by a single one of them.","Almost every Hundred Questions Beast produced five bottles of Grade 3 spirit fluid in two days.","The fat ginger cat had produced seven bottles of Grade 3 spirit fluid.","This amounted to a total of 281 Grade 3 spirit fluids in two days. Lin Yuan was extremely satisfied with this productivity.","After he set up some cat toys in the breeding room, Lin Yuan left the breeding room.","When he stepped out of the breeding room, he ran into Liu Tong, who was covered in mud and standing with ramrod straight posture 20 meters away from the structure.","Liu Tong rushed up to Lin Yuan and said with a big grin, “Lord, in less than a week, we’ll be done with the construction of the lightroom that your cat fey asked us to build.”","Lin Yuan reached out his hand to brush some of the mud off of Liu Tong’s chest and mud as he replied, “Liu Tong, try to put more thought into the construction. Here, these are the feys all of you requested. I’ve brought all of them with me with time.”","He handed a Diamond fey storage box to Liu Tong.","Lin Yuan was aware of the lightroom that Liu Tong spoke of. This was a job that Genius had given the Spirit Craftsmen the last time it came into the marsh world to plant Soldier Ration Radishes.","The lightroom would aid in the Soldier Ration Radish’s growth. Hence, it was the best option to halt all other work and focus on building the lightroom first.","Liu Tong was shocked by what Lin Yuan said, and he dared not receive the Diamond fey storage box.","It was no lie that he was delighted by this. As the one who was going to receive all the benefits first, he was undeniably happier than the other Spirit Craftsmen because he was receiving a Bronze/Legend fey instead of a Bronze/Epic fey.","But at the same time, he felt more shocked and touched than happy.","In two days, the City Lord he had pledged his loyalty to had produced 34 Bronze/Epic feys and one Bronze/Legend fey.","This was not just an injection of resources but also proof that the City Lord he had pledged his loyalty to did not look down on them just because they were only Spirit Craftsmen.","Instead, he kept his promise to them and fulfilled it in the shortest time possible.","This feeling of being respected caused Liu Tong’s heart rate to speed up.","When Liu Tong did not receive the Diamond fey storage box, Lin Yuan shook his wrist and said, “Take a look and see if there are any problems with any of the feys. If any problems are discovered when you’re handing them out, report them to me. There are some feys whose bloodlines mutated during the evolution, and so they differ from the original request. However, all the mutations and evolutions are positive, so I didn’t swap any of them out.”","Liu Tong immediately realized that he was frozen."]},{"number":1272,"title":"Chapter 1272 - Invisible Demon Transformed into a Hornet’s Nest","paragraphs":["Liu Tong hurriedly received the Diamond fey storage box and thought,? I wonder who the lucky ones are to receive feys that underwent positive mutations.","It was rare for Bronze grade feys to undergo positive mutations, and it would delight any person to know that this had happened to one of their feys. No one would turn away a fey that had undergone a positive mutation.","After Lin Yuan finished speaking to Liu Tong, the latter took the Diamond fey storage box with him and went back to work.","The Kill Food Sky Butterfly flew over to Lin Yuan and said, “Young Master, Wendy, Rising Lizard, and White Pavilion aren’t in the territory. They’ve gone out to train. If you need them for anything, I’ll bring them back to you immediately.”","Lin Yuan shook his head.","Since Wendy, Rising Lizard, and White Pavilion were all Apostles, they should not remain idle but go out to train whenever they could.","Moreover, Lin Yuan did not have any business with them this time and did not need to call them over.","The last time Lin Yuan had spoken to White Speak, he found out how the marsh region was divided.","Lin Yuan silently set the Marsh East Palace as the battleground of the marsh world.","Hence, he needed the Apostles under his wing to grow up as soon as possible.","“Kill Food Sky Butterfly, let them continue to train. I won’t call them back unless something urgent comes up. By the way, how has the recovery of your bloodline been coming along?”","“Thanks to the earth-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls you gave me, my bloodline has healed completely. Moreover, I still need some time to get used to my Sovereign power. But it will take some time before my power increases again in the future by undergoing a new Trial of World Creation.”","The Kill Food Sky Butterfly sounded slightly frustrated, and it could not help but let out a sigh.","Given that it possessed one of the top three bloodlines amongst butterfly-species feys, the Kill Food Sky Butterfly had always felt responsible for the rate at which its power increased.","During its time in the marsh world, it had seen how dimensional lifeforms increased their power and realized how much more difficult it was for feys to increase their power.","The dimensional lifeforms that increased their class through consuming flesh reminded the Kill Food Sky Butterfly of back when it was the Kill Food Worm. Now that it had transformed into the Kill Food Sky Butterfly, it could not use the same methods it did when it was the Kill Food Worm to increase its power.","The Kill Food Sky Butterfly had thought about asking Lin Yuan for some Law Crystals.","It had used many Law Crystals to force its power to increase to the level of Creation Breed. However, it was Lin Yuan who had given it the Law Crystals. Now, it was thinking about asking Lin Yuan instead.","The Kill Food Sky Butterfly was too embarrassed to bring itself to ask.","At that moment, Lin Yuan gave the Kill Food Sky Butterfly a small wooden chest. When it opened the wooden chest, it was almost blinded by the light of all the Law Crystals within.","“There are 2,000 Law Crystals here. Use them. Once you’re done, you can ask Purple Afterglow to inform me to prepare more for you. I’ll continuously provide you with Law Crystals until you reach Creation V. Once you reach Creation V, you’ll need World Crystals to increase your power. As of now, it’s slightly difficult for me to obtain World Crystals. Hence, you’ll have to work hard on your own once you reach Creation V.”","Lin Yuan could not help but think back to the World Source Crystal and two World Crystals he had given the Sacred Source Wielding Queen.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was already done absorbing the World Source Crystal, but it needed seven days to absorb each of the World Crystals.","The Miao family had sacrificed two World Crystals to Lin Yuan in order to save Zheng Kaiyuan and Miao Zhi. One of the World Crystals came from the Sovereign I/Creation I Sacred Cure White Deer while the other came from the Sovereign III/Creation II Submerged Sea Blue Whale.","After the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was done absorbing the World Source Crystal, it would definitely be more interested in absorbing the Sacred Cure White Deer’s World Crystal first because it had never absorbed a wood-type law or World Crystal before.","But in the end, Lin Yuan had decided to instruct the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to absorb the Submerged Sea Blue Whale’s World Crystal first.","Lin Yuan had the healing-type fey Jasmine Lily which fulfilled most of his healing needs.","Thus, regardless of the Sacred Cure White Deer’s World Crystal having strategic significance,","Lin Yuan wanted the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to absorb it after it absorbed the Submerged Sea Blue Whale’s World Crystal first.","There was an endlessly changing sea and the ability to shift between water and ice within the Submerged Sea Blue Whale’s World Crystal.","As such, the Submerged Sea Blue Whale’s World Crystal would be able to provide Lin Yuan with both water and ice immunity and add a Sword Skill that combined both water and ice.","This Sword Skill would suit Dark Blue well.","In three days’ time, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen would be done absorbing the Submerged Sea Blue Whale’s World Crystal.","Lin Yuan itched with anticipation to see the Submerged Sea Blue Whale’s Submerged Water World and the new Sword Skill.","The Kill Food Sky Butterfly silently received the chest.","It was anxious to increase its power as soon as possible so that it would be able to protect Purple Afterglow better.","Moreover, the Kill Food Sky Butterfly had witnessed how wealthy Lin Yuan was. Hence, it was not shocked by the 2,000 Law Crystals in the chest.","Regardless, it was still as happy as it could be.","Apart from the Law Crystals, the Kill Food Sky Butterfly was even happier that they had come from its father-in-law. It was delighted that Lin Yuan cared so much for it.","The Kill Food Sky Butterfly immediately left to find a place where it could start absorbing the Law Crystals.","Now that everything else was settled, Lin Yuan lowered his head and said to his shadow, “Invisible Demon, let’s begin.”","The moment Lin Yuan spoke, the Invisible Demon’s figure appeared 15 meters away from him with an austere expression on its face.","Lin Yuan shook his hand, and the 9900 units of source-type power he had instructed the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to prepare started flowing into the Invisible Demon’s body.","No natural phenomenon occurred once all the source-type power entered the Invisible Demon’s body.","Rather, the ground and sky were suddenly covered with a layer of shadows with Invisible Demon as its center. The enormous shadow spilled forth from the Invisible Demon, and a pained yet ecstatic expression appeared on its face.","But shortly after, the delight on its face disappeared as the shadows seemed to become knives that turned it into a hornet’s nest from the inside out."]},{"number":1273,"title":"Chapter 1273 - Smaller But Stronger!","paragraphs":["Although its body had become a hornet’s nest, the shadows continued to spill out from its body.","The Invisible Demon’s body was continuously destroyed and put back together.","Lin Yuan suddenly felt that the Invisible Demon’s experience during this evolution was very similar to his experience when he consumed the Earth Center Fine Milk, as his body had also undergone a continuous cycle of destruction and rebirth after he consumed the Earth Center Fine Milk.","His body had completely transformed during the cycles, but it had been so excruciating that he had not been able to move at all.","However, the Invisible Demon was still able to move its body in spite of the agonizing pain.","The Invisible Demon scratched its body wildly with its three-inch-long purplish-black nails in order to alleviate some of the pain. The sharp nails tore the Invisible Demon’s already wrecked body even further apart, stinging Lin Yuan’s heart.","But after a few scratches, one of the Invisible Demon’s purplish-black nails would fall off and be replaced by a pure black nail that was even sharper and thinner than before.","The pure black nails continued to rip through the Invisible Demon’s body. As the number of injuries on the Invisible Demon’s body increased, the shadows flowed out from the Invisible Demon’s body at a quicker rate.","At that moment, the Invisible Demon’s body fused with the shadows, and everything turned dark.","Nothing happened in the dark world for a few hours.","Just as Lin Yuan was becoming worried about the Invisible Demon and was going to call out to it, the Invisible Demon emerged from the shadows 15 meters away from Lin Yuan.","At that same moment, all the shadows that had taken over seemed to find their rightful place and returned to the Invisible Demon’s body.","The fully transformed Invisible Demon’s appearance was revealed.","If Lin Yuan was not already aware that this was the Invisible Demon, he would not be able to imagine that this dimensional lifeform had transformed from the Invisible Demon.","When it had been Class 11, the Invisible Demon had been light purple with a humanoid silhouette. But now, the Invisible Demon was emanating an aura of malevolent carnage and could only be described as a wild beast.","Perhaps it was because the Invisible Demon had spent some time amongst humans and became accustomed to human appearance and was intentionally imitating human appearance, but it looked exactly like a spirit qi professional in every way besides its face.","The Invisible Demon was around 1.8 meters tall. In spite of its skinny physique, its muscles had the same sturdiness that was characteristic of all abyss dimensional lifeforms.","But now that it was Class 12, it was only around 1.7 meters tall, and its body had become even skinner and bonier than before. All the strength of its muscles had been hidden under its skin.","This height and size were more suitable for the Invisible Demon, whose main attacking method had an assassination style.","This was not the only part of the Invisible Demon’s appearance that had changed. Its body no longer had any traces of purple or green. Only black and white were left.","The Invisible Demon’s skin, hair, and eyebrows were white, while its eyes, lips, and nails had become pure black. It was the same black as the shadows.","Although its teeth were still the same as they peeked through the Invisible Demon’s black lips, the transformed Invisible Demon now fit human beauty standards much better than it used to.","Lin Yuan felt that the Invisible Demon was much easier on the eyes now.","A totem of two eyes covered by shadows appeared on the back of the Invisible Demon’s right hand. This totem symbolized the Invisible Demon’s status as an Apostle.","The Invisible Demon felt slightly conflicted as it observed its appearance.","It had been bullied heavily in the abyssal world due to its small size. Its greatest wish in life was to become as mammoth as the horned demons and win over the respect and affection of other demons with its strength and heft.","Yet, it was even smaller now despite becoming stronger.","Wait! It had become shorter and skinnier.","It was like a person who had received a raise but went bald at the same time. This perfectly described how the Invisible Demon felt at that moment.","The Invisible Demon was afraid that its looks would repulse Lin Yuan, and it thought,? Will Lin Yuan want to keep his distance from me just like the other abyss demons did because I’m even skinnier and shorter now?","Lin Yuan walked over to the Invisible Demon at this moment while saying, “Shadow, you look much better now. All you need is a mask to cover your mouth, and you won’t stick out no matter where you go.”","Shadow let out a breath of relief. It seemed that Lin Yuan did not despise the new appearance it gained after transforming.","Lin Yuan’s praise also made Shadow less upset about its height and size changes, as nothing was more important to it than Lin Yuan’s happiness.","Lin Yuan took out a set of spirit qi clothes and tossed it at Shadow.","Shadow hurriedly thanked Lin Yuan and carefully put on the clothes in case its nails ripped the cloth.","Now that Shadow was Class 12 and had gained immortal power, Lin Yuan knew that he would not be able to use True Data to check on its characteristics.","But at the same time, he was still extremely curious about the potential changes to Shadow’s original natural skill and any new natural skills it might have gained.","Shadow had pledged its loyalty to Lin Yuan and had no reason not to tell Lin Yuan about its natural skills if he asked.","As such, Lin Yuan asked, “Shadow, now that you’re an Apostle, did your natural skill improve in any way?”","Shadow hurriedly replied, “Lord Dictator, Hidden Shadow/Killer Shadow can now allow me to hide within the shadow of any item. Hidden Shadow does not seem to have improved by much. I can still only sense targets up to two levels higher than me. But in the Killer Shadow state, I’m able to attack the shadows of other targets. When I attack the shadow of a non-living being, I will be able to shatter the body of the non-living being. When I attack the shadow of a living being, the living being will experience many times the inflicted damage.”","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up."]},{"number":1274,"title":"Chapter 1274 - Shadow Piercing Back Hibernation","paragraphs":["According to Shadow’s reply, Lin Yuan now knew that the improvement in the ability of Hidden Shadow/Killer Shadow lay in that it now enabled Shadow to shatter non-living beings and inflict multiplied damage on living beings.","Shadow used an assassination style of combat.","The changes to Hidden Shadow/Killer Shadow increased Shadow’s damage power and enabled it to attack targets that were stronger than it was effectively.","When Shadow saw Lin Yuan’s expression, it knew that he was very satisfied with the improvement in Hidden Shadow/Killer Shadow. This delighted Shadow and spurred it on to prove itself even further.","Before Lin Yuan asked Shadow what the new natural skill it obtained was, Shadow said, “Lord Dictator, the new natural skill I gained when I evolved to Apostle is called Shadow Piercing Back Hibernation. It’s much stronger than Hidden Shadow/Killer Shadow. It will allow me to lock a shadow-possessing target within a set area. I will appear behind the target through its shadow and assassinate it. When I’m using Shadow Piercing Back Hibernation on a target, the other shadow-possessing targets in the area will be blinded by shadows. When I stab a target with my nails, I’ll also be able to extract the target’s vitality to heal my wounds.”","Lin Yuan almost started clapping for Shadow.","If what Shadow said was true, Shadow Piercing Back Hibernation seemed almost too powerful! It would allow Shadow to move freely behind targets in a set area using shadows.","Normally, the back of every lifeform was their blindspot, and it was the place that the lifeform would be least able to respond to in the shortest time possible. This position might not be the target’s weak spot, but it would still greatly increase Shadow’s attack’s success rate.","Moreover, Shadow could achieve this even without activating Shadow Piercing Back Hibernation.","But when Shadow did activate Shadow Piercing Back Hibernation, it would be able to blind all other targets in the area and prevent them from going to the aid of Shadow’s current target. This also greatly increased Shadow’s attack’s success rate.","Meanwhile, the ability to drain a target’s vitality to heal itself would increase Shadow’s endurance during combat and enable it to stand toe to toe against stronger opponents by killing other targets and continuously healing its wounds.","Lin Yuan felt that Shadow Piercing Back Hibernation fit Shadow’s physique perfectly and allowed it to become an even better assassin.","This would enable Shadow to strike fear into any lifeform of the same grade.","Lin Yuan looked down at the shorter Shadow and stretched out his hand to ruffle its white hair as he said with a smile, “Shadow, you’re now strong enough to defeat ten of your past selves. If we ever have a chance to enter the abyssal world in the future, you can accept any lifeform that catches your fancy as your believer. Alternatively, if you see any interesting dimensional lifeform in the marsh world, you can accept it as well.”","Shadow was shocked. It had been the most scorned creature in the abyssal world not long ago. It had still been a captive within the purple-golden cage a month ago.","But now, it had increased not only its power but also become an Apostle, which it had never dreamed that it would become.","This all came from the Dictator standing before him.","Along the way, a feeling besides respect rose within Shadow.","Actually, Shadow had already decided which believer it was going to accept.","Rather than the horned fire-element-wielding demons it had used to envy, it preferred to accept many of its kind.","It wanted to declare loudly to the entire abyssal world that the Invisible Demons were not pathetic creatures. It wanted to use its army of Invisible Demons to gain the respect of all other demons.","Hence, Shadow told Lin Yuan about its idea candidly, “Lord Dictator, I only want to accept Invisible Demons as my believers and Favored Believers. I will create a team of assassins to serve you.”","After some thought, Lin Yuan found Shadow’s idea to be achievable.","Sky City’s white-clothed followers were more like soldiers and could not perform the job of assassins.","It was inevitable that Sky City needed to spill blood in order to expand.","Hence, Sky City needed a sharp dagger that could perform jobs in the dead of night.","The team of Invisible Demon assassins formed by Shadow would be able to fulfill this job.","Although Invisible Demons were rare in the abyssal world, it would not be difficult for Lin Yuan to achieve this.","All he had to do was ask Long Tao to look out for Invisible Demons when he ventured into the Class 6 abyss dimensional rift.","At that moment, Lin Yuan thought about the ability Faith Gift or Robbery, which Dark Blue had gained the previous night.","Faith Gift or Robbery would enable Dark Blue to inject faith power into a target to strengthen its faith power. This was the gift part of the ability.","The robbery part of the ability would allow Dark Blue to use the faith power in its body as the standard to drain faith power from targets with less faith power than it had.","But as strong as Faith Gift or Robbery was, the amount of faith power in Dark Blue’s body was limited.","However, Dark Blue also had the ability Faith Application, which allowed Lin Yuan to inject faith power into Dark Blue when they were fused together.","This would enable Lin Yuan to use Faith Gift or Robbery in the fused state as well. If so, the amount of faith power in Lin Yuan’s body would become the standard, and he would be able to give or take faith power from targets with less faith power than him.","Lin Yuan decided to test Faith Power Gift or Robbery when he saw the totem in Shadow’s hand.","He had already turned into a mermaid once in front of the Shadow the last time he used Faith Application. Hence, he had nothing to be embarrassed about doing it a second time."]},{"number":1275,"title":"Chapter 1275 - Shadow’s Lethal Weakness","paragraphs":["As such, Lin Yuan used Faith Application to fuse with Dark Blue.","Shadow had been slightly embarrassed when Lin Yuan tousled its hair. It was about to say something when it saw Lin Yuan transform into its Dictator’s body.","The last time Lin Yuan transformed into the Dictator’s body, Shadow had only dared to peek at him once before averting its gaze as it was afraid that staring would be regarded as blasphemous.","But that one glance had etched the magnificence of Lin Yuan’s Dictator’s body into Shadow’s mind.","Now that it was looking at Lin Yuan’s Dictator’s body again, Shadow was just as shellshocked as before. But at the same time, it felt nervous as it thought that something had happened to Lin Yuan.","According to legend, Dictators only used their Dictators’ bodies when they needed to flaunt their might.","“Shadow, I want to use you to test one of my abilities. It won’t put you in any danger, so you don’t need to be scared. If you feel uncomfortable in any way during the experiment, let me know immediately. At the same time, I’ll observe your situation carefully,” said Lin Yuan.","Shadow anxiously said, “Lord Dictator, use me to test whatever you need. I might be small, but I’m as strong as can be.”","Shadow stood at attention, completely unguarded, as it awaited for Lin Yuan to do whatever he wanted. It was its honor to be experimented on by its Dictator in Shadow’s mind.","Lin Yuan flicked his tail, and faith power gushed out from the shrine in his soul.","His liquid-like long hair changed from dark blue to vibrant amber, and 12 pillars of amber water shot out from the ground near his feet toward the sky.","All the faith power within the pillars of water made Shadow’s eyes widen to the size of sockets. It was astonished by the ocean of faith power possessed by Lin Yuan’s Dictator’s body.","Lin Yuan pointed at Shadow, and the 12 pillars of amber water combined into one belt of water that shot into Shadow’s body.","Shadow noticed that the totem on the back of its hand was starting to grow warmer.","Since Shadow had only recently evolved to Apostle, the faith power within its totem was at the level of extremely weak.","In the short span of a few seconds, the faith power in Shadow’s totem started to rise in power until it became higher weal.","As Shadow felt the faith power surging within its totem, it thought,? How could this be uncomfortable? I’ve never been more comfortable!","Faith power was the source of all Apostles’ power.","Shadow had heard of how powerful Dictators were, but it had never heard of any Dictators who were able to use their faith power to strengthen the faith power of the Apostles.","Before Shadow could revel in this blissful feeling, it experienced what it could only describe as true discomfort.","The moment that the faith power rose from higher weak to below average, it felt the totem on the back of its right hand twist violently.","It was as though the pillars of water were trying to push air into a balloon that had already been stretched to its limit. If any more air were pushed into the balloon, it would burst.","Lin Yuan had been observing Shadow throughout. When he noticed a strange expression come over its face, he immediately stopped using Faith Gift or Robbery to inject faith power into Shadow.","Judging from the results of Shadow’s experiment, Lin Yuan was able to estimate the limits of Faith Gift or Robbery.","Although he still had more than enough faith power left in his shrine, he would not inject faith power into Shadow when it could not take any more.","It was likely that using such an ability would only be able to strengthen the faith power of the Apostles by one large step before it started endangering the Apostles.","After Lin Yuan stopped injecting faith power into Shadow, it said with shock, “Lord Dictator, I can now use my source sacred body.”","This immediately piqued Lin Yuan’s interest.","He remembered both White Speak and the Dark Scorpion using their source sacred bodies during their fight.","The source sacred body was the second ability that Apostles had, and it could only be used when the Apostle’s faith power reached below average.","Both White Speak and Dark Scorpion had changed into human form when they used their source sacred bodies. Not only did their power increase, but they could also use a power known as sacred absolute ability.","“Shadow, since you can use your source sacred body now, use it once so I can see what your sacred absolute ability is.”","During his conversation with White Speak, Lin Yuan had learned that Dark Scorpion’s sacred absolute ability was disintegration. When the ability made contact with a lifeform, the lifeform’s cells would separate rapidly. This would cause significant damage to the lifeform.","White Speak had been able to swallow Dark Scorpion’s sacred absolute because White Speak’s sacred absolute ability was replay. This meant that White Speak would be able to swallow the sacred absolutes of Apostles that did not have a stronger faith power than it did. It would only be able to swallow a portion of the sacred absolutes of Apostles that had stronger faith power than it did.","It would then spit out the sacred absolutes it had swallowed to attack its targets.","The sacred absolutes of Apostles all had unique abilities.","Thus, Lin Yuan was almost uncontrollably curious about Shadow’s sacred absolute.","Frankly, Lin Yuan was not only curious about Shadow’s sacred absolute but the appearance of its sacred source body.","Now that Shadow already looked almost indistinguishable from humans, what changes would it undergo when it used its source sacred body?","Shadow immediately activated the faith power that Lin Yuan had injected into its totem.","The white parts of Shadow’s body slowly became transparent while the black parts turned into shadows. It was as though Shadow had disappeared right before Lin Yuan’s eyes.","However, he could sense through the faith power he had injected into Shadow that it had not moved an inch.","Lin Yuan thought,? Shadow’s source sacred body turns it into an actual shadow. This greatly increases its ability to conceal itself.","While Shadow was using source sacred body, he realized that the faith power he had injected into Shadow was slowly depleting.","Shadow deactivated its source sacred body and exclaimed, “Lord Dictator, my sacred absolute allows me to fuse with any shadow and explode it at will to inflict damage on the main body casting the shadow.”","Lin Yuan’s eyebrow twitched.","Shadow’s sacred absolute seemed to increase its ability to attack from a distance. This enabled Shadow not to have to be near a body in a battle to attack it.","Lin Yuan noticed its flaw after understanding what Shadow Piercing Back Hibernation was all about. This seemingly invincible ability actually had a fatal weakness."]},{"number":1276,"title":"Chapter 1276 - Comparison Between Brothers","paragraphs":["When Shadow was facing off against targets like the Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly, it would be grievously hurt by being rebuffed by the shield even before it managed to land a hit on its target.","This seriously limited the attacking range of Shadow’s sacred absolute.","“Shadow, you gained a new method of attacking with this sacred absolute, and it will definitely be effective during battle. I’m going to continue testing my ability now!”","Once again, Lin Yuan used Faith Gift or Robbery on Shadow. But this time, he used the robbery part of the ability.","When Lin Yuan used the ability, a giant silhouette of faith power appeared behind the mermaid that Lin Yuan had transformed into.","When the amber silhouette and Lin Yuan pointed at Shadow, the latter realized that it could no longer control its faith power.","When Lin Yuan used the robbery part of Faith Gift or Robbery, he did not take back the faith power he had injected into Shadow. This meant that Lin Yuan could use his faith power to keep Apostles trapped at below-average and cause them to lose control of their faith power.","This was basically the same as lowering an Apostle’s life rank back to a dimensional lifeform.","Moreover, given the strength of Lin Yuan’s faith power, he would be able to suppress Apostles with stronger faith power than below-average. This ability had significant strategic significance for Lin Yuan as he continued to expand into the different dimensional worlds.","After testing Faith Gift or Robbery, Lin Yuan released his control over Shadow’s faith power while retrieving the faith power he had injected into its body.","Shadow would be able to replenish its depleted faith power, but Lin Yuan could not.","Thus, he could not use up his faith power carelessly to strengthen the faith power of his Apostles.","Shadow, Rising Lizard, Wendy, and White Pavilion should depend on themselves to strengthen their faith power while using him should be reserved as secret weapons to be used against powerful opponents.","......","White Speak had decided to follow him because it believed that he was a Dictator and that Dark Blue’s Faith Water was his dictator’s prize.","As long as Lin Yuan was careful not to expose himself and allow White Speak to realize that he was not actually a Dictator, White Speak was the strongest combat power he possessed.","He would be able to use Faith Gift or Robbery to strengthen White Speak’s faith power to its maximum extent to reach the pinnacle of what Apostles could achieve.","If he helped White Speak, he would even be able to challenge the Marsh East Palace in the Marsh East Circle.","Lin Yuan badly wanted the sacred source lifeforms in the Marsh East Palace.","After handing a ball of Faith Water to Shadow, he left the marsh world.","...","In Miao Zhenshan’s study, Miao Zhuo and Miao He sat on either side of Miao Zhenshan as they reported to him.","As Miao Zhenshan listened to Miao Zhuo’s report, he nodded with satisfaction.","It was undeniable that Miao Zhenshan preferred Miao Zhuo over Miao He. However, Miao Zhuo’s soul was injured, which prevented him from becoming a Class 4 Creation Master.","Under such circumstances, it would be difficult to make the others accept Miao Zhuo as the next family leader.","Ever since Miao Zhenshan singled out Miao He, the latter no longer wasted his days away and started taking things seriously.","However, Miao He clearly lacked some of the deviousness and bravery that Miao Zhuo had.","Miao Zhenshan asked Miao Zhuo, “Zhuo, how high of a chance do you think that Sky City will help the Sea Bliss Clan with their blood fight ultimate fight against us?”","Miao Zhuo knew that his grandfather had been bothered by this problem over the past few days.","Miao Zhenshan had decided of his own accord to issue the blood pact ultimate fight challenge to the Sea Bliss Clan. Hence, he definitely did not think that Sky City would help the Sea Bliss Clan.","However, Miao Zhuo did not say what his grandfather wanted to hear as it would only bring his father temporary joy. It would also be impractical, and his grandfather would think of him as a shortsighted person when he failed.","After thinking for some time, Miao Zhuo felt he needed to give his grandfather some form of warming, even if the warning might displease his grandfather.","“Grandfather, I think we need to be on our guard against Sky City. It would be unsurprising if Sky City came after us for revenge after we helped the Zheng family with their blood pact ultimate fight against Sky City.”","Miao Zhenshan frowned and turned to ask Miao He, “He, what do you think?”","Miao He chortled maniacally to himself after listening to what Miao Zhuo said.","Why is Miao Zhuo setting up more roadblocks for Grandfather at such a time? Grandfather was the one who decided to go ahead with the blood pact ultimate fight. By saying this, he might as well slap Grandfather across the face.","“Grandfather, you’ve thoroughly investigated the matter of the Aurora pollen. The Sea Bliss Clan started their scheme regarding the Aurora pollen long ago, and Condense Fairy Orchard’s Sun Ningxiang is also personally involved.","“Condense Fairy Orchard is on good terms with Sky City. But at the same time, Condense Fairy Orchard is also at odds with the Sea Bliss Clan. There’s no reason for Sky City to help the Sea Bliss Clan by this logic.","“Moreover, we placed many spies in the Sea Bliss Clan decades ago. It’s possible that the Sea Bliss Clan discovered one or two of them over the years, but we placed more than 20 spies there. All the news they sent back says that Sky City rejected the Sea Bliss Clan’s plea for help.","“The Sea Bliss Clan’s internal situation is a mess now, and Qi Hend has started settling matters his way. It seems that he wants to drag Qi Wangyang down from his position as the leader of the Sea Bliss Clan and replace him with Qi Haitao instead. Obviously, he has gone mad. I think that Big Brother’s words came from a place of fear.”","Miao Zhuo decided not to rebuff Miao He and chose to ignore him.","Miao Zhenshan did not reply, so Miao Zhuo knew that his grandfather was still unconvinced by either side.","Miao Zhenshan grandfather was playing a dangerous game of chess. It was so perilous that he was not even able to trust either Miao Zhuo or Miao He with certainty.","“Grandfather, if you’re still worried, I can ask Lord Lin Yuan to look into the matter, or you can go to Whale Ocean Commerce. Whale Ocean Commerce has already settled their deal with us. There’s no way they’ll deny a request for help from us now. With an immortal expert on our side, we won’t have to be afraid even if Sky City does decide to help the Sea Bliss Clan.”","Miao Zhuo’s words struck Miao Zhenshan deeply.","But eventually, he decided to take one final gamble and placed his bet that Sky City would not help the Sea Bliss Clan with their blood pact ultimate fight.","If his gamble fell through, he still had enough time to seek help from the Moon Empress’ disciple or Whale Ocean Commerce. Either way, he would have to owe one of them a favor. As such, there was no need for him to take preventive measures."]},{"number":1277,"title":"Chapter 1277 - Strange Occurrence on the Ultimate Fighting Ground","paragraphs":["It should be good news that Connected Beast Park had gained seven new thearch-class experts. Alas, some of them became arrogant after their power increased, which greatly displeased Miao Zhenshan.","They used to be mere emperor-class experts who had climbed up the ladder using Connected Beast Park’s resources. The source of their development came solely from the Miao family. However, a few of them were so pompous that Miao Zhenshan was sure that Miao Zhuo and Miao He would not be able to hold down once he died.","Hence, Miao Zhenshan decided to send these people out to participate in the blood pact ultimate fight against the Sea Bliss Clan.","It would be fine if Sky City decided not to help the Sea Bliss Clan. But even if they did decide to step in, Miao Zhenshan would not be overly distraught over sacrificing these few thearch-class experts.","While Miao Zhenshan was engulfed in his anxiousness, the blood pact ultimate fight between Connected Beast Park and the Sea Bliss Clan officially began.","Lin Yuan had no intention of attending the blood pact ultimate fight. He did not think that the City Lord of Sky City needed to participate in such a spectacle personally.","He was fully focused on the new Sword Skill he was about to receive and the whale fall near the islands that the Sea Bliss Clan owned. As such, he instructed Shadow to attend the blood pact ultimate fight itself.","A few hours later, Shadow would bring back the bodies of the Creation Breed feys and World Crystals.","Lin Yuan did not care about whether the experts from the Sea Bliss Clan had survived.","He ordered Shadow to manipulate the experts from Connected Beast Park to summon their feys and attack them so that he would be able to gain more rewards.","Although Lin Yuan did not care about the blood pact ultimate fight between Connected Beast Park and the Sea Bliss Clan, the other factions did not share his sentiment.","Connected Beast Park helping the Zheng family with their blood pact ultimate fight had already caused hysteria to sweep through the public, much less this blood pact ultimate fight between a veteran and a top faction.","Sky City and the Sea Bliss Clan immediately became trending topics on Star Web, and almost all trending posts were about this matter. Even news about the main member of a top faction being cheated on or the daughter-in-law of a veteran faction being abused suddenly became insignificant by comparison.","......","Lin Yuan needed to garner faith power from the main world. Hence, he only cared about the posts regarding Sky City.","Star Web was like another world in the Radiance Federation, and many spirit qi professionals were even professional tabloid reporters on Star Web.","Professional reporters usually reported the facts. However, tabloid reporters would latch onto any morsel of gossip and start spreading it throughout Star Web to attract as much attention and speculation as they could.","Lin Yuan found these salacious topics to be ironic because if he was not the person in question, he would have been fooled by them and assumed they were true.","These tabloid posts included topics such as:","<Sky City’s City Lord berates Connected Beast Park in a meeting room. So stuck up! A real man would help the Sea Bliss Clan!>","<Shocking! Sky City’s best combat power falls at Connected Beast Park’s feet>","<According to sources, Connected Beast Park and Sky City have settled the matter privately>","There were both positive and negative comments under these posts, but Lin Yuan did not think of removing them because they were advertising Sky City in a way. In fact, Lin Yuan wanted to thank these tabloid posts for boosting Sky City’s popularity and mentioning the City Lord numerous times.","It could be said that the blood pact ultimate fight between Connected Beast Park and Sea Bliss Clan had become the main topic of conversation in the entire Radiance Federation. Even non-spirit qi professionals discussed the matter when they were grocery shopping for the Usneas and Jasmine Lilies in the morning markets.","The moment the blood pact ultimate fight started, three thearch-class experts flew out from Connected Beast Park’s side.","The veteran and rising factions who were knowledgeable about Connected Beast Park had been shocked to see the three thearch-class experts. They had assumed that Liu Yanshan and Han Tianhe’s deaths were almost unrecoverable blows to Connected Beast Park. Yet, Connected Beast Park managed to produce three new thearch-class experts in the blink of an eye. It seemed that Connected Beast Park’s well of resources ran deeper than they originally thought.","By contrast, when the Sea Bliss Clan’s three participants stepped out, the spectators’ excitement deflated. The Sea Bliss Clan’s three participants were clearly feeble.","Neither Qi Heng nor Qi Wangyang was present, and Qi Haitao led the team.","It was clear that this team was a far cry from being a match for Connected Beast Park’s experts.","But, when Gu Han did his round of participant confirmation, the downtrodden-looking Qi Haitao suddenly requested to be swapped out.","Soon, Gu Han announced the official start of the blood pact ultimate fight between Connected Beast Park and the Sea Bliss Clan, with a strange look on his face despite there being seemingly no one who stepped up to take Qi Haitao’s place.","This caused the scene to fall into a peculiar silence. The situation resembled the blood pact ultimate fight between Sky City and the Zheng family almost uncannily. It had also been two versus three, and the side with two was almost ridiculously outmatched.","It did not take long before the astonished gasps broke the silence of the spectators.","“Damn! What’s going on? There are clearly only two members of the Sea Bliss Clan left, but I definitely heard that young man who left say that he would be swapped out. Where’s the substitute?”","“I’m sure the Sea Bliss Clan is done for either way. The person that was swapped out was their Young Leader Qi Haitao. I heard that Qi Haitao was gutsy, so I didn’t expect him to back out almost immediately. Moreover, Lord Gu Han should have raised the issue of them lacking a substitute. But instead, he went directly to announcing the start of the blood pact ultimate fight.”","“Can history really be repeating itself? Is Sky City helping the Sea Bliss Clan with the blood pact ultimate fight, after all?”","“Sky City is amazing! Connected Beast Park is so pretentious that they should be taught a good lesson!”","Miao Zhenshan was personally leading the team for Connected Beast Park because he had been unsure if Sky City would end up helping the Sea Bliss Clan.","When he saw the situation over on the Sea Bliss Clan’s side, his face fell, and alarm bells rang in his head.","He released his pinnacle thearch-class expert aura and was sweeping through the entire ultimate fighting ground.","His unrestrained aura affected the audience."]},{"number":1278,"title":"Chapter 1278 - Similarity Between Dimensional Lifeforms and Feys","paragraphs":["Gu Han coughed lightly while releasing his aura as a warning to Miao Zhenshan.","Miao Zhenshan had released his aura to investigate whether there was another expert on the Sea Bliss Clan’s side.","After a thorough check, he became certain that he could not sense even a hint of anything strange going on.","However, this made his heart sink instead of filling him with joy.","Previously, he had only arrived in time to see Han Tianhe and Liu Yanshan’s corpses but not who from Sky City had killed them.","Now that the same situation was unfolding, an ominous feeling overwhelmed Miao Zhenshan. Could Sky City have immortal power?","If so, there would be no point in Connected Beast Park trying to win against Sky City. After scheming and plotting against Sky City for so long, it had been for naught. Connected Beast Park was like an ignorant mouse playing right into the hands of the cat that was Sky City.","But no matter how depressed Miao Zhenshan felt at that moment, he still had to express his apologies to Gu Han immediately. Gu Han had the support of the Chief Guard of the Spirit Guards and Iron Prison. As such, Miao Zhenshan could not afford to get on the wrong side of Gu Han.","Miao Zhenshan and the spectators were not alone as the three thearch-class experts from the Miao family had also sensed something was wrong. They immediately summoned their main combat feys with grim expressions.","The two king-class experts from the Sea Bliss Clan had come resigned to what they thought was their inevitable deaths because Qi Heng and Qi Haitao had told neither of them about what was going to happen.","When they saw the three Creation Breed feys summoned by the experts from Connected Beast Park, the two king-class experts could not even muster the courage to summon their own feys.","As per Lin Yuan’s instruction, Shadow did not attack immediately after Connected Beast Park’s thearch-class experts summoned their Creation Breed feys. Instead, it waited for them to summon more of their feys.","Shadow would feel that it had failed Lin Yuan if it only managed to bring back the corpses of three Creation Breed feys and three World Crystals.","......","The three thearch-class experts from the Miao family stared at the two king-class experts from the Sea Bliss Clan warily, and they dared not make the first move.","The two king-class experts from the Sea Bliss Clan had completely lost the courage to fight back. If their sphincter had not strengthened after becoming A-rank spirit qi professionals, they would have already soiled their pants.","One side was on guard while the other was terrified. The blood pact ultimate fight was at a stalemate.","The buzzing noises of chatter intensified, and Connected Beast Park’s three thearch-class experts exchanged looks.","Each of them summoned a Myth Breed fey that they would use to attack the Sea Bliss Clan experimentally.","However, the moment they summoned their Myth Breed feys, a black shadow that had been positioned a distance away from the ultimate fighting ground for some time flashed through the ultimate fighting ground.","Nine flashes later, the corpses of three thearch-class experts, three Creation Breed feys, and three Myth Breed feys littered the ground of the ultimate fighting ground.","Just like before, the bodies of the three dead thearch-class experts were split cleanly in half while the bodies of the dead Creation Breed feys and Myth Breed feys remained intact save for a hole on their backs.","Previously, Shadow had not been aware that the fey corpses would be useful to Lin Yuan, and it had felt guilty for some time about splitting the two Creation Breed feys’ bodies into halves. Thus, Shadow took special care not to damage the bodies of the feys’ bodies this time.","It stored the feys’ bodies into a Diamond fey storage box and turned to return to the Return from Faraway Mansion so it could report back to Lin Yuan.","Shadow’s orders had been to kill the three thearch-class experts and win the blood pact ultimate fight on the Sea Bliss Clan’s behalf. It had performed the job perfectly.","After Shadow left, the spectators remained silent.","Although they had already guessed that Sky City was helping the Sea Bliss Clan with the blood pact ultimate fight, they still found it hard to quickly come to terms with it when it happened right before their eyes.","Connected Beast Park did not just lose three thearch-class experts as according to the rules of the blood pact ultimate fight, the lives of the members of Connected Beast Park were in the hands of the Sea Bliss Clan.","Could this spell the end of the mighty top-faction Connected Beast Park?","All the Star Web reporters present started racking their brains for the best way to report on this blood pact ultimate fight.","Many of the people who had come to watch the blood pact ultimate fight between Connected Beast Park and the Sea Bliss Clan live were famous. When they recovered from the shock, some of them immediately logged onto Star Web to post about the results of the blood pact ultimate fight.","Sky City’s popularity shot up as the gossip mongers spread the news throughout Star Web.","At that moment, Lin Yuan and the Fortuitous Blessing-Carrying Swallow were looking at each other. Suddenly, he felt the faith power within the shrine increase by at least 5%. However, this was just the beginning, a kickstarter.","Lin Yuan felt that his identity as the City Lord of Sky City would be able to multiply the amount of faith power within the shrine.","Excitement bubbled up uncontrollably within him.","The increase in faith power also notified Lin Yuan that the blood pact ultimate fight between Connected Beast Park and the Sea Bliss Clan had ended and that Shadow should be back soon.","Sure enough, Shadow appeared in front of him the moment the thought entered his mind.","Shadow handed the Diamond fey storage box that Lin Yuan had given it that morning back to him as it said, “Lord Dictator, there are a total of three Class 11 lifeforms and three lifeforms below Class 11 in this Diamond fey storage box. Take a look.”","Lin Yuan smiled at Shadow’s expectant expression as he received the Diamond fey storage box.","He did not need to look inside to know that the three Creation Breed feys and three Myth Breed feys’ corpses were complete within the Diamond fey storage box.","As a demon from the abyssal world, Shadow was merciless. But at the same time, it was new to feelings which resulted in an adorable side.","Seeing how innocently excited Shadow was, Lin Yuan had to play along.","As such, he praised Shadow generously.","When he saw Shadow’s toothy smile of contentment, Lin Yuan felt that dimensional lifeforms and feys shared many similarities. The biggest similarity was that they approached feelings with a very simple approach."]},{"number":1279,"title":"Chapter 1279 - Prism Snapping Turtle and Blazing Sun Dragon Cricket","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan could not help but think about how the Radiance Federation and abyssal world would be linked through the Class 6 abyss dimensional rift once it opened.","It was possible that abyss demons would become helpers to spirit qi professionals or be tamed by them so that they would eventually move over to the main world.","After praising Shadow, Lin Yuan carefully checked the fey corpses within the Diamond fey storage box.","Previously, at the Miao family, Lin Yuan had taken the Creation World Ley Lines of the seven thearch-class experts’ feys while they were undergoing the Trials of World Creation to evolve to Creation Breed. He had gained seven new golden pearls through this.","Hence, Lin Yuan was well aware of what the seven thearch-class experts’ Creation Breed feys were.","They had all been pinnacle emperor-class, and their main feys had been picked carefully. As such, Lin Yuan badly yearned for these Creation Breed feys’ law worlds.","When he was done checking the three Creation Breed fey corpses, his eyes suddenly lit up. One of them was the fey that he wanted the most. It was the Prism Snapping Turtle.","The Prism Snapping Turtle’s law world was the Simulation World, and it could be used to imitate other feys and their abilities and exclusive skills.","Although the Prism Snapping Turtle could not overwhelm stronger feys by imitating them, it would be able to use this to defeat weaker feys.","Lin Yuan took out the Prism Snapping Turtle’s World Crystal. A large silver turtle with a mirror for a shell lay within the World Crystal. It looked very ordinary and could not compare to the scene within the Sacred Heal White Deer or the Submerged Sea Blue Whale’s World Crystals.","But upon closer inspection of the Prism Snapping Turtle’s World Crystal, Lin Yuan noticed that there seemed to be a world tucked within each of the scoots on its back. As the scoots overlapped, they formed an ever-evolving world.","The Prism Snapping Turtle flawlessly fit into every one of the worlds and became an essential part of them.","Lin Yuan did not know what type of Sword Skill the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen would gain after it absorbed the Simulation World. But regardless, it was sure to be acrobatic and versatile.","......","The other two Creation Breed feys’ law worlds were not bad but not as impressive as the Prism Snapping Turtle’s Simulation World.","The Shadow Tied Mesmerizing Snake’s World Crystal was full of faint shadows that looked as though they were about to die out as they spread their woe throughout the world. These shadows turned into nooses every once in a while that tried to loop around anything they could.","The dead expert’s Shadow Tied Mesmerizing Snake would eventually become a burden that tied to every tangible item.","The giant snake with long horns on its head, sharp grayish-purple scales, and a wooden horn growing out of its head was twirling around on a stone pillar as though it wanted to strangle the stone pillar.","Its law world was the Shadow Tied World which enabled it to control shadows during combat like Shadow could.","However, Shadow attacked like a strong assassin while the Shadow Tied Mesmerizing Snake’s attack would act more like a shadow being puppeteered by a wizard.","Moreover, the shadows from the dead would have some level of spiritual combat ability.","Lin Yuan guessed that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen would be able to gain a controlling Sword Skill when it consumed the Shadow Tied World Crystal.","Yet, Lin Yuan did not want the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to absorb the Shadow Tied World Crystal so soon unless it no longer had any other World Crystals to absorb.","Shadow was borne from darkness and the Shadow Tied World Crystal was a dark-type World Crystal.","When the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen absorbed the Shadow Tied World, Lin Yuan would gain resistance to dark-type. However, he already had the Dark Death World for this.","Lin Yuan preferred a more comprehensive development rather than specialized resistance against dark-type.","The third World Crystal was the Scorching Sun World Crystal that came from the Blazing Sun Dragon Cricket.","The Blazing Sun Dragon Cricket was both fire- and light-type, and the Scorching Sun World would give Lin Yuan defense against fire- and light-type. This would provide Lin Yuan with the second type of defensive ability.","After the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen absorbed the Scorching Sun World Crystal, Lin Yuan would have a much easier time fighting against Zong Ze.","Of course, this would be the case if the Fiery Sky Hou had not purified its bloodline. Now that it had improved its Barren bloodline and gained the top strange flames Red Plum Falling Fire, Lin Yuan was not confident that the fire-elemental resistance provided by the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen would be enough.","The Blazing Sun Dragon Cricket was a damage-type fey that purely used wide-ranged attacks. It was exceedingly similar to Han Tianhe’s Earth Core Dragon Snail.","After the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen absorbed the Scorching Sun World Crystal, Lin Yuan would also gain a Sword Skill that would be powerful against a group.","It was not easy to gain World Crystals. Once the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen absorbed all the World Crystals that Lin Yuan had, he would have to try to come up with a way to use the golden pearls formed from Creation World Ley Lines.","These golden pearls should be used to strengthen the law worlds on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt, and Lin Yuan needed to think carefully about how he would go ahead in utilizing them.","Every part of Myth Breed and Creation Breed feys’ bodies was precious, and Lin Yuan intended to give the corpses of these Myth Breed and Creation Breed feys to the Mother of Bloodbath so that it could absorb the blood energy within them before separating them into spiritual ingredients that would be useful to Creation Masters.","The flesh would be given to Purple Demon so that it could grow quickly.","According to Lin Yuan’s plan, after helping the Sea Bliss Clan win their blood pact ultimate fight against Connected Beast Park, he was going to take Liu Jie, the Mother of Bloodbath, and a few Spirit Craftsmen with him through the Space Tunnel to the Divine Wood Federation to continue training.","But after the news that Qi Haitao had given him, Lin Yuan decided to scrap this plan as going to the islands owned by the Sea Bliss Clan to check on the exact situation of the whale fall was of a higher priority now.","Qi Heng had left his phone number with Lin Yuan before leaving Sky City’s Star Web private territory.","The Sea Bliss Clan had just won the blood pact ultimate fight and were about to hand over all of their resources to Sky City."]},{"number":1280,"title":"Chapter 1280 - I Want to See the Whale Fall!","paragraphs":["Qi Heng definitely had many things to do now.","Lin Yuan did not want to wait for Qi Heng to contact him so that he could stall. As such, he called Qi Heng immediately.","At that moment, Qi Heng was standing in the Sea Bliss Clan’s tent at the ultimate fighting ground and basking in the crowd’s attention.","When he saw Miao Zhenshan standing some ways ahead of him, he suddenly felt that he was better than Miao Zhenshan.","However, this feeling only lasted a fleeting moment because he knew that the Sea Bliss Clan was not the one who had defeated Connected Beast Park in the blood pact ultimate fight. It was actually Sky City that deserved the credit.","The Sea Bliss Clan was a loser, just like Connected Beast Park, and both sides had lost all their resources to Sky City. Sky City, which had remained in the shadows, was the true victor of this incident.","For some reason, when Qi Heng thought back to Sky City’s City Lord’s calmness when they met at Star Web’s private faction territory, he had a feeling that Sky City was pulling the strings behind everything.","At the end of the day, the Qi family would be a rudderless boat once they left the ultimate fighting ground.","Qi Heng could not help but feel uncontrollable resentment when he saw Qi Wangyang’s ecstatic expression.","At that moment, Qi Heng’s phone rang. When he looked at the screen, he saw that it was an unfamiliar number.","Given the timing, Qi Heng could guess who the call was coming from.","He dared not hesitate before he answered the call and a clear young voice on the other end of the call said, “The Sea Bliss Clan has won the blood pact ultimate fight against Connected Beast Park. Sky City has kept up our end of the deal. Now, it is time for the Sea Bliss Clan to keep up its end.”","Qi Heng circulated his spiritual power and molded the spirit qi into a vortex beside him. Next, he used his sleeve to cover his mouth before saying, “Lord, the Qi family will not return to the Sea Bliss Clan residence after the blood pact ultimate fight. You can come and take over our resources at any time. If you don’t want the spirit qi professionals working in the Sea Bliss Clan, please give me one day to dismiss them.”","......","Lin Yuan nodded to himself. He was satisfied with the way Qi Heng conducted business.","“Someone will go over to the Sea Bliss Clan to take over the resources and handle the spirit qi professionals working under the Sea Bliss Clan. You don’t need to worry about it. However, you should still remember what you said in Sky City’s Star Web private faction territory. Now, take me to see the large whale fall near the islands.”","Qi Heng momentarily froze when he heard what Lin Yuan said because he knew that Sky City’s City Lord was calling to ascertain the truth of Qi Haitao’s news. Sky City would keep its promise to the Qi family if it were true. If it turned out to be fake, Sky City would probably make the Qi family pay.","However, Qi Heng had nothing to be afraid of because there truly was a large whale fall near the islands. But any large whale fall would be protected by powerful sea beasts and experts from the sea clans.","Thus, Qi Heng dared not touch the large whale fall in spite of its close proximity to the Sea Bliss Clan’s islands. He had only made use of the nutrients swept to the surface by the currents.","Although Qi Haitao had not mentioned this, Qi Heng was sure that the City Lord of Sky City would understand this.","“Please give me an hour. I will wait for you at the entrance of the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce then. I would like to use the hour to settle some of the Qi family’s internal problems.”","Lin Yuan made a noise of acknowledgment before hanging up.","This journey to Raging Waves City would be a long one.","Lin Yuan’s Ethereal Jellyfish had not placed any Tentacle Nodes along the route to Raging Waves City, and Lin Yuan could use this journey to do so as it would make his future journeys to Raging Waves City much easier.","Wen Yu had wanted to go on this journey as well. But when she remembered her power and all the matters that needed to be attended to in Sky City’s Star Web private territory, she eventually decided to stay in the mansion.","Given that this would be a long journey, Liu Jie and the Mother of Bloodbath immediately started to make preparations.","Ji Feng would stay to watch over the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce. It was still not convenient for him to move around in his current situation. If he summoned his feys and displayed his power, people would link him to the Young Leader of the faction Sea Sky Nurture that had disappeared over a decade ago.","When Qi Heng put down the phone, he looked at Qi Wangyang, who was waving madly at the crowd, and coughed.","Qi Heng pulled Qi Wangyang over and told him about the deal between Sky City and the Sea Bliss Clan that he and Qi Haitao had made on Star Web.","Qi Wangyang’s expression changed abruptly and hardened.","He had been overjoyed when he saw the black shadow kill the three Connected Beast Park thearch-class experts during the blood pact ultimate fight. He silently blamed Qi Heng and Qi Haitao for not telling him about such a serious matter.","Qi Wangyang had expected Qi Heng and Qi Haitao to pay a heavy price, but he did not expect that it would cost the entire Sea Bliss Clan.","5,000,000 Radiance dollars is useless! It can’t even buy a few Angelfish of Bliss of decent quality. Is the City Lord of Sky City treating us like beggars that need to be patronized?","Before Qi Wangyang could say anything, Qi Heng summoned a giant bear covered with blue flames and slapped Qi Wangyang’s head.","This sudden slap was not forceful, but Qi Wangyang still fainted. A spark of blue flame also entered Qi Wangyang’s head when he fell unconscious.","This slap shocked every member of the Qi family, including Qi Haitao. The people from Connected Beast Park, Gu Han, the audience, and the influencers and reporters from Star Web were all taken aback as well.","The Star Web reporters took photos while the influencers from Star Web immediately posted about this on Star Web. Anyone would want a piece of such juicy news.","Qi Heng ignored the reactions and used his spiritual power to create a wall around the Qi family before he turned and said to Qi Haitao, “Haitao, you’re going to be the leader of the Qi family from now on. Your father caused the Qi family to fall and gave away everything the Sea Bliss Clan built over the past decades. He forced us to become beggars that are desperately looking for a way out. A person like this isn’t fit to be the leader of the Qi family.","“My Death Flames Curse Bear hit Qi Wangyang’s head with a curse. As long as his spiritual energy doesn’t exceed mine, he won’t be able to break free of the curse.”"]},{"number":1281,"title":"Chapter 1281 - Why are You Showing Off?","paragraphs":["Qi Heng paused when he noticed Qi Haitao’s conflicted and worried expression before continuing. “After Qi Wangyang wakes up, he won’t be able to use his spiritual energy to summon feys. I need to go to the sea for some time. You can decide how you want to handle your father during this time. If anyone in the family pushes back against you, I will settle it for you when I return.”","Qi Heng cast a cold look at the rest of the Qi family as he had meant for them to hear what he said as well.","Actually, none of the rest of the Qu family felt that there was anything wrong with what Qi Heng intended. Rather, they felt happy instead.","Qi Wangyang’s decision had doomed them to waiting for inevitable death, and all of them hated him. Hence, none of them truly treated him as the leader.","Qi Haitao became the leader of the Qi family, while Qi Wangyang became an ordinary person who could not even summon feys. The other members of the Qi family all felt that this was the best decision, and they assured Qi Heng they would not go against him.","Qi Heng turned and left the ultimate fighting ground.","While he was talking, the audience, Star Web reporters, and influencers all went into a frenzy.","Qi Heng’s spiritual power shield was soundproof, so no one else heard what he said. However, it was clear that what he said was related to him knocking Qi Wangyang unconscious.","In the span of a short few minutes, many posts about how Qi Heng knocked Qi Wangyang unconscious were posted onto Star Web. All of them were about guessing the reason behind Qi Heng’s action.","Every single one of the posts increased the popularity of this blood pact ultimate fight, and many more people started paying attention to Sky City because of it.","Qi Heng noticed the three people standing at the entrance of the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","The masks they wore confirmed their identities.","Qi Heng calmly looked at one of them wearing white and blue spirit qi clothes and Sky City’s mask.","......","When he was previously at Sky City’s private faction territory, Qi Heng’s mind had been filled with thoughts about what he should do to convince Sky City to help the Sea Bliss Clan with their blood pact ultimate fight against Connected Beast Park. Hence, he had not paid much attention to the City Lord.","However, that call had suddenly made Qi Heng aware that Sky City’s City Lord was young as his voice sounded a lot like that of an adolescent boy.","A ludicrous idea popped into Qi Heng’s head.","Can Sky City’s City Lord actually be very young? But how is such a young person able to maintain such a powerful secret faction?","The more carefully Qi Heng observed, the more certain he was that the City Lord could not be older than Qi Haitao.","This realization not only made chills run up Qi Heng’s back, but he also suddenly felt as though the Radiance Federation where he had been born and bred seemed foreign.","But no matter how many complex thoughts were running through Qi Wangyang’s head, he dared not offend Sky City’s City Lord at this time.","Qi Heng rushed up to greet Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, and the Mother of Bloodbath as he said, “All credit goes to the City Lord of Sky City for helping the Qi family win the blood pact ultimate fight against Connected Beast Park. Thank you again!”","A faint smile appeared on Qi Heng’s face.","Lin Yuan did not think that Qi Heng was thanking him. He did not bother with small talk and took out a phone to call for the Platinum Divine Travel Black Swallow.","Qi Heng’s jaw almost dropped when he saw Lin Yuan ordering a flying fey.","What was going on? Why did Sky City’s City Lord need to rent such an inferior flying fey when he traveled?","Qi Heng felt that he needed to prove himself now.","“City Lord, I have the Diamond V/Fantasy V Red-Necked Kite Swan that is one step away from evolving to Myth Breed and the Suzerain/Fantasy VI pinnacle Myth Breed Giant Winged Wombat. It would be much more comfortable to ride the Red-Necked Kite Swan but slower as well. The Giant Winged Wombat will be able to fly faster, but it won’t be as comfortable. However, it will still be much more comfortable than riding on the Platinum Divine Travel Black Swallow. Why don’t you pick between the Red-Necked Kite SWan and the Giant Winged Wombat?”","The Mother of Bloodbath scoffed and said, “Why are you showing off? Is the Red-Necked Kite Swan that quick? I doubt so. I’ll believe you if you say the Red-Necked Kite Swan is tasty.”","Qi Heng immediately shut his trap as he could sense that the red-haired woman who spoke was the pinnacle Myth II fey in human form.","Judging from the red-haired woman’s aura, it had to be a spider-species fey. More accurately, a bird-catching spider species that consumed avian-type feys.","Qi Heng was afraid that the red-haired woman would swallow the Red-Necked Kite Swan with one gulp if he summoned it.","He did not know how he should react at such a moment. Even if he bit back at what the red-haired woman said, he might not be able to save the Red-Necked Kite Swan and might lose his own life.","Qi Heng had learned something when he watched how Sky City helped the Sea Bliss Clan defeat Connected Beast Park during the blood pact ultimate fight. He learned that he should not cross Sky City no matter what. Otherwise, he could end up being split in half as well.","During the time that the Mother of Bloodbath was speaking to Qi Heng, the Divine Travel Black Swallow that Lin Yuan ordered arrived.","The group climbed aboard the Divine Travel Black Swallow and rode off toward Raging Waves City.","Raging Waves City was about the same distance from the Royal Capital as Indigo Azure City was. It was just that they were in opposite directions as Indigo Azure City was toward the east while Raging Waves City was toward the west.","Previously, it took Lin Yuan about a week to travel from Indigo Azure City to the Royal Capital while riding on the Diamond Divine Travel Black Swallow. But on the Platinum Divine Travel Black Swallow, it would take at least two weeks.","Thus, Lin Yuan had no intention of relying on the Platinum Divine Travel Black Swallow to travel to Raging Waves City.","He had already communicated with Purple Afterglow and the Kill Food Sky Butterfly. He would summon the Kill Food Sky Butterfly once they left the vicinity of the Royal Capital’s factions so that it could take the group to Raging Waves City.","As his power grew, Lin Yuan understood how precious time was. He wanted to spend the smallest amount of time traveling if it was possible.","The Platinum Divine Travel Black Swallow flew for an hour until it left the Royal Capital’s district and arrived at the outskirts.","Lin Yuan ordered everyone to climb down from the Divine Travel Black Swallow and pressed ‘completed order’ on his phone to officially end the Divine Travel Black Swallow’s job.","Next, with a wave of his hand, he summoned the Kill Food Sky Butterfly back to the Spirit Lock spatial zone through Klein Hub and then out of the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","The Mother of Bloodbath immediately frowned when it saw the Kill Food Sky Butterfly, and a look of high alert appeared on its face."]},{"number":1282,"title":"Chapter 1282 - Long Lamplight Might Already Know!","paragraphs":["Although the Mother of Bloodbath knew that the Kill Food Sky Butterfly had become Lin Yuan’s protector, it had also been the Kill Food Sky Butterfly that almost killed the Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer when it was still the Kill Food Worm. As such, the Mother of Bloodbath found it difficult to completely let its guard down around the Kill Food Sky Butterfly.","Lin Yuan noticed this and was about to say something when the Kill Food Sky Butterfly went over to the Mother of Bloodbath and said softly, “I haven’t had the chance to apologize to you and Endless Summer after I changed into human form. Now, we’re both a part of Sky City, and I hope we can get along well from now on.”","The Mother of Bloodbath pursed its lips and replied, “Okay.” Then, it fell silent.","Liu Jie and Lin Yuan, who had spent a lot of time with the Mother of Bloodbath, noticed that its ears had turned slightly red. They had noticed that this would happen to the Mother of Bloodbath whenever it felt proud. Thus, it seemed that it was feeling proud again.","But at the same time, the Mother of Bloodbath’s reaction showed it acknowledged what the Kill Food Sky Butterfly said. Although the Mother of Bloodbath had not said much, it was not difficult to figure out at all.","After Lin Yuan summoned the Kill Food Sky Butterfly in its human form, Qi Heng discreetly observed it. But because it was more powerful than Qi Heng, he could not see it through it at all. But judging from its appearance and the way it appeared, Qi Heng instinctively knew that it was a fey in human form. After all, very few humans had natural blue hair. Even its eyebrows and eyes were blue.","At the same time, Qi Heng studied Lin Yuan again in astonishment.","Was this clearly young City Lord actually able to contract Myth Breed feys in human form? What kind of genius was he?","Obviously, Qi Haitao would not be able to match up to him. But even the main members of the other top factions could not hope to have a Myth Breed fey in human form at just over 20 years of age.","The Kill Food Sky Butterfly turned back into its original body after greeting Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, and the Mother of Bloodbath.","Now that it was in its original form, it emanated its Sovereign/Creation aura.","When Qi Heng sensed the Kill Food Sky Butterfly’s Creation Breed aura, he almost collapsed to the ground.","He gulped as he glanced at Lin Yuan.","......","At that point, he was sure that Lin Yuan was not a young man but an ancient monster that could imitate the voice of a young man. There was just no way that such a young man could have a Creation Breed fey.","Qi Heng still felt slightly dizzy when he was riding on the Kill Food Sky Butterfly.","He never expected himself ever to be riding on a Creation Breed fey.","The Kill Food Sky Butterfly flew at a rapid rate. With world power in its hands, it could travel 10 kilometers with one flap of its wings.","Lin Yuan had found out from the Kill Food Sky Butterfly that it would only take the Kill Food Sky Butterfly half a day to arrive at Raging Waves City.","Qi Heng, who had only just gotten used to riding on the Kill Food Sky Butterfly’s back, gnashed his teeth and prepared to describe the exact situation at the islands to Lin Yuan.","But before Qi Heng could do so, he suddenly found himself unsure of how to begin.","He was afraid that he would be pushed off the Kill Food Sky Butterfly when he revealed the exact situation of the whale fall.","Qi Heng knew that they would reach the islands soon, given the Kill Food Sky Butterfly’s speed.","Since he was already teetering off the edge of the cliff, he had no choice but to say something now.","Qi Heng coughed and said, “City Lord, the Sea Bliss Clan wasn’t the one who discovered the whale fall.”","Lin Yuan turned to look deeply into Qi Heng’s eyes.","Qi Heng’s heart skipped a beat, and he continued anxiously. “Not long ago, a few sea clan experts appeared from the sea and proposed to trade with the Sea Bliss Clan. They told us that there’s a large whale fall near the islands and asked us not to allow anyone more than 500 meters below the surface of the sea.”","He carefully observed the changes in Lin Yuan’s expressions as he spoke.","Lin Yuan nodded and said, “A large whale fall will benefit the entire area of the sea. It’s unsurprising that there are experts protecting it. But since it was a deal, what did they give the Sea Bliss Clan in return? Don’t forget to give it up too.”","Qi Heng’s expression immediately became complex, and he said with a pained voice, “City Lord, the sea clan experts gave us the Sea Source Grass when we agreed to their request.”","He took out a spiral-shaped sea grass with dark blue leaves and carefully presented it to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan received it and coughed lightly before replying, “I see the Sea Bliss Clan isn’t very honest. Why didn’t you mention the Sea Source Grass before? I guess it’s because the Sea Source Grass will enable the Sea Bliss Clan to have a much smoother comeback.”","He did not expect the sea clan experts to have burnt such a large hole in their pocket for the whale fall. They were willing to give the Sea Bliss Clan a treasure like the Sea Source Grass to ensure that nothing would go wrong.","The Sea Source Grass was a very special fey. Although it did not have many combat abilities, its abilities and exclusive skill could change the area of water or sea when it was planted in that area. It could nourish any fey within the area of water or sea.","Since the Sea Bliss Clan relied on nurturing such special aquatic feys, the Sea Source Grass would be a very important resource for them.","Qi Heng jumped in fear when he heard Lin Yuan’s level tone. He fell to his knees and started to explain, “I mentioned the deal between the Sea Bliss Clan and the sea clan experts so that I could give you the Sea Source Grass. You saved the lives of everyone in the Sea Bliss Clan. How could I ever dare to hide anything from you?”","Lin Yuan revealed an all-knowing smile and replied, “You better be. I saw your expression of hesitation. If there’s anything going on, why don’t you tell me now? Otherwise, if we arrive at the islands and find out that you haven’t been truthful, I’ll have to reconsider how Sky City plans to treat the Qi family in the future.”","Qi Heng steeled himself and said, “City Lord, the Sea Bliss Clan burned the bridge between Connected Beast Park and us to buy the islands. We were afraid that Connected Beast Park would use top combat power to ruin our development of the islands and then kill us. As such, we paid a large sum to hire the Five Thearch Soldiers to protect the islands. Actually, the Five Thearch Soldiers were also there during the deal.”","Qi Heng’s voice slowly turned into a whisper as he went on, “City Lord, I don’t know if you’re aware, but Long Lamplight supports the Five Thearch Soldiers. He might already know about the large whale fall.”"]},{"number":1283,"title":"Chapter 1283 - Fight to the End","paragraphs":["It was likely that Long Lamplight already knew about the large whale fall.","Lin Yuan knitted his brow tightly.","He was not surprised to hear that the Sea Bliss Clan had hired the Five Thearch Soldiers, as Wen Yu’s investigation had already uncovered that information.","However, he did not expect the Five Thearch Soldiers to remain on the islands or that they knew about the whale fall as well.","Lin Yuan would not be afraid in the slightest if only the Five Thearch Soldiers were involved.","Although the Five Thearch Soldiers and Coiling Dragon’s Valley were on good terms, Lin Yuan would not show them mercy when something like the whale fall was at stake.","However, all the factions in the Radiance Federation were intertwined, and half of the 50 top factions were supported by the 13 members of royalty. For example, the Moon Empress supported the Cage of Brahma Insects, Chef Supreme supported Whale Ocean Commerce, and the Bamboo Monarch supported Coiling Dragon’s Valley. In the same way, the Five Thearch Soldiers were supported by Long Lamplight.","Moreover, every relationship between a member of royalty and the faction they supported was different.","The name Five Thearch Soldiers came about from the five thearch-class experts in the faction. Two of the Five Thearch-class experts used to be Long Lamplight’s assistants, but they eventually left Bright Light Building for some reason. But regardless, they remained on close terms with Long Lamplight.","When Long Lamplight held the Ten Thousand Lamps Temple Fair six years ago, not only had he invited these two thearch-class experts but they were even seated in the special guest section.","As such, Lin Yuan did not think it unlikely that the Five Thearch Soldiers would tell Long Lamplight about such an opportunity.","If so, it would not be good news.","Lin Yuan regretted not immediately rushing to the whale fall when he heard about it from Qi Haitao and Qi Heng in Sky City’s private territory.","At that moment, Qi Heng was holding his breath as he looked at Lin Yuan with tightly pursed lips. However, he did not regret telling Lin Yuan the truth.","This matter concerned a member of royalty. Although Qi Heng had witnessed Sky City’s powerful martial force, he still did not think Sky City would dare fight over resources with a member of royalty.","Qi Heng had no idea what was coming next.","While Qi Heng’s imagination was running wild, the young man who had been silently standing behind Lin Yuan took a step forward and asked him, “Do you know when the sea clan experts arrived on the island to negotiate with the Sea Bliss Clan and Five Thearch Soldiers?”","Qi Heng went through his memories before replying honestly, “Lord, this didn’t happen that long ago. According to my memory, it happened last Tuesday at 7:00 p.m.”","Liu Jie turned to say to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, today is Monday. If it happened last Tuesday at 7:00 p.m., then it happened six days ago. I heard that Long Lamplight rushed to the outskirts a week ago. Hence, there’s no way Long Lamplight doesn’t know about this matter.”","Qi Heng did not feel much when Liu Jie calculated the time. But when Liu Jie mentioned the part about Long Lamplight’s journey, Qi Heng’s eyes widened.","The members of royalty in the Radiance Federation all had incomparable power, and their travel plans were kept secret. There was no way that outsiders would know about them.","Not even the two thearch-class experts amongst the Five Thearch Soldiers were privy to Long Lamplight’s travel plans.","So how did this mask-wearing man know? He had heard about it! Where would you go to hear about such a thing?","Moreover, Qi Heng had noticed that the mask-wearing young man had addressed Lin Yuan as ‘Young Master’ instead of ‘City Lord’. This meant that the mask-wearing man was not just a member of Sky City but one of Lin Yuan’s servants.","From another angle, it could also be said that the City Lord of Sky City had an even more impressive identity. This identity had to be impressive enough that even his servant knew about the movements of a member of royalty.","When this thought entered his mind, Qi Heng felt that his imagination was not sufficient because he could not fathom what kind of person in the Radiance Federation would have such capabilities.","Lin Yuan’s brow relaxed when he heard what Liu Jie said.","The members of royalty did not need to report to anyone where they went. But when they wanted to head to the outskirts, they needed to let the Spirit Guards know first.","The Spirit Guards had no say over where the members of royalty went, but they needed to provide the Spirit Guards with a report.","Since Liu Jie was Night Leaning Moon’s disciple, he was able to access the information on where the members of royalty went.","As long as the matter did not concern the member of royalty himself, Lin Yuan would not yield and fight for the whale fall till the end because it would help the Floating Island Whale to hatch quicker and enable Lin Yuan to produce a true Sky City.","“Young Master, Long Lamplight is not the only one not present in the Radiance Federation. There are also five Radiance Envoys who aren’t here. If the Five Thearch Soldiers need to report to Long Lamplight, they’ll most likely have to report to An He, who’s still in the Radiance Federation,” said Liu Jie.","When Liu Jie mentioned An He, Lin Yuan remembered the call Zong Ze made to Gu Lang a few days ago.","At that time, Zong Ze and An He had been clashing at the Class 5 dimensional rift outside of Cold Frost City. From what Gu Lang said, Zong Ze had called when the fight was at its tail end.","Gu Lang had gone to the Class 5 marsh dimensional rift to search for dimensional lifeforms, so he had to have a few experts with him.","Yet, he still could not defeat An He easily. This meant that An He had to have had experts with him as well.","Lin Yuan felt that the Invisible Demon might not be able to defeat An He’s experts even with its immortal power.","But any martial force used during the fight for the large whale fall would result in strange consequences.","After thinking for some time, Lin Yuan decided to communicate with Red Thorn through his spiritual energy and instruct it to use its Tongue of Relinquish to control Liu Yanshan so that he could be manipulated to go to White Speak. If there were no other choice, he would have to release White Speak out of the marsh world.","Currently, Morbius was unable to read the data of Immortal lifeforms. Hence, Lin Yuan could not investigate White Speak.","But according to what the Invisible Demon said, once White Speak reached pinnacle Class 12, it would have the power of an Immortal IX fey."]},{"number":1284,"title":"Chapter 1284 - You Dare to Clash Against the Disciple of a Member of Royalty?","paragraphs":["Although the experts with Immortal power were overwhelmingly powerful and could unlock a higher level of strength momentarily, White Speak was an Apostle that could use its sacred source body. The strength of the sacred source body came from the power of its faith power.","The faith power in Lin Yuan’s shrine was still increasing continuously due to the blood pact ultimate fight.","Lin Yuan felt that if he used his faith body and Faith Gift or Robbery to help White Speak, White Speak would be able to stand a fighting chance against An He as long as he did not have any Immortal experts by his side.","He looked out toward the distance and said softly, “My faction must have the large whale fall. Not even Ah He, the disciple of Long Lamplight, will be allowed to take it from me!”","“Cold Frost City isn’t far from Raging Waves City. An He will rush over if he hears about the large whale fall,” said Liu Jie.","While he spoke, the aura of combat rose from Liu Jie.","Qi Heng, who had lived for so long and gained an inordinate amount of knowledge, was stunned by Lin Yuan’s statement.","What does he mean? Do you dare to clash against An He, who’s the disciple of Long Lamplight? Is Sky City tired of existing in the Radiance Federation? How can he speak so haughtily?","No matter how strong Sky City was, Qi Heng did not think that they were able to win over the disciple of a member of royalty as it would essentially mean opposing a member of royalty.","Long Lamplight was famous for his protectiveness. If Sky City ever won over An He, Long Lamplight would definitely bring the sword of punishment crashing down on Sky City.","Qi Heng did not know what the City Lord of Sky City was thinking.","But at the same time, he was also secretly pleased. If Sky City truly clashed with An He and were later punished by Long Lamplight, the Sea Bliss Clan would no longer have to keep their promise to Sky City.","Qi Heng only hoped now that the Five Thearch Soldiers would tell An He about the large whale fall so that they would turn the imminent confrontation into a doomed event.","......","While the Kill Food Sky Butterfly was streaking through the sky toward Raging Waves City, Miao Zhenshan, who had just returned to the Miao family’s manor, slammed his hand down forcefully on his treasured tiger bone desk.","This caused small cracks to appear on the tiger bone desk and caused Miao Zhuo and Miao He, who had just walked in, to jump.","A pained look came across Miao He’s face as clear fright and panic shone in his eyes.","Miao Zhuo’s eyes showed a flurry of emotions. He was not frantic.","Although Connected Beast Park had lost the blood pact ultimate fight to the Sea Bliss Clan, and the latter now held the lives of the Miao family in their hands and could take over all of Connected Beast Park’s resources, the Sea Bliss Clan could not absorb all of Connected Beast Park.","Since his grandfather had dared to make such a bet, he definitely would have planned for the consequences. It was likely that his grandfather was already making plans.","When his grandfather had asked them questions before the blood pact ultimate fight, Miao Zhuo had said that he felt Sky City would help the Sea Bliss Clan. In this respect, he had won over Miao He.","Miao Zhuo steeled himself and asked Miao Zhenshan, “Grandfather, have you decided what we’ll do from now on? Should I try to contact Lord Lin Yuan?”","Miao Zhenshan turned to look at Miao Zhuo and Miao He. He noticed that Miao Zhuo was calm while Miao He was lost in his panic.","He frowned slightly and set his eyes on Miao Zhuo. He did not pay Miao He any attention at all.","When Miao Zhenshan thought that the Sea Bliss Clan had defeated the mighty Miao family in the blood pact ultimate fight, his mind went blank, and his heart grew cold.","It seemed that after getting used to prosperity, the family members had lost their ambition. He needed to hammer this into them again when the Class 6 abyss dimensional rift opened. Otherwise, the Miao family would crumble and eventually be lost to time as another meaningless speck of history.","Miao Zhenshan was impressed by Miao Zhuo’s suggestion.","But after dealing with Lin Yuan the last time, Miao Zhenshan knew that he would have to pay a heavier cost in order to obtain anything from Lin Yuan.","Thus, Miao Zhenshan preferred to work with Whale Ocean Commerce rather than using Miao Zhuo’s connection with Lin Yuan.","Di Wancheng and Di Wantian of Whale Ocean Commerce both had Immortal power.","Whale Ocean Commerce was unmatched, and they could even keep the Cage of Brahma Insects and Rhine Lifeform in place.","Miao Zhenshan felt that Whale Ocean Commerce would definitely help Connected Beast Park as long as he offered enough benefits.","He said to Miao Zhuo, “Zhuo, let’s not rush into asking the Moon Empress’ disciple for help. I know what to do.”","Miao Zhenshan took out his phone and called Di Wancheng. His voice was friendly, but he ended the call after exchanging a few words. After he put down the phone, he clenched his teeth tightly.","Miao Zhenshan had been under the impression that Whale Ocean Commerce would agree immediately. However, Di Wancheng had told him to wait for news.","How could the Miao family afford to wait now?","The Sea Bliss Clan would not be able to absorb all of Connected Beast Park on their own. If Sky City helped the Sea Bliss Clan, they would have to clash with the Miao family. Miao Zhenshan was not afraid of this happening.","Although the Miao family would break the rules by protesting, they would have their own story to break if the matter was presented to the Spirit Guards.","Nonetheless, the Miao family could not be a sitting duck waiting for slaughter!","When the other factions won a blood pact ultimate fight and started to absorb all the resources of the other faction, it was seen as a necessity to kill the faction’s members.","Miao Zhenshan was most afraid of what was being said on Star Web. If Connected Beast Park did not come up with a plan to deal with this now, they would truly become the laughingstock of the entire Radiance Federation. Miao Zhenshan did not even dare to go onto Star Web to read the reports about the blood pact ultimate fight.","Meanwhile, within the Whale Ocean Commerce residence...","Di Wantian was perusing through a scroll.","Di Wancheng sat beside Di Wantian and asked in confusion, “Big Brother, helping the Miao family with this will deepen our relationship with them. It might even cause them to go below the radar. This is what Third Sister and Ten Thousand Flags Trading want. The bodies of the Creation Masters from Sea Sky Nurture have already decayed and are of no use to Third Sister. She badly needs fresh Creation Master bodies and souls. Why aren’t you seizing such a big opportunity? Are you afraid that Sky City won’t pay their respects to us?”","Di Wantian handed his scroll to Di Wancheng and said, “Wancheng, read what the fourth line of the sixth paragraph says.”","Di Wancheng lowered his head to look at the scroll as he did not understand what his brother was getting at."]},{"number":1285,"title":"Chapter 1285 - The More Known You are, the More Likely You are to have Your Name Smeared","paragraphs":["The fourth line of the sixth paragraph was an idiom, and Di Wancheng read it out softly, “The more known you are, the more likely you are to have your name smeared.”","“Brother, you’ve become more and more anxious in the way you do things because of Third Sister. It’s not exactly bad to be anxious. Under normal circumstances, we will attract the attention of the members of royalty if we reveal that two of our experts have Immortal power. But I revealed the news because Sea Sky Nurture has been absent for too long.","“Chef Supreme mentioned Sea Sky Nurture the last time I went to see him. If we reveal that we have two experts with Immortal power, the attention being placed on Sea Sky Nurture will be shifted onto us. Additionally, it will help us when we’re doing as high-profile as recruiting Creation Masters.","“I told Hao to participate in the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection and leaked the news that he will be fighting for an opportunity to become a Radiance Envoy to calm down some of the members of royalty.","“Now that the Radiance Hundred Sequence is upon us, and the Azure Envoys are here to watch it, the members of royalty don’t have time to focus on Whale Ocean Commerce.","“Now that the blood pact ultimate fight between the Sea Bliss Clan and Connected Beast Park has become the center of chatter in the Radiance Federation, we will join the topics of conversation if we join in now. Then, Iron Prison, who handles faction roles, will immediately zero in on us and start investigating us thoroughly. We cannot handle such a consequence. Before Third Sister succeeds, the only end for us will be the Sin Cleansing Pool if we are exposed.”","Di Wancheng now knew what Di Wantian and the idiom meant.","It was true that Whale Ocean Commerce was too noticeable now, and any movement would attract scrutiny from all directions.","No matter how badly Whale Ocean Commerce wanted to seize the opportunity that Connected Beast Park was offering, they could not.","Di Wancheng sighed and said, “Big Brother, I’ll return the call to Miao Zhenshan before going to see Third Sister.”","Di Wancheng strode out of the room, and Di Wantian continued reading quietly.","When he got to the last line that said ‘walking into a trap’, he frowned and lost the mood to continue reading.","Di Wantian actually had another reason for saying all that to Di Wancheng. The important reason was that Connected Beast Park had formed a deep relationship with the Moon Empress’ disciple. This was the only way that Connected Beast Park could have gained seven new thearch-class experts in such a short span of time.","......","According to Whale Ocean Commerce’s investigation into Connected Beast Park, the three thearch-class experts that had participated this time used to be only pinnacle emperor-class experts.","It seemed that it was no longer a safe choice for Whale Ocean Commerce to target Connected Beast Park’s Creation Masters. If they attracted the attention of the Moon Empress’ disciple, it was possible that Whale Ocean Commerce would slip up and reveal something.","At that moment, Di Wantian suddenly thought about the impressive Sky City. He had heard that Sky City had just as many Creation Master resources as Connected Beast Park.","Moreover, Sky City was shrouded in secrecy, and not much was known about them. As such, it would not attract much attention if Sky City lost some Creation Master resources now.","Di Wantian decided to look into Sky City and find an opportunity to interact with the City Lord of Sky City.","Something flashed past Di Wantian’s eyes.","Miao Zhenshan did not have to wait long before he received Di Wancheng’s response. It was fair to say that it disappointed him greatly.","There were only two paths Miao Zhenshan could have gone down. One of the paths was to use their connection with Whale Ocean Commerce, and the other was to use their link to the Moon Empress’ disciple.","Since the route involving Whale Ocean Commerce was no longer viable, only one option was left.","Miao Zhenshan turned to Miao Zhuo and said, “Zhuo, go and contact Lin Yuan. Agree to whatever he asks for.”","Miao Zhuo hurriedly replied, “Grandfather, I will get to it now.”","Miao He hastily added, “Grandfather, I can also contact Lord Lin Yuan. Lord Lin Yuan and I—”","Before Miao He could finish speaking, Miao Zhenshan cut in and said, “He, go and call everyone in the family for a meeting in the meeting room. Your brother will handle contacting Lin Yuan.”","Miao He made an embarrassed noise of acknowledgment and reluctantly turned to fetch the rest of the family.","Miao Zhuo had only reached the doorway and had heard what Miao Zhenshan said. He knew that he was now one step ahead of Miao He and that his grandfather placed more importance on him despite his inability to evolve to a Class 4 Creation Master.","...","Lin Yuan was currently directing Red Thorn to organize the wind-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","He smiled knowingly when the phone rang. He looked at his phone and saw that the call was coming from the Miao family.","When he saw that it was Miao Zhuo and not Miao He who was calling him, he knew that Miao Zhuo now deserved a better seat at the table in Miao Zhenshan’s books.","After picking up the call, Miao Zhuo anxiously described Connected Beast Park’s current situation.","Given that Lin Yuan was pulling the strings behind all of this, he knew the Miao family’s situation better than anyone.","However, he did not interrupt Miao Zhuo. Rather, he acted like he was completely ignorant and listened intently.","After listening to Miao Zhuo for some time, Lin Yuan became certain that Miao Zhuo was trying his best to curry favor with him. Miao Zhuo told Lin Yuan every single detail candidly.","“I’ve been busy these few days and don’t have much time to spare.”","Miao Zhuo’s heart promptly sank when he heard Lin Yuan, and small beads of sweat rose on his forehead.","If Lin Yuan did not help, the Miao family would truly be doomed.","Just as Miao Zhuo’s throat started to close and he was at a loss for words, Lin Yuan added, “It won’t be difficult to resolve this matter. I will help you once I’m done with my own matters.”","Lin Yuan hung up the call.","Qi Heng had perked up his ears from the moment Lin Yuan picked up the call. However, he could not glean any useful information.","He would never have expected this young man standing before him to be the Sea Bliss Clan and Connected Beast Park’s savior.","Miao Zhuo heaved a sigh of relief when he heard what Lin Yuan said.","Since Lin Yuan gave his word, he would definitely be able to do it.","This meant that Connected Beast Park was saved.","However, Lin Yuan had said that he would only help Connected Beast Park once he was done with his matters. But if this matter were dragged on any longer, Connected Beast Park would become public enemy number one."]},{"number":1286,"title":"Chapter 1286 - Eternal Fight of Logic","paragraphs":["Miao Zhuo was unsure if the call ended on a good or bad note. But regardless, he would have to report it to Miao Zhenshan.","Lin Yuan could have solved Connected Beast Park’s problem immediately as it would only take one word. After all, the City Lord of Sky City was also the Moon Empress’ disciple.","However, he intentionally did not do so because he wanted the matter to blow up to a greater extent online. He wanted more people to learn about this incident, and Star Web was the only way he could garner as much faith power as possible.","Once the matter unfolded to its climax, Lin Yuan would use his identity as the Moon Empress’ disciple to do the Miao family a favor and add even more fuel to the flame that would push the popularity of this incident to greater heights. Through this, he could gain a large harvest of faith power.","Moreover, this would place the City Lord of Sky City at odds with the Moon Empress’ disciple and attract even more attention. It would also generate more debate about it online between supporters of both camps.” read more on newn0vel. org ”","These heated debates would only cement the faith that these supporters had and solidify themselves as a source of faith power for one of Lin Yuan’s identities.","Lin Yuan did not care about Connected Beast Park’s ruined reputation.","By this time, the Kill Food Sky Butterfly had flown for half a day.","Lin Yuan could make out the faint outline of a majestic city that slowly became clearer as they approached.","This was Raging Waves City, which Lin Yuan had never been to before.","Although both Raging Waves City and Indigo Azure City were by the sea, they had completely different atmospheres.","Indigo Azure City had a more relaxed and romantic seaside feeling to it, while Raging Waves City seemed much more metropolitan.","Shallow waters surrounded Indigo Azure City, so they only needed to defend against dimensional rifts that could open anytime. They did not have to be worried about the threat of large sea creatures because they would be beached in the shallow water. After some time, the sea creature’s life would be in danger from being out of water for too long.","......","There was not much shallow water in Raging Waves City’s vicinity. Instead, they were surrounded by 1,500-meter deep water. With waters of such depth, it was common for large sea creatures to pass by the city.","However, this geographical environment also allowed Raging Waves City to produce so many rare deep-sea creatures. This also provided a suitable area to build a harbor which increased Raging Waves City’s ability to trade and enabled them to gain another flow of income.","Raging Waves City was often known as ‘the number one seaside city’.","In order to reduce the chance of attack by sea creatures, Raging Waves City invested a lot of money into fortifying its defenses.","Raging Waves City was the only seaside city in the Radiance Federation that had an 800-meter outer wall. When one looked down from atop the wall, any movement on the surface of the water could be seen clearly.","The wall was 20 meters thick and was embedded with many sturdy metal spiritual ingredients so that no tsunami would be able to breach the wall and enter Raging Waves City as long as it was not higher than 800 meters.","At that moment, the Kill Food Sky Butterfly said, “City Lord, we’re headed toward the islands now. Or, would you like to take a rest at Raging Waves City?”","Lin Yuan fell silent. Normally, when factions needed to report to cities about the exchange of territory if the territory lay within the jurisdiction of a city.","Lin Yuan needed to report to Raging Waves City before successfully taking over the islands from the Sea Bliss Clan.","During the journey, Lin Yuan had heard from Qi Heng that because the whale fall had just begun, it would take two or three days for the Island Whale embryo to form.","The sea factions would definitely try to protect the whale fall during this time.","Currently, everything was calm within Raging Waves City. This was enough to prove that the whale fall was still untouched.","Since it would take a few days for the Island Whale embryo to form, Lin Yuan would just be waiting if he went to the islands now.","Thus, it was better to spend the time in Raging Waves City to complete the handover of the islands from the Sea Bliss Clan to Sky City.","Since the whale fall was directly below the islands, it was considered part of the island’s area.","After the handover was over, Sky City would have reason to claim ownership of the whale fall if anyone contested them. No matter who tried to take over the large whale fall, it would be considered a provocation.","Since he made his decision, Lin Yuan turned to say to the Kill Food Sky Butterfly, “Kill Food Sky Butterfly, let’s go to Raging Waves City first.”","Lin Yuan turned to Qi Heng and said, “Qi Heng, after establishing yourself as a veteran faction in Raging Waves City for so long, you must be familiar with the city. I’m sure you are familiar with the guards here. The Sea Bliss Clan is now at the height of popularity after winning the ultimate blood pact fight against Connected Beast Park. I’m sure the Raging Waves Guard Captain won’t reject an invitation to meet you now. We’re going to process the handover of the islands now.”","Qi Heng nodded in agreement and replied, “Yes, City Lord. I am old friends with the Guard Captain of the Raging Waves Guards. He will meet with me if I call him as long as he isn’t busy.”","Qi Heng’s agreement was not fake. He genuinely hoped that the Sea Bliss Clan would hand over the islands to Sky City as soon as possible.","Lin Yuan’s request to speed up the handover meant that Sky City regarded the whale fall as a necessity.","As long as An He set his eyes on the whale fall as well, both parties were bound to clash.","Moreover, if he did not complete the transaction now and Sky City’s City Lord and An He ended up butting heads, An He would ask Qi Heng to choose a side.","At that point, he would be stuck between a rock and a hard place. No matter which side he chose, he would be offending the other party.","It would be better if he handed over the islands to Lin Yuan now to save himself from being forced to make such a decision.","Liu Jie walked over to Lin Yuan and whispered, “Young Master, let’s split up later. I will handle matters first. If a fight truly breaks out, the sea-clan experts might endanger the safety of Raging Waves City.”","Lin Yuan nodded. He knew that Liu Jie was headed for the Spirit Guards branch in Raging Waves City.","The dimensional rift active period had just ended, and the Guard Envoys stationed in the major cities had not returned to the main Spirit Guards branch in the Royal Capital yet.","This was the time when every Spirit Guards branch was at its strongest."]},{"number":1287,"title":"Chapter 1287 - Captain of Raging Waves Guards","paragraphs":["Liu Jie arranged for the Guard Envoy to lead the Spirit Guards in defense. This would prepare for any incidents that took place while the group was fighting for the whale fall on the islands.","Ever since the Mother of Bloodbath climbed aboard the Kill Food Sky Butterfly’s back, it started absorbing the blood energy in the corpses of the Prism Snapping Turtle, Blazing Sun Dragon Cricket, and Shadow Tied Mesmerizing Snake.","The moment the Kill Food Sky Butterfly landed, the Mother of Bloodbath opened its eyes, and it could not contain the excitement in its voice, “The blood energy in my body has reached its full extent. I can’t absorb any more blood energy. I can break through to Myth III at any time.”","Lin Yuan’s face lit up before he said with a hint of worry, “Hold it off for now. I will find you a good place to go through the breakthrough once I’m done with what I have to do.”","The Mother of Bloodbath breaking through to Myth III was a big deal to Lin Yuan. This not only concerned whether the Mother of Bloodbath would be able to evolve to a Heavenly Family Fey but also the safety of its life.","If the Mother of Bloodbath failed to evolve and awaken its Sky Sundial Jade Spider bloodline, it could die from the impact. Hence, Lin Yuan had to be extremely careful about the Mother of Bloodbath’s evolution.","After the Kill Food Sky Butterfly landed on the ground, it did not return to the marsh world. Instead, Lin Yuan sent it to the Spirit Guards branch with Liu Jie.","This was to protect Liu Jie’s safety, and so that the Kill Food Sky Butterfly could act as Lin Yuan’s representative in matters that he could not attend to himself.","Qi Heng had finished speaking to the Captain of the Raging Waves Guards.","Since the Sea Bliss Clan was a native faction from Raging Waves City, Raging Waves City cared significantly about the blood pact ultimate fight between the Sea Bliss Clan and Connected Beast Park. This was because it concerned a large chunk of Raging Waves City’s resources.","Hence, the Captain of the Raging Waves Guards immediately agreed to Qi Heng’s request to meet. However, the dimensional rift’s active period had just ended, and the Captain had too many things on his plate. As such, he asked to meet Qi Heng at the area where he was currently working.","Qi Heng walked ahead to lead the way while Lin Yuan and the Mother of Bloodbath followed him.","Along the way, they admired Raging Waves City’s scenery while listening to Qi Heng talk about the situation in Raging Waves City.","......","Previously, Lin Yuan had gained benefits from working with the Captain of the Indigo Azure Guard and the City Lord of Ascending Dragon City.","Given that Raging Waves City was deemed ‘the number one seaside city’, its resources were much more bountiful than that of Indigo Azure City.","In order to increase their defenses and protect themselves against sea beasts, Raging Waves City invested a large number of resources into the Raging Waves Guard every year.","A large portion of the invested resources went toward hiring Creation Masters. Although the Radiance Federation had many more Creation Masters than other federations and only the Freedom Federation came close to matching the quantity, this did not mean that the Radiance Federation had no lack of Creation Master resources.","The number of people in the Radiance Federation to the number of Creation Masters was disproportionate.","Moreover, Creation Masters were often employed by the major factions. The Creation Masters that were employed only worked for that one faction. Hence, the tightly-stretched Creation Master resources only became more scarce.","The major factions were constantly competing against each other as they developed. As such, they did everything they could to swallow up all the Creation Master resources available on the market.","Lin Yuan also wanted to ask the Captain of the Raging Waves Guard if he was willing to work together. Lin Yuan would provide the Raging Waves Guard Captain with Creation Master resources in return for items that Lin Yuan needed. It was a win-win deal.","It did not take long for Qi Heng to lead Lin Yuan and the Mother of Bloodbath to the residence of Raging Waves City’s City Lord. The Raging Waves Guard Captain was working directly beside the City Lord’s residence.","Before arriving at the entrance, Lin Yuan spotted a tall, skinny man striding out. He smiled broadly and said with a deep laugh, “Qi Heng, congratulations on the Sea Bliss Clan’s win in the blood pact ultimate fight. Do you plan on transferring Connected Beast Park’s resources to Raging Waves City?”","Qi Heng had been gleeful thinking about the confrontation between the City Lord of Sky City and An He.","However, when he heard what the tall and skinny man said, Qi Heng’s face immediately fell.","He sure knows how to rub my nose in it! I would love to transfer Connected Beast Park’s resources to Raging Waves City, but it will need Sky City’s City Lord’s approval! All of the Sea Bliss Clan belongs to Sky City now. Sky City might even pull out all of the Sea Bliss Clan’s resources from Raging Waves City too.","While the tall and skinny man spoke to Qi Heng, he cast a look at Lin Yuan and the Mother of Bloodbath. His eyes lit up when he saw the masks they were wearing.","Meanwhile, Lin Yuan was also sizing up the tall and skinny man. He assumed that this was the Captain of the Raging Waves City Guards.","Through the conversation between the Raging Waves Guard Captain and Qi Heng, Lin Yuan knew that the Raging Waves Guard Captain really hoped Qi Heng would transfer Connected Beast Park’s resources to Raging Waves City. With a large influx of resources, Raging Waves City’s progress would be pushed forward.","However, the Captain of the Raging Waves Guards would be sorely disappointed.","Qi Heng hurled insults at the Captain of the Raging Waves City Guards while preparing to introduce Lin Yuan and the Mother of Bloodbath to him.","However, the Raging Waves Guard Captain was one step ahead as he cheerily walked over to Lin Yuan and the Mother of Bloodbath and said, “The two of you must be from Sky City! I heard Feng Dong mention Sky City while on a call with him.”","The Raging Waves Guard Captain reached his hand out to Lin Yuan.","When the Raging Waves Guard Captain greeted Lin Yuan in such a friendly manner, Lin Yuan knew that the Raging Waves Guard Captain wanted to strike up a relationship with him.","However, Lin Yuan had no clue who the Feng Dong the Raging Waves Guard Captain was talking about.","When Lin Yuan did not speak after catching the Raging Waves Guard Captain’s hand, the Raging Waves Guard Captain immediately realized Lin Yuan might not know who Feng Dong was and hurriedly explained, “Feng Dong is the Indigo Azure Guard Captain. I heard him say that the Indigo Azure Guards have been working together with Sky City to nurture feys.”","Lin Yuan smiled and replied, “That’s right. Sky City and Indigo Azure City have always worked together to nurture feys. Actually, it’s not just with Indigo Azure City. We also work with Ascending Dragon City to nurture feys. But compared to working with factions, we much prefer to work with City Lords. This way, we’ll be able to give back to the cities slightly.”","While listening to Lin Yuan, Wang Ce also started to grin."]},{"number":1288,"title":"Chapter 1288 - Sea Valley Tea","paragraphs":["Ever since the City Lord of Raging Waves City handed Wang Ce the job of establishing the Raging Waves Guard three years ago, he had been bothered by the issue of Creation Master resources.","Wang Ce went to the Creation Master Association often to assign jobs and had also recruited some Class 2 and 3 Creation Masters.","However, tens of Class 2 Creation Masters and two Class 3 Creation Masters were not enough.","He occasionally recruited a Class 4 Creation Master, but they demanded such high prices that Wang Ce could not accept it. The Raging Waves Guard needed to be fair when dispensing resources.","During the active period of the dimensional rift, every Raging Waves Guard laid their lives on the line to protect Raging Waves City. Every one of them was a hero who deserved equal credit.","If the Class 4 Creation Masters demanded too high of a price, Wang Ce would be unable to give every Raging Waves Guard a Bronze/Epic fey. This would cause the Bronze/Epic feys to become meaningless.","Biased dispensing of resources would mess up the team. This was a major taboo when leading a team.","Wang Ce also tried seeking out top and veteran factions like Coiling Dragon’s Valley and Connected Beast Park, who had Creation Master roles.","However, he once again hit a wall due to the cost.","Not long ago, the Indigo Azure Guard Captain Feng Dong had called and let it slip how the Indigo Azure Guards had been able to produce hundreds of Bronze/Epic Hot Spring Snails during the active period of the dimensional rift.","When Wang Ce threatened to expose Feng Dong’s dirty laundry on Star Web, he finally learned about the deal between the Indigo Azure Guard and Sky City.","He also learned that Sky City only needed Law Source Crystals but not Radiance dollars or any other precious resources. This was unsurprising as Indigo Azure City was a large level below Raging Waves City and would not be able to afford resources that Raging Waves City could not afford.","Hence, Wang Ce immediately took the initiative to make Lin Yuan’s acquaintance.","......","Lin Yuan guessed what Wang Ce was thinking. This was why he mentioned Sky City working with Indigo Azure City and Ascending Dragon City. He wanted Wang Ce to know that if Raging Waves City was willing, they could also work with Sky City.","Naturally, Wang Ce understood what Lin Yuan meant.","He waved and said, “Valued guests, why don’t we head inside to have a taste of Raging Waves City’s specialty, Sea Valley Tea?”","Lin Yuan smiled and replied, “I’ve long heard about the Sea Valley Tea Tree in Furious Raging Sea Gorge. I heard that its taste is marvelous. I must fill my stomach with this new taste!”","The Mother of Bloodbath suddenly appeared next to Lin Yuan. It went wherever Lin Yuan went.","It did not like socializing and had not said a word during the journey.","However, it was a glutton and greatly looked forward to tasting the Sea Valley Tea.","Qi Heng had almost gone pale. He was supposed to be the middleman and had arranged this meeting. Yet, he seemed like an outsider now. He had not said anything after his first statement.","Ever since Wang Ce figured out who Lin Yuan was, he understood why Qi Heng had called to meet.","Although he was the Captain of Raging Waves City’s Guards, Qi Heng was a main veteran member of one of Raging Waves City’s native factions.","The two of them often met at big events. It was considered gentlemanly for them to help each other out with small favors.","However, they were not close enough for Qi Heng to look for him immediately after the Sea Bliss Clan won the blood pact ultimate fight to share his joy.","Since Sky City had helped the Sea Bliss Clan to win their blood pact ultimate fight against Connected Beast Park, the Sea Bliss Clan would have to pay a high price. It was possible that all of the Sea Bliss Clan belonged to Sky City now.","Wang Ce wanted to talk about the collaboration with Lin Yuan, but he also wanted to glean information from Lin Yuan to see if he was planning to take all of the Sea Bliss Clan’s resources out of Raging Waves City.","If so, Raging Waves City’s finances and prosperity would be severely affected.","Given the nature of the Sea Bliss Clan’s resources, they would definitely have to be shifted to another seaside city.","Although Raging Waves City was crowned the number one seaside city, other seaside cities like Sea City and Icy Waves City were looming in the shadows.","If the Sea Bliss Clan’s resources were transplanted into Sea City or Icy Waves City, Raging Waves City could lose its title.","This was the last thing that Wang Ce wanted.","Just as Qi Heng was about to step into the house as well, the Mother of Bloodbath turned and obstructed his path.","It pointed at an area not far off where some Raging Waves Guards were training and said, “Go and stand there. When the City Lord is done with his discussion, I’ll come and fetch you. Don’t run off, and don’t call anyone to leak any news. I will be watching you.”","With a wave of the Mother of Bloodbath’s hand, a fingernail-sized red crystal spider landed on Qi Heng’s head.","Qi Heng trembled with anger, but he was helpless.","As a pinnacle emperor-class expert, he was much stronger than the Mother of Bloodbath. But he had no choice but to listen to what it said and even kept the red crystal spider on his head.","However, at the thought of the impending clash between Sky City and An He, all of Qi Heng’s anger vanished.","Inside the house, Wang Ce warmly invited Lin Yuan and the Mother of Bloodbath to sit.","He took out two cups carved from Freezing Shells and poured freshly brewed Sea Valley Tea into them while saying to Lin Yuan and the Mother of Bloodbath, “Freezing Shell cups are best suited for Sea Valley Tea. It can cool down the Sea Valley Tea quickly, but the cold taste won’t result in freezing either. The Sea Valley Tea has a slight odor to it, but it also has the freshness of seagrass. After drinking the tea, the cooling taste will start to rise, but it will also be sweet at the same time. Have a taste.”","The Mother of Bloodbath took a tentative sip, and its eyes immediately lit up.","The taste of the Sea Valley Tea pleased the Mother of Bloodbath greatly, and it quickly took more gulps.","After drinking the Sea Valley Tea, Lin Yuan agreed that it had a pleasing taste, but it was so fresh that he felt as though he was drinking vegetable soup."]},{"number":1289,"title":"Chapter 1289 - The Third World About to be Built By the Radiance Federation","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan preferred the faint bitterness of the Three Treasures Tea over the freshness of the Sea Valley Tea. Both were sweet, but the bitterness of the Three Treasures Tea contrasted against its sweetness. This gave the Three Treasures Tea an even more complex flavor.","Since it did not suit Lin Yuan’s taste, he set the Freezing Shell cup down on the table after one sip.","Wang Ce started to talk about the main topic.","“I heard from Feng Dong that Sky City asked the Indigo Azure Guard for Law Source Crystals in exchange for the Bronze/Epic Hot Spring Snails. Was he lying to me?”","Wang Ce held his breath while he spoke.","Lin Yuan did not expect Feng Dong to tell Wang Ce about this. It seemed that they were on very good terms.","Lin Yuan did not have any reason to hide this.","Although he had no lack of Law Source Crystals now, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen would eventually run out given the rate that it absorbed them.","Law Source Crystals were useless to others but exceedingly precious to Lin Yuan. If it was possible, he preferred to trade for Law Source Crystals over other resources.","“Sky City did trade for Law Source Crystals with Indigo Azure City. The rate we used was 5 Law Source Crystals for 1 Bronze/Epic fey. If Raging Waves City wants to trade with Sky City, I can offer the same rate.”","Wang Ce was overjoyed and hurriedly said, “I would like to trade for 1,000 Law Source Crystals with Sky City.”","He flipped over his hand, and a purplish-black shell covered with spikes appeared in his hand.","Wang Ce gave the shell to Lin Yuan and said, “This is the Steel Spike Iron Oyster which is the standard fey of the Raging Waves Guard. I’ll order someone to gather 200 Steel Spike Iron Oysters now.","......","“I hope that Sky City will be able to nurture them as soon as possible. I’m not trying to rush you, but our losses during the dimensional rift’s active period were too heavy.","“Moreover, the imperial court just ordered the 36 cities to use our own resources to build the main cities within the abyssal world when the Class 6 abyss rift opens. Without the high-quality Bronze Steel Spike Iron Oysters, we will suffer even more losses while building the main city within the abyssal world. As the Captain of the Raging Waves Guard, I don’t want to see my brothers fall right before my eyes.”","His eyes and face flushed. Evidently, emotional ties were important to him.","There was no reason for Lin Yuan not to agree to Wang Ce’s request.","He only needed a few minutes to evolve a Bronze/Epic fey in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. He would be doing a good deed if he could help the Raging Waves Guard to reduce their losses.","“I will try to finish the order as soon as possible. Sky City’s Creation Master resources have been idle for some time. Hence, we accumulated a large number of spirit fluids. If I use them, I’ll be able to finish the order in ten days.","“Besides quickly nurturing the Steel Spike Iron Oysters, I can also evolve all of them to Elite/Epic and choose their exclusive skill. However, the choices might not be suitable for combat. Hence, you can give me some Steel Spike Iron Oysters that have already chosen their Bronze exclusive skill?”","Wang Ce immediately looked touched.","Lin Yuan’s words had all been spoken in consideration of the Raging Waves Guard, and this left a good impression on Wang Ce. But at the same time, he was silently shocked by what Lin Yuan had said.","What did he mean by Sky City’s Creation Master resources had been idle for some time? Is it even possible for Creation Master resources to be idle?","Sky City was also working with Indigo Azure City and Ascending City, which were both large cities. Sky City seemed to have even more Creation Master resources than Wang Ce had initially thought. He was intent on cementing a good relationship with them.","When they started building the main city in the abyssal world, Raging Waves City would often require Sky City’s Creation Master resources. It was even possible that Raging Waves City could use Sky City’s Creation Master resources to gain a step ahead and earn the praise of the members of royalty. This could enable Raging Waves City to obtain even more resources from the members of royalty.","“I would like to thank Sky City on behalf of all my brothers of the Raging Waves Guard. I shall replace wine with tea and toast to you.”","Wang Ce downed his cup of Sea Valley Tea.","Although Lin Yuan did not fancy the Sea Valley Tea, he hurriedly followed suit.","The Mother of Bloodbath also raised its cup but realized that it was empty. There was nothing for it to drink.","When Lin Yuan finished his cup of Sea Valley Tea, Wang Ce guffawed and said, “Great pride! Wait for me here, and I’ll go and fetch the Steel Spike Iron Oysters.”","Lin Yuan nodded.","He had been thinking about what Wang Ce said about the imperial court ordering every major city to build their main city in the abyssal world.","This was the first time that Lin Yuan heard about this, but it also allowed him to understand how determined the members of royalty were about venturing into the abyssal world.","Once the 36 major cities were built in the abyssal world, it would be as though a copy of the Radiance Federation had popped up in the abyssal world.","The abyssal world would become the third version of the Radiance Federation after Star Web.","Lin Yuan saw a huge business opportunity in this.","A Class 1 abyss dimensional rift could reach temperatures of up to 40 degrees. A Class 3 dimensional rift could commonly reach temperatures of up to 50 degrees. As such, the temperature in the abyssal world had to be even higher.","As such, the first problem that spirit qi professionals would have to face in order to live in the abyssal world was the high temperatures.","It was likely that the imperial court had only given out this order recently, and news had not reached the major factions.","But regardless, the price of ice-type feys was already skyrocketing.","For example, the Ice Crystal Grass, which used to cost 300 Federation dollars, now cost 2,400 Federation dollars. The cost had inflated by eight times.","The price of the ice-type feys that had a small capacity to affect their environment had increased by 15 times.","Lin Yuan had never thought about doing business in this area before. But if the abyssal world truly became the third world of the Radiance Federation, the price of the ice-type feys would only continue to shoot upward."]},{"number":1290,"title":"Chapter 1290 - Start of Plan 4.0 to Change Iron Bucket Sister","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan decided to try and see if he could use the Spirit Lock spatial zone to nurture a fey that would be suited to the abyssal world’s environment, did not require maintenance, and would be able to change the abyssal world’s environment to a large extent.","Since Wang Ce had not returned, Lin Yuan lowered his head and started to study the Steel Spike Iron Oyster.","Since the Raging Waves Guard had chosen it, it had to have impressive defense-type skills.","Lin Yuan used Morbius to check on the Steel Spike Iron Oyster, and he was delighted to see that it suited Chu Ci’s current fey system well.","The Steel Spike Iron Oyster’s Normal abilities Iron Thorn Cross had a similar effect to the Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly’s Counterattack Tremor. The difference was that Counterattack Tremor would reflect a portion of the damage sustained to the shield regardless of whether it was magical or physical damage.","However, Iron Thorn Cross would shoot out many iron thorns while holding out against the damage. When the iron thorns made contact with a friendly target, it would cause the target’s bloodthirst level to rise. But if it made contact with an enemy target, it would become even sharper, resulting in even more serious damage.","This meant that if the Steel Spike Iron Oyster used Iron Thorn Cross on a target, it would also cause added effects to surrounding targets, and friendly targets would benefit from being attacked.","Iron Thorn Cross was enough to qualify the Steel Spike Iron Oyster to join Chu Ci’s fey team. It would fortify Chu Ci’s defensive ability while pushing forward the Iron Bucket plan.","With the Steel Spike Iron Oyster, Lin Yuan felt that he would be able to start Plan 4.0 to turn his sister into an iron bucket.","Since Lin Yuan had sealed such a large deal with the Raging Waves Guard, he was certain that Wang Ce would not turn him down if he asked for one Bronze Steel Spike Iron Oyster.","At that moment, Wang Ce returned holding a Gold fey storage box.","“There are 200 Steel Spike Iron Oysters in here. 100 of them are Bronze grade while the other 100 are Normal quality and Elite quality.”","Wang Ce smiled sincerely and added, “All the Creation Masters who worked for the Raging Waves Guard had invested their efforts into evolving fey grades and qualities. It’s inevitable for the Raging Waves Guard to run into danger while out on assignment. The feys whose roots are injured also need a large amount of Creation Master resources to heal them. There are only 100 Bronze Steel Thorn Iron Oysters, but they are our treasures. All of them are equipped with an exclusive skill that’s suited for external terrain combat.”","......","Lin Yuan received the fey storage box and looked through the box. He saw that all the Steel Spike Iron Oysters were truly exceptional.","With Iron Thorn Cross, they could produce above-average defensive skills. This would enable them to return damage to their attackers even if their defense fell short while still aiding their teammates.","At that moment, Lin Yuan noticed a purple-pink Steel Spike Iron Oyster amongst the sea of purple and black. It was considerably more ostentatious than the other Steel Spike Iron Oysters.","Additionally, it was not a mix of pink and purple but a gradient from pink to purple where the colors slowly became lighter from the outside in. This made the Steel Spike Iron Oyster appear mystical.","The black and purple Steel Spike Iron Oysters looked like coarsely dressed middle-aged women, while the pink and purple gradient Steel Spike Iron Oyster looked like a little princess dressed in a flowing skirt.","Lin Yuan flipped over his hand and plucked out the pink and purple Steel Spike Iron Oyster before using True Data to check on it.","[Fey Name]: Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster","[Fey Species]: Folded-shell/Steel-shell","[Fey Grade]: Bronze (4/10)","[Fey Type]: Water/Spiritual","[Fey Quality]: Elite","Abilities:","[Iron Thorn Cross]: Add a shield to protect targets while shooting out many iron thorns. When the iron thorns make contact with friendly targets, their bloodthirst will be raised. When they make contact with enemy targets, the targets will feel affection, and their desire to battle will be lowered.","[Bubble Crystal Shield]: Rapidly shoot out bubbles from within the shell. The bubbles can form a shield as a final attempt to hold off damage or aid when the target’s defensive abilities are falling.","Exclusive Skill:","[Tool Transformation]: Capable of transforming into a tool for the contractor to use.","Lin Yuan was overcome with excitement when he saw the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster’s True Data. It basically had Chu Ci’s name written all over it.","Compared to the Steel Spike Iron Oyster, the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster’s Iron Thorn Cross was different.","The Steel Spike Iron Oyster’s Iron Thorn Cross would result in damage to a certain area. This would be very useful in a low-grade fight. But in a high-grade fight, the effects would not be as impactful as feys that excelled in defense would be able to overcome the attacks easily.","On the other hand, the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster’s Iron Thorn Cross’ area of attack had a mesmerizing effect instead.","The stronger Lin Yuan became, the more he understood the importance of willpower during combat. Those with stronger combat willpower were able to create miracles that those who were weaker could not.","However, the difference in Iron Thorn Cross was not the only reason Lin Yuan felt that it suited Chu Ci.","Bubble Crystal Shield was practically made for Chu Ci’s battle system.","Chu Ci’s Burning Sunflower Twins and Obsidian Iron Wild Bull were not defense feys in the traditional sense.","The only fey in Chu Ci’s team that could produce a shield was the Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly. Moreover, its shield only covered individuals.","The Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster’s Bubble Crystal Shield would improve the shielding of Chu Ci’s team. She would no longer have to specialize in one-on-one combat. Rather, she would gain a team protection ability that defense spirit qi professionals needed.","When Bubble Crystal Shield was used with the Yellow Jadeite Golden Butterfly’s Explosive Shield Counterattack, it would produce a magnified killing effect as Bubble Crystal Shield would not only be able to protect many targets but also be stacked in front of an individual."]},{"number":1291,"title":"Chapter 1291 - Little Princess’ Dream Weapon","paragraphs":["If many layers of bubbles could be stacked in front of one target, they could still produce serious reflective damage.","However, Tool Transformation was a pain in the neck as too many outstanding feys had fallen because they chose Tool Transformation as their exclusive skill.","As such, Lin Yuan wanted to ask Wang Ce what the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster could transform into.","While Lin Yuan was studying the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster, Wang Ce could tell that Lin Yuan was interested in it.","Before Lin Yuan could ask, Wang Ce knocked on the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster’s shell and said, “Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster, use Tool Transformation.”","The Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster had been nurtured a long time ago but had always remained in the Raging Waves Guard’s storage.","Although Wang Ce was not a Creation Master and had not nurtured the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster personally, he had personally fed all the Steel Spike Iron Oysters in the fey storage box, including the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster.","Hence, the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster listened to him despite him not being its contractor.","However, it decided to defy him now. It snapped its shell a few times in Lin Yuan’s hand.","Wang Ce was embarrassed as he did not expect the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster to disobey him right in front of Lin Yuan.","How humiliating!","Wang Ce could easily kill the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster, but he could not force it to use Tool Transformation if it was unwilling.","He scratched his head and said, “When the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster was just nurtured, we tested its Normal and Elite quality abilities. Its Normal ability is slightly different from that of the other Steel Spike Iron Oysters. Its Elite ability is a group defense ability and is considered rare. It only appears in one out of 5,000 Steel Spike Iron Oysters. However, it is slightly resistant to Tool Transformation. Otherwise, I would have contracted it a year ago.”","......","Wang Ce looked frustrated. Clearly, he was vexed by the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster’s Tool Transformation.","When Lin Yuan heard Wang Ce’s sigh of lament, his chest panged.","Could the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster really be that resistant to Tool Transformation? If so, Lin Yuan had to think twice about letting Chu Ci contract it, regardless of how much it suited her combat system.","If the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster’s Tool Transformation was something useless, it would essentially have one less exclusive skill. This would greatly lower its value.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan decided that he wanted to see for himself what the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster’s Tool Transformation was.","He faintly activated the spiritual power in his body, and an almost unnoticeable burst of spirit qi flowed from his hand into the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster.","“Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster, use Tool Transformation,” ordered Lin Yuan.","The pinkish-purple Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster in his hand started to glow when Lin Yuan spoke.","It started to become narrower and longer until it became an 80-centimeter-long pink and purple sword. Including the hilt, it was exactly a meter long.","The sword was even more beautiful than the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster had been, and the pink-purple gradient of the sword was half-crystallized. The half-crystallized sword also shone with a milky glow that was characteristic of oysters.","The spikes on the shell had turned into markings engraved on the sword.","The sword’s hilt curved backward and could protect the wielder’s hand well.","Lin Yuan was not the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster’s contractor and could not wield the sword. But given his knowledge of other feys that had become swords after Tool Transformation, Lin Yuan could be sure that the wielder would be able to use Iron Thorn Cross and Bubble Crystal Shield.","When the sword made contact with a target or was used to defend against damage, Iron Thorn Cross would be used automatically.","Lin Yuan felt a mix of emotions as he looked at the sword in his hand.","Wang Ce’s words had made Lin Yuan lose hope in the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster. But now that he was looking at the sword that the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster had transformed into, he felt that its Tool Transformation complemented Chu Ci well.","Chu Ci had been practicing swordwork for half a year out of interest.","At the Allstar Match, Chu Ci had used her sword to produce Explosive Shield Counterattack and defeated Dragon Gate Guild Club’s Chen Hongfeng.","But on the other hand, Lin Yuan wanted to find a solely defense-type fey for Chu Ci. However, the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster could enable Chu Ci to compete in close-combat battles.","It seemed that Chu Ci was only going to become more impulsive. Hence, Lin Yuan felt that his Plan 4.0 to turn his sister into an iron bucket had run into bumps not long after it started.","Lin Yuan silently came up with Plan 5.0. Under Plan 5.0, he was determined to iron out her impulsive personality.","While encouraging Chu Ci’s impulsivity, the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster also raised the overall attractiveness of Chu Ci’s feys.","When Chu Ci used the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster’s sword during the S Tournament or the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection, she would be able to rid herself of the nickname ‘Princess Iron Bull,’ which had never sat right with Lin Yuan.","At that moment, Wang Ce said with shock, “Wow! The Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster is very stubborn. It will never do anything that goes against its wishes. Why is it so obedient to you? It used Tool Transformation just because you told it to!”","Wang Ce had identified Lin Yuan as the City Lord of Sky City immediately from his mask.","He had guessed that Lin Yuan could be a Creation Master. But even if he was, he would have to use spirit fluid to coax positive feelings from a fey in order to get it to submit. However, Lin Yuan had not taken out anything. In fact, he had barely moved.","Thus, why did the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster listen to Lin Yuan’s order?","Since Lin Yuan had decided to allow Chu Ci to contract the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster, he would have to obtain it from Wang Ce first.","“Perhaps this little thing is fated with me. I really like it too. Is it possible for me to trade for it with you?”","Lin Yuan’s words gave Wang Ce pause."]},{"number":1292,"title":"Chapter 1292 - I’m Giving You a Warning","paragraphs":["The Steel Spike Iron Oyster was the standard fey of the Raging Waves Guard, while the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster was the only known mutation of the Steel Spike Iron Oyster.","Although the sword that the Steel Spike Iron Oyster never suited Wang Ce, he never thought about trading it away.","When Wang Ce’s expression soured, Lin Yuan hurriedly said, “The sword that the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster transforms into doesn’t suit traditional defense-type spirit qi professionals. It goes against the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster’s usual role as a defense-type fey.","“All the Raging Waves Guards are hot-blooded men, and very few of them are willing to wield such a sword. How about this? Sky City will provide the Raging Waves Guard with another ten Bronze/Epic Steel Spike Iron Oysters for free in exchange for this Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster. What do you think?”","Lin Yuan had said what he said to strike a chord with Wang Ce before stating his true intention.","He felt that ten Bronze/Epic Steel Spike Iron Oysters were enough to trade for the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster.","All of Wang Ce’s hesitation was wiped off his face, and he replied, “Deal. If you can nurture 210 Bronze/Epic Steel Spike Iron Oysters for the Raging Waves Guard, the Pink Piercing Crystal Oyster will be yours.”","Wang Ce immediately drafted the contract. While he was drafting it, he asked Lin Yuan nonchalantly, “Let’s move on from work. I haven’t asked you and Qi Heng why you’re here. If you need my help, you only need to say the word.”","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “The Sea Bliss Clan will give all of their resources to Sky City. We came to collect.”","Wang Ce’s chest panged. He did not expect his guess to be right. He gathered his thoughts before saying, “It’ll be easy to collect the resources. But I wonder what Sky City plans to do once you collect the Sea Bliss Clan’s resources?","“If Sky City would like to invest some of the resources into Raging Waves City, I can communicate with the higher-ups and try to gain more benefits for Sky City to help with your development.","“70 leagues away from the islands that the Sea Bliss Clan bought, there’s an even larger island. The Sea Bliss Clan didn’t have the means to buy that island. If Sky City is interested and decides to invest resources into Raging Waves City, I can guarantee you a 30% discount. After Sky City purchases the island, I will make sure to dispatch Raging Waves Guards to patrol the area. If a water world dimensional rift opens up there, they will take care of it.”","Lin Yuan immediately realized what Wang Ce’s worries were.","......","If no faction bought the island, it would belong to Raging Waves City. To a seaside city like Raging Waves City, the island was just a huge expense that they would not mind selling off.","Wang Ce was offering to lower the price and had promised many added benefits to find out if Lin Yuan would pull the Sea Bliss Clan’s resources out of Raging Waves City.","Lin Yuan had long decided to hand over the Sea Bliss Clan’s resources to Gao Feng.","Lin Yuan and Gao Feng held equal shares of Gao Feng’s faction.","If Lin Yuan gave the Sea Bliss Clan’s resources to Gao Feng, he would not have to worry about them or have to assign anyone to handle them. All he had to do was sit back and wait to collect the harvests.","Lin Yuan had not discussed with Gao Feng how they were going to develop the Sea Bliss Clan. However, he felt that Gao Feng would not pull out the Sea Bliss Clan’s resources from Raging Waves City.","Wind Mist City was one of the less illustrious cities of the 36 major cities. The only top faction there was the Gao family.","The Gao family took up half of Wind Mist City’s sea resources and was at the top of the food chain there. It could be said that the Gao family had developed to their full extent in Wind Mist City.","If the Sea Bliss Clan’s resources were moved to Wind Mist City, Gao Feng would be using the Sea Bliss Clan’s resources to compete with his own family’s resources. This would negatively impact both sides.","Thus, Raging Waves City would definitely be the best stepping stone for Gao Feng.","After Wang Ce made his proposal, he started to observe Lin Yuan carefully.","When Lin Yuan did not immediately look convinced, Wang Ce became uneased.","Just as Wang Ce was about to ask again, Lin Yuan said, “Sky City won’t handle the Sea Bliss Clan in the future. I can’t give you a definite answer.”","Wang Ce immediately became anxious.","Lin Yuan went on to say, “Have you heard of the Young Leader of Wind Mist City’s Gao family, Gao Feng?”","Wang Ce was stunned and did not understand what Lin Yuan meant. What did this have to do with Gao Feng?","Gao Feng’s name was famous amongst the major factions and City Lords.","He had been accepted to become Cicada Song’s disciple right in front of all the main members of the major factions at the Guard Ye Banquet.","After the incident, every faction was dying to curry favor with the Gao family.","Neither Gao Feng nor the Gao family were secretive about Gao Feng being accepted as Cicada Song’s disciple. Hence, the news spread far and wide.","Under normal circumstances, rising factions had no right to learn about any members of royalty who had accepted disciples.","However, the Gao family had been so open about it that even rising factions had heard about it.","Although Cicada Song did not hold the disciple-acceptance ritual after the Guard Ye Banquet, nor did he tell the 36 City Lords about his decision, Cicada Song had jurisdiction over all the 36 City Lords. As such, they all privately tried their best to learn as much about Cicada Song as possible.","Since Wang Ce was the Captain of the Raging Waves Guard and was second in position in Raging Waves City after the City Lord, he also knew all about Gao Feng.","Could Gao Feng be the one who would take over the Sea Bliss Clan? But if that was the case, why was Sky City the one to handle the takeover? Could Sky City be connected to Gao Feng?","This thought made Wang Ce’s throat close.","A moment later, he made a noise of acknowledgment.","From Wang Ce’s expression, Lin Yuan knew that Wang Ce was aware of Gao Feng being the disciple of a member of royalty. As such, there was no need for further explanation.","Lin Yuan wrote down Gao Feng’s number and gave it to Wang Ce before saying, “This is Gao Feng’s number. Over the next few days, I will be handling some business on the Sea Bliss Clan’s islands. There will be some repercussions. I’ve already notified the Spirit Guards branch in Raging Waves City, and they will protect Raging Waves City. I’m just giving you a warning.”"]},{"number":1293,"title":"Chapter 1293 - You’ll Definitely Die","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan paused for a moment before adding, “I hope that no matter what happens the next few days, the Raging Waves Guard will ignore everything that happens on the islands.”","Wang Ce immediately became anxious. He never imagined that he would have the chance to be in contact with Cicada Song’s disciple. Additionally, he was shocked by what Lin Yuan said about the possibility of there being an event that could shake up Raging Waves City happening sometime over the next few days.","The Sea Bliss Clan’s islands were the furthest islands within Raging Waves City’s boundaries as they were about 800 leagues apart. With such a distance between them, the event had to be tremendous in order for its effects to be felt in Raging Waves City.","But at the same time, Wang Ce was also shocked that Sky City could order the people from the Spirit Guards around with one letter. The Guard Envoy was not even obligated to help when Raging Waves City’s City Lord personally went to make the request.","The Guard Envoys reported to the Chief Guard directly. There were even some of them who did not have to heed the words of Chief Guard’s left and right-hand men. Raging Waves City’s Guard Envoy was one of them.","Apparently, Sky City had not only ties to Gao Feng but also the Spirit Guards.","This meant that Sky City, which was currently the center of all conversation, actually already had the support of two members of royalty. It was hard not to be intimidated by such a faction.","Wang Ce nodded, saying, “I will work with the Spirit Guards. If whatever Sky City does on the island causes too large of a commotion and threatens Raging Waves City’s safety, you will have to provide us with an explanation afterward.”","Lin Yuan replied solemnly, “I only informed the Spirit Guards as a warning. Threatening the safety of the people within Raging Waves City is a line I won’t cross.”","He had instructed Red Thorn to inform White Speak so as to prepare stronger power to stand toe to toe against the sea-clan experts and An He’s experts, but also to make sure the effects were contained for the safety of Raging Waves City.","After settling the deal with Wang Ce and completing the handover of the Sea Bliss Clan’s resources, Lin Yuan prepared to leave to meet up with Liu Jie and the Kill Food Sky Butterfly.","Once they stepped out the door, the Mother of Bloodbath asked Lin Yuan, “City Lord, now that the matter is settled, we no longer have any use for Qi Heng. What do you plan to do with him?”","Lin Yuan followed the Mother of Bloodbath to the statuesque Qi Heng standing on the training ground and said, “Mother of Bloodbath, tell Qi Heng to return to the Royal Capital to clean up the mess that is the Sea Bliss Clan. Tell him the 5,000,000 Radiance dollars are waiting for him once he’s done.”","......","The Mother of Bloodbath flashed itself next to Qi Heng and said, “Your involvement will end here. Return to the Royal Capital now. I won’t recall the red crystal spider on your shoulder, so I can use it to continue to keep a close eye on you. After you’re done cleaning up the mess of resources, throw out all nasty ideas brewing in your head.”","It flashed itself back to Lin Yuan’s side, and they left together.","Qi Heng’s expression was extremely sour, but he was completely helpless. All he could do was scuttle back to the Royal Capital.","He was disappointed that he would not be able to watch the clash between Sky City’s City Lord and An He.","He thought,? No matter how strong Sky City is, you’ll definitely die after clashing against the disciple of a member of royalty.","...","As the clouds lazily sailed by the faintly red sunset, seven rays of light shone through. When one followed the light, they would trace back to an exceptionally extravagant fey carriage.","This fey carriage looked like a temple. The shape of the fey carriage was unusual. However, the most shocking part was that there were seven lanterns in front of the carriage.","If one took a closer look at the lanterns, one would realize that they were each lit with a thousand fireflies. Evidently, each of the seven lanterns contained 1,000 firefly-type feys.","A young man with mid-length hair toyed with a ball of rainbow light within the fey carriage.","His eyes were as sharp as a falcon, but the mole under his right eye softened his gaze.","Two middle-aged men were sitting next to this young man. There was also an elderly man standing behind the young man.","The elderly man’s eyes were half-closed, but he kept his aura locked around the young man.","Although the elderly man was not seated, the two middle-aged men were very respectful toward him. One of the middle-aged men looked at the smiling young man and said, “Young Building Lord, this fight between you and Gu Lang didn’t even last ten minutes. You’ll definitely be able to clinch one of the top three places in the Radiance Envoy selection that’s happening two years later.”","Before the middle-aged man could finish speaking, the young man shot him a glare and flipped over his hand to store the rainbow light inside the lantern-shaped bangle around his wrist.","“Uncle Cheng, I told you many times not to call me Young Building Lord. Senior Brother is the rightful Young Building Lord. By calling me that, you’re disrespecting him.","“Gu Lang didn’t go all out during our fight. He only used the Cuttlefish of Days Past. He didn’t use his fey with the Barren bloodline nor his sacred source lifeform. His fey with the Barren bloodline is stronger than the Cuttlefish of Days Past. His true strength is unleashed when he uses his sacred source lifeform to support his fey with the Barren bloodline to produce explosive power. Since he didn’t use his true power, there’s nothing for me to be happy about over winning the fight,” snarled the young man.","The middle-aged addressed as Uncle Cheng smiled ruefully while forcing down his vexation.","Why can’t I remember to call him Young Lord He? He has needled me at least 20 times about not calling him Young Building Lord. With my lousy memory, it’s no wonder that he doesn’t like me. Why can’t I improve my memory? Can anyone teach me how to filter my words before I say them out?","The other middle-aged man looked out at the scene outside of the fey carriage before checking the time and saying to An He, “Young Lord He, we’re going to reach Raging Waves City in a few hours.”"]},{"number":1294,"title":"Chapter 1294 - Disciple of Royalty: An He","paragraphs":["“However, the large whale fall occurred within Raging Waves City’s territory. Should we notify the City Lord of Raging Waves City first?”","An He picked up a fruit from the table and took a bite before replying, “Uncle Jiang, isn’t the whale fall below the Sea Bliss Clan’s island? Since the Sea Bliss Clan bought the island, it has nothing to do with Raging Waves City anymore. We don’t have to notify Raging Waves City’s City Lord.","“Uncle Cheng, Uncle Jiang, there should be several people from your Five Thearch Soldiers who are stationed on the Sea Bliss Clan’s islands. Go and contact them. If anyone from the Sea Bliss Clan is on the islands, I’ll discuss trade with them first. If none of them is on the islands, we can go and take over the whale fall without any trouble.","“It’s not like the Sea Bliss Clan has the ability to hold out against the sea-clan experts. Since they already made a deal with the sea-clan experts not to touch the whale fall, what’s wrong with us laying a hand on it?”","Zhang Cheng and Sun Jiang were stumped by what An He said.","What logic was this?","Although he technically was not wrong, the Sea Bliss Clan had gone through the official channels of Raging Waves City’s City Lord and the Spirit Guards when they bought the islands.","Cicada Song and Night Leaning Moon would definitely hear of it if they truly started fighting over the whale fall.","Cicada Song was on good terms with Long Lamplight and would probably keep one eye closed for Long Lamplight’s sake if he heard of the commotion.","However, Night Leaning Moon and Long Lamplight had always gotten along as well as water and fire. They never even bothered to offer each other pleasantries in the imperial court. Hence, if Night Leaning Moon found out about the matter, she would relentlessly sink her teeth into it.","Nonetheless, Zhang Cheng and Sun Jiang knew about An He’s temperament. He would not listen even if they tried to persuade him now. As such, they decided to find another way to convince him.","Otherwise, if the matter truly blew up and Long Lamplight returned to the Bright Light Building, he would spare the rod for An He, whom he adored but make sure that Zhang Cheng and Sun Jiang were taught a lesson they would not soon forget.","“We heard about the whale fall from our subordinates. They did not manage to learn about its exact scale. If it’s also the burial ground of old whales on top of one large whale, sea kings will definitely be amongst the sea-clan experts that have come forward to protect it. The sea kings have Immortal power. Due to their environment, they become much stronger.","“Young Lord He, if you plan on using the whale fall to temper your sacred source lifeform, it will affect the formation of the Island Whale embryo. I’m afraid that if the sea kings are riled up, they’ll be able to use the power of the four seas to threaten the safety of the far-off Raging Waves City,” said Sun Jiang.","An He acted in a cavalier manner. He tossed the spirit fruit seed into the trash and said, “Regardless of whether it’s a burial ground for the Island Whales, I’m not worried even if it attracts sea kings. Grandfather Gu will handle it. With him around, the sea kings won’t have any chance to summon any tsunamis. Unless any of the sea kings have power that exceeds pinnacle Immortal, I will definitely make the whale fall mine!","“I’m going to use it to temper my sacred source lifeform. At the very most, the newest formed Island Whale embryos will fail to be formed. The sea-clan experts only care about whether the Island Whales will hatch but not if the Island Whales will fall under anyone’s control. As long as I promise to protect the whale fall and allow the Island Whale embryos to hatch, I’m sure the sea-clan experts won’t oppose me.”","The elderly man behind An He opened his eyes and said, “Young Lord He, when we arrive on the island, I will seek out the strongest sea-clan expert protecting the whale fall and have a talk with them. You can focus on tempering your sacred source lifeform. If you can evolve your sacred source lifeform to 4 Stars and enable it to gain its second ability before Lord Long Lamplight returns, I’m sure it will please him.”","After hearing what An He and the Path Protector that Long Lamplight assigned to watch over An He said, Zhang Cheng and Sun Jiang knew there was no choice trying to step on the brakes.","The Sea Bliss Clan had won the blood pact ultimate fight against Connected Beast Park with Sky City’s help.","There was no way that Sky City had helped the Sea Bliss Clan out of the goodness of their heart. It was all but certain that the Sea Bliss Clan had offered Sky City significant benefits.","Thus, the question was, did the Sea Bliss Clan tell Sky City about the large whale fall? If they did, Sky City would definitely be unable to resist the allure of the whale fall and come forward to participate in the fight for it.","Zhang Cheng and Sun Jiang had personally witnessed the blood pact ultimate fight between Sky City and the blood pact ultimate fight. As such, the two of them were certain that Sky City had to possess thearch-class combat power at the very least.","When Miao Zhenshan did not cause trouble after rushing to the scene, it indicated that the hidden expert from Sky City was more powerful than Miao Zhenshan.","Sky City was a mysterious faction that seemed to have popped out of thin air. They not only had a mountain of Creation Master resources that enabled them to produce a Bronze/Epic fey per day but also the combat power of a top faction.","Given how deeply mysterious Sky City was, it was not unlikely that they had an Immortal expert amongst their ranks.","If they did have an Immortal expert fighting for them from the shadows, it would cause trouble for An He.","After thinking for a moment, Zhang Cheng decided to give An He a warning.","“Young Lord He, have you heard of Sky City?”","An He tossed a grape into his mouth in annoyance while shaking his head.","This made Zhang Cheng feel very awkward.","Since An He did not know of Sky City, Zhang Cheng was momentarily at a loss about how he should start telling An He about Sky City.","When Zhang Cheng mentioned Sky City, the elderly man behind An He frowned slightly and said to An He in an austere tone, “I talked about Sky City with Lord Long Lamplight some time ago. I wouldn’t have thought about it if Zhang Cheng didn’t mention it. Young Lord He, you best be prepared. Sky City could rise and cause trouble during the matter of the whale fall.”","An He spat out the grape seeds irritatedly and said, “Grandfather Gu, you know I don’t like to go onto Star Web. I haven’t logged in ever since I competed and made my way into the Celestial Stairway Hall. What is Sky City? Who will tell me about it?”"]},{"number":1295,"title":"Chapter 1295 - The Queen’s New Changes","paragraphs":["The elderly man knew that An He would ask about this.","Amongst all the young men of the younger generation, An He was the most conservative of them all. He did not go onto Star Web, visit forums, or even use his phone.","When he was at the Bright Light Building, he remained there for two years straight without leaving. It was only half a year ago when Long Lamplight decided that An He needed character building that he left to forge his own path instead of continuing to be cooped up in the Bright Light Building.","After listening to Long Lamplight mention the rising factions that had cropped up over the last year and the names of the disciples that the Moon Empress, Chief Guard Ye, and Cicada Song once, An He soon forgot all of them.","Long Lamplight had wanted to take An He to the Guard Ye Banquet as he was the right age to participate in the Martial Arts Stage. However, when he returned to the Bright Light Building after training for a few months, An He had obstinately refused to move or leave to attend the Guard Ye Banquet. In the end, he refused to go with Long Lamplight.","It was due to this reason that Long Lamplight, who always indulged An He, became determined to iron out An He’s character. After being taught a lesson and training for another few months, An He was kicked out of the Bright Light Building again.","At first, the elderly man was going to personally tell An He about Sky City. However, Zhang Cheng and Sun Jiang took up the mantle instead.","An He listened to them while nodding slightly. He did not puff up his ego as the disciple of a member of royalty and say anything like Sky City was not fit to fight over the whale fall with him.","Instead, he calmly said, “If Sky City truly wants to fight over the whale fall with me, we’ll just have to pit our abilities against each other. If Sky City lacks the capability, they will end up paying the price of being pushed aside by me. If Sky City has what it takes to take the whale fall from me, they can go ahead and do so. I can’t blame anyone else for my inability.”","Perhaps it was because he had eaten too many fruits, but An He’s mouth stretched into a yawn.","He gestured to Zhang Cheng and Sun Jiang to keep silent before saying to the elderly man behind him, “Grandfather Gu, I’m so sleepy. I want to take a nap. Wake me up when we arrive at the island.”","An He closed his eyes while the elderly man behind him pursed his lips.","The elderly man looked at Zhang Cheng and Sun Jiang, who dared not utter a word and sighed.","......","He had experienced An He’s temper when he was woken up. His biggest hobby was sleeping. Whoever woke him up would be served a chilling glower.","The elderly man pointed at Zhang Cheng. When Zhang Cheng looked back at the elderly man, the elderly man pointed at the sleeping An He.","Zhang Cheng immediately understood what the elderly man meant and nodded happily.","An He was ticked off by Zhang Cheng for his slip of the tongue, and he needed to do a good job of getting back into An He’s good books when he woke up An He later.","Zhang Cheng pressed his hand to his throat to silently practice the best way to wake An He up.","He was so excitedly caught up in practice that he did not notice the elderly man’s apologetic gaze.","...","Meanwhile, Lin Yuan was at a hotel in Raging Waves City that Liu Jie and the Kill Food Sky Butterfly had rented.","Lin Yuan had already been in Raging Waves City for two days.","When Lin Yuan met up with Liu Jie and the Kill Food Sky Butterfly two days ago, Liu Jie had ordered the Insect Queen to produce 20 Hurricane Owlet Moths. He instructed them to fly to the Sea Bliss Clan’s islands.","The Hurricane Owlet Moths were skilled at controlling the strength of winds and could fly even faster in the wildest air currents. Moreover, each of them was only about the size of a fist and could easily hide as they conducted surveillance on the island.","From Liu Jie’s reports, Lin Yuan understood what the humans on the island were doing.","Besides the 2,000 members of the Sea Bliss Clan placed there to nurture the Angelfish of Bliss, there were four king-class experts and one emperor-class expert from the Five Thearch Soldiers.","The emperor-class expert had noticed and killed a few of Liu Jie’s Hurricane Owlet Moths.","The Sea Bliss Clan had hired the Five Thearch Soldiers to watch over the island.","The Sea Bliss Clan had definitely informed the Five Thearch Soldiers about their fight with Connected Beast Park. An emperor-class expert would not be enough to protect the island from a secret attack from Connected Beast Park.","Lin Yuan guessed that the thearch-class experts from the Five Thearch Soldiers were not on the island because they had gone to deliver news to Long Lamplight.","It seemed that it was inevitable that Lin Yuan would clash with people from Long Lamplight’s party.","Suddenly, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s voice sounded out in Lin Yuan’s head. “Master, I’ve finished absorbing the Vast Ocean World Crystal.”","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up as this was the moment he had been waiting for over the past few days.","He returned to the Spirit Lock spatial zone and summoned the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","Lin Yuan noticed that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had changed significantly after absorbing the Vast Sea World Crystal. But this time, the changes were not contained to its skirt like before.","Instead, the changes were to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s general aura.","Ever since the Dark Death Law transformed into the Dark Death World, it took the form of a bat embroidered on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt.","After the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen absorbed the Vast Sea world crystal, the large whale embroidered on its skirt was enough for Lin Yuan to know that it had perfectly gained control of the Vast Water World.","Compared to the changes to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt, the change to its aura was more obvious as it had become much more mature than before.","This was not maturity in its looks. Previously, it seemed like a sheltered princess. But now, it seemed more like a princess that had been declared to and was ready to take over the reign and become a queen.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s aura was full of dignified pride, and there was contempt in its gaze.","This indicated that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had evolved from 2 Stars to 3 Stars.","Lin Yuan thought,? If the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen continues to evolve at such a rate, will it start to act more and more like a queen?","While Lin Yuan was observing the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, it said, “Master, I have two things to give you.”","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen gave Lin Yuan two light gold crystal items."]},{"number":1296,"title":"Chapter 1296 - Sword Skill: Attack of the Sea Leaping Whale","paragraphs":["Lin Yuan was unfamiliar with the items that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had just handed him, but he knew they were treasures.","These two light gold crystal items were World Crystals that Creation V and above feys would be able to absorb and breakthrough its quality.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen waited expectantly to be fed the World Crystals.","Lin Yuan smiled dolefully and handed the Prism Snapping Turtle’s World Crystal back to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen as he said, “Absorb this Simulation World Crystal from the Prism Snapping Turtle next. Once you’re done, I’ll have you absorb the Scorching Sun World Crystal next. After you absorb the Shadow Tied World Crystal, you can absorb the World Crystal from the Sacred Cure White Deer World Crystal.”","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen did not voice any opinion and delightedly received the Simulation World Crystal from Lin Yuan. It was not picky when it came to World Crystals, as it would eventually be able to eat all of them.","It felt that no one treated it better than Lin Yuan did.","At that moment, Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s characteristics.","[Sacred Source Name]: Sacred Sword Wielding Queen","[Sacred Source Species]: Source genus/Sacred Source species","[Sacred Source Star Grade]: 3 Stars","[Sacred Source Type]: Main water-type/mixed type","Abilities:","[Queen Form]:","......","1. Queen’s Skirt Hem: Able to absorb the Willpower Runes from the bodies of dead feys or source-type items. The Willpower Runes or Law Runes from Myth Breed feys’ law crystals will be carved on the queen’s skirt. The law crystals which have their laws absorbed will become law crystals that possess pure law power.","[Sacred Sword Form]:","1. Blade of Sacred Sword: When the spirit qi in the body is depleted, the blade will pierce the skirt hem to unleash all the laws and willpower stored within.","Sword Form (Dark Death World): Night Crow Wither Attack: Inject all the power from the Dark Death World into the sacred sword. The sacred sword’s blade will change into 28 Night Crows with dark death power. The contractor can attack with the sacred sword 28 times. If the attacks are launched consecutively, every attack will have an additional withering effect. Every 14 layers of withering effects will be released towards the target, and the 56 withering effects from the 28 consecutive attacks will cause the target to start withering truly.","Sword Form (Vast Water World): Attack of the Sea Leaping Whale: Inject all the power of the Vast Water World into the Sacred Sword so that it will be configured with the power of water. According to the water surrounding the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, the Sword Form can either be diminished or amplified. When the contractor wields the Sacred Sword, it can summon an enormous whale out of the water as an attack. During the attack, the wielder of the Sacred Sword can decide the state of the enormous whale. It can rile up giant waves that switch between water and ice.","Lin Yuan was right that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had evolved to a 3 Stars sacred source lifeform and changed its type from main dark type/mixed type to main water type/mixed type.","Its previous type had been main dark-type because dark-type world, laws, and willpowers were the majority in the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s body.","However, the Vast Water World Crystal’s Vast Water World had two Creation World Ley Lines, which was one more than the Dark Death World.","Although the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt also had a Myth III Dead Dream Law, it could not compete with the two Creation World Ley Lines in the Vast Water World.","Compared to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s sacred source type, Lin Yuan was more attracted by the new Sword Form that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen gained, Attack of the Sea Leaping Whale.","After Lin Yuan scrutinized the description of Attack of the Sea Leaping Whale, he realized that it was highly dependent on its environment.","Without water or with a lack of water, using Attack of the Sea Leaping Whale would only result in minimum damage.","But what is he used Attack of the Sea Leaping Whale in the sea?","Every area of seawater was connected. As long as there was not a particularly large piece of land separating the bodies of water, Lin Yuan would be able to make use of the seawater to its full extent.","If Lin Yuan used Attack of the Sea Leaping Whale in the sea, the damage it caused would be unimaginable on a horrifying scale.","The enormous whale that could be summoned using Attack of the Sea Leaping Whale could produce a wave that shifted between water and ice.","Lin Yuan felt that Attack of the Sea Leaping Whale could be used as a controlling and defensive method on top of an attack. When the enormous whale used the wave of ice, it would be able to trap a target within.","When faced with a strong attack, turning the entire whale to ice would also enable it to be used as a shield.","Although Attack of the Sea Leaping Whale was highly dependent on its environment, it covered all bases of attack, defense, and control. As such, Lin Yuan was more than satisfied with Attack of the Sea Leaping Whale.","Lin Yuan was happy yet amused as he watched the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen absorbing the Simulation World Crystal.","He had to invest enormous resources into nurturing the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen. Yet, it had only just reached 3 Stars and was still in its young stage.","Lin Yuan wondered how much longer it would take for the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to reach 4 Stars and the adolescent stage so that it could gain a new ability.","Suddenly, Lin Yuan remembered that he still had three World Crystals and tens of thousands of World Source Crystals. This immediately filled him with confidence.","Given his resources and ability to procure resources, it was only a matter of time before the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen reached 4 Stars.","Lin Yuan left the Spirit Lock spatial zone. But before he even had time to take a sip of water, someone knocked on his door.","He rushed to open the door to see Liu Jie standing stoically there.","When Liu Jie saw Lin Yuan, he hastily said, “Lin Yuan, according to reports from the Hurricane Owlet Moths, a fey carriage is on its way to the island. Judging from the shape of the fey carriage, it must be An He who Qi Heng mentioned.”","“Big Brother Liu, let’s fetch the Kill Food Sky Butterfly and the Mother of Bloodbath. Since the people who will be fighting with us over the whale fall are here, it’s time for us to make a move too,” replied Lin Yuan."]},{"number":1297,"title":"Chapter 1297 - Liu Jie’s New Carcinoma Fey","paragraphs":["An He was currently yawning as he sulkily stepped out of the fey carriage.","He glanced at the blinding sun, and his lethargic eyes immediately turned sharp.","With a wave of its hand, he summoned a light purple worm.","An He looked at two moths flying above the island and said, “Earth Covering Dormant Insect, seek out everything on this island that shouldn’t be here.”","The light purple worm immediately wiggled out of An He’s hand and onto the floor.","Soon, the entire island started to tremble, and ten wavy stone pillars shot out of the ground. A mouth similar to that of the light purple worm grew out of the end of the pillars.","It only took a moment for the stone pillars to seek out and kill all 27 of the Hurricane Owlet Moths. They picked up the bodies of the Hurricane Owlet Moths with their mouths and deposited them by An He’s feet.","Liu Jie, who accompanied Lin Yuan to fetch the Mother of Bloodbath and the Kill Food Sky Butterfly, saw this happen. His eyes slightly darkened before the spark of combat was set alight in his gaze.","He had not intended for the Hurricane Owlet Moths to engage in combat when he created them. Since they were scouts, he had focused all the energy in their wings so that they were much larger than the ordinary Hurricane Owlet Moth. As such, they did not possess many attacking or defensive abilities.","Moreover, Liu Jie was limited as he was instructing them from 800 leagues away. This was the maximum distance that Liu Jie could handle while still keeping them in his control.","Given the speed of the soaring stone pillars, the light purple worm had to be at least Diamond X/Fantasy V.","As of that moment, Liu Jie had lost all sense of the situation on the island. He immediately told Lin Yuan about the last thing he had been able to see.","A day ago, Red Thorn had controlled Liu Yanshan and found White Speak. White Speak was currently waiting to receive an order at the edge of Klein Hub.","......","When Lin Yuan needed White Speak, Purple Afterglow would inform White Speak, and it would be immediately summoned.","Since it was already confirmed that An He had arrived at the island, a nail-biting fight would be inevitable.","However, Lin Yuan was not worried.","Since sea-clan experts were protecting the whale fall, An He would definitely start fighting against them first when he arrived.","Both of them were experiments that would allow Lin Yuan to gauge the strength of the sea-clan experts as well as An He’s experts. After he understood their capabilities thoroughly, it would be easier for him to handle them later.","As they headed to the islands on the Kill Food Sky Butterfly’s back, Liu Jie whispered to Lin Yuan, “Lin Yuan, I won’t be much help in the fight later. However, I can clear out the surrounding environment.”","Liu Jie had talked in detail about the whale fall with Lin Yuan two days ago.","He had wanted to call over Zuo Ming so that he could quell hidden dangers.","But Lin Yuan had already made preparations for this. Hence, Liu Jie did not go through with this plan.","Zuo Ming was Night Leaning Moon’s left-hand man and represented her wishes to a certain extent. Once Long Lamplight’s experts saw Zuo Ming, they would definitely recognize him.","Zuo Ming’s appearance would change the matter at hand from one surrounding a fight for resources to a fight between two members of royalty.","The fight between members of royalty would certainly result in a butterfly effect. There was no guarantee that this effect would be positive.","Even if Lin Yuan had made all the preparations, Liu Jie needed to do all he could as Lin Yuan’s retainer.","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up, and he hurriedly said, “Big Brother Liu, it would be great if you could clear the surrounding shores. Do what you can to chase away some of the weaker aquatic lifeforms from the vicinity of the whale fall.”","He was afraid that if he used Attack of the Sea Leaping Whale, the weaker aquatic lifeforms would immediately be decimated.","Liu Jie gave Lin Yuan a thumbs up, and the Dimensional Light Moth that contained the Insect Queen appeared next to Liu Jie.","He circulated his spiritual power, and the spiritual power around him started to fluctuate violently.","Numerous Hurricane Owlet Moths spilled forth from the Dimensional Light Moth’s abdomen.","Liu Jie ordered the Insect Queen to summon two insect-species carcinoma feys that he had not used before.","One of them was like a small lightbulb that had soft, thin fur growing on its limbs. Its abdomen was covered with a turbid white mucus.","The other one was like a grayish-brown rock, and it looked very unimpressive. However, its front had two pincers growing out of it and a pair of sturdy tails growing out of the end of its body. Both its pincers and tails were covered with sharp mouthparts. It looked like it was made to eat.","After Liu Jie summoned the two insect-species carcinoma feys, he took out a few Protein Silkworm Chrysalis and tossed them to the two insect-species carcinoma feys.","These two insect-species carcinoma feys started to produce eggs rapidly.","All the Hurricane Owlet Moths were released by this point.","The Dimensional Light Moth was like the mothership, while the Hurricane Owlet Moths were like smaller fleets.","The army of insect-species carcinoma feys efficiently entered the sea.","When Lin Yuan saw the two new insect-species carcinoma feys, he did not need to use True Data to know what they were.","He never expected Liu Jie to be able to control such terrifying creatures.","The white lightbulb-like insect-species carcinoma fey was called the Quiet Floating Hat Insect, and it was extremely compatible with water.","The insects produced by the Quiet Floating Hat Insect spread out in the sea and covered every visible surface of water.","The small Quiet Floating Hat Insects would split and multiply when it absorbed the energy from the environment. The multiplied Quiet Floating Hat Insects would line up to form a fused entity that took up an area of 100 square meters. It greatly resembled a gathering of jellyfish.","However, the Quiet Floating Hat Insects were not as simple as jellyfish.","When they entered the water, their limbs which seemed soft and slender on land, would extend and become strong. As long as there was water, the limbs would continue to grow."]},{"number":1298,"title":"Chapter 1298 - Giant Insect Cocoon","paragraphs":["The insect’s sturdy limbs also secreted an extremely sticky glue that acted like a holeless web that could trap every lifeform within the sea.","With the Quiet Floating Hat Insect, the insects it produced could float on the surface of the sea, and any weaker lifeform would be trapped within the glue. In an instant, the sea would be cleared.","The glue was actually the Quiet Floating Hat Insect’s method of storing sustenance. In order to ensure the freshness of the sustenance, the glue would provide basic nutrients to the trapped lifeforms.","Liu Jie would be able to use this method to bring the weaker lifeforms away from the sea shore. Once the event was over, Liu Jie could order the Insect Queen to kill the produced insects. At that point, the glue would rapidly lose its stickiness.","This was a chance for the weaker aquatic lifeforms to survive the event.","The other rust-colored insect-species carcinoma fey that looked like a stone was called the Grounding Louse. It produced many young that hatched around 50 meters below the water’s surface.","Once the young hatched, they would quickly change their body to adapt to the depths of the sea. When they reached the bottom of the sea, they would start to quickly consume the rocks there while producing a strong and calcified item.","When the calcified items were stacked together, they would form a tall and steep stone peak.","The Grounding Louse had appeared on the shores of Raging Waves City, and it was rumored that the Spirit Guards had captured it.","At that time, the Grounding Louse had almost put a stop to Raging Waves City’s economy.","The rock towers they produced were so tall that they even protruded out of the sea’s surface. They almost turned Raging Waves City from a seaside city to a land city.","The Grounding Louse was able to reclaim land, but Raging Waves City did not want the rocks that it produced.","Raging Waves City used to be amongst the top 12 of the 36 major cities. But due to the Grounding Louse, Raging Waves City’s finances had dropped to almost zero within a year. This had also caused the Gao family’s ranking amongst the top factions to fall.","......","Raging Waves City’s finances only started to recover after five years of relying on resources from the sea. However, they were unable to regain their position as part of the top 12 cities of the 36 major cities.","It was not an exaggeration to say that the Grounding Louse had been a nightmare for Raging Waves City.","It was possible that this Grounding Louse that the Insect Queen controlled was the same one that had terrorized Raging Waves City.","Liu Jie had absolute control over the Insect Queen and the Grounding Louse.","Since the young produced by the Grounding Louse could produce calcified items and then eat them afterward, Liu Jie’s actions would not have any impact on Raging Waves City’s resources.","The stone towers produced by the Grounding Louse could also protect the creatures at the bottom of the sea.","The Quiet Floating Hat Insect could keep a lock on the surface of the sea while the Grounding Louse would be able to handle the bottom of the sea. With these two insect-species carcinoma feys working in tandem, no seaside city would be able to stand against them.","The Grounding Louse that had brought Raging Waves City to its knees was only Silver grade, while the one that the Insect Queen was controlling had reached Diamond X. As such, their powers could not be compared.","As Lin Yuan watched Liu Jie wield the army of insects, he felt that Liu Jie resembled more like a walking disaster as time passed.","However, Liu Jie’s method proved that every coin had two sides. The two insect-species carcinoma feys that could bring doom upon a shore were now guarding its safety.","Perhaps, Night Leaning Moon wanted Liu Jie to contract carcinoma feys because she wanted him to become both a walking disaster and an almighty wall.","Meanwhile, An He was happily playing with the bodies of the Hurricane Owlet Moths.","Zhang Cheng, Sun Jiang, and the elderly man had climbed out of the carriage.","Zhang Cheng was dumbfounded. He had practiced for more than an hour to soften his tone to its most gentle form. So why did An He still glare at him murderously when he woke An He up?","The elderly man caught sight of Zhang Cheng’s expression and silently expressed his apology before bending down to pick up one of the Hurricane Owlet Moths.","He peered at it before asking Sun Jiang, “Are there Creation Masters amongst the Five Thearch Soldiers members on the island? Tell him to come over to take a look at what this insect-species fey is.”","Sun Jiang looked slightly awkward as he replied, “We have two Class 4 Creation Masters, and they’re both in the main branch.”","Class 4 Creation Masters were treasures to Five Thearch Soldiers.","It had not been long since the Five Thearch Soldiers was established, and they depended on their martial force to climb the ranks of the top factions.","This was why they chose to butter up Coiling Dragon’s Valley.","Suddenly, the glimmer of an idea shone in Sun Jiang’s gaze. Since this was where the Sea Bliss Clan nurtured feys, they had to have stationed Creation Masters here.","As such, Sun Jiang decided to set out to find them.","But before he could begin, An He stopped him.","An He was not a Creation Master and could not tell what the Hurricane Owlet Moth was. But he was not keen to know what they were as they should not have appeared on the island in the first place.","An He knew that it was likely that the Hurricane Owlet Moths had appeared because they had been sent as scouts ahead of whoever was headed for the island.","Whoever was surveilling the island had to have their reasons. If they were also after the large whale fall, they would eventually have to show their face.","An He lowered his head and said to the light purple Earth Covering Dormant Insect, “Earth Covering Dormant Insect, start absorbing the energy from the island’s ground and turn into a cocoon.”","The Earth Covering Dormant Insect’s body went stiff. Soon after, it started to throb violently, and the sound reverberated throughout the island.","Soon after, the Earth Covering Dormant Insect’s body started to writhe wildly as it spat out light purple sap that turned into sticky threads.","The cocoon of an insect that was only about four centimeters long should only be about the size of a fist. However, the cocoon formed by the Earth Covering Dormant Insect was even larger than the breeding room that the Sea Bliss Clan had built on the island.","An He was dwarfed by the 20 meters wide and 25 meters tall cocoon."]},{"number":1299,"title":"Chapter 1299 - Sudden Appearance of a Sea Emperor","paragraphs":["After the giant cocoon was produced, the sound of a beating heart sounded out again. But this time, the ground started trembling in rhythm with the rhythm of the heartbeat.","It was difficult to imagine what would spring forth from the cocoon.","An He gently patted the cocoon before saying to the elderly man behind him, “Grandfather Gu, let’s make haste. Go and fetch the strongest sea-clan expert protecting the whale fall.”","Just as the elderly man was about to nod, he narrowed his eyes in the direction of the far-off seashore.","A giant vortex had appeared at the seashore. At the same moment, the color of the seashore changed from brilliant blue to murky navy.","An energetic yet gentle voice that was still filled with fury said from within the vortex, “I knew the humans would try to stake a claim on the whale fall. Do you really think we from the sea clan are weak?”","Small waves started rolling across the murky navy water. They overlapped and stacked together until they crashed onto the island as a large roll of seawater.","The giant wave engulfed half of the island, smashing apart the Sea Bliss Clan’s fish farm as well. Many of the Angelfish of Bliss took the chance to flee into the sea.","The elderly man behind An He shouted, “A navy sea! I can’t believe the shores near the Radiance Federation belong to a member of the Eight Clans of Sea Emperors. May I ask which clan you’re from? Please reveal yourself. Young Lord He has something to discuss with you.”","Someone sneered menacingly from within the vortex. “A pathetic human like you has no right to gaze upon someone of my status! The whale fall is nature’s gift to the ocean, and all of it belongs to the sea clan. You humans have no right to desire it. Leave now, or the sea will become your final resting place!”","An He waved his hand, and a beast even larger than the island appeared in the sea. It had the shape of a cow but was covered with grayish-blue scales.","The gigantic beast was like a mountain that had sprouted from the bottom of the sea.","It let out an ear-splitting bellow when it was summoned. The noise it produced was like thunder. Its bellow silenced the entire sea.","......","All the seawater that had slammed onto the island retreated back into the sea as the vortex continued to spin.","An He said to the vortex, “I don’t think an unimportant member of the Eight Clans of Sea Emperors has any right to be so proud. If you were important to them, you wouldn’t have been given territory so near to the Radiance Federation. The Radiance Federation and the sea clans have an agreement. According to that agreement, all the resources within a 1,000-kilometer radius around the Radiance Federation belong to the Radiance Federation. This whale fall is directly below Raging Waves City’s island. By the agreement, the whale fall belongs to the owner of the island. Not everything in the sea belongs to the sea clans. If something from the sea belongs to the Radiance Federation, you can’t take it.”","While An He was speaking, a small figure appeared within the vortex. It was dressed in a silvery blue long robe with silvery blue hair reaching its feet. It had blue eyes and a pair of long horns almost the same length as its body protruded from its forehead.","The strange horns were not hard or sharp. Instead, there were more like silvery blue fins that had a clear golden line running down the middle of each of them.","There were two human-like middle-aged women behind this girl. One of them was rotund while the other was skinny. Both of them clearly had the characteristics of aquatic lifeforms.","The slimmer middle-aged woman had translucent hair and was wrapped in an icy aura. The chubbier woman had bright red scales on her menacing face, and several sharp spikes protruded from her back.","However, both of them shared the same grim expression.","The fey that An He had summoned was a declaration of his identity.","It was easy to recognize the aura of feys with the Barren bloodline and only the members of royalty, their disciples, and Radiance Envoys.","Moreover, disciples of members of royalty only had limited access, and not every one of them could obtain one.","Radiance Envoys mostly worked in groups, and it was rare for them to act alone.","Hence, it was all but certain that this young man with the fey with the Barren bloodline was the disciple of a member of royalty.","If so, then it would be bad news!","However, this whale fall was too important. The silvery blue-haired girl decided that she would not allow the young man to snatch away the whale fall no matter what, even if he was the disciple of a member of royalty.","The silvery blue-haired girl’s resolution came from her duty as a member of royalty but also for her own benefit.","The elderly man behind An He frowned when he saw the silvery blue-haired girl with three-meter-long fins sprouting from her head.","An He noticed this, but he did not care and snapped. “I see you’re from the First Emperor Cutlass Clan. I heard that the First Emperor Cutlass Clan’s members had been locked in a constant fight. The First Emperor Cutlass Clan dropped from the top three clans to the bottom five clans a century ago and is only continuing to slip. Now, I understand why. The golden color on your fins is so vibrant, and your bloodline is so elite. Yet, the First Emperor Cutlass Clan gave you a piece of the sea so close to the Radiance Federation to force you to fight for resources with the Radiance Federation. It looks like you’re just collateral damage to the First Emperor Cutlass Clan!”","The elderly man’s lips twitched.","It was fine that Young Master He noticed all this. But did he really have to say it out loud? He’s clearly touching the nerve of this girl from the First Emperor Clan!","The elderly man sensed that the girl from the First Emperor Cutlass Clan was weaker than him.","She was only Immortal III and was even weaker than the two sea king experts standing behind her. However, this did not make the elderly man relax in the slightest."]},{"number":1300,"title":"Chapter 1300 - My Master’s Name is Ji Changdeng!","paragraphs":["This was because sea king experts could produce explosive combat power that was five to six times stronger than their regular level.","The elderly man’s main fey was at pinnacle Immortal, and he had more than enough power to take on two sea king experts and a Sea Emperor.","However, the sea was too vast, and he would not be able to attack effectively if they deliberately tried to hide from him.","If the Sea Emperor secretly attacked alongside the two sea king experts, he might not be able to protect An He in time.","If he focused on the girl from the First Emperor Cutlass Clan while Zhang Cheng and Sun Jiang handled the two sea king experts, they would definitely struggle against the two Immortal IV sea king experts in their element even with their Sovereign VI/Immortal IV and Sovereign V/Immortal V main feys.","If any more sea king experts arrived, An He would be plunged into peril.","No matter how strong An He was amongst the younger generation, his fey with the Barren bloodline the Country Governor Kui was only Diamond V/Fantasy V. It was not even Myth Breed.","An He could even be killed by an offshoot of the battle, much less a dedicated attack from a sea king expert.","With each word that fell from An He’s lips, the silvery blue-haired girl’s expression soured even further. He had poured salt right on her most painful wounds.","The decaying of the First Emperor Cutlass Clan from the inside caused anguish for the girl. She was indeed nothing more than collateral damage to the First Emperor Cutlass Clan. The girl had essentially been abandoned by being placed in this area of the sea.","But even if she agreed with him, she could not allow An He to ridicule the First Emperor Cutlass Clan casually.","As the girl’s expression soured, the calm sea started to thrash again.","The waves caused the Country Governor Kui to sway unsteadily. From their contact, An He could sense that the waves were bringing the Country Governor Kui agony when they made contact with its body.","......","But, he still did not recall the Country Governor Kui. Instead, he gave it the order, “Country Governor Kui, use Roar of the Mountain and Stubborn Drought Dried Up Land!”","The Country Governor Kui released two thunderous roars, and a mountain almost 2,000 meters tall arose on the island.","The heartbeat-like thumping of the light purple cocoon also seemed to be diminished.","The island’s ground started to dry up and crack before it started to absorb the seawater.","Suddenly, An He’s expression shifted. There should have been mountains emerging from the surface of the sea. The sea should have turned into a mass of land formed by mountains that linked back to the main island.","So why was nothing happening?","While An He was confused, a large number of rust-colored insects had covered the seabed. These insects were the Grounding Lice that Liu Jie had produced.","They had produced three-meter thick calcified rocks that covered the bottom of the sea. They were not made of an earth element but a product of the Grounding Louse’s body.","This barrier caused the Country Governor Kui to lose contact with the earth element at the bottom of the sea.","The silvery-blue-haired girl stepped lightly through the air and led the two middle-aged women onto the island.","“The agreement between the Radiance Federation and the Eight Clans of Sea Emperors clearly states that the Radiance Federation isn’t allowed to interfere with the formation of the Island Whale embryos. In fact, the Radiance Federation is supposed to help hatch them if possible. The Island Whale embryo below the island isn’t stable yet. Even if you are a disciple of a member of royalty, you can’t touch the whale fall as per the agreement. Otherwise, it will be counted as the Radiance Federation openly breaking the agreement! At that point, the Radiance Federation will become the enemy of every aquatic lifeform.”","An He smirked derisively and replied, “You said it yourself. The Island Whale embryo has already been formed. As such, it won’t be counted as breaking the agreement even if I take the whale fall now. Over the years, Creation Masters from the Radiance Federation have hatched countless Island Whales and helped them return to the ocean. We’ve always been kind to the sea clans. One whale fall can’t produce more than ten Island Whale embryos. All ten Island Whale embryos will start fighting for nutrients until only less than five survive. Even if I take away the source of nutrients that is the large whale fall, I only need to produce a third of the Island Whale embryos as thanks for the sea clans’ help. No matter who we go to, I will be recognized as right.","“If you dare to interfere, you’ll be fighting for resources with the owner of this island and be taken as the one who’s breaking the agreement.","“17 years ago, the Eight Clans of Sea Emperors was the one who suggested forming the agreement with the Radiance Federation. If you wreck the agreement, will the Eight Clans of Sea Emperors take your side or give up your life? I’m sure you know the answer better than anyone. So, the one who should leave is you and not me. If you leave of your own accord now, we might still be able to work together in the future.”","The silvery blue-haired girl’s expression changed again.","She had invested a lot of effort into this whale fall. However, she did not expect the dying whale to swim more than 250 leagues to enter the vicinity of the Radiance Federation.","Hence, she had no choice but to remain in the Radiance Federation’s territory to watch over the whale fall.","If the girl guided the Island Whales to hatch from the whale fall, it would bring a transformation to her barren territory.","However, there happened to be an island right above the whale fall, and people had even built a fey breeding base on the island. As such, she immediately sent people to negotiate with the people on the island. In order to prevent the information from leaking, she had even given away the Sea Source Grass.","Alas, who could have predicted a disciple of a member of royalty to arrive on the island?","The girl dared not break the agreement because she understood how the Eight Clans of Sea Emperors felt toward the Radiance Federation.","On the one hand, if she broke the agreement, the Eight Clans of Sea Emperors would not support her. On the other hand, she was a member of the First Emperor Cutlass Clan, and breaking the agreement could cause the First Emperor Cutlass Clan to be dragged down with her.","This would cause the other clans that coveted the First Emperor Cutlass Clan to find a legitimate opportunity to attack the First Emperor Cutlass Clan.","Thus, the girl had no choice but to keep her head down. She thought about what the disciple of the member of royalty said about working together and took a deep breath before asking, “Is your Master the Moon Empress, Chef Supreme, or Bamboo Monarch?”","An He’s countenance darkened, and he growled, “My Master’s name is Ji Changdeng.”"]}]);
